('178a1858-8b93-54ab-93d6-18dd33a02471', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '0800e79c-9e90-5df8-bd45-4bcdac047d4b', '96d4c426-5e2e-58d3-95a1-ef3bc23ea6a3', 'exposure', '/ɪkˈspəʊʒə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng tiếp xúc với một thứ gì đó, thường là nguy hiểm.', 'the state of being in a situation where you are not protected from something harmful.', 'Prolonged exposure to the sun can be harmful to your skin.', 'Việc phơi nắng kéo dài có thể gây hại cho làn da của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must wear protective gear to avoid exposure to dangerous chemicals in the lab.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải mặc đồ bảo hộ để tránh tiếp xúc với các hóa chất nguy hiểm trong phòng thí nghiệm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-ljspeech-aea93ac5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-cori-aea93ac5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exposure-2ff825ad.webp', '[\"contact\", \"vulnerability\"]', '[\"protection\", \"shelter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prolonged exposure\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp xúc kéo dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exposure to risk\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp xúc với rủi ro\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expose\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-cori-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru0-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru5-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru6-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru10-aea93ac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru9-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru3-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru7-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru8-aea93ac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exposure-aru2