('01435cfa-b134-5df3-8b33-8134ecf1cf6b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '08ebbcda-648b-5982-9483-d67fef92e069', 'b4fe555f-5b6e-5afd-ae8c-034e47faa372', 'wheat', '/wiːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loại cây ngũ cốc được trồng rộng rãi để lấy hạt làm bột mì.', 'a plant whose grain is used for making flour to produce bread and pasta.', 'Bread is often made from wheat flour.', 'Bánh mì thường được làm từ bột lúa mì.', '{\"en\": \"The bakery uses organic wheat to make their signature bread for the breakfast menu.\", \"vi\": \"Tiệm bánh sử dụng lúa mì hữu cơ để làm món bánh mì đặc trưng cho thực đơn bữa sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-ljspeech-7f572f2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-cori-7f572f2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wheat-a2439570.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wheat flour\", \"meaning\": \"bột mì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whole wheat\", \"meaning\": \"lúa mì nguyên cám\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"barley\", \"note_vi\": \"barley là lúa mạch, còn wheat là lúa mì.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-cori-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru0-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru5-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru6-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru10-7f572f2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru9-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru3-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru7-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru8-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-aru2-7f572f2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-ljspeech-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt408-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt138-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt624-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt396-7f572f2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt498-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt132-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt288-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt42-7f572f2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wheat-lt90-7f572f2b.mp3\"]}}', 'Whole wheat bread nghĩa là bánh mì nguyên cám, thường gặp trong chủ đề ăn uống.', 'dining', 1, 14),
('a7ccb4e4-214b-508a-b9e9-284a3e0e059d', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '08ebbcda-648b-5982-9483-d67fef92e069', 'b4fe555f-5b6e-5afd-ae8c-034e47faa372', 'equality', 'UK: /ɪˈkwɒləti/ | US: /ɪˈkwɑːləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự bằng nhau, sự bình đẳng', 'The state of having the same rights, status, or opportunities for all individuals.', 'The organization strives for equality in the workplace.', 'Tổ chức phấn đấu cho sự bình đẳng tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"The department promotes gender equality in its hiring processes.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận thúc đẩy sự bình đẳng giới trong quy trình tuyển dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-ljspeech-d252f0ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-cori-d252f0ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/equality-356726f6.webp', '[\"fairness\", \"equity\", \"parity\"]', '[\"inequality\", \"disparity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gender equality\", \"meaning\": \"bình đẳng giới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"equality of opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"sự bình đẳng về cơ hội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"equity\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Equity\' vừa có nghĩa sự công bằng, vừa có nghĩa là vốn chủ sở hữu trong tài chính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"equal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"equally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-cori-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru0-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru5-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru6-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru10-d252f0ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru9-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru3-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equality-aru7-d252f0ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/