('ba357e8c-ee89-509f-84af-56a4e175ab02', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '1bbeb210-a6fe-5f87-885b-d27cca17bcff', '1f5b1ada-2540-596d-bc8d-70ad6280ce94', 'outstanding', '/aʊtˈstændɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất tốt, nổi bật, vượt trội.', 'clearly very much better than what is usual or expected.', 'The sales team achieved outstanding results during the final quarter of the year.', 'Đội ngũ kinh doanh đã đạt được những kết quả xuất sắc trong quý cuối năm.', '{\"en\": \"The employee of the month award was given to Sarah for her outstanding customer service.\", \"vi\": \"Giải thưởng nhân viên của tháng đã được trao cho Sarah vì dịch vụ khách hàng xuất sắc của cô ấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-ljspeech-b5efd490.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-cori-b5efd490.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outstanding-d4ed2ef1.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"exceptional\", \"superb\"]', '[\"average\", \"mediocre\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"outstanding performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất xuất sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outstanding achievement\", \"meaning\": \"thành tựu nổi bật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"outstanding\", \"note_vi\": \"còn có nghĩa là chưa thanh toán đối với hóa đơn hoặc nợ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"outstandingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-cori-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru0-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru5-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru6-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru10-b5efd490.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru9-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru3-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru7-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru8-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru2-b5efd490.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-ljspeech-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt408-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt138-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt624-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt396-b5efd490.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt498-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt132-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt288-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt42-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt90-b5efd490.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, ngoài nghĩa xuất sắc, từ này còn có nghĩa chưa thanh toán (outstanding balance).', 'hr', 1, 20),
('3ca5c144-c0da-5d68-a691-2f7efa2361e3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '1bbeb210-a6fe-5f87-885b-d27cca17bcff', '1f5b1ada-2540-596d-bc8d-70ad6280ce94', 'distinct', '/dɪˈstɪŋkt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Riêng rẽ, khác biệt rõ ràng.', 'clearly different or easy to notice because it is not like others.', 'The two cultures have very distinct traditions, though they share a common border.', 'Hai nền văn hóa có những truyền thống rất riêng biệt, mặc dù chúng có chung đường biên giới.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a distinct advantage in the market due to its innovative technology.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có một lợi thế khác biệt trên thị trường nhờ vào công nghệ đổi mới của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-ljspeech-21a08d67.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-cori-21a08d67.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distinct-e23ea845.webp', '[\"clear\", \"different\"]', '[\"vague\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"distinct advantage\", \"meaning\": \"lợi thế rõ rệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distinct possibility\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"distinctive\", \"note_vi\": \"distinct là khác biệt, distinctive là đặc trưng/dễ nhận biết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distinction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"distinctive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-cori-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru0-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru5-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru6-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru10-21a08d67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru9-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru3-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru7-21a08d67.mp3\",