('9e50673a-433c-5b74-8687-555993988d30', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '1e05a2b4-25f4-5912-abc5-969bda239571', '42a9070f-c965-56f2-aac9-9d83e581b3d6', 'identical', '/aɪˈdentɪkl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Giống nhau hoàn toàn về mọi mặt, không có sự khác biệt.', 'being exactly the same in every detail and having no differences between two or more things.', 'The twins wore identical outfits to the party, making it hard to tell them apart.', 'Hai chị em sinh đôi mặc trang phục giống hệt nhau đến bữa tiệc, khiến khó phân biệt họ.', '{\"en\": \"Both branches of the company use identical software to manage their daily inventory records.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai chi nhánh của công ty đều sử dụng phần mềm giống hệt nhau để quản lý hồ sơ hàng tồn kho hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-ljspeech-d3f23119.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-cori-d3f23119.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/identical-b8fab11a.webp', '[\"alike\", \"matching\"]', '[\"different\", \"distinct\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"identical to\", \"meaning\": \"giống hệt với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"identical twins\", \"meaning\": \"anh chị em sinh đôi giống hệt nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"indistinguishable\", \"note_vi\": \"khó phân biệt được bằng mắt thường, khác với giống nhau hoàn toàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"identity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-cori-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru0-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru5-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru6-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru10-d3f23119.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru9-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru3-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru7-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru8-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru2-d3f23119.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-ljspeech-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt408-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt138-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt624-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt396-d3f23119.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt498-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt132-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt288-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt42-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt90-d3f23119.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'to\' hoặc \'with\'.', 'business', 1, 27),
('eb1c6b22-647a-51e4-b307-a98d5adaf33b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '1e05a2b4-25f4-5912-abc5-969bda239571', '42a9070f-c965-56f2-aac9-9d83e581b3d6', 'crucial', 'UK: /ˈkruːʃəl/ | US: /ˈkruːʃəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'quan trọng, cốt yếu', 'Of supreme importance, especially in determining the success or failure of something.', 'Timely delivery is crucial for customer satisfaction.', 'Giao hàng đúng hẹn là yếu tố cốt yếu cho sự hài lòng của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Effective communication is crucial for the success of any cross-departmental project.\", \"vi\": \"Giao tiếp hiệu quả là vô cùng quan trọng đối với sự thành công của bất kỳ dự án liên phòng ban nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-ljspeech-dd3cf290.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-cori-dd3cf290.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crucial-2cb19405.webp', '[\"essential\", \"vital\", \"critical\", \"pivotal\"]', '[\"trivial\", \"unimportant\", \"minor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"play a crucial role\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai trò quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crucial factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố cốt yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it is crucial that\", \"meaning\": \"điều quan trọng là\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"crucially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-cori-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru0-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru5-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru6-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru10-dd3cf290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru9-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru3-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru7-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru8-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru2-dd3cf290.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-ljspeech-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt408-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt138-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt624-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt396-dd3cf290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt498-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt132-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt288-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt42-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt90-dd3cf290.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước mệnh đề hoặc động từ nguyên mẫu: \'It is crucial to do something\' hoặc \'play a crucial role in\'. Xuất hiện nhiều trong Part 5 & 7.', 'business', 1, 28),
('fc18a171-d786-5de0-8131-18c45bce129e', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '1e05a2b4-25f4-5912-abc5-969bda239571', '42a9070f-c965-56f2-aac9-9d83e581b3d6', 'neutral', '/ˈnjuːtrəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không đứng về phía nào trong một cuộc tranh chấp hoặc xung đột.', 'not supporting either side in a disagreement or conflict.', 'As a mediator, it\'s important to remain neutral and listen to both sides fairly.', 'Với tư cách là người hòa giải, điều quan trọng là phải giữ thái độ trung lập và lắng nghe cả hai bên một cách công bằng.', '{\"en\": \"The chairman stayed neutral during the debate between the two departments.\", \"vi\": \"Vị chủ tịch giữ thái độ trung lập trong cuộc tranh luận giữa hai phòng ban.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-ljspeech-e7fb41a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-cori-e7fb41a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neutral-2026933f.webp', '[\"impartial\", \"unbiased\", \"nonpartisan\"]', '[\"biased\", \"partial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"neutral position\", \"meaning\": \"vị thế trung lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain neutral\", \"meaning\": \"giữ trung lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"neutral party\", \"meaning\": \"bên trung lập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"natural\", \"note_vi\": \"natural nghĩa là tự nhiên, không phải không thiên vị\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"neutrality\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"neutralize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-cori-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru0-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru5-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru6-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru10-e7fb41a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru9-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru3-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru7-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru8-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru2-e7fb41a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-ljspeech-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt408-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt138-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt624-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt396-e7fb41a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt498-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt132-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt288-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt42-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt90-e7fb41a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Neutral phát âm có âm t câm, đừng phát âm thành \'neu-tral\'.', 'business', 1, 29)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('c6bdb439-7a45-5812-a430-e2b1a74ce8e4', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '2908ee48-5bf4-52da-a36c-f7120045267c', '6789d49d-7f96-5934-b503-79a96f747592', 'enable', 'UK: /ɪˈneɪbəl/ | US: /ɪˈneɪbəl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'cho phép, làm cho có thể', 'To make it possible or easy for someone to do something or for an action to happen.', 'The new software enables remote teams to collaborate effectively.', 'Phần mềm mới cho phép các nhóm làm việc từ xa cộng tác hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update will enable employees to access company files remotely.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới sẽ cho phép nhân viên truy cập hồ sơ công ty từ xa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-ljspeech-9905c339.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-cori-9905c339.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enable-b66c55d1.webp', '[\"allow\", \"permit\", \"facilitate\", \"empower\"]', '[\"prevent\", \"disable\", \"hinder\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enable somebody to do something\", \"meaning\": \"cho phép/giúp ai làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enable access\", \"meaning\": \"cho phép truy cập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"able\", \"note_vi\": \"\'able\' là tính từ thể hiện khả năng, còn \'enable\' là động từ tạo điều kiện cho ai có thể làm gì.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"enabled\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enabler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-cori-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru0-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru5-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru6-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru10-9905c339.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru9-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru3-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru7-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru8-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-aru2-9905c339.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-ljspeech-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt408-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt138-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt624-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt396-9905c339.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt498-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt132-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt288-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt42-9905c339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enable-lt90-9905c339.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: \'enable somebody to do something\' (cho phép/giúp ai làm gì). Khác với \'allow\' mang tính cấp phép, \'enable\' mang tính tạo điều kiện.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('43721ddb-30fc-54a5-acb9-4587ecdada3f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '2908ee48-5bf4-52da-a36c-f7120045267c', '6789d49d-7f96-5934-b503-79a96f747592', 'continually', 'UK: /kənˈtɪnjuəli/ | US: /kənˈtɪnjuəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'liên tục, không ngừng', 'in a way that happens repeatedly or frequently over a period of time.', 'The team continually strives for better results.', 'Đội nhóm không ngừng phấn đấu để đạt được kết quả tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The research team continually strives to refine the product formula to increase efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ nghiên cứu liên tục nỗ lực hoàn thiện công thức sản phẩm nhằm tăng hiệu suất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-ljspeech-9a698970.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-cori-9a698970.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/continually-33a64f52.webp', '[\"repeatedly\", \"frequently\", \"constantly\", \"regularly\"]', '[\"rarely\", \"occasionally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"continually update\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật liên tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"continually seek\", \"meaning\": \"không ngừng tìm kiếm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"continuously\", \"note_vi\": \"Continually là lặp đi lặp lại có khoảng nghỉ, còn continuously là xuyên suốt không ngừng nghỉ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"continual\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"continue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-cori-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru0-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru5-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru6-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru10-9a698970.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru9-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru3-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru7-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru8-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-aru2-9a698970.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-ljspeech-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt408-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt138-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt624-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt396-9a698970.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt498-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt132-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt288-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt42-9a698970.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continually-lt90-9a698970.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ miêu tả hành động lặp đi lặp lại thường xuyên (thường diễn tả nỗ lực cải tiến hoặc rắc rối lặp lại).', 'research and development', 1, 1),
('3639b5a9-f508-54dd-88d1-2f6af88e907b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '2908ee48-5bf4-52da-a36c-f7120045267c', '6789d49d-7f96-5934-b503-79a96f747592', 'nursing', '/ˈnɜːsɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nghề điều dưỡng, việc chăm sóc bệnh nhân', 'the job or activity of caring for sick or injured people in a hospital.', 'She decided to pursue a career in nursing because she loves helping people.', 'Cô ấy quyết định theo đuổi sự nghiệp điều dưỡng vì cô ấy yêu thích việc giúp đỡ mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The hospital management board announced ten new job openings for the qualified nursing staff.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị bệnh viện đã thông báo mười vị trí tuyển dụng mới cho nhân viên điều dưỡng đạt chuẩn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-ljspeech-a8dea297.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-cori-a8dea297.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nursing-e3cac66b.webp', '[\"caregiving\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"nursing home\", \"meaning\": \"viện dưỡng lão\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nursing staff\", \"meaning\": \"đội ngũ điều dưỡng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nursery\", \"note_vi\": \"nursery là nhà trẻ hoặc vườn ươm cây\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nurse\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"nurse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-cori-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru0-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru5-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru6-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru10-a8dea297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru9-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru3-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru7-a8dea297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nursing-aru8-