('fdd1fff4-098d-5439-810d-c1d116d1fbf3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'concrete', '/ˈkɒŋkriːt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Vật liệu xây dựng cứng, làm từ xi măng, cát, đá và nước.', 'a hard building material made by mixing cement, sand, small stones, and water.', 'The new bridge is made of reinforced concrete, making it very strong.', 'Cây cầu mới được làm bằng bê tông cốt thép, giúp nó rất chắc chắn.', '{\"en\": \"The construction workers are pouring concrete to build the foundation of the new warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Các công nhân xây dựng đang đổ bê tông để xây móng cho nhà kho mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-ljspeech-aec5c8ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-cori-aec5c8ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concrete-c48d39b7.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reinforced concrete\", \"meaning\": \"bê tông cốt thép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pour concrete\", \"meaning\": \"đổ bê tông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cement\", \"note_vi\": \"cement là xi măng (chỉ là một thành phần tạo nên bê tông)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"concrete\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-cori-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru0-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru5-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru6-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru10-aec5c8ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru9-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru3-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru7-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru8-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-aru2-aec5c8ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-ljspeech-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt408-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt138-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt624-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt396-aec5c8ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt498-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt132-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt288-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt42-aec5c8ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concrete-lt90-aec5c8ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'concrete\' (bê tông - hỗn hợp) và \'cement\' (xi măng - dạng bột).', 'manufacturing', 1, 2),
('c533272c-b70c-5022-8837-104273230a80', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'conduct', 'UK: /kənˈdʌkt/ | US: /kənˈdʌkt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'tiến hành, thực hiện', 'To organize, manage, and carry out a particular activity, process, or research.', 'We will conduct a survey to assess customer satisfaction.', 'Chúng tôi sẽ tiến hành khảo sát để đánh giá sự hài lòng của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department will conduct interviews for the senior managerial position next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự sẽ tiến hành phỏng vấn cho vị trí quản lý cấp cao vào thứ Hai tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-ljspeech-1f005da3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-cori-1f005da3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conduct-c11cb67d.webp', '[\"carry out\", \"perform\", \"execute\", \"organize\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct a survey\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành một cuộc khảo sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conduct an investigation\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành điều tra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conduct research\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện nghiên cứu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conduce\", \"note_vi\": \"Conduce (v) mang nghĩa dẫn đến/góp phần vào, ít dùng hơn nhiều so với conduct.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conduct\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conductor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-cori-1f005da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-aru0-1f005da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-aru5-1f005da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-aru6-1f005da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-aru10-1f005da3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-aru9-1f005da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conduct-aru3-1f005da