('0464f2ec-d3c2-5c2c-9f15-da61054d8c5f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'confess', '/kənˈfes/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thừa nhận một việc làm sai trái hoặc một bí mật.', 'to admit that you have done something wrong, bad, or illegal.', 'He decided to confess his mistake to his parents after feeling guilty for days.', 'Anh ấy quyết định thú nhận lỗi lầm của mình với bố mẹ sau nhiều ngày cảm thấy tội lỗi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to confess that the project would not be completed on schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã phải thừa nhận rằng dự án sẽ không được hoàn thành đúng tiến độ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-ljspeech-62d2b1f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-cori-62d2b1f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confess-b1f51141.webp', '[\"admit\", \"acknowledge\", \"reveal\"]', '[\"deny\", \"conceal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confess to a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận một lỗi lầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confess that\", \"meaning\": \"thú nhận rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confuse\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ chỉ sự làm cho bối rối, nhầm lẫn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confession\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-cori-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru0-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru5-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru6-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru10-62d2b1f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru9-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru3-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru7-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru8-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-aru2-62d2b1f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-ljspeech-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt408-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt138-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt624-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt396-62d2b1f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt498-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt132-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt288-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt42-62d2b1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confess-lt90-62d2b1f3.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \"to\" khi theo sau là một danh từ hoặc danh động từ (V-ing).', 'office', 1, 9),
('32c367a2-d1eb-5daf-bf7c-b67b89842722', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'optimistic', '/ˌɒptɪˈmɪstɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có thái độ tích cực, tin tưởng vào điều tốt đẹp sẽ xảy ra.', 'expecting good things to happen or believing that something will be successful.', 'Despite the challenges, she remained optimistic about the project\'s success.', 'Mặc dù có nhiều thách thức, cô ấy vẫn lạc quan về thành công của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The board members are optimistic about expanding the retail business into overseas markets.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị rất lạc quan về việc mở rộng kinh doanh bán lẻ ra thị trường nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-ljspeech-f1913a74.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-cori-f1913a74.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/optimistic-3908d4d6.webp', '[\"hopeful\", \"positive\", \"confident\"]', '[\"pessimistic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cautiously optimistic\", \"meaning\": \"lạc quan một cách thận trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"optimistic outlook\", \"meaning\": \"góc nhìn lạc quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pessimistic\", \"note_vi\": \"Pessimistic là bi quan, trái nghĩa hoàn toàn với optimistic.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"optimism\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"optimist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"optimistically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-cori-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru0-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru5-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru6-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru10-f1913a74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru9-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru3-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru7-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru8-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-aru2-f1913a74.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-ljspeech-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt408-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt138-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt624-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt396-f1913a74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt498-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt132-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt288-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt42-f1913a74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/optimistic-lt90-f1913a74.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ \'about\' (optimistic about something).', 'business', 1, 10),
('8dae19ef-cecc-5e61-af5d-7daefbb650d8', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'historian', '/hɪˈstɔːriən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người nghiên cứu và viết về lịch sử.', 'An expert who researches, analyzes, and records historical events and past human societies.', 'A renowned historian gave a fascinating lecture on ancient civilizations.', 'Một nhà sử học nổi tiếng đã có một bài giảng hấp dẫn về các nền văn minh cổ đại.', '{\"en\": \"The historian was hired to consult on the museum\'s new exhibition.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sử học được thuê làm tư vấn cho triển lãm mới của bảo tàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-ljspeech-8ab500bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-cori-8ab500bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/historian-2107796b.webp', '[\"chronicler\", \"history scholar\", \"researcher\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"renowned historian\", \"meaning\": \"nhà sử học danh tiếng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"professional historian\", \"meaning\": \"nhà sử học chuyên nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"history\", \"note_vi\": \"history là môn học, historian là người nghiên cứu lịch sử.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"history\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"historical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-cori-8ab500bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru0-8ab500bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru5-8ab500bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru6-8ab500bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru10-8ab500bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru9-8ab500bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru3-8ab500bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historian-aru7-8ab500bf.