('117747a3-bbe9-560b-a9a7-477e6187079d', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'fever', '/ˈfiːvə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng thân nhiệt cơ thể tăng cao hơn bình thường do bệnh.', 'a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal.', 'The doctor advised him to rest until his fever subsides completely.', 'Bác sĩ khuyên anh ấy nên nghỉ ngơi cho đến khi cơn sốt giảm hẳn.', '{\"en\": \"The employee called in sick because she had a high fever and a sore throat.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã gọi điện xin nghỉ ốm vì cô ấy bị sốt cao và đau họng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-ljspeech-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fever-f24117e9.webp', '[\"temperature\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"run a fever\", \"meaning\": \"bị sốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high fever\", \"meaning\": \"sốt cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"favor\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ sự giúp đỡ hoặc ủng hộ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feverish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru0-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru5-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru6-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru10-e2f347fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru9-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru3-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru7-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru8-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru2-e2f347fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/