('638449f6-8e81-5872-95a0-7c989c29b229', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '53729796-a08c-5c53-b4fd-1f01e533a8fe', 'fb1c33d4-9ec8-5109-b23d-537950310af0', 'disagreement', '/ˌdɪsəˈɡriːmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng không đồng ý hoặc có ý kiến khác biệt.', 'a situation where people have different opinions or fail to agree.', 'There was a slight disagreement among the team members about the best approach.', 'Có một chút bất đồng giữa các thành viên trong nhóm về phương pháp tiếp cận tốt nhất.', '{\"en\": \"There was a minor disagreement between the two partners regarding the marketing budget.\", \"vi\": \"Đã có một sự bất đồng ý kiến nhỏ giữa hai đối tác liên quan đến ngân sách tiếp thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-ljspeech-f3d78eaa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-cori-f3d78eaa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disagreement-602bde39.webp', '[\"dispute\", \"argument\", \"conflict\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"harmony\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have a disagreement\", \"meaning\": \"có sự bất đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disagreement over\", \"meaning\": \"sự bất đồng về việc gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"argument\", \"note_vi\": \"disagreement là bất đồng quan điểm, argument là cuộc tranh cãi nảy lửa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disagree\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disagreeable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-cori-f3d78eaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-aru0-f3d78eaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-aru5-f3d78eaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-aru6-f3d78eaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-aru10-f3d78eaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreement-aru9-f3d78eaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disagreemen