('95261dcd-4cc4-5697-ae02-081b3cdacc88', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5725bd42-be2e-54a4-8a40-76d80630510c', '954a2918-cd0c-5f7c-8bf2-5ec1fff06698', 'confusion', '/kənˈfjuːʒn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Trạng thái không hiểu rõ ràng hoặc không thể suy nghĩ mạch lạc.', 'a state of not being able to understand what is happening or what to do.', 'There was a lot of confusion about the new rules, so many people asked questions.', 'Có rất nhiều sự bối rối về các quy tắc mới, nên nhiều người đã đặt câu hỏi.', '{\"en\": \"There was some confusion regarding the meeting time, so we sent a follow-up email.\", \"vi\": \"Có một chút nhầm lẫn về thời gian cuộc họp, vì vậy chúng tôi đã gửi email xác nhận lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-ljspeech-cfc8b23a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-cori-cfc8b23a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confusion-0d2396df.webp', '[\"uncertainty\", \"misunderstanding\"]', '[\"clarity\", \"understanding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cause confusion\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự nhầm lẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear up confusion\", \"meaning\": \"làm rõ sự nhầm lẫn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confuse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-cori-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru0-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru5-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru6-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru10-cfc8b23a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru9-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru3-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru7-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusion-aru8-cfc8b23a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object