('60ee5329-ccda-5501-819e-8953a0606dcd', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5725bd42-be2e-54a4-8a40-76d80630510c', '954a2918-cd0c-5f7c-8bf2-5ec1fff06698', 'modest', '/ˈmɒdɪst/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không quá lớn, không phô trương; hoặc thể hiện sự khiêm nhường.', 'not very large in size, amount, or price, or showing a humble attitude toward personal success.', 'Despite her success, she remained very modest about her achievements.', 'Dù thành công, cô ấy vẫn rất khiêm tốn về những thành tựu của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a modest increase in quarterly profits despite the challenging economic market conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo mức tăng trưởng lợi nhuận khiêm tốn trong quý dù điều kiện thị trường kinh tế đầy thách thức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-ljspeech-0a1784bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-cori-0a1784bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/modest-3f89b0ae.webp', '[\"moderate\", \"humble\"]', '[\"excessive\", \"large\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"modest increase\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng khiêm tốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"modest budget\", \"meaning\": \"ngân sách vừa phải\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"modesty\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"modestly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-cori-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru0-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru5-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru6-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru10-0a1784bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru9-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru3-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modest-aru7-0a1784bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2