('298a381b-315f-50ef-a6f4-a77733eedad7', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5b2a68ff-ffa6-5685-8606-5623d5f1f600', '051e7114-78e9-55d8-b256-f0843a188b27', 'withdraw', '/wɪðˈdrɔː/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Lấy lại, rút ra hoặc rút lui.', 'to take money out of an account or to remove oneself from a situation.', 'He decided to withdraw his application from the competition.', 'Anh ấy quyết định rút đơn đăng ký khỏi cuộc thi.', '{\"en\": \"The client decided to withdraw his funds from the investment account yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã quyết định rút tiền của mình khỏi tài khoản đầu tư vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-ljspeech-951f850c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-cori-951f850c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/withdraw-e452e6f1.webp', '[\"remove\", \"extract\", \"retreat\"]', '[\"deposit\", \"insert\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"withdraw money\", \"meaning\": \"rút tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"withdraw from a contract\", \"meaning\": \"rút khỏi một hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"withhold\", \"note_vi\": \"withhold là giữ lại không đưa, withdraw là lấy lại hoặc rút ra\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"withdrawal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-cori-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru0-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru5-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru6-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru10-951f850c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru9-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru3-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru7-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withdraw-aru8-951f850c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p