('9589dd57-935a-5ed9-90a3-a466ad59ccfb', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5b2a68ff-ffa6-5685-8606-5623d5f1f600', '051e7114-78e9-55d8-b256-f0843a188b27', 'dramatically', '/drəˈmætɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách đáng kể, mạnh mẽ hoặc đột ngột.', 'in a way that is very sudden, large, or surprising in degree.', 'The company\'s profits increased dramatically after the new marketing campaign.', 'Lợi nhuận của công ty đã tăng đáng kể sau chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.', '{\"en\": \"The demand for our new services has grown dramatically since we launched the advertising campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Nhu cầu cho các dịch vụ mới của chúng tôi đã tăng đáng kể kể từ khi chúng tôi tung chiến dịch quảng cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-ljspeech-3a210a49.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-cori-3a210a49.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dramatically-2f937fdb.webp', '[\"significantly\", \"substantially\"]', '[\"slightly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dramatically increased\", \"meaning\": \"tăng đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dramatically changed\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi mạnh mẽ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dramatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-cori-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru0-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru5-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru6-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru10-3a210a49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru9-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru3-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru7-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru8-3a210a49.mp3\", \"