('f0014ae4-ee6b-5cfb-a0ac-c133e207970a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5b2a68ff-ffa6-5685-8606-5623d5f1f600', '051e7114-78e9-55d8-b256-f0843a188b27', 'permanently', '/ˈpɜːmənəntli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách lâu dài, không thay đổi hoặc không có ý định thay đổi.', 'for all time in the future without any changes or plans to stop doing something.', 'After years of moving, they decided to settle permanently in Canada.', 'Sau nhiều năm chuyển nhà, họ quyết định định cư vĩnh viễn ở Canada.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to permanently close the branch office due to the recent budget cuts.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định đóng cửa vĩnh viễn văn phòng chi nhánh do việc cắt giảm ngân sách gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-ljspeech-f3c0246b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-cori-f3c0246b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/permanently-a5cfbac0.webp', '[\"forever\", \"lastingly\"]', '[\"temporarily\", \"briefly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"permanently closed\", \"meaning\": \"đóng cửa vĩnh viễn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"permanently disabled\", \"meaning\": \"tàn tật vĩnh viễn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"permanent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-cori-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru0-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru5-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru6-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru10-f3c0246b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru9-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru3-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru7-f3c0246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanently-aru8-f3c02