('3eb2db23-ba57-59c1-8ea4-fbe448ed90c9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5fc7ba95-807d-57d0-aa08-f673d19bbfe8', '99c9bea4-1837-5924-9511-6d6aa7dcb1da', 'ownership', '/ˈəʊnəʃɪp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Quyền sở hữu, quyền làm chủ một tài sản.', 'the legal right to possess and control property or a business.', 'The company transferred ownership of the property to the new buyer.', 'Công ty đã chuyển quyền sở hữu tài sản cho người mua mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company announced a transfer of ownership to a global investment firm.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thông báo về việc chuyển giao quyền sở hữu sang một công ty đầu tư toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-ljspeech-9fea7940.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-cori-9fea7940.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ownership-288b2e8e.webp', '[\"possession\", \"proprietorship\", \"title\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"home ownership\", \"meaning\": \"quuyền sở hữu nhà ở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transfer of ownership\", \"meaning\": \"sự chuyển giao quyền sở hữu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take ownership\", \"meaning\": \"nhận trách nhiệm/nắm quyền sở hữu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"membership\", \"note_vi\": \"membership là tư cách thành viên\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"own\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"owner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-cori-9fea7940.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-aru0-9fea7940.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-aru5-9fea7940.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-aru6-9fea7940.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-aru10-9fea7940.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-aru9-9fea7940.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-aru3-9fea7940.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ownership-a