('2946be8f-8f6c-5a10-96c3-710877c8921a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5fc7ba95-807d-57d0-aa08-f673d19bbfe8', '99c9bea4-1837-5924-9511-6d6aa7dcb1da', 'formation', '/fɔːˈmeɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quá trình tạo ra hoặc phát triển một cái gì đó.', 'the way in which something is created or the way it is arranged.', 'The formation of clouds is a complex process involving water vapor.', 'Sự hình thành mây là một quá trình phức tạp liên quan đến hơi nước.', '{\"en\": \"The formation of a new committee was necessary to oversee the upcoming corporate merger.\", \"vi\": \"Việc thành lập một ủy ban mới là cần thiết để giám sát vụ sáp nhập doanh nghiệp sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-ljspeech-776c6153.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-cori-776c6153.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/formation-209a6228.webp', '[\"creation\", \"establishment\"]', '[\"dissolution\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"formation of a company\", \"meaning\": \"sự thành lập công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"team formation\", \"meaning\": \"việc thành lập đội nhóm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"form\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-cori-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru0-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru5-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru6-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru10-776c6153.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru9-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru3-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru7-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru8-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-aru2-776c6153.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-ljspeech-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt408-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt138-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt624-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt396-776c6153.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt498-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt132-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt288-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt42-776c6153.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formation-lt90-776c6153.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong ngữ cảnh thành lập tổ chức hoặc cấu trúc.', 'business', 1, 27),
('f6565114-dd93-5bbd-b995-2f22c33e7238', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5fc7ba95-807d-57d0-aa08-f673d19bbfe8', '99c9bea4-1837-5924-9511-6d6aa7dcb1da', 'besides', '/bɪˈsaɪdz/', 'A2', 'preposition', 'Ngoài cái gì đó hoặc ai đó.', 'in addition to something or somebody, or as well as something.', 'Besides English, she can also speak French and Spanish.', 'Ngoài tiếng Anh, cô ấy còn có thể nói tiếng Pháp và tiếng Tây Ban Nha.', '{\"en\": \"Besides managing the project, Mr. Lee also handled client communication directly.\", \"vi\": \"Ngoài việc quản lý dự án, ông Lee còn trực tiếp xử lý giao tiếp với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-ljspeech-94a325fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-cori-94a325fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/besides-c948c48c.webp', '[\"in addition to\", \"as well as\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"besides that\", \"meaning\": \"ngoài ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"besides doing something\", \"meaning\": \"bên cạnh việc làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beside\", \"note_vi\": \"Beside nghĩa là \'bên cạnh\' (vị trí), còn besides nghĩa là \'ngoài ra\'.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-cori-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru0-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru5-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru6-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru10-94a325fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru9-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru3-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru7-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru8-94a325fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/besides-aru2-94a325fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [