('6bf0efce-1b1b-5a4f-9279-407b3c267351', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '5fc7ba95-807d-57d0-aa08-f673d19bbfe8', '99c9bea4-1837-5924-9511-6d6aa7dcb1da', 'artificial', 'UK: /ˌɑːtɪˈfɪʃl/ | US: /ˌɑːrtɪˈfɪʃl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nhân tạo', 'made or produced by human beings rather than occurring naturally in the environment', 'The product contains no artificial colors or flavors.', 'Sản phẩm không chứa màu hoặc hương vị nhân tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The beverage manufacturer decided to eliminate artificial flavorings from its products.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất đồ uống đã quyết định loại bỏ các chất hương liệu nhân tạo khỏi sản phẩm của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-ljspeech-d9004fc1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-cori-d9004fc1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/artificial-184b777c.webp', '[\"man-made\", \"synthetic\", \"manufactured\"]', '[\"natural\", \"genuine\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"artificial intelligence\", \"meaning\": \"trí tuệ nhân tạo (AI)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"artificial coloring\", \"meaning\": \"phẩm màu nhân tạo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"artificially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-cori-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru0-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru5-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru6-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru10-d9004fc1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru9-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru3-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru7-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru8-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru2-d9004fc1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-ljspeech-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt408-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt138-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt624-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt396-d9004fc1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt498-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt132-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt288-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt42-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt90-d9004fc1.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong các cụm như \'artificial intelligence\' (AI - trí tuệ nhân tạo) và \'artificial ingredients\' (thành phần nhân tạo).', 'general', 1, 29),
('edf4a9b1-7f18-564c-9100-ec0e2cd2f36f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'whoever', '/huːˈevə(r)/', 'B1', 'pronoun', 'Bất cứ ai, người nào (mà).', 'the person or people who do something, no matter which person it is.', 'Whoever wants to join the club must sign up by Friday.', 'Bất cứ ai muốn tham gia câu lạc bộ phải đăng ký trước thứ Sáu.', '{\"en\": \"Whoever submits the complete budget proposal by noon will receive priority consideration for the project.\", \"vi\": \"Bất cứ ai nộp đề xuất ngân sách hoàn chỉnh trước giữa trưa sẽ nhận được sự xem xét ưu tiên cho dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-ljspeech-aa39520e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-cori-aa39520e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whoever-019e2b31.webp', '[\"whomever\", \"anyone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whoever is responsible\", \"meaning\": \"bất cứ ai chịu trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whoever wants to\", \"meaning\": \"bất cứ ai muốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"whomever\", \"note_vi\": \"Whomever đóng vai trò tân ngữ, còn whoever đóng vai trò chủ ngữ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-cori-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru0-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru5-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru6-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru10-aa39520e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru9-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru3-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru7-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru8-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-aru2-aa39520e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-ljspeech-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt408-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt138-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt624-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt396-aa39520e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt498-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt132-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt288-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt42-aa39520e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whoever-lt90-aa39520e.mp3\"]}}', 'Whoever đứng đầu mệnh đề danh từ làm chủ ngữ trong câu phức.', 'office', 1, 0),
('2c68b122-52c1-565f-bc44-eb6c6be770c3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'completion', '/kəmˈpliːʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự hoàn thành, kết thúc một công việc, dự án hoặc quá trình.', 'the act of finishing something that you are doing or making.', 'The completion of the new bridge is expected next year.', 'Việc hoàn thành cây cầu mới dự kiến vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The construction project is nearing completion, and the grand opening is scheduled for next month.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án xây dựng đang gần hoàn thành, và lễ khai trương được lên lịch vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-ljspeech-cadc9141.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-cori-cadc9141.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/completion-839bbc73.webp', '[\"finish\", \"conclusion\", \"achievement\"]', '[\"beginning\", \"start\", \"initiation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"near completion\", \"meaning\": \"gần hoàn thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upon completion\", \"meaning\": \"khi hoàn thành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compliment\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ lời khen ngợi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"complete\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"complete\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"completely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-cori-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru0-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru5-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru6-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru10-cadc9141.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru9-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru3-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v