('2a593c1d-5a72-56d1-a02b-b1f90b8640f5', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'miner', '/ˈmaɪnə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người làm việc trong hầm mỏ để khai thác khoáng sản.', 'a person who works underground to extract coal, metals, or valuable substances from the earth.', 'The coal miner spent most of his life working underground.', 'Người thợ mỏ than đã dành phần lớn cuộc đời mình làm việc dưới lòng đất.', '{\"en\": \"The mining company bought new safety equipment for every miner working in the underground facility.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khai khoáng đã mua thiết bị bảo hộ mới cho mỗi công nhân mỏ làm việc trong hầm ngầm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-ljspeech-1c40b245.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-cori-1c40b245.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/miner-fcba70b7.webp', '[\"collier\", \"excavator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coal miner\", \"meaning\": \"thợ mỏ than\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gold miner\", \"meaning\": \"thợ khai thác vàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"minor\", \"note_vi\": \"minor (phát âm giống miner) là người vị thành niên hoặc tiểu tiết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mine\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mine\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mining\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-cori-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru0-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru5-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru6-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru10-1c40b245.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru9-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru3-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru7-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru8-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-aru2-1c40b245.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-ljspeech-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt408-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt138-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt624-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt396-1c40b245.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt498-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt132-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt288-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt42-1c40b245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miner-lt90-1c40b245.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm giống hệt từ \'minor\' (người chưa trưởng thành), cần chú ý ngữ cảnh.', 'manufacturing', 1, 9),
('be207646-c13f-5bdc-abd2-3a857bca33ed', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'consistently', '/kənˈsɪstəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách kiên định, không thay đổi.', 'in a way that does not change and remains steady or reliable.', 'To achieve your goals, you need to work hard and consistently.', 'Để đạt được mục tiêu, bạn cần làm việc chăm chỉ và nhất quán.', '{\"en\": \"The newly hired manager has consistently delivered projects well before deadlines.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý mới được tuyển dụng đã liên tục hoàn thành các dự án trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-ljspeech-94f2f00e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-cori-94f2f00e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consistently-362bb419.webp', '[\"regularly\", \"steadily\", \"constantly\"]', '[\"inconsistently\", \"irregularly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consistently high quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng cao ổn định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consistently perform well\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động tốt một cách ổn định\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consistent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consistency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-cori-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru0-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru5-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru6-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru10-94f2f00e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru9-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru3-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru7-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru8-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru2-94f2f00e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-ljspeech-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt408-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt138-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt624-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt396-94f2f00e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt498-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt132-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt288-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt42-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-lt90-94f2f00e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ rất hay xuất hiện trong đề thi TOEIC để diễn tả hiệu suất làm việc.', 'office', 1, 10),
('d48218e0-46ef-51d1-bbbb-7201e06f728a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'probability', '/ˌprɒbəˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng một sự việc xảy ra.', 'the level of chance that a particular event will happen in the future.', 'The statistical report indicates a high probability of market growth next quarter.', 'Báo cáo thống kê chỉ ra khả năng cao thị trường sẽ phát triển trong quý tới.', '{\"en\": \"There is a high probability that the shipment will arrive before the end of business today.\", \"vi\": \"Có khả năng cao là lô hàng sẽ đến trước khi kết thúc giờ làm việc hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-ljspeech-a88397b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-cori-a88397b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/probability-75d40612.webp', '[\"likelihood\", \"chance\"]', '[\"impossibility\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high probability\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"statistical probability\", \"meaning\": \"xác suất thống kê\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"probable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-cori-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru0-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru5-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru6-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru10-a88397b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru9-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru3-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru7-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru8-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prob