('39ee2cf9-fa72-5c34-998e-4b2fba7cb3e3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'monument', '/ˈmɒnjumənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Công trình kiến trúc lớn để tưởng nhớ một người hoặc sự kiện.', 'a large structure built to remind people of a famous person or historical event.', 'The Statue of Liberty is a famous national monument in the United States.', 'Tượng Nữ thần Tự do là một đài kỷ niệm quốc gia nổi tiếng ở Hoa Kỳ.', '{\"en\": \"The city council plans to build a new monument near the central business district.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng thành phố dự định xây dựng một đài tưởng niệm mới gần khu trung tâm thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-ljspeech-e10fc4ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-cori-e10fc4ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monument-5fe9eb84.webp', '[\"memorial\", \"statue\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"national monument\", \"meaning\": \"đài tưởng niệm quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"historical monument\", \"meaning\": \"di tích lịch sử\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"monumental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-cori-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru0-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru5-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru6-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru10-e10fc4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru9-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru3-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru7-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru8-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru2-e10fc4ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-ljspeech-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt408-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt138-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt624-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt396-e10fc4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt498-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt132-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt288-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt42-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-lt90-e10fc4ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'document\' (tài liệu).', 'travel', 1, 12),
('2257a403-c332-5780-81fe-4213e2e6ea74', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'unfortunate', '/ʌnˈfɔːtʃənət/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'không may, đáng tiếc', 'happening in a way that causes sadness or bad results for someone.', 'Due to an unfortunate system error, our online payment server went down today.', 'Do một lỗi hệ thống đáng tiếc, máy chủ thanh toán trực tuyến của chúng tôi đã bị sập hôm nay.', '{\"en\": \"It is an unfortunate situation that our shipment was delayed due to the heavy storm.\", \"vi\": \"Thật là một tình huống đáng tiếc khi lô hàng của chúng ta bị trì hoãn do cơn bão lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-ljspeech-661ee9f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-cori-661ee9f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unfortunate-1a635709.webp', '[\"regrettable\", \"unlucky\"]', '[\"fortunate\", \"lucky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unfortunate event\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiện không may\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly unfortunate\", \"meaning\": \"rất đáng tiếc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unfortunately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-cori-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru0-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru5-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru6-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru10-661ee9f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru9-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru3-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru7-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru8-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-aru2-661ee9f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-ljspeech-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt408-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt138-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt624-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt396-661ee9f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt498-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt132-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt288-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt42-661ee9f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunate-lt90-661ee9f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để diễn tả sự việc buồn hoặc kết quả xấu ngoài ý muốn.', 'business', 1, 13),
('7dd46284-f1cf-5427-8ee9-02f09e1ce5df', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'awareness', '/əˈweənəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự hiểu biết, nhận thức về một vấn đề hoặc tình huống.', 'knowledge or understanding of a particular subject, situation, or issue.', 'There is a growing awareness of environmental issues among young people.', 'Giới trẻ đang ngày càng có nhận thức cao hơn về các vấn đề môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign successfully raised brand awareness among young consumers.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị đã nâng cao nhận thức về thương hiệu thành công đối với người tiêu dùng trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-ljspeech-eee3afcf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-cori-eee3afcf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/awareness-03d214db.webp', '[\"consciousness\", \"understanding\", \"perception\"]', '[\"ignorance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"raise awareness\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao nhận thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brand awareness\", \"meaning\": \"nhận thức thương hiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public awareness\", \"meaning\": \"nhận thức của công chúng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"aware\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-cori-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru0-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru5-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru6-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru10-eee3afcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru9-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru3-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru7-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru8-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru2-eee3afcf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-ljspeech-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt408-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt138-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt624-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt396-eee3afcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt498-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt132-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt288-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt42-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt90-eee3afcf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ \'raise\' (nâng cao nhận thức) hoặc giới từ \'of\'.', 'marketing', 1, 14),
('2aba6190-e105-54cd-998a-506de3ae7ed1', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '61e85e0f-c41b-5c2a-b824-ee2de8f5cb6c', '6026697b-beba-5339-b4be-26823f28b42a', 'so-called', '/ˌsəʊˈkɔːld/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'được gọi là (nhưng có thể không đúng hoặc không xứng đáng).', 'used to describe something by a name that May not be correct or deserved.', 'His so-called friends left him alone when he needed help.', 'Những người bạn \"cái gọi là\" của anh ta đã bỏ mặc anh ta khi anh ta cần giúp đỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The so-called premium service offered by the vendor failed to meet our expectations.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ được gọi là cao cấp của nhà cung cấp đã không đáp ứng được kỳ vọng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-ljspeech-35d958f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-cori-35d958f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/so-called-2b937e0d.webp', '[\"supposed\", \"alleged\", \"self-styled\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"so-called expert\", \"meaning\": \"người được gọi là chuyên gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"so-called solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp được gọi là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"so-called improvement\", \"meaning\": \"sự cải tiến được gọi là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"so called\", \"note_vi\": \"so-called có gạch nối khi đứng trước danh từ; không có gạch nối khi đứng sau\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-cori-35d958f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-aru0-35d958f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-aru5-35d958f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-aru6-35d958f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-aru10-35d958f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-aru9-35d958f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-called-aru3-35d958f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu