('874220ef-bbd2-5937-90fc-d814cc750012', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'disappointment', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác buồn bã vì điều gì đó không như mong đợi.', 'the feeling of being sad because something was not as good as you hoped.', 'The cancellation of the concert was a huge disappointment to all the fans.', 'Việc hủy bỏ buổi hòa nhạc là một sự thất vọng lớn đối với tất cả người hâm mộ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed his disappointment regarding the low sales figures for the previous quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã bày tỏ sự thất vọng của mình về doanh số bán hàng thấp trong quý trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-ljspeech-c85014f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-cori-c85014f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disappointment-ceea666b.webp', '[\"regret\", \"letdown\", \"frustration\"]', '[\"satisfaction\", \"pleasure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express disappointment\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bitter disappointment\", \"meaning\": \"sự thất vọng tràn trề\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disappoint\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disappointed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disappointing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-cori-c85014f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-aru0-c85014f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-aru5-c85014f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-aru6-c85014f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-aru10-c85014f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-aru9-c85014f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointment-aru3