('8943384e-0e73-54d7-85b4-abbf0901f16b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'demographic', 'UK: /ˌdɛm.əˈɡræf.ɪk/ | US: /ˌdɛm.əˈɡræf.ɪk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nhóm dân số, nhóm đối tượng nhân khẩu học', 'A particular section of a population sharing similar social or age characteristics.', 'The marketing team analyzed the demographic of potential customers.', 'Nhóm tiếp thị đã phân tích nhóm đối tượng nhân khẩu học của khách hàng tiềm năng.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing campaign aims to attract a younger demographic.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới nhằm mục đích thu hút nhóm đối tượng khách hàng trẻ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-ljspeech-65aa5fa9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-cori-65aa5fa9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demographic-b30cc599.webp', '[\"population group\", \"target group\", \"sector\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"target demographic\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm đối tượng mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"key demographic\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm nhân khẩu học chủ chốt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"demographic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"demographically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"demographics\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-cori-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru0-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru5-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru6-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru10-65aa5fa9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru9-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru3-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru7-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru8-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru2-65aa5fa9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-ljspeech-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt408-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt138-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt624-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt396-65aa5fa9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt498-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt132-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt288-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt42-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt90-65aa5fa9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong lĩnh vực marketing, \'target demographic\' ám chỉ phân khúc khách hàng mục tiêu theo độ tuổi, thu nhập, giới tính.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('46c1bfb4-2466-552a-b4d9-c52ed997202f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'donation', '/dəʊˈneɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động tặng tiền, hàng hóa hoặc dịch vụ cho mục đích từ thiện.', 'the act of giving money, goods, or services to help people or organizations in need.', 'The charity gratefully accepted a large donation from an anonymous donor.', 'Tổ chức từ thiện đã vui mừng nhận được một khoản quyên góp lớn từ một nhà tài trợ ẩn danh.', '{\"en\": \"The corporation made a generous donation to support the local community development project this year.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn đã thực hiện một khoản quyên góp hào phóng để hỗ trợ dự án phát triển cộng đồng địa phương năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-ljspeech-6c3dedbb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-cori-6c3dedbb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/donation-5346a84c.webp', '[\"contribution\", \"gift\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a donation\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện quyên góp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"charitable donation\", \"meaning\": \"quyên góp từ thiện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"donate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"donor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-cori-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru0-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru5-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru6-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru10-6c3dedbb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru9-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru3-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru7-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru8-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-aru2-6c3dedbb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-ljspeech-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt408-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt138-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt624-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt396-6c3dedbb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt498-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt132-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt288-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt42-6c3dedbb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/donation-lt90-6c3dedbb.mp3\"]}}', 'người cho là \'donor\', hành động cho là \'donation\'.', 'business', 1, 12),
('9423bc9a-78c9-509e-aa3e-09b1c706931b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'furious', '/ˈfjʊəriəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'rất tức giận, nổi cơn thịnh nộ.', 'feeling or showing a very strong anger about something that has happened.', 'My boss was absolutely furious when I showed up late for the meeting.', 'Sếp tôi đã vô cùng giận dữ khi tôi đến muộn cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The client was furious when the important delivery arrived three days behind schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã rất tức giận khi chuyến giao hàng quan trọng đến trễ ba ngày so với lịch trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-ljspeech-de09d110.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-cori-de09d110.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/furious-11af2b65.webp', '[\"angry\", \"enraged\", \"irate\"]', '[\"calm\", \"pleased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absolutely furious\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng tức giận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"furious at someone\", \"meaning\": \"tức giận với ai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"furiously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fury\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-cori-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru0-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru5-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru6-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru10-de09d110.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru9-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru3-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru7-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru8-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-aru2-de09d110.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-ljspeech-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt408-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt138-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt624-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt396-de09d110.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt498-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt132-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt288-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt42-de09d110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furious-lt90-de09d110.mp3\"]}}', 'Vì bản thân từ đã mang nghĩa \'rất tức giận\', ta dùng \'absolutely furious\' thay vì \'very furious\'.', 'business', 1, 13),
('3fa169a8-8e35-52f5-8ce2-d9c7d8b639fa', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'customize', 'UK: /ˈkʌstəmaɪz/ | US: /ˈkʌstəmaɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'tùy chỉnh', 'To modify or adjust something to suit the specific needs or preferences of a buyer.', 'Customers can customize their orders online.', 'Khách hàng có thể tùy chỉnh đơn hàng của họ trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"Clients can customize their user dashboards to display key performance metrics.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể tùy chỉnh bảng điều khiển người dùng của họ để hiển thị các chỉ số hiệu suất chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-ljspeech-9a660134.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-cori-9a660134.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/customize-71d11a72.webp', '[\"tailor\", \"adapt\", \"modify\"]', '[\"standardize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"customize settings\", \"meaning\": \"tùy chỉnh các cài đặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customize features\", \"meaning\": \"tùy chỉnh các tính năng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"customization\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"customized\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-cori-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru0-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru5-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru6-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru10-9a660134.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru9-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru3-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru7-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru8-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-aru2-9a660134.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-ljspeech-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt408-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt138-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt624-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt396-9a660134.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt498-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt132-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt288-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt42-9a660134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customize-lt90-9a660134.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'customize something to suit/fit something\' (điều chỉnh cái gì cho phù hợp với cái gì).', 'technology', 1, 14),
('dac573ac-4b0e-5af2-ac84-b70d074034be', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'restriction', '/rɪˈstrɪkʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một giới hạn hoặc quy định ngăn cản điều gì đó.', 'a rule or law that limits what you are allowed to do or have.', 'There are strict restrictions on the amount of luggage you can bring.', 'Có những hạn chế nghiêm ngặt về số lượng hành lý bạn có thể mang theo.', '{\"en\": \"The new government regulation imposes a restriction on the import of certain electronic goods.\", \"vi\": \"Quy định mới của chính phủ áp đặt một hạn chế đối với việc nhập khẩu một số mặt hàng điện tử.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-ljspeech-993b3394.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-cori-993b3394.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restriction-aea9cd22.webp', '[\"limitation\", \"constraint\"]', '[\"freedom\", \"allowance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impose a restriction\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt hạn chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strict restriction\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chế nghiêm ngặt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"restrict\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"restrictive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-cori-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru0-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru5-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru6-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru10-993b3394.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru9-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru3-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru7-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru8-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru2-993b3394.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-ljspeech-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt408-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt138-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt624-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt396-993b3394.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt498-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt132-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt288-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt42-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt90-993b3394.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'on\' (restriction on something).', 'law', 1, 15),
('bd268584-d1bd-5709-8ec4-c84b54c91cb1', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'universal', '/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːsl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Áp dụng cho mọi người hoặc mọi thứ; chung cho tất cả.', 'existing everywhere or involving everyone in the world or in a particular group.', 'The desire for happiness is a universal human feeling.', 'Khao khát hạnh phúc là một cảm xúc phổ quát của con người.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update received universal approval from all department managers last week.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới đã nhận được sự chấp thuận chung từ tất cả các trưởng bộ phận vào tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-ljspeech-da5f51a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-cori-da5f51a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/universal-aab3c5ce.webp', '[\"global\", \"general\", \"widespread\"]', '[\"local\", \"particular\", \"specific\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"universal appeal\", \"meaning\": \"sức hấp dẫn phổ quát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"universal agreement\", \"meaning\": \"sự đồng thuận chung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"universal healthcare\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc sức khỏe toàn dân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"university\", \"note_vi\": \"university là trường đại học, viết gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"universe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"universally\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"universality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-cori-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru0-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru5-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru6-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru10-da5f51a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru9-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru3-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru7-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru8-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru2-da5f51a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-ljspeech-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt408-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt138-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt624-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt396-da5f51a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt498-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt132-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt288-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt42-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt90-da5f51a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Universal mang nghĩa là áp dụng cho mọi đối tượng, toàn cầu, toàn thể.', 'business', 1, 16),
('bb7010c1-74c4-552c-a9eb-054a651a29a9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'super', '/ˈsuːpə(r)/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Rất tốt, xuất sắc hoặc tuyệt vời.', 'of a very high quality or standard, often used to describe something excellent.', 'The new assistant has done a super job organizing the conference schedules.', 'Trợ lý mới đã làm một công việc tuyệt vời trong việc sắp xếp lịch trình hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"The staff provided super service during our business dinner at the downtown restaurant last week.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã cung cấp dịch vụ tuyệt vời trong bữa tối công việc tại nhà hàng trung tâm tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-ljspeech-8451ba8a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-cori-8451ba8a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/super-24092e45.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"great\"]', '[\"poor\", \"bad\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"super service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"super job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc xuất sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"superior\", \"note_vi\": \"Superior là cao cấp hơn, super là rất tốt (thân mật hơn).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-cori-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru0-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru5-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru6-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru10-8451ba8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru9-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru3-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru7-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru8-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-aru2-8451ba8a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-ljspeech-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt408-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt138-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt624-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt396-8451ba8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt498-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt132-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt288-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt42-8451ba8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super-lt90-8451ba8a.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính thân mật, nên dùng \'excellent\' trong văn bản trang trọng.', 'dining', 1, 17),
('140cf52e-304d-5de1-8970-d169c6276d70', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'federal', '/ˈfedərəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về chính phủ trung ương hoặc liên minh các bang.', 'relating to a system of government where several states form a central authority.', 'The federal government announced new policies to boost the economy.', 'Chính phủ liên bang đã công bố các chính sách mới để thúc đẩy nền kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"The federal agency approved the new regulations for international trade and shipping logistics.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ quan liên bang đã phê duyệt các quy định mới cho thương mại quốc tế và hậu cần vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-ljspeech-e47db9a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-cori-e47db9a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/federal-27aefee0.webp', '[\"national\", \"central\"]', '[\"local\", \"state\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"federal government\", \"meaning\": \"chính phủ liên bang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"federal law\", \"meaning\": \"luật liên bang\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"federation\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"federalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-cori-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru0-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru5-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru6-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru10-e47db9a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru9-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru3-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru7-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/federal-aru8-e47db9a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje