('a2cd0a4d-e918-50bc-a964-4e611db59da4', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'appropriately', '/əˈprəʊpriətli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách thích hợp, đúng đắn với hoàn cảnh.', 'in a way that is suitable or right for a particular situation.', 'Staff members are expected to respond appropriately to customer complaints at all times.', 'Nhân viên được kỳ vọng sẽ phản hồi một cách phù hợp với các khiếu nại của khách hàng vào mọi lúc.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must dress appropriately when meeting with high-profile corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải ăn mặc phù hợp khi gặp gỡ các khách hàng doanh nghiệp quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-ljspeech-c8453f92.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-cori-c8453f92.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appropriately-3d333feb.webp', '[\"suitably\", \"properly\", \"fittingly\"]', '[\"inappropriately\", \"improperly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"respond appropriately\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi thích hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dress appropriately\", \"meaning\": \"ăn mặc phù hợp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"appropriate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appropriateness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-cori-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru0-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru5-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru6-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru10-c8453f92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru9-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru3-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru7-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru8-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-aru2-c8453f92.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-ljspeech-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt408-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt138-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt624-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt396-c8453f92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt498-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt132-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt288-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt42-c8453f92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriately-lt90-c8453f92.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các động từ như dress, respond, act, handle.', 'office', 1, 25),
('4d629c7b-2f94-5e26-8589-87d9111634a3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'penalty', '/ˈpenəlti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hình phạt cho việc vi phạm quy tắc hoặc luật', 'a financial or legal sanction imposed on an individual for violating regulations.', 'Drivers who exceed the speed limit must pay a heavy financial penalty.', 'Những người lái xe vượt quá tốc độ cho phép phải trả một khoản tiền phạt nặng.', '{\"en\": \"The contract includes a financial penalty for any delays in completing the construction project.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng bao gồm một khoản phạt tài chính cho bất kỳ sự chậm trễ nào trong việc hoàn thành dự án xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-ljspeech-c8f39db2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-cori-c8f39db2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/penalty-1bce2466.webp', '[\"fine\", \"punishment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pay a penalty\", \"meaning\": \"trả tiền phạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe penalty\", \"meaning\": \"hình phạt nghiêm khắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"penalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-cori-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru0-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru5-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru6-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru10-c8f39db2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru9-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru3-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru7-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru8-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-aru2-c8f39db2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-ljspeech-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt408-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt138-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt624-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt396-c8f39db2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt498-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt132-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt288-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt42-c8f39db2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penalty-lt90-c8f39db2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong hợp đồng thương mại để chỉ tiền phạt vi phạm.', 'law', 1, 26),
('92429614-fc9c-588e-a2b9-bcd3a4ecbc72', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '66ad92c7-1838-5e10-a3c6-605c788a2fac', 'aed08d2f-5487-59d4-8f62-62a34cb6030d', 'bid', '/bɪd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời đề nghị giá, hoặc sự cố gắng đạt được điều gì.', 'an offer to pay a particular amount of money for something.', 'The company made a successful bid for the construction contract.', 'Công ty đã đưa ra một lời đề nghị thành công cho hợp đồng xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"Our company submitted the lowest bid for the government infrastructure project yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã nộp mức giá thầu thấp nhất cho dự án hạ tầng chính phủ vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bid-bf23e85a.webp', '[\"offer\", \"tender\", \"proposal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"winning bid\", \"meaning\": \"mức giá trúng thầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"submit a bid\", \"meaning\": \"nộp hồ sơ dự thầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a bid\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra mức giá đấu thầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"forbidden\", \"note_vi\": \"bị cấm, không liên quan tới đấu thầu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bid\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bidder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru0-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru5-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru6-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru10-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru9-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru3-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru7-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru8-a65df709.mp