('3ccb9283-aefa-5d3e-b2ce-4076fc2d4af7', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '6eb12cb1-7528-51f9-aa0c-7281e0ef025e', '5bb71592-b211-5a7b-8461-f22c88af3658', 'comparative', '/kəmˈpærətɪv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Dạng so sánh hơn (trong ngữ pháp).', 'the form of an adjective or adverb that expresses a higher degree.', 'In English grammar, \"taller\" is the comparative form of \"tall.\"', 'Trong ngữ pháp tiếng Anh, \"taller\" là dạng so sánh hơn của \"tall\".', '{\"en\": \"The English teacher explained how to form the comparative of short adjectives.\", \"vi\": \"Giáo viên tiếng Anh đã giải thích cách thành lập dạng so sánh hơn của các tính từ ngắn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-ljspeech-e08949f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-cori-e08949f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comparative-4a5ee033.webp', NULL, '[\"superlative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"comparative form\", \"meaning\": \"dạng so sánh hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"comparative degree\", \"meaning\": \"cấp độ so sánh hơn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comparable\", \"note_vi\": \"có thể so sánh được, tương đương\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compare\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comparative\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"comparatively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-cori-e08949f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru0-e08949f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru5-e08949f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru6-e08949f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru10-e08949f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru9-e08949f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru3-e08949f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comparative-aru7-e08949f7.mp3\", 