('b7f7f194-78f1-5519-9248-a6231b5999da', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '6eb12cb1-7528-51f9-aa0c-7281e0ef025e', '5bb71592-b211-5a7b-8461-f22c88af3658', 'puzzle', '/ˈpʌzl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một trò chơi hoặc vấn đề khó giải quyết.', 'a game or problem that tests a person\'s knowledge or ingenuity.', 'She enjoys solving crossword puzzles in the morning.', 'Cô ấy thích giải các câu đố ô chữ vào buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"Finding a cost-effective shipping solution remains a major puzzle for the logistics team.\", \"vi\": \"Tìm ra giải pháp vận chuyển hiệu quả về chi phí vẫn là một bài toán khó đối với đội ngũ hậu cần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-ljspeech-ddcb4be4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-cori-ddcb4be4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/puzzle-120f0d4b.webp', '[\"riddle\", \"enigma\", \"mystery\"]', '[\"solution\", \"answer\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"jigsaw puzzle\", \"meaning\": \"trò chơi xếp hình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"solve a puzzle\", \"meaning\": \"giải một bài toán khó\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"puzzling\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"puzzled\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"puzzlement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-cori-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru0-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru5-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru6-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru10-ddcb4be4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru9-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru3-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru7-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru8-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/