('a0e37aa9-6bbc-5bc0-ba7f-1b7a7c1ecb25', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '6ee08b7d-0d4b-5e9b-8fda-7aae5a2f1f62', '2577a7fa-ca70-5074-8f52-a152149ebf23', 'unacceptable', '/ˌʌnəkˈseptəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không thể chấp nhận, quá tệ hoặc không phù hợp.', 'so bad or wrong that it should not be allowed to continue or happen.', 'Delivering defective products to our clients is completely unacceptable for this firm.', 'Việc giao các sản phẩm bị lỗi cho khách hàng của chúng ta là hoàn toàn không thể chấp nhận được đối với công ty này.', '{\"en\": \"The client complained that the delay in delivering the office furniture was completely unacceptable.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phàn nàn rằng sự chậm trễ trong việc giao đồ nội thất văn phòng là hoàn toàn không thể chấp nhận được.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-ljspeech-b0da7893.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-cori-b0da7893.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unacceptable-cbadff99.webp', '[\"intolerable\", \"inappropriate\", \"unsatisfactory\"]', '[\"acceptable\", \"satisfactory\", \"appropriate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"completely unacceptable\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn không thể chấp nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"totally unacceptable\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn không thể chấp nhận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"accept\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"acceptable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acceptance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-cori-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru0-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru5-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru6-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru10-b0da7893.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru9-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru3-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru7-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru8-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-aru2-b0da7893.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-ljspeech-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt408-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt138-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt624-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt396-b0da7893.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt498-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt132-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt288-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt42-b0da7893.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unacceptable-lt90-b0da7893.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'un-\' mang nghĩa phủ định. Thường đi với các trạng từ chỉ mức độ tuyệt đối như completely, totally.', 'business', 1, 10),
('9346c237-e40d-5e42-aa77-d922ed03984a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '6ee08b7d-0d4b-5e9b-8fda-7aae5a2f1f62', '2577a7fa-ca70-5074-8f52-a152149ebf23', 'discard', 'UK: /dɪˈskɑːd/ | US: /dɪˈskɑːrd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'vứt bỏ', 'to get rid of something that is no longer useful or desired.', 'Please discard all old files after scanning them.', 'Vui lòng vứt bỏ tất cả các tệp cũ sau khi quét.', '{\"en\": \"Please discard all confidential documents in the designated shredding bins.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng vứt bỏ tất cả tài liệu bảo mật vào các thùng hủy tài liệu được quy định.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-ljspeech-f57e3806.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-cori-f57e3806.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discard-3321c3c9.webp', '[\"dispose of\", \"throw away\", \"scrap\", \"dump\"]', '[\"keep\", \"retain\", \"preserve\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"discard outdated files\", \"meaning\": \"vứt bỏ hồ sơ hết hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"properly discard\", \"meaning\": \"vứt bỏ đúng cách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"discount\", \"note_vi\": \"giảm giá; tránh nhầm với discard (vứt bỏ)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-cori-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru0-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru5-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru6-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru10-f57e3806.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru9-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru3-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru7-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru8-f57e3806.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discard-aru2-f57e3806.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag