('b09ec55c-b38e-5b6d-a8cb-10cca6d8755a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '6ee08b7d-0d4b-5e9b-8fda-7aae5a2f1f62', '2577a7fa-ca70-5074-8f52-a152149ebf23', 'precise', '/prɪˈsaɪs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất chính xác và đúng đắn; không có sai sót.', 'being very clear and accurate in every detail without making any mistakes.', 'We need precise measurements to ensure the experiment is successful.', 'Chúng ta cần các phép đo chính xác để đảm bảo thí nghiệm thành công.', '{\"en\": \"Please provide precise figures for the annual budget report by tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cung cấp các số liệu chính xác cho báo cáo ngân sách hàng năm trước sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-ljspeech-d53a4c62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-cori-d53a4c62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/precise-9fc19a27.webp', '[\"exact\", \"accurate\", \"correct\"]', '[\"imprecise\", \"vague\", \"inaccurate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"precise details\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiết chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"precise measurement\", \"meaning\": \"phép đo chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at that precise moment\", \"meaning\": \"ngay chính khoảnh khắc đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concise\", \"note_vi\": \"Ngắn gọn, súc tích.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"precisely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"precision\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-cori-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru0-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru5-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru6-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru10-d53a4c62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru9-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru3-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru7-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru8-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-aru2-d53a4c62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-ljspeech-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt408-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt138-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt624-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt396-d53a4c62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt498-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt132-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt288-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt42-d53a4c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precise-lt90-d53a4c62.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'concise\' nghĩa là ngắn gọn, súc tích.', 'finance', 1, 14),
('0e0b5e62-7061-5ecd-b36f-8ff8526eb7af', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '6ee08b7d-0d4b-5e9b-8fda-7aae5a2f1f62', '2577a7fa-ca70-5074-8f52-a152149ebf23', 'tension', '/ˈtenʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng căng thẳng (về tinh thần, mối quan hệ) hoặc áp lực.', 'a feeling of worry or nervousness that makes it difficult to relax in a situation.', 'There was a lot of tension in the room before the exam results were announced.', 'Có rất nhiều căng thẳng trong phòng trước khi kết quả thi được công bố.', '{\"en\": \"The high level of tension between the two managers delayed the final contract signing.\", \"vi\": \"Mức độ căng thẳng cao giữa hai nhà quản lý đã làm trì hoãn việc ký kết hợp đồng cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-ljspeech-e6bacb0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-cori-e6bacb0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tension-a4ca361c.webp', '[\"stress\", \"strain\"]', '[\"relaxation\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ease tension\", \"meaning\": \"giảm bớt căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high tension\", \"meaning\": \"căng thẳng cao độ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attention\", \"note_vi\": \"Attention là sự chú ý, tension là sự căng thẳng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-cori-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru0-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru5-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru6-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru10-e6bacb0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru9-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru3-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tension-aru7-e6bacb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tensi