('3122ed5f-c69b-5675-b3af-641444b0261b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'comprise', '/kəmˈpraɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'bao gồm hoặc tạo thành từ các bộ phận', 'to consist of particular parts or members that form a whole group.', 'The committee will comprise representatives from all departments.', 'Ủy ban sẽ bao gồm các đại diện từ tất cả các phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"The new project team will comprise experts from the engineering and design departments.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm dự án mới sẽ bao gồm các chuyên gia từ các phòng kỹ thuật và thiết kế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-ljspeech-48ce9885.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-cori-48ce9885.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comprise-7bd98389.webp', '[\"consist of\", \"include\"]', '[\"exclude\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"comprise members\", \"meaning\": \"bao gồm các thành viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"comprise sections\", \"meaning\": \"bao gồm các phần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compose\", \"note_vi\": \"Thường dùng \'be composed of\' thay vì \'comprise\'.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-cori-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru0-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru5-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru6-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru10-48ce9885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru9-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru3-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru7-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru8-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-aru2-48ce9885.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-ljspeech-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt408-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt138-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt624-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt396-48ce9885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt498-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt132-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt288-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt42-48ce9885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comprise-lt90-48ce9885.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý: không dùng \'of\' sau \'comprise\' (ví dụ: không nói \'comprise of\').', 'office', 1, 11),
('748b8e83-f945-5d25-9225-191f0e9b3925', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'enjoyable', '/ɪnˈdʒɔɪəbl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'mang lại niềm vui, thú vị', 'providing a feeling of happiness or pleasure.', 'We had a very enjoyable evening at the concert last night.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một buổi tối rất thú vị tại buổi hòa nhạc đêm qua.', '{\"en\": \"We had an enjoyable lunch meeting with the new clients at the downtown restaurant.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã có một buổi họp ăn trưa thú vị với các khách hàng mới tại nhà hàng trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-ljspeech-8bc92583.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-cori-8bc92583.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enjoyable-faec4b5a.webp', '[\"pleasant\", \"delightful\"]', '[\"boring\", \"unpleasant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enjoyable experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly enjoyable\", \"meaning\": \"rất thú vị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enjoy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-cori-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru0-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru5-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru6-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru10-8bc92583.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru9-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru3-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru7-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru8-8bc92583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enjoyable-aru2-8bc92583.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu