('16fea9d1-e054-505f-9e4d-ed4714c85fbc', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'promotion', '/prəˈməʊʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự thăng chức, sự quảng bá.', 'An advancement of an employee to a more senior role or higher job status.', 'After years of hard work, he finally received a well-deserved promotion.', 'Sau nhiều năm làm việc chăm chỉ, cuối cùng anh ấy cũng nhận được một sự thăng chức xứng đáng.', '{\"en\": \"She was offered a promotion to regional manager after successfully leading the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã được đề nghị thăng chức lên vị trí quản lý khu vực sau khi dẫn dắt đội ngũ bán hàng thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-ljspeech-410c25c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-cori-410c25c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/promotion-2c8c9788.webp', '[\"advancement\", \"elevation\"]', '[\"demotion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"receive a promotion\", \"meaning\": \"được thăng chức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sales promotion\", \"meaning\": \"khuyến mãi bán hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"promote\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-cori-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru0-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru5-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru6-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru10-410c25c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru9-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru3-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru7-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru8-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-aru2-410c25c9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-ljspeech-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt408-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt138-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt624-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt396-410c25c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt498-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt132-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt288-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt42-410c25c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promotion-lt90-410c25c9.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có hai nghĩa: thăng chức (nhân sự) và quảng bá/khuyến mãi (marketing).', 'hr', 1, 15),
('bf4806b5-c63c-5bc2-84f4-e2b848b61208', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'goodness', '/ˈɡʊdnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phẩm chất đạo đức của sự tốt bụng, tử tế.', 'the quality of being morally good, helpful, or kind to others.', 'Her kindness and goodness were evident in how she treated everyone.', 'Lòng tốt và sự tử tế của cô ấy thể hiện rõ qua cách cô ấy đối xử với mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The company relies on the goodness of local volunteers to run the charity event.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dựa vào lòng tốt của các tình nguyện viên địa phương để tổ chức sự kiện từ thiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-ljspeech-41391848.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-cori-41391848.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/goodness-743518bc.webp', '[\"kindness\", \"virtue\", \"decency\"]', '[\"wickedness\", \"badness\", \"evil\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"honest goodness\", \"meaning\": \"sự tốt bụng chân thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thank goodness\", \"meaning\": \"ơn trời, may quá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"goods\", \"note_vi\": \"Hàng hóa (danh từ số nhiều).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"good\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-cori-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru0-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru5-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru6-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru10-41391848.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru9-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru3-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru7-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru8-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-aru2-41391848.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-ljspeech-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt408-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt138-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt624-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt396-41391848.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt498-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt132-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt288-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt42-41391848.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goodness-lt90-41391848.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'goodness\' (lòng tốt) với \'goods\' (hàng hóa).', 'hr', 1, 16),
('91bc1d40-7e99-5c96-be31-f832a0aa47ce', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'firmly', '/ˈfɜːmli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách chắc chắn, kiên quyết; vững vàng.', 'in a strong, steady, or determined way that is unlikely to change.', 'She held onto the railing firmly as the train started to move.', 'Cô ấy nắm chặt lan can một cách chắc chắn khi tàu bắt đầu di chuyển.', '{\"en\": \"The director firmly believes that investing in technology will increase our productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tin tưởng chắc chắn rằng việc đầu tư vào công nghệ sẽ tăng năng suất của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-ljspeech-4c28d7e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-cori-4c28d7e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/firmly-e5e75746.webp', '[\"strongly\", \"securely\", \"resolutely\"]', '[\"weakly\", \"loosely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"firmly believe\", \"meaning\": \"tin tưởng chắc chắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"firmly established\", \"meaning\": \"được thiết lập vững chắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold firmly\", \"meaning\": \"nắm chặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hardly\", \"note_vi\": \"hardly nghĩa là hầu như không, không liên quan đến firmly (chắc chắn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"firm\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"firmness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-cori-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru0-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru5-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru6-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru10-4c28d7e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru9-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru3-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru7-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru8-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-aru2-4c28d7e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-ljspeech-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt408-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt138-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt624-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt396-4c28d7e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt498-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt132-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt288-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt42-4c28d7e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/firmly-lt90-4c28d7e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các động từ chỉ quan điểm như \'believe\', \'state\', \'decide\'.', 'business', 1, 17),
('90773968-a4ea-5b27-bd35-04d2506ce754', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'devote', '/dɪˈvəʊt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cống hiến, dành hết thời gian, năng lượng cho một mục đích.', 'to give all of your time or energy to a specific person or activity.', 'Researchers must devote considerable attention to reviewing every data set thoroughly.', 'Các nhà nghiên cứu phải dành sự chú ý đáng kể để xem xét kỹ lưỡng từng tập dữ liệu.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager plans to devote more time to training our junior sales staff.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý mới dự định dành nhiều thời gian hơn để đào tạo nhân viên bán hàng cấp dưới của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-ljspeech-40172d5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-cori-40172d5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/devote-09b26cb0.webp', '[\"dedicate\", \"commit\", \"allocate\"]', '[\"neglect\", \"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"devote time to\", \"meaning\": \"dành thời gian cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"devote oneself to\", \"meaning\": \"cống hiến hết mình cho\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"devotion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"devoted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-cori-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru0-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru5-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru6-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru10-40172d5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru9-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru3-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru7-40172d5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devote-aru8-40172d5b.mp3\", 