('1182286b-caf1-544d-bccd-e885015a1a0f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'extensively', '/ɪkˈstensɪvli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách rộng rãi, bao quát; nhiều, kỹ lưỡng.', 'in a wide-ranging or thorough manner covering many details or areas.', 'The research team studied the topic extensively before publishing their findings.', 'Nhóm nghiên cứu đã nghiên cứu chủ đề này một cách rộng rãi trước khi công bố kết quả của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant traveled extensively to meet clients across different regions.\", \"vi\": \"Vị tư vấn đã đi lại nhiều nơi để gặp khách hàng ở các khu vực khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-ljspeech-2f90b716.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-cori-2f90b716.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extensively-a0fe0b5b.webp', '[\"widely\", \"thoroughly\"]', '[\"superficially\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"travel extensively\", \"meaning\": \"đi lại nhiều nơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use extensively\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng rộng rãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"study extensively\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu kỹ lưỡng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expensively\", \"note_vi\": \"expensively nghĩa là tốn kém, dễ nhầm phát âm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"extensive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-cori-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru0-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru5-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru6-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru10-2f90b716.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru9-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru3-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru7-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru8-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru2-2f90b716.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-ljspeech-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt408-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt138-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt624-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt396-2f90b716.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt498-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt132-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt288-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt42-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-lt90-2f90b716.mp3\"]}}', 'Extensively (rộng rãi) không phải expensively (đắt đỏ).', 'business', 1, 19),
('2dd74007-a770-5250-bd49-58f7ce23c1c8', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'clarify', '/ˈklærəfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho điều gì đó trở nên dễ hiểu hơn, minh bạch hơn.', 'To explain a statement more clearly so that people can comprehend it easily.', 'The manager was asked to clarify the new work schedule during the morning meeting.', 'Quản lý đã được yêu cầu làm rõ lịch làm việc mới trong cuộc họp buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager scheduled a meeting to clarify the details of the new project proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã lên lịch một cuộc họp để làm rõ các chi tiết của đề xuất dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-ljspeech-ef8fe782.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-cori-ef8fe782.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clarify-e0145800.webp', '[\"explain\", \"simplify\", \"elucidate\"]', '[\"confuse\", \"complicate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clarify a point\", \"meaning\": \"làm rõ một quan điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clarify the situation\", \"meaning\": \"làm rõ tình hình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"classify\", \"note_vi\": \"classify là phân loại, clarify là làm rõ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"clarification\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"clarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-cori-ef8fe782.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru0-ef8fe782.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru5-ef8fe782.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru6-ef8fe782.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru10-ef8fe782.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru9-ef8fe782.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru3-ef8fe782.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarify-aru7-ef8fe782