('c44e9d99-9e0f-55cd-ba25-0219c0310319', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'bombing', '/ˈbɒmɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động ném bom hoặc một cuộc tấn công bằng bom.', 'an attack in which bombs are dropped or exploded in a place.', 'Investigators inspected the site immediately after the sudden bombing near the train station.', 'Các điều tra viên đã kiểm tra hiện trường ngay sau vụ đánh bom bất ngờ gần ga tàu.', '{\"en\": \"The insurance policy does not cover damage caused by a military bombing.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng bảo hiểm không chi trả cho những thiệt hại do một cuộc ném bom quân sự gây ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-ljspeech-08fe0da2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-cori-08fe0da2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bombing-ff1727c5.webp', '[\"air raid\", \"bombardment\", \"attack\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suicide bombing\", \"meaning\": \"đánh bom tự sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bombing raid\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc oanh tạc bằng bom\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bomb\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bomber\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-cori-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru0-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru5-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru6-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru10-08fe0da2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru9-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru3-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru7-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru8-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-aru2-08fe0da2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-ljspeech-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt408-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt138-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt624-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt396-08fe0da2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt498-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt132-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt288-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt42-08fe0da2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bombing-lt90-08fe0da2.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có âm \'b\' thứ hai bị câm, phát âm là /ˈbɒm.ɪŋ/.', 'other', 1, 24),
('30c19115-9c39-5c41-9c55-74a4aea65acc', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'foundation', '/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cơ sở vững chắc để phát triển hoặc xây dựng điều gì đó.', 'the basic idea or principle on which something is built or developed over time.', 'Hard work and dedication are the foundation of success in any field.', 'Làm việc chăm chỉ và cống hiến là nền tảng của thành công trong bất kỳ lĩnh vực nào.', '{\"en\": \"Reliable customer service is the foundation of our long-term success in this competitive retail market.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ khách hàng đáng tin cậy là nền tảng cho sự thành công lâu dài của chúng tôi trong thị trường bán lẻ cạnh tranh này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-ljspeech-ec9624c8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-cori-ec9624c8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foundation-a73c4490.webp', '[\"basis\", \"base\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lay the foundation\", \"meaning\": \"đặt nền móng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"solid foundation\", \"meaning\": \"nền tảng vững chắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"found\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-cori-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru0-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru5-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru6-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru10-ec9624c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru9-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru3-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru7-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru8-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-aru2-ec9624c8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-ljspeech-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt408-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt138-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt624-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt396-ec9624c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt498-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt132-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt288-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt42-ec9624c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foundation-lt90-ec9624c8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ cơ sở hạ tầng hoặc các nguyên tắc cốt lõi.', 'business', 1, 25),
('630327f2-c060-5733-9fb5-c473aaf5f529', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '7b7c3239-a89c-5be5-a030-fc84451d969d', '36258a0a-3e8d-5e74-bbe5-17be5ae4bb0a', 'memorable', '/ˈmemərəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đáng để ghi nhớ hoặc khó quên.', 'easy to remember or worth remembering because it is special or unusual.', 'The keynote speaker delivered a memorable address that inspired the entire audience.', 'Diễn giả chính đã trình bày một bài phát biểu đáng nhớ truyền cảm hứng cho toàn bộ khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker delivered a memorable presentation at the annual business conference yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã trình bày một bài thuyết trình đáng nhớ tại hội nghị kinh doanh hàng năm ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-ljspeech-59580543.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-cori-59580543.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/memorable-59d0ee9b.webp', '[\"unforgettable\", \"remarkable\"]', '[\"unremarkable\", \"forgettable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"memorable experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm đáng nhớ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"memorable event\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiện đáng nhớ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"memorial\", \"note_vi\": \"Memorial là đài tưởng niệm; memorable mang nghĩa ấn tượng, đáng nhớ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"memory\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"memorize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"memorably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-cori-59580543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-aru0-59580543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-aru5-59580543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-aru6-59580543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-aru10-59580543.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memorable-aru9-59580543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object