('ca963781-a73b-5452-b5f3-b8871ba3cad4', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'diligently', 'UK: /ˈdɪlɪdʒəntli/ | US: /ˈdɪlɪdʒəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách cần mẫn, siêng năng', 'in a manner that shows steady, conscientious, and painstaking effort toward a task.', 'The team worked diligently to meet the project deadline.', 'Nhóm đã làm việc siêng năng để kịp thời hạn dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The auditors worked diligently to finalize the annual financial report before the Friday deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Các kiểm toán viên đã làm việc một cách cần mẫn để hoàn tất báo cáo tài chính hàng năm trước hạn chót thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-ljspeech-aaeabcc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-cori-aaeabcc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diligently-3222be99.webp', '[\"industriously\", \"conscientiously\", \"painstakingly\"]', '[\"lazily\", \"carelessly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work diligently\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc siêng năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apply oneself diligently\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực hết mình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diligent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diligence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-cori-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru0-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru5-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru6-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru10-aaeabcc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru9-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru3-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligently-aru7-aaeabcc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje