('699d25b8-4ac6-5b43-bd2e-9929c7022ca9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'contractor', 'UK: /ˈkɒntræktər/ | US: /ˈkɒntræktər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nhà thầu', 'a person or company that agrees to provide materials or perform specific work.', 'We hired a contractor for the office renovation.', 'Chúng tôi đã thuê nhà thầu để cải tạo văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The building contractor estimated that the office expansion project would be completed by November.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu xây dựng ước tính rằng dự án mở rộng văn phòng sẽ hoàn thành trước tháng 11.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-ljspeech-864dc49f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-cori-864dc49f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contractor-703e14ed.webp', '[\"supplier\", \"vendor\", \"builder\", \"provider\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"independent contractor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thầu độc lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"building contractor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thầu xây dựng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contract\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"contract\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-cori-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru0-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru5-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru6-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru10-864dc49f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru9-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru3-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru7-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru8-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-aru2-864dc49f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-ljspeech-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt408-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt138-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt624-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt396-864dc49f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt498-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt132-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt288-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt42-864dc49f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contractor-lt90-864dc49f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng chỉ công ty/cá nhân nhận thi công xây dựng hoặc cung cấp dịch vụ ngoài (independent contractor).', 'construction', 1, 9),
('86550064-03e2-5b73-a904-43fecce40935', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'consequently', '/ˈkɒnsɪkwəntli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Do đó, kết quả là, vì vậy.', 'as a result of something that has just been mentioned or described.', 'She missed her flight; consequently, she had to rebook for the next day.', 'Cô ấy đã lỡ chuyến bay; do đó, cô ấy phải đặt lại vé cho ngày hôm sau.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier failed to deliver the parts; consequently, the production line was halted for hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đã không giao các bộ phận; do đó, dây chuyền sản xuất đã bị dừng trong nhiều giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-ljspeech-97332beb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-cori-97332beb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consequently-f9f1e2f6.webp', '[\"therefore\", \"thus\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"consequently, the result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"and consequently\", \"meaning\": \"và vì vậy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consequence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-cori-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru0-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru5-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru6-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru10-97332beb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru9-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru3-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru7-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru8-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-aru2-97332beb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-ljspeech-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt408-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt138-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt624-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt396-97332beb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt498-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt132-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt288-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt42-97332beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequently-lt90-97332beb.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để nối hai câu, thường đứng sau dấu chấm phẩy hoặc dấu chấm.', 'business', 1, 10),
('93c50c25-4c31-59f3-a22c-cdb9ede52e16', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'stroke', '/strəʊk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tai biến mạch máu não gây tổn thương não.', 'a sudden serious illness when a blood vessel in the brain breaks or is blocked.', 'Regular exercise can help reduce the risk of having a stroke.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên có thể giúp giảm nguy cơ bị đột quỵ.', '{\"en\": \"The executive suffered a mild stroke and took medical leave for two months.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý bị đột quỵ nhẹ và đã xin nghỉ phép chữa bệnh trong hai tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-ljspeech-fa2a4fd4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-cori-fa2a4fd4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stroke-ef8439d0.webp', '[\"brain attack\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suffer a stroke\", \"meaning\": \"bị đột quỵ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"massive stroke\", \"meaning\": \"cơn đột quỵ nặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stroll\", \"note_vi\": \"stroke là đột quỵ hoặc nét vẽ, stroll là đi dạo.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-cori-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru0-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru5-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru6-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru10-fa2a4fd4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru9-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru3-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru7-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru8-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-aru2-fa2a4fd4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-ljspeech-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt408-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt138-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt624-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt396-fa2a4fd4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt498-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt132-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt288-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt42-fa2a4fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroke-lt90-fa2a4fd4.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong y khoa nghĩa là đột quỵ; trong ngữ cảnh khác có nghĩa nét vẽ.', 'health', 1, 11)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('678af429-4a1e-5c64-842e-b3bbf2f22492', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'enthusiasm', 'UK: /ɪnˈθuːziæzəm/ | US: /ɪnˈθuːziæzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự nhiệt tình, sự hăng hái', 'A strong feeling of excitement and interest in a particular subject or activity.', 'Her enthusiasm for the new project is truly inspiring to the team.', 'Sự nhiệt tình của cô ấy với dự án mới thực sự truyền cảm hứng cho cả đội.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring committee was impressed by the candidate\'s enthusiasm for the company\'s long-term vision.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng tuyển dụng rất ấn tượng với sự nhiệt tình của ứng viên đối với tầm nhìn dài hạn của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-ljspeech-2acc576e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-cori-2acc576e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enthusiasm-5823c6b1.webp', '[\"eagerness\", \"passion\", \"zeal\", \"ardor\"]', '[\"apathy\", \"indifference\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"show enthusiasm\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự nhiệt tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lack of enthusiasm\", \"meaning\": \"sự thiếu nhiệt tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"infectious enthusiasm\", \"meaning\": \"sự nhiệt tình có sức lan tỏa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"enthusiastic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"enthusiastically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enthusiast\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-cori-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru0-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru5-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru6-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru10-2acc576e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru9-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru3-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru7-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru8-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-aru2-2acc576e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-ljspeech-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt408-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt138-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt624-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt396-2acc576e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt498-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt132-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt288-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt42-2acc576e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiasm-lt90-2acc576e.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'for\' hoặc \'about\' (enthusiasm for something). Rất hay dùng trong phỏng vấn tuyển dụng.', 'human resources', 1, 12),
('d2294154-d540-56ba-82ca-6dbce11c585b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'trap', '/træp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cái bẫy, thường dùng để bắt động vật hoặc lừa người.', 'a device or situation designed to catch animals or trick people.', 'Be careful not to fall into the trap of overspending during the holidays.', 'Hãy cẩn thận đừng rơi vào cái bẫy chi tiêu quá mức trong những ngày lễ.', '{\"en\": \"Do not fall into the trap of signing a contract without reading it.\", \"vi\": \"Đừng rơi vào cái bẫy ký hợp đồng mà không đọc kỹ nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-ljspeech-e6d30736.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-cori-e6d30736.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trap-ab1125c2.webp', '[\"snare\", \"pitfall\", \"trick\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fall into a trap\", \"meaning\": \"rơi vào bẫy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set a trap\", \"meaning\": \"đặt bẫy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tourist trap\", \"meaning\": \"nơi chặt chém khách du lịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strap\", \"note_vi\": \"Quai đeo, dây đeo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trap\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-cori-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru0-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru5-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru6-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru10-e6d30736.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru9-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru3-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru7-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru8-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-aru2-e6d30736.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-ljspeech-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt408-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt138-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt624-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt396-e6d30736.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt498-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt132-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt288-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt42-e6d30736.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trap-lt90-e6d30736.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'tourist trap\' chỉ những nơi thu hút khách du lịch nhưng bán giá quá đắt.', 'law', 1, 13),
('bb5a8607-1ee7-56a6-ba59-23f72030acda', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'medal', '/ˈmedl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một tấm kim loại nhỏ được trao làm giải thưởng hoặc vinh danh.', 'a flat piece of metal given as a prize for winning a competition.', 'The veteran received a bronze medal for his courageous actions during the mission.', 'Người cựu chiến binh đã nhận được huy chương đồng vì hành động dũng cảm trong chiến dịch.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO presented a gold medal to the employee for her outstanding sales performance.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã trao huy chương vàng cho nhân viên vì thành tích bán hàng xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-ljspeech-828b3911.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-cori-828b3911.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/medal-f7848d4d.webp', '[\"award\", \"prize\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gold medal\", \"meaning\": \"huy chương vàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"win a medal\", \"meaning\": \"giành huy chương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"metal\", \"note_vi\": \"kim loại, phát âm gần giống nhưng nghĩa hoàn toàn khác.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-cori-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru0-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru5-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru6-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru10-828b3911.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru9-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru3-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru7-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru8-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-aru2-828b3911.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-ljspeech-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt408-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt138-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt624-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt396-828b3911.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt498-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt132-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt288-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt42-828b3911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/medal-lt90-828b3911.mp3\"]}}', '\'Medal\' là huy chương, \'metal\' là kim loại, phát âm gần giống nhau.', 'other', 1, 14),
('6a21d31c-02b3-5832-a4c0-4b79ae252991', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'enterprise', 'UK: /ˈɛntəpraɪz/ | US: /ˈɛntərˌpraɪz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'doanh nghiệp', 'A business company or organization that operates to earn profits or provide services.', 'Our enterprise focuses on sustainable energy solutions.', 'Doanh nghiệp của chúng tôi tập trung vào các giải pháp năng lượng bền vững.', '{\"en\": \"The government offers tax incentives to small and medium enterprises to encourage innovation.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ cung cấp các ưu đãi thuế cho các doanh nghiệp vừa và nhỏ để khuyến khích đổi mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-ljspeech-052a3c16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-cori-052a3c16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enterprise-6d3af114.webp', '[\"business\", \"company\", \"firm\", \"corporation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"joint enterprise\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nghiệp liên doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"state enterprise\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nghiệp nhà nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"private enterprise\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nghiệp tư nhân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"enterprising\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-cori-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru0-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru5-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru6-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru10-052a3c16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru9-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru3-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru7-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p