('2265d870-a7fd-5680-a98f-825ad038b016', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'cue', '/kjuː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Dấu hiệu hoặc tín hiệu cho biết khi nào nên hành động hoặc nói điều gì đó.', 'a signal for someone to do something or start speaking during a performance.', 'The actor missed his cue and didn\'t come on stage at the right moment.', 'Diễn viên đã lỡ tín hiệu của mình và không lên sân khấu đúng lúc.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave the sales presenter a clear cue to finish the client proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra tín hiệu rõ ràng cho người thuyết trình bán hàng kết thúc đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-ljspeech-9f8d4e15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-cori-9f8d4e15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cue-83845e66.webp', '[\"signal\", \"prompt\", \"hint\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"visual cue\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu bằng hình ảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a cue from\", \"meaning\": \"học hỏi/lấy gợi ý từ ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"queue\", \"note_vi\": \"queue là hàng người/vật chờ đợi, đồng âm với cue\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-cori-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru0-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru5-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru6-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru10-9f8d4e15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru9-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru3-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru7-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru8-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-aru2-9f8d4e15.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-ljspeech-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt408-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt138-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt624-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt396-9f8d4e15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt498-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt132-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt288-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt42-9f8d4e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cue-lt90-9f8d4e15.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm phát âm và viết với từ queue (hàng chờ).', 'office', 1, 24),
('d36ff9c5-49d0-55e9-908b-8966270e3d28', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'framework', '/ˈfreɪmwɜːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống các ý tưởng, quy tắc hoặc cấu trúc cơ bản.', 'a basic structure of ideas, rules, or beliefs that supports a larger system.', 'The new policy provides a clear framework for future development.', 'Chính sách mới cung cấp một khuôn khổ rõ ràng cho sự phát triển trong tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department established a strict framework to ensure compliance with international trade laws.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý đã thiết lập một khuôn khổ nghiêm ngặt để đảm bảo tuân thủ luật thương mại quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-ljspeech-f178867d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-cori-f178867d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/framework-dae98ce1.webp', '[\"structure\", \"skeleton\", \"outline\", \"system\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"legal framework\", \"meaning\": \"khuôn khổ pháp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conceptual framework\", \"meaning\": \"khung khái niệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"frame\", \"note_vi\": \"khung ảnh, khung cửa vật lý; framework mang tính trừu tượng/hệ thống hơn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-cori-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru0-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru5-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru6-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru10-f178867d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru9-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru3-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru7-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru8-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru2-f178867d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-ljspeech-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt408-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt138-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt624-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt396-f178867d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt498-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt132-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt288-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt42-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-lt90-f178867d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các cụm từ như \'regulatory framework\' (khuôn khổ pháp lý/quản lý).', 'law', 1, 25),
('c7a6d7d3-5a8e-548a-bc42-84ec503d975d', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'coordinator', 'UK: /kəʊˈɔː.dɪn.eɪ.tər/ | US: /koʊˈɔːr.dən.eɪ.tər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'điều phối viên', 'a person whose job is to organize various elements of a project so they function smoothly', 'The project coordinator managed the team effectively.', 'Điều phối viên dự án đã quản lý nhóm một cách hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"Please contact the event coordinator if you need extra audio-visual equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng liên hệ với điều phối viên sự kiện nếu bạn cần thêm thiết bị âm thanh hình ảnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-ljspeech-b1ba516c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-cori-b1ba516c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coordinator-b1afbc99.webp', '[\"organizer\", \"planner\", \"facilitator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"project coordinator\", \"meaning\": \"điều phối viên dự án\"}, {\"phrase\": \"event coordinator\", \"meaning\": \"điều phối viên sự kiện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coordinate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coordination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-cori-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru0-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru5-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru6-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru10-b1ba516c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru9-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru3-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru7-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru8-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru2-b1ba516c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-ljspeech-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt408-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt138-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt624-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt396-b1ba516c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt498-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt132-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt288-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt42-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt90-b1ba516c.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ người chịu trách nhiệm kết nối, sắp xếp công việc giữa các nhóm. Đuôi \'-or\' chỉ người.', 'office', 1, 26),
('68b7c217-257b-5afc-887a-a0a9c726a891', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'inevitable', '/ɪnˈevɪtəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không thể tránh khỏi; chắc chắn sẽ xảy ra.', 'certain to happen and impossible to avoid or prevent.', 'Without proper care, delays in completing the project seem almost inevitable.', 'Nếu không có sự chăm sóc thích hợp, sự chậm trễ trong việc hoàn thành dự án dường như là không thể tránh khỏi.', '{\"en\": \"Delay in product delivery was inevitable due to severe weather conditions across the region.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ trong việc giao sản phẩm là không thể tránh khỏi do điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt trên toàn khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-ljspeech-c991d290.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-cori-c991d290.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inevitable-cbe3cd36.webp', '[\"unavoidable\", \"certain\"]', '[\"avoidable\", \"preventable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inevitable consequence\", \"meaning\": \"hậu quả tất yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem inevitable\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ không thể tránh khỏi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evitable\", \"note_vi\": \"evitable nghĩa là có thể tránh được, nhưng rất hiếm khi được dùng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"inevitably\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inevitability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-cori-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru0-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru5-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru6-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru10-c991d290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru9-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru3-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru7-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru8-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru2-c991d290.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-ljspeech-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt408-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt138-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt624-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt396-c991d290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt498-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt132-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt288-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt42-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-lt90-c991d290.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm lưu ý trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết thứ hai /ɪnˈev.ə.tə.bəl/.', 'business', 1, 27),
('2bf9192c-550f-59f2-b10e-00683be73f42', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '83270e19-e5cf-5a35-bed6-cb26cb881fc3', '1570f026-cac0-54a4-9b25-d3c00fa8b9a1', 'clip', '/klɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một dụng cụ dùng để giữ chặt hai vật lại với nhau.', 'a small object used for holding things together tightly.', 'Please attach your badge to your shirt using this small metal clip.', 'Vui lòng gắn thẻ tên của bạn vào áo bằng chiếc kẹp kim loại nhỏ này.', '{\"en\": \"Attach the receipt to the invoice using a paper clip before submitting the report.\", \"vi\": \"Kẹp biên nhận vào hóa đơn bằng kẹp giấy trước khi nộp báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-ljspeech-e3a93fa8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-cori-e3a93fa8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clip-967b789e.webp', '[\"fastener\", \"clamp\", \"pin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"paper clip\", \"meaning\": \"kẹp giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"binder clip\", \"meaning\": \"kẹp bướm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"staple\", \"note_vi\": \"Staple là ghim bấm (làm thủng giấy), còn clip là kẹp (không làm hỏng giấy).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"clip\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-cori-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru0-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru5-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru6-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru10-e3a93fa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru9-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru3-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru7-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru8-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru2-e3a93fa8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/p