('209c4a8a-9deb-50b7-b0c9-bf03286575a3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '8ed7f161-ef0c-56e4-88ea-13b62aceb886', 'f4946dfd-8098-5495-a4d8-0f7464479926', 'gene', '/dʒiːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị cơ bản của di truyền, mang thông tin di truyền.', 'a part of a living thing that controls how it grows and what it looks like.', 'Scientists are studying how specific genes influence human health.', 'Các nhà khoa học đang nghiên cứu cách các gen cụ thể ảnh hưởng đến sức khỏe con người.', '{\"en\": \"The research team is analyzing the gene structure to improve agricultural crop yields significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đang phân tích cấu trúc gen để cải thiện đáng kể năng suất cây trồng nông nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-ljspeech-bdc8e679.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-cori-bdc8e679.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gene-e9662987.webp', '[\"heredity unit\", \"DNA segment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gene therapy\", \"meaning\": \"liệu pháp gen\"}, {\"phrase\": \"genetic research\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu di truyền\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"genetic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-cori-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru0-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru5-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru6-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru10-bdc8e679.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru9-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru3-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru7-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru8-bdc8e679.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gene-aru2-bdc8e679.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/obj