('a0edd563-2b1a-5248-9b57-c6ff2fc00327', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '9e7a1b88-a875-5994-aa0a-6fedfdecfaa3', '85c4b8a4-2e34-52a9-8497-2117a0e0261d', 'nasty', '/ˈnɑːsti/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khó chịu, bẩn thỉu hoặc độc ác.', 'very unpleasant, unkind, or causing a lot of problems for people in a difficult situation.', 'The weather turned nasty, with heavy rain and strong winds.', 'Thời tiết trở nên khó chịu, với mưa lớn và gió mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced a nasty surprise when the audit revealed significant financial errors in the accounts.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phải đối mặt với một bất ngờ khó chịu khi cuộc kiểm toán tiết lộ những sai sót tài chính đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-ljspeech-f7a917bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-cori-f7a917bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nasty-05153403.webp', '[\"unpleasant\", \"disagreeable\"]', '[\"pleasant\", \"kind\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"nasty weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết xấu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nasty surprise\", \"meaning\": \"bất ngờ khó chịu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-cori-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru0-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru5-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru6-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru10-f7a917bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru9-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru3-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru7-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru8-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-aru2-f7a917bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-ljspeech-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt408-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt138-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt624-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt396-f7a917bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt498-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt132-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt288-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt42-f7a917bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasty-lt90-f7a917bd.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng để mô tả tình huống tiêu cực hoặc thời tiết xấu.', 'other', 1, 15),
('dd3c3637-fc95-5c7d-8ea9-1dda65e3e57a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '9e7a1b88-a875-5994-aa0a-6fedfdecfaa3', '85c4b8a4-2e34-52a9-8497-2117a0e0261d', 'protester', '/prəˈtestə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người tham gia vào một cuộc biểu tình công khai để phản đối.', 'a person who publicly expresses strong disagreement or disapproval of something.', 'Hundreds of protesters gathered outside the city hall.', 'Hàng trăm người biểu tình đã tập trung bên ngoài tòa thị chính.', '{\"en\": \"A protester stood outside the headquarters to complain about the company\'s environmental policy.\", \"vi\": \"Một người biểu tình đã đứng bên ngoài trụ sở để phàn nàn về chính sách môi trường của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-ljspeech-d03c2908.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-cori-d03c2908.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/protester-726b30c6.webp', '[\"demonstrator\", \"dissident\", \"rebel\"]', '[\"supporter\", \"ally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"peaceful protester\", \"meaning\": \"người biểu tình ôn hòa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"anti-war protester\", \"meaning\": \"người biểu tình chống chiến tranh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"protector\", \"note_vi\": \"người bảo vệ, dễ nhầm đuôi từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"protest\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"protest\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-cori-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru0-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru5-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru6-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru10-d03c2908.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru9-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru3-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru7-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru8-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-aru2-d03c2908.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-ljspeech-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt408-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt138-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt624-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt396-d03c2908.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt498-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt132-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt288-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt42-d03c2908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protester-lt90-d03c2908.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với protector nghĩa là người bảo vệ.', 'law', 1, 16),
('e7065393-3935-5fb7-b1a2-b5637e81d5ee', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', '9e7a1b88-a875-5994-aa0a-6fedfdecfaa3', '85c4b8a4-2e34-52a9-8497-2117a0e0261d', 'tap', '/tæp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để điều khiển dòng chảy của chất lỏng, thường là nước.', 'a piece of equipment for controlling the flow of water from a pipe.', 'A plumber arrived yesterday morning to fix the leaking tap in the staff kitchen.', 'Một thợ sửa ống nước đã đến vào sáng qua để sửa vòi nước bị rò rỉ trong bếp nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team will fix the leaking tap in the staff restroom tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì sẽ sửa vòi nước bị rỉ trong nhà vệ sinh nhân viên vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-ljspeech-25f30d35.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-cori-25f30d35.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tap-dde8e3f3.webp', '[\"faucet\", \"valve\", \"spigot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"turn on the tap\", \"meaning\": \"mở vòi nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leaking tap\", \"meaning\": \"vòi nước bị rỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tape\", \"note_vi\": \"tape là băng keo hoặc băng ghi âm, tap là vòi nước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tap\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-cori-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru0-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru5-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru6-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru10-25f30d35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru9-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru3-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru7-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru8-25f30d35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tap-aru2-25f30d35.mp3\"]}