('5a0bc52d-321b-59ba-8308-aa7565105e89', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'bdfa6887-ca74-5dc7-b29e-988cbf48fca8', '302951c4-2338-5936-a53a-798602caa509', 'estimate', 'UK: /ˈes.tɪ.mət/ | US: /ˈes.tə.mət/', 'B2', 'noun', 'ước tính', 'An approximate calculation or judgment of the value, cost, size, or extent of something.', 'The initial estimate was very close to the final cost.', 'Ước tính ban đầu rất sát với chi phí cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"We received a detailed cost estimate for the renovation project.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã nhận được bản dự toán chi phí chi tiết cho dự án cải tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-ljspeech-cb3fca15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-cori-cb3fca15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/estimate-018df8d0.webp', '[\"appraisal\", \"approximation\", \"quotation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cost estimate\", \"meaning\": \"bản dự toán chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rough estimate\", \"meaning\": \"ước tính sơ bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assessment\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Assessment\' thiên về đánh giá năng lực/chất lượng, còn \'estimate\' thiên về ước tính con số/chi phí.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"estimate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"estimation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-cori-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru0-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru5-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru6-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru10-cb3fca15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru9-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru3-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/estimate-aru7-cb3fca15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e