('3a4b8ffd-1037-59b0-8ef1-e0723d673762', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'counselor', 'UK: /ˈkaʊnsələr/ | US: /ˈkaʊnsələr/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cố vấn', 'a trained professional who gives advice or guidance to people about personal or professional matters', 'A financial counselor can help manage your investments.', 'Một cố vấn tài chính có thể giúp quản lý các khoản đầu tư của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can speak to a career counselor to explore internal transfer opportunities.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể trao đổi với cố vấn nghề nghiệp để tìm hiểu các cơ hội chuyển công tác nội bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-ljspeech-e8b84350.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-cori-e8b84350.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/counselor-0677cb34.webp', '[\"advisor\", \"consultant\", \"mentor\", \"guide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"career counselor\", \"meaning\": \"cố vấn nghề nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"legal counselor\", \"meaning\": \"cố vấn pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"councilor\", \"note_vi\": \"thành viên hội đồng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"counsel\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"counseling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-cori-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru0-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru5-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru6-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru10-e8b84350.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru9-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru3-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru7-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru8-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-aru2-e8b84350.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-ljspeech-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt408-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt138-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt624-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt396-e8b84350.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt498-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt132-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt288-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt42-e8b84350.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/counselor-lt90-e8b84350.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiếng Anh Mỹ viết \'counselor\', tiếng Anh Anh viết \'counsellor\' (hai chữ l).', 'human resources', 1, 12),
('51e7c8f0-5852-5537-9518-ae6217a8a4b9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'herb', '/hɜːb/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loài cây nhỏ có thân mềm, thường dùng làm thuốc hoặc gia vị.', 'a plant used in cooking to add flavor or in medicine to treat illnesses.', 'Many traditional medicines use various herbs for their healing properties.', 'Nhiều loại thuốc cổ truyền sử dụng các loại thảo mộc khác nhau vì đặc tính chữa bệnh của chúng.', '{\"en\": \"Our restaurant uses fresh herb ingredients grown in the garden to enhance every signature dish.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng chúng tôi sử dụng nguyên liệu thảo mộc tươi trồng trong vườn để tăng hương vị cho mọi món ăn đặc trưng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-ljspeech-9e12a3d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-cori-9e12a3d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/herb-5d6d1685.webp', '[\"spice\", \"plant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh herb\", \"meaning\": \"thảo mộc tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"culinary herb\", \"meaning\": \"thảo mộc dùng trong nấu ăn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-cori-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru0-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru5-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru6-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru10-9e12a3d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru9-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru3-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru7-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru8-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-aru2-9e12a3d2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-ljspeech-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt408-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt138-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt624-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt396-9e12a3d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt498-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt132-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt288-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt42-9e12a3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herb-lt90-9e12a3d2.mp3\"]}}', 'chú ý âm \'h\' có thể câm trong tiếng Anh-Anh.', 'dining', 1, 13),
('8a21a0dc-dee4-5358-a468-1a1476c574ef', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'delete', '/dɪˈliːt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Xóa bỏ, loại bỏ một mục hoặc thông tin.', 'to remove something that has been written, stored on a computer, or recorded.', 'Don\'t forget to delete old files to free up disk space.', 'Đừng quên xóa các tệp cũ để giải phóng dung lượng đĩa.', '{\"en\": \"Please delete the duplicate files from the shared folder to save space on the server.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xóa các tệp trùng lặp khỏi thư mục chia sẻ để tiết kiệm dung lượng trên máy chủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-ljspeech-9485989f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-cori-9485989f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delete-c9aca781.webp', '[\"remove\", \"erase\"]', '[\"save\", \"keep\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delete a file\", \"meaning\": \"xóa tệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delete an account\", \"meaning\": \"xóa tài khoản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"erase\", \"note_vi\": \"Erase thường dùng cho bảng hoặc băng từ, delete dùng cho dữ liệu máy tính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deletion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-cori-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru0-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru5-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru6-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru10-9485989f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru9-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru3-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru7-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru8-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-aru2-9485989f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-ljspeech-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt408-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt138-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt624-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt396-9485989f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt498-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt132-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt288-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt42-9485989f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delete-lt90-9485989f.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ vựng cơ bản trong tin học văn phòng.', 'technology', 1, 14),
('1915fb40-a328-5982-a38b-14a8fe599256', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'remarkable', '/rɪˈmɑːkəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nổi bật, đặc biệt và gây ấn tượng.', 'unusual or surprising in a way that causes people to take notice.', 'The young athlete showed remarkable determination during the difficult championship match.', 'Vận động viên trẻ đã thể hiện sự quyết tâm đáng kinh ngạc trong trận đấu vô địch khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The company achieved a remarkable increase in sales despite the economic downturn.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đạt được mức tăng trưởng doanh số đáng chú ý dù kinh tế suy thoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-ljspeech-3079ecd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-cori-3079ecd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/remarkable-4bb99875.webp', '[\"extraordinary\", \"outstanding\", \"impressive\"]', '[\"ordinary\", \"unremarkable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remarkable achievement\", \"meaning\": \"thành tựu đáng chú ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remarkable progress\", \"meaning\": \"tiến bộ đáng kinh ngạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"noticeable\", \"note_vi\": \"Noticeable là dễ nhận thấy, còn remarkable nhấn mạnh tính đặc biệt gây ấn tượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"remarkably\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"remark\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-cori-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru0-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru5-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru6-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru10-3079ecd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru9-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru3-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru7-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru8-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-aru2-3079ecd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-ljspeech-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt408-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt138-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt624-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt396-3079ecd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt498-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt132-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt288-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt42-3079ecd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/remarkable-lt90-3079ecd8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các danh từ chỉ kết quả như achievement, success, growth.', 'business', 1, 15),
('1491abac-300e-5e0f-8aac-f4671f3e5c6a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'crew', 'UK: /kruː/ | US: /kruː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đội, nhóm làm việc', 'An organized group of people who work together doing a particular specialized job.', 'The cleaning crew arrives every evening.', 'Đội vệ sinh đến vào mỗi buổi tối.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew worked overnight to restore power to the office building.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã làm việc xuyên đêm để khôi phục nguồn điện cho tòa nhà văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-ljspeech-a447a8fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-cori-a447a8fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crew-ecbd5f74.webp', '[\"team\", \"squad\", \"workforce\", \"group\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"maintenance crew\", \"meaning\": \"đội bảo trì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flight crew\", \"meaning\": \"phi hành đoàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crowd\", \"note_vi\": \"Đám đông tự phát, không phải một nhóm làm việc phối hợp có chuyên môn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-cori-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru0-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru5-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru6-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru10-a447a8fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru9-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru3-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru7-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru8-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-aru2-a447a8fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-ljspeech-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt408-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt138-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt624-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt396-a447a8fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt498-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt132-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt288-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt42-a447a8fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crew-lt90-a447a8fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các từ chỉ chuyên môn như \'maintenance crew\' (đội bảo trì), \'flight crew\' (phi hành đoàn).', 'maintenance', 1, 16),
('be6d9ee1-4568-5722-b547-a5df5e95b7b1', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'isolated', '/ˈaɪsəleɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Riêng biệt, tách rời khỏi những thứ khác.', 'being far away from other places, buildings, or people.', 'The small village was quite isolated, surrounded by mountains and forests.', 'Ngôi làng nhỏ khá cô lập, được bao quanh bởi núi và rừng.', '{\"en\": \"The factory was built in an isolated area to avoid disturbing local residents.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy được xây dựng ở một khu vực biệt lập để tránh làm phiền người dân địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-ljspeech-1b84995d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-cori-1b84995d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/isolated-78489fdf.webp', '[\"remote\", \"separated\", \"lonely\"]', '[\"connected\", \"accessible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"isolated incident\", \"meaning\": \"sự cố đơn lẻ, cá biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"isolated community\", \"meaning\": \"cộng đồng biệt lập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insulated\", \"note_vi\": \"Được cách nhiệt hoặc cách điện.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"isolate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"isolation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-cori-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru0-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru5-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru6-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru10-1b84995d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru9-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru3-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru7-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru8-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-aru2-1b84995d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-ljspeech-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt408-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt138-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt624-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt396-1b84995d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt498-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt132-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt288-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt42-1b84995d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolated-lt90-1b84995d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'insulated\' nghĩa là được cách nhiệt/cách điện.', 'manufacturing', 1, 17),
('3e2b198e-b24e-522d-82ca-2e22822c1648', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'rival', '/ˈraɪvl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người hoặc nhóm cạnh tranh với người khác để giành chiến thắng.', 'a person or group competing with others for the same goal or success.', 'The smartphone manufacturer recently launched a new model to compete with its primary rival.', 'Nhà sản xuất điện thoại thông minh gần đây đã ra mắt một mẫu mới để cạnh tranh với đối thủ chính của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The smartphone maker introduced lower prices to stay ahead of its main market rival.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất điện thoại thông minh đã hạ giá bán để vượt lên trên đối thủ thị trường chính của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-ljspeech-9ba5eef5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-cori-9ba5eef5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rival-706fec3d.webp', '[\"competitor\", \"opponent\", \"challenger\"]', '[\"ally\", \"partner\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chief rival\", \"meaning\": \"đối thủ chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business rival\", \"meaning\": \"đối thủ kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"arrival\", \"note_vi\": \"arrival nghĩa là sự đến nơi, chỉ khác chữ a ở đầu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rivalry\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rival\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-cori-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru0-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru5-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru6-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru10-9ba5eef5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru9-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru3-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru7-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru8-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru2-9ba5eef5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-ljspeech-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt408-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt138-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt624-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt396-9ba5eef5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt498-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt132-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt288-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt42-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt90-9ba5eef5.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa làm danh từ (đối thủ) vừa làm động từ (cạnh tranh với).', 'business', 1, 18),
('28d14963-398b-51f2-b855-dc4de1dc50cc', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'cb929931-230f-5604-bd9b-39e8c3e2e97c', '16b65943-6c8a-5dbc-ae54-e2e416000a40', 'revision', '/rɪˈvɪʒn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động xem xét và thay đổi để cải thiện.', 'a change or set of changes made to improve a document or plan.', 'The author made several revisions to the manuscript before its publication.', 'Tác giả đã thực hiện một vài lần sửa đổi bản thảo trước khi xuất bản.', '{\"en\": \"Please send the final revision of the proposal to the client before noon.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gửi bản sửa đổi cuối cùng của đề xuất cho khách hàng trước giữa trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-ljspeech-eae79d6e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-cori-eae79d6e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/revision-0effe05b.webp', '[\"correction\", \"amendment\", \"modification\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make revisions\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện các chỉnh sửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minor revision\", \"meaning\": \"chỉnh sửa nhỏ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"review\", \"note_vi\": \"Review là xem xét/đánh giá, còn revision là việc sửa đổi dựa trên đánh giá đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"revise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-cori-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru0-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru5-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru6-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru10-eae79d6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru9-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru3-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru7-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revision-aru8-eae79d6e.mp3\", \"/