('5a4d9e02-3107-58f1-a564-1a71284f2734', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd4c5d0e0-19b6-578b-a49c-912627e04107', 'a8ebee89-49cc-5dee-a488-ec4e21fed4dc', 'scratch', '/skrætʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một vết cắt hoặc vết cào nhỏ trên bề mặt.', 'A shallow line or damage inflicted upon an exterior by a sharp instrument.', 'My new phone got a small scratch on its screen.', 'Điện thoại mới của tôi bị một vết xước nhỏ trên màn hình.', '{\"en\": \"The customer requested a refund because the delivered laptop had a visible scratch on the cover.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng yêu cầu hoàn tiền vì chiếc máy tính xách tay được giao có một vết xước rõ trên vỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-ljspeech-ffdf8c66.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-cori-ffdf8c66.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scratch-a06cec11.webp', '[\"mark\", \"scrape\", \"cut\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"minor scratch\", \"meaning\": \"vết xước nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scratch resistance\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng chống xước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scar\", \"note_vi\": \"scar là vết sẹo (trên cơ thể), còn scratch là vết xước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"scratch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-cori-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru0-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru5-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru6-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru10-ffdf8c66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru9-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru3-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru7-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru8-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-aru2-ffdf8c66.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-ljspeech-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt408-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt138-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt624-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt396-ffdf8c66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt498-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt132-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt288-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt42-ffdf8c66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scratch-lt90-ffdf8c66.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'from scratch\' (bắt đầu lại từ đầu) xuất hiện rất thường xuyên trong đề thi TOEIC.', 'shopping', 1, 25),
('79dcb68b-12e2-5305-a29c-db82090a8852', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd4c5d0e0-19b6-578b-a49c-912627e04107', 'a8ebee89-49cc-5dee-a488-ec4e21fed4dc', 'energetically', 'UK: /ˌɛnəˈdʒɛtɪkli/ | US: /ˌɛnərˈdʒɛtɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách năng nổ, mạnh mẽ', 'In a manner full of high activity, vitality, enthusiasm, and active effort.', 'The team worked energetically to meet the deadline.', 'Đội ngũ đã làm việc năng nổ để hoàn thành đúng thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team energetically promoted the new product line at the international trade fair.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng đã năng nổ quảng bá dòng sản phẩm mới tại hội chợ thương mại quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-ljspeech-8cfc485e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-cori-8cfc485e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/energetically-e8b3bc6f.webp', '[\"enthusiastically\", \"vigorously\", \"actively\", \"dynamically\"]', '[\"sluggishly\", \"passively\", \"lazily\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work energetically\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc năng nổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promote energetically\", \"meaning\": \"quảng bá tích cực/mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficiently\", \"note_vi\": \"\'efficiently\' là hiệu quả (tiết kiệm thời gian/chi phí), còn \'energetically\' là tràn đầy năng lượng, hăng hái.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"energy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"energetic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-cori-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru0-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru5-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru6-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru10-8cfc485e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru9-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru3-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru7-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru8-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-aru2-8cfc485e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-ljspeech-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt408-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt138-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt624-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt396-8cfc485e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt498-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt132-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt288-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt42-8cfc485e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energetically-lt90-8cfc485e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho động từ hành động thể hiện sự nhiệt tình, chủ động (vd: work energetically, promote energetically).', 'marketing', 1, 26),
('dbd6c439-e4a6-5ac8-a389-09b8a642dc2e', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd4c5d0e0-19b6-578b-a49c-912627e04107', 'a8ebee89-49cc-5dee-a488-ec4e21fed4dc', 'workplace', '/ˈwɜːkpleɪs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Địa điểm mà mọi người làm việc.', 'the office, factory, or other place where people perform their professional duties every day.', 'Creating a positive and inclusive workplace culture is essential for employee satisfaction.', 'Tạo ra một văn hóa nơi làm việc tích cực và hòa nhập là điều cần thiết cho sự hài lòng của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The company introduced new safety protocols to ensure a secure and healthy workplace for all staff.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã giới thiệu các quy trình an toàn mới để đảm bảo một nơi làm việc an toàn và lành mạnh cho tất cả nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-ljspeech-0656d57d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-cori-0656d57d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/workplace-ec10e27b.webp', '[\"office\", \"work environment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"workplace safety\", \"meaning\": \"an toàn nơi làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"workplace culture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa nơi làm việc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-cori-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru0-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru5-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru6-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru10-0656d57d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru9-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru3-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru7-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru8-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-aru2-0656d57d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-ljspeech-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt408-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt138-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt624-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt396-0656d57d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt498-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt132-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt288-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt42-0656d57d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workplace-lt90-0656d57d.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết liền thành một từ duy nhất.', 'office', 1, 27),
('27602bd9-6511-5aa6-bfef-841f77ac774a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd4c5d0e0-19b6-578b-a49c-912627e04107', 'a8ebee89-49cc-5dee-a488-ec4e21fed4dc', 'isolate', '/ˈaɪsəleɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tách biệt một người, vật hoặc nhóm khỏi những người khác.', 'to separate a person or thing from others so they are alone.', 'Engineers decided to isolate the faulty server to prevent further network disruptions.', 'Các kỹ sư quyết định cách ly máy chủ bị lỗi để ngăn chặn sự gián đoạn mạng thêm nữa.', '{\"en\": \"The technician needs to isolate the faulty component to repair the server system effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên cần tách biệt thành phần bị lỗi để sửa chữa hệ thống máy chủ hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-ljspeech-eb5779e2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-cori-eb5779e2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/isolate-d36ff4b8.webp', '[\"separate\", \"detach\"]', '[\"connect\", \"integrate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"isolate from\", \"meaning\": \"tách biệt khỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"isolate the problem\", \"meaning\": \"cô lập vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insulate\", \"note_vi\": \"cách điện, cách nhiệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"isolation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"isolated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-cori-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru0-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru5-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru6-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru10-eb5779e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru9-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru3-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru7-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru8-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru2-eb5779e2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-ljspeech-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt408-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt138-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt624-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt396-eb5779e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt498-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt132-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt288-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt42-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt90-eb5779e2.mp3\"]}}', '\"Isolate\" là tách biệt, \"insulate\" là cách điện hoặc cách nhiệt.', 'technology', 1, 28),
('47bbb601-efeb-5efa-8334-b899d5b2c151', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd4c5d0e0-19b6-578b-a49c-912627e04107', 'a8ebee89-49cc-5dee-a488-ec4e21fed4dc', 'defect', 'UK: /ˈdiː.fekt/ | US: /ˈdiː.fekt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lỗi, khuyết tật', 'A fault or imperfection that prevents something from working properly.', 'The car was returned due to a manufacturing defect.', 'Chiếc xe đã được trả lại do lỗi sản xuất.', '{\"en\": \"The factory inspector identified a minor manufacturing defect in the batch of laptop batteries.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra nhà máy đã phát hiện một lỗi sản xuất nhỏ trong lô pin máy tính xách tay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-ljspeech-1ca07399.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-cori-1ca07399.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defect-1b0b9a75.webp', '[\"flaw\", \"fault\", \"imperfection\", \"blemish\"]', '[\"perfection\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"manufacturing defect\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi sản xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"zero defects\", \"meaning\": \"không có lỗi / khuyết tật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"defeat\", \"note_vi\": \"đánh bại hoặc sự thất bại (khác với defect là khuyết điểm/lỗi sản phẩm)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"defective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-cori-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru0-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru5-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru6-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru10-1ca07399.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru9-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru3-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru7-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru8-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru2-1ca07399.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-ljspeech-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt408-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt138-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt624-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt396-1ca07399.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt498-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt132-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt288-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt42-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-lt90-1ca07399.mp3\"]}}', 'Trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết thứ nhất /ˈdiː.fekt/ khi là danh từ. Hay gặp trong chủ đề Quản lý chất lượng (Quality Control).', 'manufacturing', 1, 29),
('485ee68f-73e2-58bf-bc0b-59510425e99b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'desperately', '/ˈdespərətli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách tuyệt vọng, rất cần hoặc muốn điều gì đó.', 'in a way showing great need or hopelessness.', 'She desperately wanted to pass the exam to get into her dream university.', 'Cô ấy vô cùng muốn đỗ kỳ thi để vào được trường đại học mơ ước của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The startup desperately needed more funding to survive the economic crisis.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp rất tuyệt vọng cần thêm vốn để sống sót qua khủng hoảng kinh tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-ljspeech-35d14dfa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-cori-35d14dfa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desperately-bdd068cc.webp', '[\"frantically\", \"urgently\", \"hopelessly\"]', '[\"calmly\", \"indifferently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"desperately need\", \"meaning\": \"cần thiết tuyệt vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"desperately want\", \"meaning\": \"muốn đến tuyệt vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"desperately seek\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm khẩn cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"separately\", \"note_vi\": \"phó từ nghĩa riêng biệt, dễ viết nhầm chính tả\"}, {\"word\": \"despicably\", \"note_vi\": \"một cách đáng khinh, phát âm gần\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"desperate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"desperation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-cori-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru0-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru5-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru6-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru10-35d14dfa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru9-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru3-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru7-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru8-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-aru2-35d14dfa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-ljspeech-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt408-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt138-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt624-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt396-35d14dfa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt498-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt132-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt288-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt42-35d14dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperately-lt90-35d14dfa.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này đánh vần \'desperate\' + ly; tránh nhầm với \'separately\'.', 'business', 1, 0),
('d6d57709-c5da-55db-96e1-2f22c875808c', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'steam', '/stiːm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hơi nước nóng, là dạng khí của nước.', 'the hot gas that is produced when water is heated to a high temperature.', 'Thick white steam rose quickly from the iron factory pipes during the morning.', 'Hơi nước màu trắng dày đặc bốc lên nhanh chóng từ các đường ống nhà máy sắt vào buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The industrial machine uses high-pressure steam to clean the heavy metal parts efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Máy công nghiệp sử dụng hơi nước áp suất cao để làm sạch các bộ phận kim loại nặng một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-ljspeech-bf2903b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-cori-bf2903b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steam-03f157f3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steam engine\", \"meaning\": \"động cơ hơi nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steam power\", \"meaning\": \"năng lượng hơi nước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"steamy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-cori-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru0-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru5-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru6-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru10-bf2903b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru9-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru3-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru7-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru8-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru2-bf2903b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-