('53d09e15-6246-5b4a-bd31-997da11673c4', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'emission', '/ɪˈmɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự phát ra hoặc chất được thải ra, đặc biệt là khí hoặc nhiệt.', 'the release of gas, heat, or other substances into the surrounding environment.', 'Reducing carbon emissions is crucial for combating climate change.', 'Giảm lượng khí thải carbon là rất quan trọng để chống lại biến đổi khí hậu.', '{\"en\": \"The factory upgraded its equipment to reduce harmful emissions into the atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã nâng cấp thiết bị để giảm lượng khí thải độc hại ra môi trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-ljspeech-b5da25e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-cori-b5da25e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/emission-9b88e204.webp', '[\"discharge\", \"release\", \"output\"]', '[\"absorption\", \"intake\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"carbon emission\", \"meaning\": \"khí thải carbon\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce emissions\", \"meaning\": \"giảm lượng khí thải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"emission standard\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu chuẩn khí thải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"omission\", \"note_vi\": \"omission là sự bỏ sót, thiếu sót; emission là sự phát thải khí hoặc năng lượng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"emit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"emissive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-cori-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru0-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru5-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru6-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru10-b5da25e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru9-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru3-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru7-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru8-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru2-b5da25e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-ljspeech-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt408-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt138-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt624-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt396-b5da25e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt498-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt132-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt288-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt42-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-lt90-b5da25e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'emission\' (khí thải) với \'omission\' (sự bỏ sót); chỉ khác nhau một chữ cái đầu.', 'manufacturing', 1, 4),
('ab25add6-a357-5f71-9665-7dc2a9006c58', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'affordable', '/əˈfɔːdəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có giá hợp lý, đủ khả năng mua được.', 'cheap enough for most people to be able to buy or pay.', 'The restaurant serves affordable lunch specials for local office workers every day.', 'Nhà hàng phục vụ các suất ăn trưa giá cả phải chăng cho dân văn phòng địa phương mỗi ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers affordable health insurance plans for all full-time employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp các chương trình bảo hiểm y tế giá cả phải chăng cho tất cả nhân viên toàn thời gian.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-ljspeech-20567187.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-cori-20567187.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/affordable-da58fecf.webp', '[\"reasonable\", \"inexpensive\", \"cheap\"]', '[\"expensive\", \"unaffordable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"affordable housing\", \"meaning\": \"nhà ở giá rẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"affordable price\", \"meaning\": \"mức giá phải chăng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"avoidable\", \"note_vi\": \"có thể tránh được, viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"afford\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"affordability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-cori-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru0-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru5-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru6-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru10-20567187.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru9-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru3-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru7-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru8-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-aru2-20567187.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-ljspeech-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt408-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt138-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt624-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt396-20567187.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt498-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt132-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt288-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt42-20567187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affordable-lt90-20567187.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các danh từ như price, cost, housing.', 'finance', 1, 5),
('23882c1a-d155-522c-ba51-a048fe4dd739', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'coordination', 'UK: /kəʊˌɔː.dɪˈneɪ.ʃən/ | US: /koʊˌɔːr.dənˈeɪ.ʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự phối hợp', 'the organization of different elements of a complex body or activity to enable efficient work', 'Effective coordination is key for project success.', 'Phối hợp hiệu quả là chìa khóa cho sự thành công của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Effective coordination between marketing and sales boosted overall revenue by 15 percent.\", \"vi\": \"Sự phối hợp hiệu quả giữa bộ phận tiếp thị và bán hàng đã tăng tổng doanh thu lên 15%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-ljspeech-c242f8bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-cori-c242f8bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coordination-cd27960b.webp', '[\"organization\", \"integration\", \"harmonization\"]', '[\"disorganization\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in coordination with\", \"meaning\": \"phối hợp với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lack of coordination\", \"meaning\": \"sự thiếu phối hợp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coordinate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coordinator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-cori-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru0-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru5-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru6-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru10-c242f8bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru9-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru3-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru7-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru8-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-aru2-c242f8bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-ljspeech-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt408-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt138-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt624-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt396-c242f8bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt498-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt132-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt288-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt42-c242f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordination-lt90-c242f8bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ sự sắp xếp nhịp nhàng giữa các khâu/bộ phận. Hay gặp trong cấu trúc \'in coordination with\' (phối hợp với).', 'management', 1, 6),
('3c9c7bc5-bcd2-5b08-9435-74874c8ca2a1', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'distributor', 'UK: /dɪˈstrɪbjʊtə/ | US: /dɪˈstrɪbyətər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nhà phân phối', 'a company or person that supplies goods to shops and other business customers.', 'We are seeking new distributors for our products in Asia.', 'Chúng tôi đang tìm kiếm các nhà phân phối mới cho sản phẩm của mình ở châu Á.', '{\"en\": \"We are seeking an authorized distributor to represent our electronics brand in Europe.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đang tìm kiếm một nhà phân phối được ủy quyền để đại diện cho thương hiệu điện tử của chúng tôi tại châu Âu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-ljspeech-5ffa7721.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-cori-5ffa7721.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distributor-10fede27.webp', '[\"wholesaler\", \"supplier\", \"vendor\", \"dealer\"]', '[\"consumer\", \"buyer\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"authorized distributor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà phân phối được ủy quyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exclusive distributor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà phân phối độc quyền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supplier\", \"note_vi\": \"Distributor bán sản phẩm ra thị trường tiêu thụ; Supplier cung cấp nguyên liệu/hàng hóa đầu vào.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"distribute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distribution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-cori-5ffa7721.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-aru0-5ffa7721.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-aru5-5ffa7721.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-aru6-5ffa7721.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-aru10-5ffa7721.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distributor-aru9-5ffa7721.mp3\", \"/stora