('8a68dcb7-7abb-5408-b4fe-01a75d2651f4', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'd9319830-aca5-5c6a-a971-9aa85c7e80ce', '5e65316d-551e-5501-935b-d54d96ca4e05', 'darkness', '/ˈdɑːknəs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng không có ánh sáng; sự tối tăm.', 'a state where there is no light at all, making it difficult to see things clearly.', 'The power went out, plunging the entire house into darkness.', 'Mất điện khiến cả căn nhà chìm vào bóng tối.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse was left in total darkness after the main electrical system failed last night.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà kho chìm trong bóng tối hoàn toàn sau khi hệ thống điện chính bị hỏng tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-ljspeech-60eb7e5f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-cori-60eb7e5f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/darkness-77ee4b73.webp', '[\"gloom\", \"shadow\"]', '[\"light\", \"brightness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"total darkness\", \"meaning\": \"bóng tối hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the darkness\", \"meaning\": \"trong bóng tối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dark\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"darken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-cori-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru0-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru5-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru6-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru10-60eb7e5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru9-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru3-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru7-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru8-60eb7e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/darkness-aru2-60eb7e5f.mp3\"]}, \