('b1b693db-476f-51eb-b7ea-2c9b50130f40', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'exclusive', 'UK: /ɪkˈskluːsɪv/ | US: /ɪkˈskluːsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'độc quyền, riêng biệt', 'Limited to a particular group of people or not shared with any others.', 'Members receive exclusive access to VIP events.', 'Các thành viên nhận được quyền truy cập độc quyền vào các sự kiện VIP.', '{\"en\": \"Our company signed an exclusive contract to distribute the new software in Asia.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã ký hợp đồng độc quyền để phân phối phần mềm mới tại châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-ljspeech-341efea4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-cori-341efea4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exclusive-b2cfbeb7.webp', '[\"sole\", \"restricted\", \"private\", \"unique\"]', '[\"shared\", \"public\", \"inclusive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exclusive deal\", \"meaning\": \"thỏa thuận độc quyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exclusive access\", \"meaning\": \"quyền truy cập riêng biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inclusive\", \"note_vi\": \"inclusive có nghĩa là bao gồm tất cả, trái ngược với exclusive là độc quyền hoặc loại trừ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"exclusively\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exclude\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exclusivity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-cori-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru0-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru5-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru6-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru10-341efea4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru9-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru3-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru7-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru8-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru2-341efea4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-ljspeech-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt408-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt138-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt624-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt396-341efea4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt498-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt132-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt288-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt42-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt90-341efea4.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'exclusive right/deal\' rất hay xuất hiện trong hợp đồng và thỏa thuận thương mại TOEIC.', 'business', 1, 9),
('44d194ca-0726-518c-bb88-acef9ce4e6ec', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'absorb', '/əbˈzɔːb/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hấp thụ, tiếp thu.', 'to take in liquid, gas, or information in a gradual way.', 'Plants absorb sunlight through their leaves to grow.', 'Cây cối hấp thụ ánh sáng mặt trời qua lá để phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"New employees need time to absorb all the information during training.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới cần thời gian để tiếp thu tất cả thông tin trong suốt quá trình đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-ljspeech-846e2a86.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-cori-846e2a86.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/absorb-ea0d7040.webp', '[\"assimilate\", \"take in\", \"soak up\"]', '[\"exude\", \"release\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absorb information\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp thu thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"absorb moisture\", \"meaning\": \"hút ẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adsorb\", \"note_vi\": \"hấp phụ chất trên bề mặt chứ không thấm vào\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"absorption\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"absorbent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-cori-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru0-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru5-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru6-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru10-846e2a86.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru9-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru3-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru7-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru8-846e2a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/absorb-aru2-846e2a8