('67415654-09c9-5e7f-aaeb-3fe7130f65b1', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'info', '/ˈɪnfəʊ/', 'A2', 'noun', '(Không trang trọng) Thông tin hoặc dữ liệu.', 'facts or details about a situation, person, or event that you can learn or provide.', 'The brochure provides useful info regarding travel insurance options for tourists.', 'Cuốn sách nhỏ này cung cấp thông tin hữu ích về các lựa chọn bảo hiểm du lịch cho khách tham quan.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the website for more info regarding the upcoming training session next month.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra trang web để biết thêm thông tin về buổi đào tạo sắp tới vào tháng sau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-ljspeech-59bd0a3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-cori-59bd0a3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/info-95f5f213.webp', '[\"data\", \"details\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"get info\", \"meaning\": \"lấy thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide info\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp thông tin\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"information\", \"note_vi\": \"Info là dạng viết tắt không trang trọng của information.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"information\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-cori-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru0-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru5-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru6-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru10-59bd0a3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru9-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru3-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru7-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru8-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-aru2-59bd0a3f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-ljspeech-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt408-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt138-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt624-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt396-59bd0a3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt498-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt132-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt288-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt42-59bd0a3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/info-lt90-59bd0a3f.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng trong giao tiếp thân mật, không nên dùng trong văn bản hợp đồng trang trọng.', 'daily', 1, 13),
('189b7713-8335-5055-bd8f-75b49cc31c3f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'survivor', '/səˈvaɪvə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người sống sót qua một tai nạn, thảm họa hoặc tình huống nguy hiểm.', 'a person who continues to live after a dangerous event or illness.', 'Rescue teams managed to pull a survivor out of the collapsed building.', 'Các đội cứu hộ đã giải cứu thành công một người sống sót ra khỏi tòa nhà bị sập.', '{\"en\": \"The insurance company contacted the sole survivor of the factory accident to discuss compensation.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty bảo hiểm đã liên hệ với người sống sót duy nhất của vụ tai nạn nhà máy để thảo luận về bồi thường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-ljspeech-f52d1b09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-cori-f52d1b09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/survivor-45e7cf4b.webp', NULL, '[\"victim\", \"casualty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sole survivor\", \"meaning\": \"người sống sót duy nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cancer survivor\", \"meaning\": \"người chiến thắng bệnh ung thư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"surveyor\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ người khảo sát, đo đạc đất đai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"survive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"survival\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-cori-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru0-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru5-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru6-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru10-f52d1b09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru9-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru3-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru7-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru8-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-aru2-f52d1b09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-ljspeech-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt408-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt138-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt624-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt396-f52d1b09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt498-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt132-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt288-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt42-f52d1b09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survivor-lt90-f52d1b09.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \"surveyor\" (người đo đạc, khảo sát).', 'health', 1, 14),
('84f308ae-58c4-50a5-a40f-fc0a4e1a715c', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'assumption', '/əˈsʌmpʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Điều được cho là đúng mà không cần chứng minh.', 'something that you think is true without having any proof.', 'We\'re making a lot of assumptions about what the customers truly want.', 'Chúng ta đang đưa ra nhiều giả định về những gì khách hàng thực sự muốn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing strategy was based on the assumption that sales would increase in summer.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược tiếp thị dựa trên giả định rằng doanh số sẽ tăng vào mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-ljspeech-57763304.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-cori-57763304.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assumption-02f7789f.webp', '[\"presumption\", \"belief\", \"supposition\"]', '[\"fact\", \"proof\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make an assumption\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra giả định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"based on the assumption\", \"meaning\": \"dựa trên giả định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consumption\", \"note_vi\": \"sự tiêu thụ, dễ nhầm mặt chữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assume\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-cori-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru0-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru5-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru6-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru10-57763304.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru9-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru3-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru7-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru8-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru2-57763304.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-ljspeech-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt408-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt138-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt624-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt396-57763304.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt498-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt132-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt288-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt42-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt90-57763304.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ make (make an assumption).', 'business', 1, 15),
('7a859883-b758-5b55-90ea-c452f6cc5cf9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'organic', '/ɔːˈɡænɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Hữu cơ, không dùng hóa chất tổng hợp trong trồng trọt, chăn nuôi.', 'Relating to methods of growing food naturally without synthetic fertilizers or pesticides.', 'Many people prefer to buy organic vegetables for health reasons.', 'Nhiều người thích mua rau hữu cơ vì lý do sức khỏe.', '{\"en\": \"Our restaurant sources organic ingredients from local farms to ensure high food quality.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng chúng tôi nhập nguyên liệu hữu cơ từ các trang trại địa phương để đảm bảo chất lượng món ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-ljspeech-2ee79daa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-cori-2ee79daa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/organic-6366627c.webp', '[\"natural\"]', '[\"inorganic\", \"synthetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"organic food\", \"meaning\": \"thực phẩm hữu cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"organic farming\", \"meaning\": \"canh tác hữu cơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"organized\", \"note_vi\": \"có nghĩa là được tổ chức ngăn nắp, không phải hữu cơ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"organism\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"organically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-cori-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru0-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru5-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru6-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru10-2ee79daa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru9-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru3-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru7-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru8-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-aru2-2ee79daa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-ljspeech-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt408-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt138-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt624-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt396-2ee79daa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt498-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt132-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt288-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt42-2ee79daa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organic-lt90-2ee79daa.mp3\"]}}', 'Organic thường dùng cho thực phẩm hoặc nông sản sạch không chứa chất hóa học.', 'dining', 1, 16),
('4a879e1c-3319-5894-a381-514a4273348c', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'ethnic', '/ˈeθnɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về một nhóm người có chung văn hóa, ngôn ngữ hoặc nguồn gốc.', 'connected with a group of people who share a common culture, language, or origin.', 'The city is known for its diverse ethnic neighborhoods and delicious food.', 'Thành phố này nổi tiếng với các khu dân tộc đa dạng và đồ ăn ngon.', '{\"en\": \"The company promotes workforce diversity by recruiting employees from various ethnic backgrounds.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty thúc đẩy sự đa dạng nhân sự bằng cách tuyển dụng nhân viên từ nhiều nguồn gốc sắc tộc khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-ljspeech-a4b408bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-cori-a4b408bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ethnic-e03ca0d7.webp', '[\"cultural\", \"racial\", \"tribal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ethnic minority\", \"meaning\": \"dân tộc thiểu số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ethnic diversity\", \"meaning\": \"sự đa dạng sắc tộc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ethical\", \"note_vi\": \"ethical là thuộc đạo đức, còn ethnic là thuộc sắc tộc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ethnicity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ethnically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-cori-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru0-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru5-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru6-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru10-a4b408bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru9-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru3-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru7-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru8-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-aru2-a4b408bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-ljspeech-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt408-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt138-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt624-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt396-a4b408bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt498-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt132-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt288-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt42-a4b408bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethnic-lt90-a4b408bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn \'ethnic\' (sắc tộc) với \'ethical\' (thuộc về đạo đức).', 'hr', 1, 17),
('99579302-357b-5499-9fda-78d6968e1f3b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'erupt', '/ɪˈrʌpt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bùng nổ, phun ra dữ dội (như núi lửa) hoặc đột ngột xuất hiện.', 'to suddenly release hot liquid rock or gas from inside the earth with great force.', 'The volcano is expected to erupt within the next few days.', 'Núi lửa dự kiến sẽ phun trào trong vài ngày tới.', '{\"en\": \"The local authorities warned that the mountain might erupt during the busy tourist season.\", \"vi\": \"Chính quyền địa phương cảnh báo rằng ngọn núi có thể phun trào trong mùa du lịch cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-ljspeech-f0dc9ec3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-cori-f0dc9ec3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/erupt-06a3a4ee.webp', '[\"explode\", \"burst\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"volcanic eruption\", \"meaning\": \"sự phun trào núi lửa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eruption\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-cori-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru0-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru5-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru6-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru10-f0dc9ec3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru9-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru3-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru7-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru8-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-aru2-f0dc9ec3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-ljspeech-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt408-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt138-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt624-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt396-f0dc9ec3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt498-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt132-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt288-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt42-f0dc9ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erupt-lt90-f0dc9ec3.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ núi lửa hoặc sự bùng nổ cảm xúc, xung đột bất ngờ.', 'nature', 1, 18),
('6b485b34-ba27-5717-a42d-d9796385ed25', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'make-up', '/ˈmeɪkˌʌp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Mỹ phẩm dùng để trang điểm mặt.', 'colored substances that people put on their faces to look more attractive or different.', 'She always wears a little make-up to enhance her features.', 'Cô ấy luôn trang điểm nhẹ để tôn lên những nét đẹp của mình.', '{\"en\": \"She works as a professional artist applying make-up for models at the fashion show.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy làm nghệ sĩ chuyên nghiệp trang điểm cho các người mẫu tại buổi trình diễn thời trang.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-ljspeech-9fca05d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-cori-9fca05d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/make-up-520e9153.webp', '[\"cosmetics\", \"makeup\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wear make-up\", \"meaning\": \"trang điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apply make-up\", \"meaning\": \"thoa mỹ phẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"makeup\", \"note_vi\": \"Make-up (danh từ/tính từ) và makeup (danh từ) thường dùng thay thế nhau.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"make up\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-cori-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru0-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru5-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru6-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru10-9fca05d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru9-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru3-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru7-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru8-9fca05d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mak