('d7ba9fca-a0e1-58e8-8569-63600d24e030', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'offender', '/əˈfendə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người đã thực hiện một hành vi phạm pháp.', 'a person who has broken the law or committed a crime against the rules.', 'The police quickly apprehended the offender responsible for the theft.', 'Cảnh sát đã nhanh chóng bắt giữ kẻ phạm tội chịu trách nhiệm về vụ trộm.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard identified the repeat offender who had been stealing office supplies from the desk.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ đã xác định được kẻ tái phạm đã lấy cắp văn phòng phẩm từ bàn làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-ljspeech-f937a467.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-cori-f937a467.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/offender-c3e0850f.webp', '[\"criminal\", \"lawbreaker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"repeat offender\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ tái phạm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"first-time offender\", \"meaning\": \"người phạm tội lần đầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"offend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"offense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-cori-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru0-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru5-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru6-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru10-f937a467.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru9-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru3-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru7-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offender-aru8-f937a467.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/of