('cdb40087-4bc0-5b9c-ba1a-27d93941f119', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'correspondence', 'UK: /ˌkɒrɪˈspɒndəns/ | US: /kɔːrəˈspɑːndəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'thư tín, thông tin trao đổi', 'letters, messages, or emails sent and received between individuals or organization members', 'Please keep all business correspondence in a safe place.', 'Vui lòng lưu giữ tất cả thư tín kinh doanh ở một nơi an toàn.', '{\"en\": \"All official correspondence should be addressed to the human resources department.\", \"vi\": \"Mọi thư tín chính thức nên được gửi đến bộ phận nhân sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-ljspeech-f915e104.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-cori-f915e104.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/correspondence-eaf8eab3.webp', '[\"mail\", \"communication\", \"letters\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business correspondence\", \"meaning\": \"thư từ thương mại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written correspondence\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin trao đổi bằng văn bản\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"correspond\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"corresponding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-cori-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru0-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru5-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru6-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru10-f915e104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru9-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru3-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru7-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru8-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-aru2-f915e104.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-ljspeech-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt408-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt138-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt624-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt396-f915e104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt498-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt132-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt288-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt42-f915e104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/correspondence-lt90-f915e104.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ KHÔNG đếm được khi chỉ thư từ trao đổi liên lạc thương mại. Thường đi cùng cụm \'business correspondence\'.', 'communication', 1, 25),
('7886acc2-525a-5634-9e57-cb0ecfe2d2a9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'excel', 'UK: /ɪkˈsel/ | US: /ɪkˈsel/', 'B2', 'verb', 'xuất sắc, vượt trội', 'To perform remarkably well in a particular activity or a specific workplace role.', 'She excels in her role as a project manager.', 'Cô ấy xuất sắc trong vai trò quản lý dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Our new sales representative has managed to excel in building client relationships.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện kinh doanh mới của chúng tôi đã thể hiện sự vượt trội trong việc xây dựng mối quan hệ với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-ljspeech-d455be4a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-cori-d455be4a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excel-7b863f90.webp', '[\"surpass\", \"outshine\", \"exceed\", \"distinguish oneself\"]', '[\"fail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"excel in\", \"meaning\": \"xuất sắc trong lĩnh vực...\"}, {\"phrase\": \"excel at\", \"meaning\": \"giỏi về việc...\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exceed\", \"note_vi\": \"excel có nghĩa là giỏi vượt trội, còn exceed là vượt quá (chỉ tiêu, ngân sách).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excellent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"excellence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-cori-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru0-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru5-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru6-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru10-d455be4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru9-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru3-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru7-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru8-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-aru2-d455be4a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-ljspeech-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt408-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt138-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt624-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt396-d455be4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt498-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt132-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt288-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt42-d455be4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excel-lt90-d455be4a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'in\' hoặc \'at\' (excel in sales / excel at problem-solving).', 'personnel', 1, 26),
('b9868a8a-2bc6-5c47-9ab8-c36e9024d1d3', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'gesture', '/ˈdʒestʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một chuyển động của tay, đầu hoặc cơ thể để thể hiện ý nghĩa.', 'a movement of the hands, arms, or head to express an idea or feeling.', 'Sending flowers to a colleague in hospital is a thoughtful personal gesture.', 'Gửi hoa cho đồng nghiệp đang nằm viện là một cử chỉ cá nhân chu đáo.', '{\"en\": \"Offering a free dessert was a nice gesture from the restaurant manager to apologize for the delay.\", \"vi\": \"Tặng món tráng miệng miễn phí là một cử chỉ đẹp từ quản lý nhà hàng để xin lỗi vì sự chậm trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-ljspeech-a820fe7d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-cori-a820fe7d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gesture-80073a0f.webp', '[\"sign\", \"signal\", \"motion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"friendly gesture\", \"meaning\": \"cử chỉ thân thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a gesture\", \"meaning\": \"ra cử chỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"posture\", \"note_vi\": \"Posture là tư thế đứng/ngồi, gesture là cử chỉ chuyển động.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"gesticulate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-cori-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru0-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru5-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru6-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru10-a820fe7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru9-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru3-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru7-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru8-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru2-a820fe7d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-ljspeech-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt408-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt138-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt624-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt396-a820fe7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt498-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt132-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt288-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt42-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-lt90-a820fe7d.mp3\"]}}', 'Gesture vừa là cử chỉ cơ thể, vừa là hành động thể hiện thiện chí.', 'dining', 1, 27),
('588e46ac-795d-5869-bb75-74f17fdb2b2a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e3f6115c-6311-5240-9963-4aafebcf7bdd', '641d6c87-6976-5ab8-979f-b9fe656558cd', 'risky', '/ˈrɪski/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng gây nguy hiểm, rủi ro hoặc tổn thất.', 'involving the possibility of something bad or unpleasant happening.', 'Investing all your savings in one stock can be very risky.', 'Đầu tư toàn bộ tiền tiết kiệm vào một cổ phiếu có thể rất mạo hiểm.', '{\"en\": \"Investing in unstable markets is too risky for our conservative business model.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu tư vào các thị trường không ổn định là quá rủi ro đối với mô hình kinh doanh thận trọng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-ljspeech-f8a3616d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-cori-f8a3616d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/risky-fb83f84e.webp', '[\"dangerous\", \"hazardous\", \"unsafe\"]', '[\"safe\", \"secure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"risky investment\", \"meaning\": \"khoản đầu tư rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"risky business\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động kinh doanh mạo hiểm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"risk\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"risk\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-cori-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru0-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru5-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru6-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru10-f8a3616d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru9-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru3-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru7-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru8-f8a3616d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risky-aru2-f8a3616d.m