('bc97ba72-5025-5e5e-8936-b700d0682b2c', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'tsunami', '/tsuːˈnɑːmi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một đợt sóng biển lớn và mạnh do động đất dưới đáy biển gây ra.', 'a series of huge ocean waves caused by underwater earthquakes.', 'The coastal towns were devastated by the powerful tsunami.', 'Các thị trấn ven biển đã bị tàn phá bởi trận sóng thần mạnh mẽ.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency warned clients about tsunami risk on the coastal tour.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch cảnh báo khách hàng về rủi ro sóng thần trong tour ven biển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-ljspeech-8ffd9b35.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-cori-8ffd9b35.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tsunami-4ef7fc1d.webp', '[\"tidal wave\", \"seismic sea wave\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tsunami warning\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh báo sóng thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tsunami disaster\", \"meaning\": \"thảm họa sóng thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tsunami wave\", \"meaning\": \"sóng thần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tornado\", \"note_vi\": \"tornado là lốc xoáy trên đất liền, không phải sóng biển\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-cori-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru0-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru5-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru6-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru10-8ffd9b35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru9-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru3-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru7-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru8-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-aru2-8ffd9b35.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-ljspeech-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt408-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt138-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt624-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt396-8ffd9b35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt498-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt132-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt288-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt42-8ffd9b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tsunami-lt90-8ffd9b35.mp3\"]}}', 'Tsunami phát âm là /tsuːˈnɑːmi/, không đọc là \'ti-sunami\'.', 'nature', 1, 8),
('d827b888-26c9-5e59-a86a-17a54a662de0', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'consideration', 'UK: /kənˌsɪdəˈreɪʃn/ | US: /kənˌsɪdəˈreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự cân nhắc, sự xem xét', 'Careful thought about something, especially before making a choice or deciding what to do.', 'Please give careful consideration to my proposal.', 'Xin hãy xem xét kỹ lưỡng đề xuất của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will take all job applicants\' qualifications into careful consideration.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng tất cả bằng cấp của các ứng viên xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-ljspeech-5e05bd28.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-cori-5e05bd28.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consideration-fa4d791a.webp', '[\"deliberation\", \"scrutiny\", \"thought\", \"attention\"]', '[\"disregard\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take into consideration\", \"meaning\": \"tính đến, cân nhắc đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under consideration\", \"meaning\": \"đang được xem xét\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consider\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"considerable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"considerate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-cori-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru0-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru5-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru6-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru10-5e05bd28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru9-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru3-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru7-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru8-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru2-5e05bd28.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-ljspeech-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt408-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt138-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt624-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt396-5e05bd28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt498-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt132-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt288-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt42-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt90-5e05bd28.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong các cấu trúc: \'take something into consideration\' (cân nhắc) hoặc \'under consideration\' (đang được xem xét).', 'human resources', 1, 9),
('a0016a49-7bae-57e0-aad0-0c8071828611', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'certificate', '/səˈtɪfɪkət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'văn bản xác nhận một sự thật hoặc trình độ', 'an official document that proves you have finished a course or achieved a specific skill.', 'After completing the course, students receive a certificate of achievement.', 'Sau khi hoàn thành khóa học, học viên nhận được chứng chỉ thành tích.', '{\"en\": \"Please attach a copy of your professional training certificate to your job application form.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đính kèm một bản sao chứng chỉ đào tạo chuyên môn của bạn vào đơn xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-ljspeech-735ad571.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-cori-735ad571.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/certificate-2baf57f0.webp', '[\"diploma\", \"credential\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"training certificate\", \"meaning\": \"chứng chỉ đào tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"issue a certificate\", \"meaning\": \"cấp chứng chỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"certification\", \"note_vi\": \"Certificate là văn bản, certification là quá trình cấp chứng chỉ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"certify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"certification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-cori-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru0-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru5-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru6-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru10-735ad571.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru9-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru3-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru7-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru8-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-aru2-735ad571.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-ljspeech-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt408-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt138-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt624-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt396-735ad571.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt498-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt132-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt288-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt42-735ad571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certificate-lt90-735ad571.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn âm tiết thứ hai: cer-TI-fi-cate.', 'hr', 1, 10),
('b4be53af-540e-5eab-8849-36a9ce0b6536', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'shore', '/ʃɔː(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Dải đất dọc theo mép biển, hồ lớn hoặc sông lớn.', 'The coastal area or ground immediately bordering a large body of water such as an ocean.', 'Several fishing boats anchored near the rocky shore as sunset approached.', 'Một số thuyền đánh cá đã thả neo gần bờ đá khi hoàng hôn buông xuống.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offers guests a relaxing walk on the private shore.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng mang lại cho khách chuyến đi dạo thư giãn trên bờ biển riêng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-ljspeech-24dc6316.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-cori-24dc6316.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shore-4a5f6abb.webp', '[\"coast\", \"beach\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sea shore\", \"meaning\": \"bờ biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shore line\", \"meaning\": \"đường bờ biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"off shore\", \"meaning\": \"xa bờ, ngoài khơi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sheer\", \"note_vi\": \"shore là bờ, sheer là hoàn toàn hoặc dốc đứng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shoreline\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shore\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-cori-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru0-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru5-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru6-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru10-24dc6316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru9-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru3-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru7-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru8-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-aru2-24dc6316.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-ljspeech-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt408-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt138-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt624-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt396-24dc6316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt498-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt132-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt288-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt42-24dc6316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shore-lt90-24dc6316.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt shore (bờ) với sheer (hoàn toàn) và sure (chắc chắn).', 'travel', 1, 11)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('78e0c349-726d-59a3-a368-5f188beef44f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'arise', 'UK: /əˈraɪz/ | US: /əˈraɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'phát sinh, nảy sinh', 'to begin to occur, exist, or become noticeable as a result of a particular situation', 'Unexpected problems can arise from poor planning.', 'Những vấn đề bất ngờ có thể phát sinh từ việc lập kế hoạch kém.', '{\"en\": \"Should any technical issues arise, please contact the IT helpdesk immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu có bất kỳ sự cố kỹ thuật nào phát sinh, vui lòng liên hệ bộ phận hỗ trợ IT ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-ljspeech-8b77d8a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-cori-8b77d8a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arise-3c9682db.webp', '[\"occur\", \"emerge\", \"stem\", \"originate\"]', '[\"disappear\", \"cease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"if problems arise\", \"meaning\": \"nếu nảy sinh vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arise from\", \"meaning\": \"phát sinh từ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"arouse\", \"note_vi\": \"arouse là ngoại động từ (khơi gợi, kích thích cảm xúc), còn arise là nội động từ (phát sinh).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-cori-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru0-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru5-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru6-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru10-8b77d8a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru9-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru3-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru7-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru8-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-aru2-8b77d8a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-ljspeech-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt408-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt138-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt624-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt396-8b77d8a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt498-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt132-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt288-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt42-8b77d8a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arise-lt90-8b77d8a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Arise là động từ bất quy tắc (arise - arose - arisen), hay dùng trong ngữ cảnh sự cố/vấn đề nảy sinh (issues/problems arise).', 'office', 1, 12),
('c4f223b7-9614-5c1a-8b8f-4c142fcfd560', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'assign', '/əˈsaɪn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giao một nhiệm vụ, công việc hoặc vai trò cho ai đó.', 'to give someone a particular job or duty to do as part of their work.', 'The project manager will assign specific tasks to each team member tomorrow morning.', 'Quản lý dự án sẽ giao các nhiệm vụ cụ thể cho từng thành viên trong nhóm vào sáng mai.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor will assign specific tasks to each team member before the project starts.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát sẽ giao các nhiệm vụ cụ thể cho từng thành viên trong nhóm trước khi dự án bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-ljspeech-9009b730.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-cori-9009b730.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assign-80b45e6d.webp', '[\"allocate\", \"delegate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"assign a task\", \"meaning\": \"giao nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assign responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"giao trách nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"design\", \"note_vi\": \"thiết kế, phát âm gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác hẳn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assignment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-cori-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru0-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru5-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru6-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru10-9009b730.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru9-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru3-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru7-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru8-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru2-9009b730.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-ljspeech-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt408-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt138-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt624-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt396-9009b730.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt498-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt132-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt288-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt42-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt90-9009b730.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh phân công công việc.', 'hr', 1, 13),
('e048cdb3-0ce4-58de-9a9e-480ae52fcccf', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e53d2cf7-3203-5f81-b991-74dea325fcfd', '299745d8-17d3-5380-a9a8-d125c1c7c378', 'exceptionally', 'UK: /ɪkˈsɛpʃənəli/ | US: /ɪkˈsɛpʃənəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'đặc biệt, phi thường', 'To a degree that is far beyond what is usual, standard, or normally expected.', 'The team performed exceptionally well in the last quarter.', 'Đội đã có màn trình diễn đặc biệt tốt trong quý vừa qua.', '{\"en\": \"Third-quarter profits were exceptionally high thanks to the successful product release.\", \"vi\": \"Lợi nhuận quý ba cao một cách đặc biệt nhờ việc ra mắt sản phẩm thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-ljspeech-fc429644.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-cori-fc429644.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exceptionally-4671986c.webp', '[\"extraordinarily\", \"remarkably\", \"exceedingly\"]', '[\"ordinarily\", \"typically\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exceptionally high\", \"meaning\": \"cao một cách đặc biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exceptionally well\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ tốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"occasionally\", \"note_vi\": \"exceptionally mang nghĩa \'đặc biệt/phi thường\', còn occasionally nghĩa là \'thỉnh thoảng/đôi khi\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"except\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exception\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"exceptional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-cori-fc429644.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-aru0-fc429644.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-aru5-fc429644.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-aru6-fc429644.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-aru10-fc429644.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptionally-aru9-fc429644.mp3\", \"/stora