('de439ab4-4d08-50c6-9e8c-229a0129aa3a', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e96df1cc-d034-5003-9fd4-4d4907494535', '8c0d15cf-4e34-5cdc-af2b-f62f496762d3', 'efficiency', 'UK: /ɪˈfɪʃ.ən.si/ | US: /ɪˈfɪʃ.ən.si/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hiệu quả', 'The state or quality of performing tasks productively without wasting time, energy, or resources.', 'The company improved its efficiency by streamlining processes.', 'Công ty đã cải thiện hiệu quả của mình bằng cách hợp lý hóa các quy trình.', '{\"en\": \"The company upgraded its software system to improve operational efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã nâng cấp hệ thống phần mềm để cải thiện hiệu suất vận hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-ljspeech-fff33dfb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-cori-fff33dfb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/efficiency-315843be.webp', '[\"productivity\", \"competence\", \"streamlining\"]', '[\"inefficiency\", \"wastefulness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"energy efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu quả sử dụng năng lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"operational efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu quả vận hành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"improve efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao hiệu suất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficacy\", \"note_vi\": \"Efficacy là tính hiệu lực/tác dụng (thường dùng trong y tế hoặc thử nghiệm kỹ thuật).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"efficient\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"efficiently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-cori-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru0-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru5-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru6-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru10-fff33dfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru9-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru3-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru7-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru8-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru2-fff33dfb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-ljspeech-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt408-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt138-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt624-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt396-fff33dfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt498-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt132-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt288-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt42-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-lt90-fff33dfb.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ năng suất công việc hoặc khả năng tối ưu hóa tài nguyên. Thường đi cùng động từ \'improve\' hoặc \'increase\'.', 'business operations', 1, 6),
('8166346c-5e1a-5115-a4a5-56587a1f2196', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e96df1cc-d034-5003-9fd4-4d4907494535', '8c0d15cf-4e34-5cdc-af2b-f62f496762d3', 'miserable', '/ˈmɪzrəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất bất hạnh, đau khổ hoặc khó chịu.', 'very unhappy, uncomfortable, or showing great sadness and lack of hope.', 'After losing his job, he felt utterly miserable for several weeks.', 'Sau khi mất việc, anh ấy cảm thấy hoàn toàn khốn khổ trong vài tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The staff felt miserable due to the poor working conditions and low salaries.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cảm thấy rất khổ sở do điều kiện làm việc tồi tệ và lương thấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-ljspeech-d4cad4e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-cori-d4cad4e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/miserable-b0397f00.webp', '[\"unhappy\", \"depressed\", \"gloomy\"]', '[\"happy\", \"cheerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"miserable weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết tồi tệ, khó chịu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel miserable\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy khổ sở, tuyệt vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stingy\", \"note_vi\": \"miserable đôi khi nghĩa là bủn xỉn, nhưng stingy phổ biến hơn với nghĩa này.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"misery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"miserably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-cori-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru0-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru5-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru6-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru10-d4cad4e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru9-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru3-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru7-d4cad