('68703212-fed6-53fc-bd88-6848af617d85', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e96df1cc-d034-5003-9fd4-4d4907494535', '8c0d15cf-4e34-5cdc-af2b-f62f496762d3', 'relieved', '/rɪˈliːvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm, bớt lo lắng.', 'feeling happy because something unpleasant has stopped or did not happen.', 'The manager was relieved to hear that the delayed shipment finally arrived.', 'Người quản lý cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm khi nghe tin chuyến hàng bị chậm trễ cuối cùng đã đến.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was relieved to hear that the missing contract had finally been located.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm khi biết rằng hợp đồng bị thất lạc cuối cùng đã được tìm thấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-ljspeech-34c5beaa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-cori-34c5beaa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relieved-56f14390.webp', '[\"reassured\", \"comforted\"]', '[\"anxious\", \"worried\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"greatly relieved\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhẹ nhõm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel relieved\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relevant\", \"note_vi\": \"có nghĩa là liên quan, không phải nhẹ nhõm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"relieve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"relief\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-cori-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru0-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru5-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru6-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru10-34c5beaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru9-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru3-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru7-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ