('ff32d065-19cc-5ca8-ae62-edf229dc01df', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e96df1cc-d034-5003-9fd4-4d4907494535', '8c0d15cf-4e34-5cdc-af2b-f62f496762d3', 'bat', '/bæt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có vú biết bay, thường hoạt động về đêm.', 'a small animal that flies at night and sleeps in dark places during the day.', 'A bat flew out of the cave just as the sun was setting.', 'Một con dơi bay ra khỏi hang ngay khi mặt trời lặn.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse inspection was delayed because a bat was found nesting in the ceiling rafters.\", \"vi\": \"Việc kiểm tra nhà kho bị trì hoãn vì một con dơi được tìm thấy đang làm tổ trên các thanh xà trần nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-ljspeech-9b64d4ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-cori-9b64d4ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bat-2ae62950.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fruit bat\", \"meaning\": \"dơi ăn quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vampire bat\", \"meaning\": \"dơi ma cà rồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bat\", \"note_vi\": \"Còn có nghĩa là đánh bóng trong thể thao. (verb)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-cori-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru0-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru5-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru6-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru10-9b64d4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru9-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru3-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru7-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru8-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru2-9b64d4ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-ljspeech-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec