('7d01ff13-f17b-5671-9a2f-9d9e59ddf08f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'e96df1cc-d034-5003-9fd4-4d4907494535', '8c0d15cf-4e34-5cdc-af2b-f62f496762d3', 'durable', 'UK: /ˈdjʊərəbəl/ | US: /ˈdʊrəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'bền', 'capable of withstanding wear, pressure, or damage over a long period.', 'These office chairs are very durable and suitable for daily use.', 'Những chiếc ghế văn phòng này rất bền và phù hợp để sử dụng hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"These work boots are made of durable leather designed for construction sites.\", \"vi\": \"Những đôi ủng bảo hộ này được làm bằng da bền bỉ được thiết kế cho các công trường xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-ljspeech-6802cb5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-cori-6802cb5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/durable-1f94af50.webp', '[\"sturdy\", \"long-lasting\", \"robust\"]', '[\"fragile\", \"delicate\", \"flimsy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"durable goods\", \"meaning\": \"hàng hóa lâu bền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"durable material\", \"meaning\": \"chất liệu bền bỉ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"durability\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"durably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-cori-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru0-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru5-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru6-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru10-6802cb5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru9-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru3-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru7-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-aru8-6802cb5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/durable-a