('9e0b15b2-77e6-5138-a016-9abf75d2371f', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'screening', '/ˈskriːnɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quá trình kiểm tra, sàng lọc để phát hiện hoặc lựa chọn.', 'the process of checking or filtering to find something.', 'The medical screening helped detect the disease early.', 'Việc sàng lọc y tế đã giúp phát hiện bệnh sớm.', '{\"en\": \"The company conducted a security screening for all new employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tiến hành sàng lọc an ninh cho tất cả nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-ljspeech-8246bb32.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-cori-8246bb32.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/screening-a0f15cec.webp', '[\"check\", \"examination\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"security screening\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra an ninh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"medical screening\", \"meaning\": \"sàng lọc y tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"screening test\", \"meaning\": \"bài kiểm tra sàng lọc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"screaming\", \"note_vi\": \"screaming là la hét, phát âm gần screening\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"screen\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"screened\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-cori-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru0-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru5-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru6-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru10-8246bb32.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru9-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru3-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru7-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru8-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-aru2-8246bb32.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-ljspeech-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt408-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt138-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt624-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt396-8246bb32.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt498-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt132-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt288-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt42-8246bb32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screening-lt90-8246bb32.mp3\"]}}', 'Screening là sự sàng lọc, không nhầm với scream (la hét).', 'hr', 1, 12),
('38b1808d-8262-5b11-84f8-effea18fa83b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'fortunate', '/ˈfɔːtʃənət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'may mắn', 'having good luck or experiencing good things by chance.', 'We were fortunate that the storm changed direction right before reaching the coastline.', 'Chúng tôi đã may mắn khi cơn bão đổi hướng ngay trước khi đến đường bờ biển.', '{\"en\": \"We are fortunate to secure the exclusive distribution rights for this popular electronic brand.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi rất May mắn khi có được quyền phân phối độc quyền cho thương hiệu điện tử nổi tiếng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-ljspeech-552b515b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-cori-552b515b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fortunate-e218ca58.webp', '[\"lucky\", \"favorable\", \"blessed\"]', '[\"unfortunate\", \"unlucky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fortunate enough to\", \"meaning\": \"đủ may mắn để làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consider yourself fortunate\", \"meaning\": \"tự cho là mình may mắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fortuitous\", \"note_vi\": \"fortuitous nghĩa là tình cờ xảy ra, không hẳn là may mắn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fortune\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fortunately\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unfortunate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-cori-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru0-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru5-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru6-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru10-552b515b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru9-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru3-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru7-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru8-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru2-552b515b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-ljspeech-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt408-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt138-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt624-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt396-552b515b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt498-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt132-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt288-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt42-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt90-552b515b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm cấu trúc: be fortunate to do something hoặc be fortunate in doing something.', 'business', 1, 13),
('ae85718a-95ec-5cf4-9794-9bc0e927db96', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'territory', '/ˈterətri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một khu vực đất đai thuộc quyền kiểm soát của một quốc gia hoặc tổ chức.', 'an area of land that is controlled by a specific government, country, or a certain group.', 'The explorers ventured into uncharted territory, discovering new species of plants and animals.', 'Các nhà thám hiểm đã mạo hiểm vào lãnh thổ chưa được khám phá, tìm thấy các loài thực vật và động vật mới.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales team is expanding into a new territory to increase our market share abroad.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm bán hàng của chúng tôi đang mở rộng sang một khu vực mới để tăng thị phần ở nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-ljspeech-4a2f290c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-cori-4a2f290c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/territory-15b727f4.webp', '[\"region\", \"area\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"new territory\", \"meaning\": \"lãnh thổ mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sales territory\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực kinh doanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"territorial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-cori-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru0-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru5-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru6-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru10-4a2f290c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru9-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru3-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru7-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru8-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-aru2-4a2f290c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-ljspeech-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt408-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt138-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt624-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt396-4a2f290c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt498-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt132-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt288-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt42-4a2f290c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/territory-lt90-4a2f290c.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, \'territory\' thường chỉ khu vực phụ trách của nhân viên bán hàng.', 'business', 1, 14),
('4376beb7-98d3-548c-a7a0-b57388f703e5', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'casual', '/ˈkæʒuəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thường ngày, không trang trọng, hoặc không quá nghiêm túc.', 'relaxed and informal in style, manner, or attitude, not serious or formal.', 'She prefers to wear casual clothes like jeans and a T-shirt on weekends.', 'Cô ấy thích mặc quần áo bình thường như quần jean và áo phông vào cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are allowed to wear casual attire every Friday at the head office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được phép mặc trang phục thường ngày vào mỗi thứ Sáu tại trụ sở chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-ljspeech-7b664f70.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-cori-7b664f70.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/casual-b3ea0506.webp', '[\"informal\", \"relaxed\", \"laid-back\"]', '[\"formal\", \"professional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"casual attire\", \"meaning\": \"trang phục thường ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"casual conversation\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc trò chuyện thân mật, không trang trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"casual worker\", \"meaning\": \"lao động thời vụ, không chính thức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"casualty\", \"note_vi\": \"casualty là nạn nhân hoặc thương vong, hoàn toàn khác nghĩa với casual\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"casually\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"casualness\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"casualty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-cori-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru0-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru5-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru6-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru10-7b664f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru9-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru3-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru7-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru8-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru2-7b664f70.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-ljspeech-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt408-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt138-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt624-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt396-7b664f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt498-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt132-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt288-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt42-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt90-7b664f70.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'casual\' (thường ngày) với \'casualty\' (nạn nhân); hai từ rất khác nghĩa dù gần mặt chữ.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('23653b97-9b27-5afe-b10a-ac95eb3b3755', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'notebook', '/ˈnəʊtbʊk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sổ tay để ghi chép hoặc máy tính xách tay.', 'a portable computer or a small pad for writing.', 'I always carry a small notebook to jot down ideas when they come to me.', 'Tôi luôn mang theo một cuốn sổ tay nhỏ để ghi lại các ý tưởng khi chúng xuất hiện.', '{\"en\": \"The manager used a notebook to record minutes during the quarterly meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã dùng một cuốn sổ tay để ghi biên bản trong cuộc họp quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-ljspeech-5280933c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-cori-5280933c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/notebook-d4171a83.webp', '[\"laptop\", \"notepad\", \"writing pad\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"notebook computer\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính xách tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spiral notebook\", \"meaning\": \"sổ tay có lò xo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carry a notebook\", \"meaning\": \"mang theo sổ tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"note\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ nghĩa ghi chú, không phải vật phẩm\"}, {\"word\": \"book\", \"note_vi\": \"sách, dày hơn sổ tay\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-cori-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru0-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru5-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru6-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru10-5280933c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru9-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru3-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru7-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru8-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-aru2-5280933c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-ljspeech-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt408-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt138-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt624-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt396-5280933c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt498-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt132-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt288-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt42-5280933c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notebook-lt90-5280933c.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có 2 nghĩa: sổ giấy hoặc laptop; chú ý ngữ cảnh.', 'office', 1, 16),
('544b6b63-07c6-5515-b3ad-210644a831c0', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'variation', '/ˌveəriˈeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự khác biệt nhỏ hoặc một dạng khác của một cái gì đó.', 'a change in amount, level, or form, or a slightly different version of something.', 'There are many variations of this traditional dish across different regions.', 'Có nhiều biến thể của món ăn truyền thống này ở các vùng khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"We noticed a slight variation in the product quality between the two manufacturing batches.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi nhận thấy một sự khác biệt nhỏ về chất lượng sản phẩm giữa hai lô sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-ljspeech-1ca7c5fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-cori-1ca7c5fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/variation-6486091a.webp', '[\"difference\", \"variety\", \"modification\"]', '[\"similarity\", \"uniformity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wide variation\", \"meaning\": \"sự biến động rộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"price variation\", \"meaning\": \"sự thay đổi giá cả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"variety\", \"note_vi\": \"variety là sự đa dạng, variation là sự biến đổi/khác biệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vary\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"variable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"various\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-cori-1ca7c5fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-aru0-1ca7c5fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-aru5-1ca7c5fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-aru6-1ca7c5fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-aru10-1ca7c5fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-aru9-1ca7c5fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/variation-