('11ba38c7-a705-58b7-9aeb-cbaadba4aaa6', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'portion', '/ˈpɔːʃn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Chia một thứ gì đó thành các phần.', 'to divide something into smaller amounts to be given or served to different people.', 'The chef carefully portioned out the dessert for each guest.', 'Đầu bếp cẩn thận chia phần món tráng miệng cho từng thực khách.', '{\"en\": \"The catering staff will portion the meals equally for the conference attendees at noon.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phục vụ sẽ chia khẩu phần ăn đều nhau cho những người tham dự hội nghị vào buổi trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-ljspeech-7b813d63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-cori-7b813d63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/portion-680cf0a7.webp', '[\"divide\", \"allocate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"portion out\", \"meaning\": \"chia nhỏ ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"portion size\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước khẩu phần\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"portion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-cori-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru0-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru5-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru6-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru10-7b813d63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru9-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru3-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru7-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru8-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru2-7b813d63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-ljspeech-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt408-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt138-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt624-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt396-7b813d63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt498-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt132-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt288-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt42-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-lt90-7b813d63.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh chia thức ăn hoặc phân bổ nguồn lực.', 'dining', 1, 26),
('deeeb08a-0ac7-5c60-a7ad-51f25f39fc79', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'f652b720-7da1-55ae-86e2-ac0fae411396', 'fd3c425d-45ee-5d08-9db8-fff313638e44', 'diversity', '/daɪˈvɜːsəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự khác biệt, phong phú về chủng loại hoặc đặc điểm.', 'the state of having many different types of people or things within a group.', 'The company values diversity in its workforce, believing it leads to better innovation.', 'Công ty coi trọng sự đa dạng trong lực lượng lao động, tin rằng điều đó dẫn đến sự đổi mới tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department promotes diversity to build a more creative and inclusive workplace.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự thúc đẩy sự đa dạng để xây dựng một nơi làm việc sáng tạo và hòa nhập hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-ljspeech-a63b60ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-cori-a63b60ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diversity-6fad5dfc.webp', '[\"variety\", \"range\"]', '[\"uniformity\", \"sameness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cultural diversity\", \"meaning\": \"đa dạng văn hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"workplace diversity\", \"meaning\": \"sự đa dạng tại nơi làm việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diverse\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"diversify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-cori-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru0-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru5-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru6-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru10-a63b60ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru9-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru3-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru7-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage