('f644f7f9-a00c-5683-aa0a-709e1de970c9', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'fed9f349-d46c-50c5-bfe9-0e0da1f45461', '56168317-3c93-5ec3-bd0b-eec60cb311a7', 'parallel', '/ˈpærəlel/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hai hoặc nhiều đường, mặt phẳng hoặc vật thể không bao giờ cắt nhau.', 'a situation or event that is similar to another one happening at the same time.', 'In geometry, parallel lines never intersect.', 'Trong hình học, các đường song song không bao giờ cắt nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The current economic situation has a direct parallel to the market crash ten years ago.\", \"vi\": \"Tình hình kinh tế hiện tại có sự tương đồng trực tiếp với cuộc khủng hoảng thị trường mười năm trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-ljspeech-1a925201.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-cori-1a925201.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/parallel-fce2e8bf.webp', '[\"similarity\", \"correspondence\"]', '[\"difference\", \"contrast\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"draw a parallel\", \"meaning\": \"so sánh tương đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"run parallel\", \"meaning\": \"chạy song song\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"parallel\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-cori-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru0-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru5-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru6-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru10-1a925201.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru9-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru3-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru7-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru8-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru2-1a925201.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-ljspeech-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt408-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt138-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt624-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt396-1a925201.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt498-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt132-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt288-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt42-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt90-1a925201.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'draw a parallel\' rất hay dùng trong các bài phân tích kinh tế.', 'business', 1, 0),
('ddc23bc8-4208-5045-b9cb-0cff985a699b', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'fed9f349-d46c-50c5-bfe9-0e0da1f45461', '56168317-3c93-5ec3-bd0b-eec60cb311a7', 'clerk', '/klɑːk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người làm việc văn phòng, bán hàng, hoặc ghi chép sổ sách.', 'a person who works in an office, bank, or store, keeping records or serving customers.', 'The bank clerk helped me open a new savings account.', 'Nhân viên ngân hàng đã giúp tôi mở một tài khoản tiết kiệm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The payroll clerk will process your salary and send the pay stub by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên tính lương sẽ xử lý lương của bạn và gửi phiếu lương trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-ljspeech-f38de235.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-cori-f38de235.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clerk-3a7c7ad4.webp', '[\"assistant\", \"receptionist\", \"worker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bank clerk\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên ngân hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sales clerk\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên bán hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cleric\", \"note_vi\": \"cleric là giáo sĩ, clerk là nhân viên văn phòng hoặc bán hàng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clerical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-cori-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru0-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru5-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru6-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru10-f38de235.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru9-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru3-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru7-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru8-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-aru2-f38de235.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-ljspeech-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt408-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt138-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt624-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt396-f38de235.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt498-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt132-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt288-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt42-f38de235.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clerk-lt90-f38de235.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các chức danh văn phòng như \'payroll clerk\' hay \'accounting clerk\'.', 'office', 1, 1),
('4cd42848-e0fe-5f7a-99c1-fc27e468abf8', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'fed9f349-d46c-50c5-bfe9-0e0da1f45461', '56168317-3c93-5ec3-bd0b-eec60cb311a7', 'forum', '/ˈfɔːrəm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nơi công cộng hoặc trực tuyến để thảo luận các vấn đề.', 'a public meeting place or online space used for open discussion of particular topics.', 'The international conference provided a great forum for experts to exchange innovative ideas.', 'Hội nghị quốc tế đã tạo ra một diễn đàn tuyệt vời để các chuyên gia trao đổi những ý tưởng sáng tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The company established an online forum for employees to share feedback on working conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thành lập một diễn đàn trực tuyến để nhân viên chia sẻ ý kiến phản hồi về điều kiện làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-ljspeech-732d18e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-cori-732d18e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forum-7edb778a.webp', '[\"board\", \"platform\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"online forum\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đàn trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"open forum\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đàn mở\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"form\", \"note_vi\": \"form là mẫu đơn, forum là diễn đàn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-cori-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru0-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru5-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru6-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru10-732d18e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru9-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru3-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru7-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru8-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun