('95b0a183-da09-5493-b093-af1659952858', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'fed9f349-d46c-50c5-bfe9-0e0da1f45461', '56168317-3c93-5ec3-bd0b-eec60cb311a7', 'empower', 'UK: /ɪmˈpaʊə/ | US: /ɪmˈpaʊər/', 'B2', 'verb', 'trao quyền, ủy quyền', 'To give someone the authority, confidence, or freedom to take control of their own actions.', 'We empower employees to make decisions for their teams.', 'Chúng tôi trao quyền cho nhân viên đưa ra quyết định cho nhóm của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to empower team leaders to make final decisions on project budgets.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã quyết định trao quyền cho các trưởng nhóm đưa ra quyết định cuối cùng về ngân sách dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-ljspeech-f0529720.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-cori-f0529720.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/empower-b6a4b640.webp', '[\"authorize\", \"enable\", \"delegate\"]', '[\"restrict\", \"disempower\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"empower employees\", \"meaning\": \"trao quyền cho nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"empower someone to make decisions\", \"meaning\": \"trao quyền cho ai đưa ra quyết định\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"empowerment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-cori-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru0-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru5-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru6-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru10-f0529720.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru9-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru3-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru7-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru8-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru2-f0529720.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-ljspeech-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt408-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt138-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt624-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt396-f0529720.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt498-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt132-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt288-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt42-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt90-f0529720.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'empower somebody to do something\' (trao quyền cho ai làm gì).', 'management', 1, 10),
('101b8b33-ff54-54da-9649-119c363e0777', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'fed9f349-d46c-50c5-bfe9-0e0da1f45461', '56168317-3c93-5ec3-bd0b-eec60cb311a7', 'ridiculous', '/rɪˈdɪkjələs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Buồn cười hoặc phi lý đến mức không thể tin được.', 'very silly or unreasonable in a way that makes people want to laugh at it.', 'That hat looks absolutely ridiculous on him.', 'Chiếc mũ đó trông thật nực cười khi anh ấy đội.', '{\"en\": \"It is ridiculous to expect the staff to finish this massive project in just two days.\", \"vi\": \"Thật phi lý khi mong đợi nhân viên hoàn thành dự án khổng lồ này chỉ trong hai ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-ljspeech-7da7b5f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-cori-7da7b5f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ridiculous-3af9815a.webp', '[\"absurd\", \"ludicrous\"]', '[\"reasonable\", \"sensible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ridiculous idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng nực cười\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ridiculous price\", \"meaning\": \"giá cả vô lý\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ridicule\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-cori-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru0-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru5-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru6-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru10-7da7b5f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru9-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru3-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru7-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru8-7da7b5f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridiculous-aru2-7da7b5f7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/s