('5203493a-cfae-5159-9310-26ae20e12526', '2a37052e-e854-5df4-aebd-58ca22610d12', 'fed9f349-d46c-50c5-bfe9-0e0da1f45461', '56168317-3c93-5ec3-bd0b-eec60cb311a7', 'voluntary', '/ˈvɒləntri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Được thực hiện một cách tự ý, không bị ép buộc.', 'done, made, or given willingly, without being forced or paid.', 'Many students participate in voluntary work to help the community.', 'Nhiều sinh viên tham gia công việc tự nguyện để giúp đỡ cộng đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The company offered a voluntary retirement program for employees who wished to leave early.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đưa ra chương trình nghỉ hưu tự nguyện cho những nhân viên muốn nghỉ sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-ljspeech-78f6b9c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-cori-78f6b9c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/voluntary-2fe1ed14.webp', '[\"optional\", \"willing\", \"discretionary\"]', '[\"compulsory\", \"mandatory\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"voluntary work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc tình nguyện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"voluntary contribution\", \"meaning\": \"sự đóng góp tự nguyện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compulsory\", \"note_vi\": \"voluntary là tự nguyện, compulsory là bắt buộc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"volunteer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"voluntarily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-cori-78f6b9c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-aru0-78f6b9c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-aru5-78f6b9c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-aru6-78f6b9c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-aru10-78f6b9c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-aru9-78f6b9c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-aru3-78f6b9c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluntary-