('a7f61ac7-65e4-53a4-b38e-f59aaccfd079', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '087386e9-0595-5073-98a8-40c5c30cea13', 'ebca9358-f7e1-52b0-9853-2128dd00dc76', 'bat', '/bæt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Con dơi (động vật có vú biết bay); gậy đánh bóng.', 'a piece of wood used for hitting the ball in games like baseball or cricket.', 'A bat flew out of the cave just as the sun was setting.', 'Một con dơi bay ra khỏi hang ngay khi mặt trời lặn.', '{\"en\": \"The sports equipment store is selling a professional wooden bat for the upcoming baseball tournament.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng thiết bị thể thao đang bán một chiếc gậy gỗ chuyên nghiệp cho giải đấu bóng chày sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-ljspeech-9b64d4ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-cori-9b64d4ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bat-2ae62950.webp', '[\"club\", \"stick\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"baseball bat\", \"meaning\": \"gậy bóng chày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wooden bat\", \"meaning\": \"gậy gỗ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bad\", \"note_vi\": \"\'bad\' là tính từ (tệ), \'bat\' là danh từ (cây gậy).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"batter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-cori-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru0-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru5-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru6-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru10-9b64d4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru9-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru3-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru7-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru8-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru2-9b64d4ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pr