('c3e82746-107e-5762-ad42-d987dff7bf83', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '087386e9-0595-5073-98a8-40c5c30cea13', 'ebca9358-f7e1-52b0-9853-2128dd00dc76', 'density', '/ˈdensəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mật độ, sự dày đặc.', 'the amount of space that something contains compared with its total volume.', 'Wood with high density is often preferred for building durable furniture.', 'Gỗ có mật độ cao thường được ưa chuộng để làm nội thất bền bỉ.', '{\"en\": \"High traffic density during peak hours often delays delivery trucks across the city.\", \"vi\": \"Mật độ giao thông cao trong giờ cao điểm thường làm chậm các xe giao hàng khắp thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-ljspeech-bbbf26a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-cori-bbbf26a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/density-31aed040.webp', '[\"thickness\", \"solidity\", \"concentration\"]', '[\"sparsity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high density\", \"meaning\": \"mật độ cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"population density\", \"meaning\": \"mật độ dân số\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dense\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"densely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-cori-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru0-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru5-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru6-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru10-bbbf26a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru9-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru3-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru7-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru8-bbbf26a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/density-aru2-bbbf26a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\"