('929f9720-8caf-5e37-a8b8-5f25ec7b64ed', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0b26ef8c-3640-59e9-81d8-0cd7cf00dc04', 'a78519cd-b1c4-5607-a92d-4cb761975521', 'arguably', '/ˈɑːɡjuəbli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Có thể lập luận rằng, có lẽ là.', 'used to state an opinion that is supported by facts or strong evidence.', 'She is arguably the most talented artist of her generation.', 'Cô ấy được cho là nghệ sĩ tài năng nhất trong thế hệ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"This new software is arguably the most efficient tool for managing our client database.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới này có thể được coi là công cụ hiệu quả nhất để quản lý cơ sở dữ liệu khách hàng của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-ljspeech-ca6cfbeb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-cori-ca6cfbeb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arguably-1dbb9acf.webp', '[\"possibly\", \"probably\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"arguably the best\", \"meaning\": \"có thể coi là tốt nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arguably the most\", \"meaning\": \"có thể coi là nhất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"argue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-cori-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru0-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru5-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru6-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru10-ca6cfbeb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru9-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru3-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru7-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru8-ca6cfbeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arguably-aru2-ca6cfbeb.mp3\"]}, \"us\"