('eab02b6b-3464-51af-9b19-850d101c5271', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0b26ef8c-3640-59e9-81d8-0cd7cf00dc04', 'a78519cd-b1c4-5607-a92d-4cb761975521', 'demon', '/ˈdiːmən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một linh hồn xấu xa, quỷ dữ.', 'a cruel and powerful spirit that is believed to cause harm to people.', 'In many ancient stories, heroes must battle powerful demons.', 'Trong nhiều câu chuyện cổ, các anh hùng phải chiến đấu với những con quỷ mạnh mẽ.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager faced a demon of a task when the entire server crashed unexpectedly.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dự án đã đối mặt với một nhiệm vụ cực kỳ khó khăn khi toàn bộ máy chủ bị sập bất ngờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-ljspeech-79637a0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-cori-79637a0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demon-44bf6446.webp', '[\"fiend\", \"monster\"]', '[\"angel\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"demon of a task\", \"meaning\": \"một nhiệm vụ cực kỳ khó khăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"demonic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-cori-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru0-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru5-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru6-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru10-79637a0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru9-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru3-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru7-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru8-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-aru2-79637a0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demon-ljspeech-79637a0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat