('de39be32-3497-5073-b656-c43e5b83934b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0d53d776-2781-5b64-a243-ea56a1ea9f96', '529d11c7-7f2a-5f7e-a1ec-3117a4c2668b', 'ironically', '/aɪˈrɒnɪkli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách trớ trêu, ngược đời hoặc mỉa mai.', 'in a way that is interesting or strange because the result is unexpected.', 'Ironically, the software developer forgot his password to access the company system.', 'Trớ trêu thay, lập trình viên phần mềm lại quên mất mật khẩu truy cập hệ thống công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Ironically, the computer repair shop had to close because their own system crashed.\", \"vi\": \"Trớ trêu thay, cửa hàng sửa chữa máy tính đã phải đóng cửa vì hệ thống của chính họ bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-ljspeech-5aee10ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-cori-5aee10ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ironically-62fee32e.webp', '[\"paradoxically\", \"unexpectedly\"]', '[\"predictably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ironically enough\", \"meaning\": \"thật trớ trêu thay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"irony\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ironic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-cori-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru0-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru5-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru6-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru10-5aee10ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru9-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru3-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru7-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru8-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/iro