('e60894c0-cffc-57d2-9994-1d21577c4d36', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0f734994-c8c4-5a28-96c2-44d59b4684dd', 'd8002f98-71ed-56f8-b91a-a12c37320945', 'hospitality', 'UK: /ˌhɒspɪˈtæləti/ | US: /ˌhɑːspɪˈtæləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lòng hiếu khách, ngành dịch vụ khách sạn', 'Friendly and generous behavior towards guests, or the business of managing hotels.', 'The hotel is known for its excellent hospitality.', 'Khách sạn này nổi tiếng nhờ lòng hiếu khách tuyệt vời.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury resort is famous throughout the region for its exceptional hospitality and service.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng này nổi tiếng khắp vùng nhờ lòng hiếu khách và dịch vụ tuyệt vời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-ljspeech-6831cb0b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-cori-6831cb0b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hospitality-40878288.webp', '[\"welcoming\", \"warmth\", \"friendliness\"]', '[\"hostility\", \"unfriendliness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hospitality industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành dịch vụ khách sạn - du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hospitality suite\", \"meaning\": \"phòng tiếp đón khách hàng/đối tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hospital\", \"note_vi\": \"bệnh viện (danh từ chỉ nơi chữa bệnh, không phải sự hiếu khách)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hospitable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-cori-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru0-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru5-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru6-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru10-6831cb0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru9-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru3-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru7-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru8-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-aru2-6831cb0b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-ljspeech-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt408-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt138-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt624-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt396-6831cb0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt498-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt132-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt288-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt42-6831cb0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hospitality-lt90-6831cb0b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Hospitality industry\' (ngành du lịch - nhà hàng - khách sạn) là một trong những chủ đề chính của bài thi TOEIC.', 'hospitality', 1, 1),
('154975a4-f30a-5140-9a9d-4abe0129fca5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0f734994-c8c4-5a28-96c2-44d59b4684dd', 'd8002f98-71ed-56f8-b91a-a12c37320945', 'creep', '/kriːp/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Di chuyển chậm rãi, lén lút hoặc rón rén.', 'to move slowly, quietly, and carefully, usually in order to avoid being noticed.', 'The children tried to creep downstairs without waking their parents.', 'Những đứa trẻ cố gắng rón rén xuống cầu thang mà không đánh thức bố mẹ.', '{\"en\": \"Production costs began to creep up slowly over the last quarter of the fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí sản xuất đã bắt đầu tăng dần lên một cách chậm rãi trong quý cuối cùng của năm tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-ljspeech-5f008f9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-cori-5f008f9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/creep-764070fa.webp', '[\"crawl\", \"tiptoe\", \"sneak\"]', '[\"rush\", \"dash\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"creep up\", \"meaning\": \"tăng dần lên (giá cả, chi phí)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"creep in\", \"meaning\": \"len lỏi vào, bắt đầu xuất hiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crawl\", \"note_vi\": \"crawl là bò bằng tay đầu gối, creep là đi rón rén sát đất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"creepy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creep\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-cori-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru0-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru5-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru6-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru10-5f008f9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru9-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru3-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru7-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru8-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru2-5f008f9f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-ljspeech-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt408-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt138-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt624-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt396-5f008f9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt498-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt132-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt288-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt42-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-lt90-5f008f9f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'creep up\' thường dùng để chỉ giá cả hoặc chi phí tăng dần một cách âm thầm.', 'finance', 1, 2),
('5a7782b0-c37a-5d25-98b9-e834e1116525', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0f734994-c8c4-5a28-96c2-44d59b4684dd', 'd8002f98-71ed-56f8-b91a-a12c37320945', 'noon', '/nuːn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thời điểm chính giữa ngày, 12 giờ trưa.', 'the middle of the day, twelve o\'clock in the daytime.', 'The scheduled seminar will adjourn at noon for a short coffee break.', 'Hội thảo theo kế hoạch sẽ tạm nghỉ vào 12 giờ trưa để giải lao uống cà phê.', '{\"en\": \"The deadline for submitting the proposal is noon on Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Hạn chót nộp đề xuất là 12 giờ trưa thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-ljspeech-c1e8ec03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-cori-c1e8ec03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/noon-d7bf629b.webp', '[\"midday\", \"twelve o\'clock\", \"noontime\"]', '[\"midnight\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at noon\", \"meaning\": \"vào lúc 12 giờ trưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"noon deadline\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chót vào buổi trưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"before noon\", \"meaning\": \"trước 12 giờ trưa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"midnight\", \"note_vi\": \"midnight là 12 giờ đêm, noon là 12 giờ trưa, dễ nhầm khi đọc lịch\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"noontime\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"noonday\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-cori-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru0-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru5-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru6-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru10-c1e8ec03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru9-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru3-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru7-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru8-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-aru2-c1e8ec03.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-ljspeech-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt408-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt138-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt624-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt396-c1e8ec03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt498-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt132-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt288-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt42-c1e8ec03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noon-lt90-c1e8ec03.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong lịch họp TOEIC, \'noon\' luôn chỉ 12:00 PM, đừng nhầm với \'midnight\' (12:00 AM).', 'office', 1, 3),
('91e743dd-b1d0-5035-a9f9-834ccb1262f2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0f734994-c8c4-5a28-96c2-44d59b4684dd', 'd8002f98-71ed-56f8-b91a-a12c37320945', 'neutral', 'UK: /ˈnjuːtrəl/ | US: /ˈnuːtrəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'trung lập', 'not supporting or favoring either side in a disagreement, competition, or war.', 'The mediator remained neutral during the negotiations.', 'Người hòa giải giữ thái độ trung lập trong suốt cuộc đàm phán.', '{\"en\": \"The mediator remained completely neutral throughout the contract negotiations.\", \"vi\": \"Người hòa giải giữ thái độ hoàn toàn trung lập trong suốt quá trình đàm phán hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-ljspeech-e7fb41a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-cori-e7fb41a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neutral-2026933f.webp', '[\"impartial\", \"unbiased\", \"objective\"]', '[\"biased\", \"partial\", \"prejudiced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"neutral ground\", \"meaning\": \"địa điểm trung lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain neutral\", \"meaning\": \"giữ thái độ trung lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"neutral stance\", \"meaning\": \"lập trường trung lập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"natural\", \"note_vi\": \"Natural nghĩa là tự nhiên, khác với neutral là trung lập.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"neutrality\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"neutrally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-cori-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru0-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru5-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru6-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru10-e7fb41a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru9-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru3-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru7-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru8-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru2-e7fb41a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-ljspeech-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt408-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt138-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt624-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt396-e7fb41a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt498-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt132-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt288-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt42-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-lt90-e7fb41a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong thương lượng kinh doanh, giữ thái độ \'neutral\' nghĩa là không nghiêng về bên nào để đảm bảo tính khách quan.', 'negotiation', 1, 4),
('8002dfee-76bd-5715-a8d3-5d7a3c609500', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0f734994-c8c4-5a28-96c2-44d59b4684dd', 'd8002f98-71ed-56f8-b91a-a12c37320945', 'integrated', '/ˈɪntɪɡreɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Kết hợp các bộ phận khác nhau thành một tổng thể thống nhất.', 'combining several different parts or systems into one single unit that works well together.', 'The new software offers an integrated solution for all our business needs.', 'Phần mềm mới cung cấp một giải pháp tích hợp cho tất cả các nhu cầu kinh doanh của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"Our company implemented an integrated system to manage all inventory and sales data efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã triển khai một hệ thống tích hợp để quản lý tất cả dữ liệu hàng tồn kho và bán hàng một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-ljspeech-22835725.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-cori-22835725.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/integrated-7d1d26d8.webp', '[\"unified\", \"combined\"]', '[\"separated\", \"divided\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"integrated system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống tích hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"integrated approach\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp tiếp cận tổng thể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"integrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"integration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-cori-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru0-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru5-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru6-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru10-22835725.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru9-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru3-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru7-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru8-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-aru2-22835725.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-ljspeech-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt408-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt138-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt624-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt396-22835725.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt498-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt132-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt288-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt42-22835725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrated-lt90-22835725.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong bối cảnh công nghệ hoặc quản lý hệ thống doanh nghiệp.', 'technology', 1, 5),
('9d66ccf5-e109-5a3c-b39c-72a4f87ae93f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '0f734994-c8c4-5a28-96c2-44d59b4684dd', 'd8002f98-71ed-56f8-b91a-a12c37320945', 'radical', '/ˈrædɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất khác biệt, mới mẻ và thường gây tranh cãi.', 'causing or being a very great, basic, and important change.', 'The company implemented a radical change to its marketing strategy.', 'Công ty đã thực hiện một thay đổi cấp tiến trong chiến lược tiếp thị của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors proposed a radical restructuring of the company to save costs.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã đề xuất một cuộc tái cơ cấu triệt để của công ty để tiết kiệm chi phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-ljspeech-5da0e27d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-cori-5da0e27d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/radical-c924487f.webp', '[\"drastic\", \"fundamental\", \"extreme\"]', '[\"conservative\", \"moderate\", \"minor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"radical change\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi triệt để\"}, {\"phrase\": \"radical reform\", \"meaning\": \"cải cách triệt để\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"radically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"radicalism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-cori-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru0-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru5-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru6-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru10-5da0e27d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru9-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru3-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru7-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru8-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub