('4345a910-77bd-562b-be56-1ace72c2f784', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'beast', '/biːst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một con vật lớn, hoang dã, đôi khi đáng sợ.', 'a large and wild animal, especially one that is dangerous.', 'The ancient legend spoke of a fearsome beast living in the deep forest.', 'Truyền thuyết cổ xưa kể về một con thú đáng sợ sống trong rừng sâu.', '{\"en\": \"The cargo ship transported a rare beast to the city zoo last week.\", \"vi\": \"Tàu chở hàng đã vận chuyển một con thú quý hiếm đến vườn thú thành phố vào tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-ljspeech-1173cbc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-cori-1173cbc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beast-91e65654.webp', '[\"animal\", \"creature\", \"monster\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wild beast\", \"meaning\": \"thú hoang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beast of burden\", \"meaning\": \"thú thồ hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"best\", \"note_vi\": \"best là tốt nhất, beast là con thú, viết gần giống nhau.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"beastly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-cori-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru0-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru5-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru6-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru10-1173cbc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru9-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru3-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru7-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru8-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru2-1173cbc9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor