('be7e228b-27ce-5b23-9f91-579226f0a535', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'long-time', '/ˌlɒŋˈtaɪm/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đã tồn tại, làm việc hoặc quen biết trong một thời gian dài.', 'having been something or known someone for a very extended period of years.', 'She is a long-time resident of this town and knows everyone.', 'Cô ấy là một cư dân lâu năm của thị trấn này và quen biết tất cả mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The company offered a special discount to honor its long-time corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đưa ra mức giảm giá đặc biệt để tri ân các khách hàng doanh nghiệp lâu năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-ljspeech-d38bcc1c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-cori-d38bcc1c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/long-time-6ce5a713.webp', '[\"long-standing\", \"long-term\"]', '[\"short-term\", \"new\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"long-time customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng lâu năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"long-time employee\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên lâu năm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"longtime\", \"note_vi\": \"longtime (viết liền) và long-time (có gạch nối) đều mang nghĩa tương tự\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-cori-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru0-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru5-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru6-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru10-d38bcc1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru9-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru3-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru7-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru8-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-aru2-d38bcc1c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-ljspeech-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt408-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt138-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt624-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt396-d38bcc1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt498-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt132-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt288-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt42-d38bcc1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/long-time-lt90-d38bcc1c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước danh từ để bổ nghĩa (ví dụ: long-time partner).', 'business', 1, 8),
('8c95a355-7ab2-5eec-9554-557921a57b10', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'longtime', 'UK: /ˈlɒŋˌtaɪm/ | US: /ˈlɔŋˌtaɪm/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'lâu năm, lâu dài', 'having occupied a role, status, or position over a continuous duration spanning many years.', 'The company recognized its longtime employees for their dedication.', 'Công ty đã công nhận những nhân viên lâu năm vì sự cống hiến của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO presented an award to Mr. Harrison, a longtime employee who served the firm for 30 years.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc đã trao giải thưởng cho ông Harrison, một nhân viên lâu năm đã cống hiến cho công ty 30 năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-ljspeech-4e4c0fa2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-cori-4e4c0fa2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/longtime-a653dd18.webp', '[\"veteran\", \"established\", \"enduring\"]', '[\"new\", \"recent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"longtime customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng thân thiết lâu năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"longtime partner\", \"meaning\": \"đối tác lâu năm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"long time\", \"note_vi\": \"Long time (2 từ tách biệt) là cụm danh từ chỉ khoảng thời gian dài\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-cori-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru0-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru5-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru6-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru10-4e4c0fa2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru9-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru3-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru7-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru8-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-aru2-4e4c0fa2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-ljspeech-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt408-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt138-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt624-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt396-4e4c0fa2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt498-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt132-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt288-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt42-4e4c0fa2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longtime-lt90-4e4c0fa2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng ngay trước danh từ chỉ người hoặc vai trò (longtime customer, longtime employee). Viết liền không gạch nối.', 'personnel', 1, 9),
('82ccb0ed-a058-5399-97cb-8d8ff9b94742', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'persist', '/pəˈsɪst/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tiếp tục làm gì đó một cách kiên trì dù gặp khó khăn.', 'to continue doing something determinedly despite difficulties or opposition.', 'If you persist in practicing, you will eventually master the skill.', 'Nếu bạn kiên trì luyện tập, cuối cùng bạn sẽ thành thạo kỹ năng đó.', '{\"en\": \"If technical glitches persist, please report them to the support desk immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu các sự cố kỹ thuật vẫn tiếp diễn, vui lòng báo cho bộ phận hỗ trợ ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-ljspeech-f11f3d18.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-cori-f11f3d18.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/persist-9ae7732f.webp', '[\"persevere\", \"continue\", \"endure\"]', '[\"quit\", \"stop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"persist in doing something\", \"meaning\": \"kiên trì làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"problems persist\", \"meaning\": \"các vấn đề vẫn tiếp diễn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insist\", \"note_vi\": \"Insist là khăng khăng yêu cầu; persist là kiên trì hoặc tiếp diễn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"persistence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"persistent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-cori-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru0-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru5-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru6-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru10-f11f3d18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru9-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru3-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru7-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru8-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-aru2-f11f3d18.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-ljspeech-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt408-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt138-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt624-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt396-f11f3d18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt498-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt132-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt288-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt42-f11f3d18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persist-lt90-f11f3d18.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'in\' (persist in + V-ing) hoặc dùng cho các sự cố tiếp diễn.', 'office', 1, 10),
('ffe667e3-b7d1-5405-8bb3-30b47f76d907', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'symbolic', '/sɪmˈbɒlɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mang tính biểu trưng, tượng trưng cho điều gì đó.', 'representing something else, often an idea or a quality, rather than itself.', 'Wearing formal attire to the annual ceremony is symbolic of respect for company traditions.', 'Mặc trang phục trang trọng tới buổi lễ hàng năm mang tính tượng trưng cho sự tôn trọng truyền thống công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The new office logo is symbolic of our commitment to sustainable energy solutions.\", \"vi\": \"Logo văn phòng mới là biểu tượng cho cam kết của chúng tôi đối với các giải pháp năng lượng bền vững.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-ljspeech-06f9b0fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-cori-06f9b0fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/symbolic-fcfa8928.webp', '[\"representative\", \"emblematic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"symbolic gesture\", \"meaning\": \"cử chỉ mang tính biểu tượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"symbolic meaning\", \"meaning\": \"ý nghĩa biểu trưng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"symbol\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"symbolize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-cori-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru0-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru5-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru6-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru10-06f9b0fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru9-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru3-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru7-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru8-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-aru2-06f9b0fa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-ljspeech-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt408-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt138-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt624-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt396-06f9b0fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt498-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt132-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt288-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt42-06f9b0fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symbolic-lt90-06f9b0fa.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả các vật phẩm hoặc hành động mang ý nghĩa sâu xa.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('b58ac4e7-bd66-57e2-bb2f-1ad4248a8d8d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'forge', '/fɔːdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm giả giấy tờ, chữ ký hoặc tiền bạc.', 'to make an illegal copy of something in order to deceive people.', 'Dishonest employees tried to forge official receipts to claim unauthorized business expenses.', 'Những nhân viên không trung thực đã cố gắng giả mạo hóa đơn chính thức để đòi các khoản chi tiêu kinh doanh không hợp lệ.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant was arrested after trying to forge the director\'s signature on a check.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán đã bị bắt sau khi cố gắng giả mạo chữ ký của giám đốc trên một tờ séc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-ljspeech-52b7362e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-cori-52b7362e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forge-947cbec0.webp', '[\"counterfeit\", \"fake\", \"falsify\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"forge a signature\", \"meaning\": \"giả mạo chữ ký\"}, {\"phrase\": \"forge documents\", \"meaning\": \"làm giả tài liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"force\", \"note_vi\": \"force là bắt buộc/lực lượng, forge là làm giả hoặc rèn luyện\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"forgery\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"forger\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-cori-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru0-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru5-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru6-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru10-52b7362e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru9-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru3-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru7-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru8-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-aru2-52b7362e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-ljspeech-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt408-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt138-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt624-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt396-52b7362e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt498-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt132-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt288-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt42-52b7362e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forge-lt90-52b7362e.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa \'làm giả\', forge còn có nghĩa tích cực là \'tạo dựng\' mối quan hệ (forge a relationship).', 'law', 1, 12),
('a1a23ecc-e031-51d0-adf6-6ac3438daafc', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'slavery', '/ˈsleɪvəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chế độ nô lệ, tình trạng bị bắt làm nô lệ.', 'the condition where people are owned by others and forced to work without any payment.', 'The abolition of slavery was a major turning point in human history.', 'Việc bãi bỏ chế độ nô lệ là một bước ngoặt lớn trong lịch sử loài người.', '{\"en\": \"Modern international laws strictly prohibit any form of forced labor that resembles historical systems of slavery.\", \"vi\": \"Các luật quốc tế hiện đại nghiêm cấm mọi hình thức lao động cưỡng bức giống với các hệ thống nô lệ trong lịch sử.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-ljspeech-dbe289c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-cori-dbe289c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slavery-05c6a3fb.webp', '[\"servitude\", \"bondage\"]', '[\"freedom\", \"liberty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"abolish slavery\", \"meaning\": \"bãi bỏ chế độ nô lệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"modern slavery\", \"meaning\": \"nô lệ thời hiện đại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"slave\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-cori-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru0-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru5-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru6-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru10-dbe289c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru9-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru3-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru7-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slavery-aru8-dbe289c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu