('27a42125-2ad0-5f00-850d-3a4468707758', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '14000a4c-760f-5285-91b2-94d88e9079a1', 'e1ab5cd6-5da2-5b89-97a7-d1a1d4919cea', 'interactive', '/ˌɪntərˈæktɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng tương tác, ảnh hưởng lẫn nhau.', 'able to communicate and respond to each other actively.', 'The museum features many interactive exhibits for children.', 'Bảo tàng có nhiều triển lãm tương tác dành cho trẻ em.', '{\"en\": \"Our training software includes interactive modules for new staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm đào tạo của chúng tôi bao gồm các mô-đun tương tác cho nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-ljspeech-00753189.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-cori-00753189.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interactive-25919ac6.webp', '[\"participatory\", \"responsive\"]', '[\"passive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"interactive whiteboard\", \"meaning\": \"bảng tương tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interactive session\", \"meaning\": \"phiên tương tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"activated\", \"note_vi\": \"activated là được kích hoạt, interactive là tương tác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"interact\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interaction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-cori-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru0-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru5-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru6-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru10-00753189.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru9-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru3-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interactive-aru7-00753189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio