('6f2a66c2-f4b7-5d82-893e-500395f74d8b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '19c93a9c-0cf8-5df5-9d03-29f6d1d12551', '0dbd2711-ba6b-5d55-b04a-a057ce97f8cf', 'liberty', '/ˈlɪbəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Quyền tự do hành động, suy nghĩ mà không bị hạn chế.', 'the state of being free to act, speak, or think as you want.', 'The statue of Liberty is a symbol of freedom and democracy.', 'Tượng Nữ thần Tự do là biểu tượng của tự do và dân chủ.', '{\"en\": \"The new contract gives employees the liberty to choose their own working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng mới cho phép nhân viên tự do chọn giờ làm việc của riêng họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-ljspeech-abd66376.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-cori-abd66376.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/liberty-d4161116.webp', '[\"freedom\", \"independence\"]', '[\"restriction\", \"confinement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at liberty\", \"meaning\": \"được tự do\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take the liberty of\", \"meaning\": \"mạn phép làm gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"liberate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-cori-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru0-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru5-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru6-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru10-abd66376.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru9-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru3-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru7-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru8-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-aru2-abd66376.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-ljspeech-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt408-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt138-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt624-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt396-abd66376.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt498-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt132-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt288-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt42-abd66376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberty-lt90-abd66376.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'take the liberty of\' dùng khi muốn xin phép một cách lịch sự.', 'business', 1, 24),
('39a20e94-4aee-5f8a-9050-86cdcc025c05', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '19c93a9c-0cf8-5df5-9d03-29f6d1d12551', '0dbd2711-ba6b-5d55-b04a-a057ce97f8cf', 'well', '/wel/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một cái hố đào sâu xuống đất để lấy nước.', 'A shaft excavated into the earth to extract underground liquid resources like water.', 'Villagers often gather around the communal well to fetch water.', 'Dân làng thường tụ tập quanh giếng làng để lấy nước.', '{\"en\": \"The old house had a stone well in the backyard for daily use.\", \"vi\": \"Ngôi nhà cổ có một giếng đá ở sân sau để dùng hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-ljspeech-bd848328.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-cori-bd848328.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/well-93459bae.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"water well\", \"meaning\": \"giếng nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oil well\", \"meaning\": \"giếng khoan dầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dig a well\", \"meaning\": \"đào giếng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"will\", \"note_vi\": \"will nghĩa là sẽ, khác well là giếng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-cori-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru0-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru5-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru6-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru10-bd848328.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru9-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru3-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru7-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru8-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-aru2-bd848328.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-ljspeech-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt408-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt138-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt624-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt396-bd848328.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt498-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt132-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt288-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt42-bd848328.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-lt90-bd848328.mp3\"]}}', 'Well là danh từ nghĩa giếng, còn trạng từ well nghĩa là tốt.', 'housing', 1, 25),
('4d68ad17-fc1b-5e62-b327-5a50a5d13f24', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '19c93a9c-0cf8-5df5-9d03-29f6d1d12551', '0dbd2711-ba6b-5d55-b04a-a057ce97f8cf', 'intervene', '/ˌɪntəˈviːn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tham gia vào một tình huống để cải thiện hoặc ngăn chặn điều gì đó.', 'to become involved in a difficult situation to help solve a problem or prevent trouble.', 'The teacher had to intervene to stop the argument between the students.', 'Giáo viên phải can thiệp để ngăn chặn cuộc cãi vã giữa các học sinh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to intervene when the two departments could not agree on the budget plan.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã phải can thiệp khi hai bộ phận không thể thống nhất về kế hoạch ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-ljspeech-650dc03a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-cori-650dc03a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intervene-1685950c.webp', '[\"mediate\", \"arbitrate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"intervene in\", \"meaning\": \"can thiệp vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"directly intervene\", \"meaning\": \"can thiệp trực tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intervention\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-cori-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru0-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru5-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru6-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru10-650dc03a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru9-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru3-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru7-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervene-aru8-650dc03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inter