('ca80da88-95ac-5fff-a81f-34f441493125', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '23cdbb34-c4ff-586f-ab29-3d3fda3ed675', '5f7a8228-6eea-51ed-af51-90bd790ac500', 'shrug', '/ʃrʌɡ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nhún vai để thể hiện sự không biết, không quan tâm hoặc bất lực.', 'to raise and lower your shoulders to show that you do not know or care about something.', 'Instead of answering the difficult question, the student gave a quick shrug.', 'Thay vì trả lời câu hỏi khó, cậu học sinh chỉ nhún vai một cái thật nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"The technician could only shrug when asked about the sudden computer network failure.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên chỉ biết nhún vai khi được hỏi về sự cố mạng máy tính đột ngột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-ljspeech-d2ec8455.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-cori-d2ec8455.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shrug-28b25cd2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shrug shoulders\", \"meaning\": \"nhún vai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shrug off\", \"meaning\": \"gạt bỏ, coi nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hug\", \"note_vi\": \"hug là ôm, shrug là nhún vai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shrug\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-cori-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru0-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru5-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru6-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru10-d2ec8455.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru9-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru3-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru7-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru8-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru2-d2ec8455.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stora