('eb70e49d-9ae7-5651-866c-23c1467b0186', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'morality', '/məˈræləti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Các nguyên tắc về đúng sai, tốt xấu trong hành vi con người.', 'a set of personal or social rules about what is right and wrong behavior.', 'The story explores complex questions of morality and personal responsibility.', 'Câu chuyện khám phá những câu hỏi phức tạp về đạo đức và trách nhiệm cá nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The new corporate training program emphasizes ethics and morality in all business transactions.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình đào tạo doanh nghiệp mới nhấn mạnh đạo đức và luân lý trong mọi giao dịch kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-ljspeech-4ecd97d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-cori-4ecd97d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/morality-7dd4aa8c.webp', '[\"ethics\", \"virtue\", \"goodness\"]', '[\"immorality\", \"evil\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of morality\", \"meaning\": \"ý thức đạo đức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public morality\", \"meaning\": \"đạo đức xã hội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"morale\", \"note_vi\": \"morale là tinh thần làm việc, morality là đạo đức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"moral\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"moralize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-cori-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru0-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru5-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru6-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru10-4ecd97d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru9-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru3-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru7-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru8-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-aru2-4ecd97d3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-ljspeech-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt408-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt138-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt624-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt396-4ecd97d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt498-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt132-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt288-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt42-4ecd97d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/morality-lt90-4ecd97d3.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt với từ \'morale\' (tinh thần, nhuệ khí) rất hay gặp trong TOEIC.', 'business', 1, 17),
('338deeaa-9ea8-55c0-8d8f-681dac693652', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'exhibit', 'UK: /ɪɡˈzɪbɪt/ | US: /ɪɡˈzɪbɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'trưng bày', 'To display or show an object publicly for people to view and admire.', 'The museum will exhibit new artifacts next month.', 'Bảo tàng sẽ trưng bày các hiện vật mới vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"Several local suppliers will exhibit their new product lines at the trade fair next week.\", \"vi\": \"Một số nhà cung cấp địa phương sẽ trưng bày các dòng sản phẩm mới của họ tại hội chợ thương mại tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-ljspeech-d7be268f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-cori-d7be268f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exhibit-eb4c914a.webp', '[\"display\", \"show\", \"demonstrate\", \"present\"]', '[\"conceal\", \"hide\", \"cover\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exhibit products\", \"meaning\": \"trưng bày sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exhibit leadership\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện năng lực lãnh đạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inhibit\", \"note_vi\": \"inhibit có nghĩa là cản trở/ngăn chặn, phát âm và cách viết gần giống exhibit.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exhibition\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exhibitor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-cori-d7be268f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru0-d7be268f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru5-d7be268f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru6-d7be268f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru10-d7be268f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru9-d7be268f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru3-d7be268f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhibit-aru7-d7be268f.m