('a6bbe43e-7c72-5ca5-828d-e2aa5293d839', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'commodity', '/kəˈmɒdəti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một sản phẩm hoặc nguyên liệu thô có thể mua bán được.', 'a raw material or agricultural product that can be bought and sold in large quantities.', 'Coffee remains a crucial agricultural commodity traded extensively across international exchange markets.', 'Cà phê vẫn là một mặt hàng nông sản quan trọng được giao dịch rộng rãi trên các sàn giao dịch quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The price of this agricultural commodity has increased significantly due to the recent supply shortage.\", \"vi\": \"Giá của mặt hàng nông sản này đã tăng đáng kể do tình trạng thiếu hụt nguồn cung gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-ljspeech-12caee05.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-cori-12caee05.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commodity-e716b194.webp', '[\"good\", \"merchandise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"global commodity\", \"meaning\": \"hàng hóa toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commodity market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường hàng hóa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-cori-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru0-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru5-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru6-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru10-12caee05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru9-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru3-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru7-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commodity-aru8-12caee05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi