('cee9f759-6428-5bc6-b74d-fe31cb4a7a59', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'compromise', '/ˈkɒmprəmaɪz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thỏa hiệp, sự dàn xếp.', 'an agreement reached by two sides where both give up something they wanted.', 'Negotiators managed to strike a fair compromise regarding salary increases for employees.', 'Các nhà đàm phán đã đạt được một thỏa hiệp công bằng về việc tăng lương cho nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Both parties finally reached a compromise regarding the contract terms after several long meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai bên cuối cùng đã đạt được sự thỏa hiệp về các điều khoản hợp đồng sau vài cuộc họp dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-ljspeech-faaabf11.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-cori-faaabf11.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compromise-834b4b7c.webp', '[\"agreement\", \"settlement\"]', '[\"disagreement\", \"confrontation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reach a compromise\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được thỏa hiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accept a compromise\", \"meaning\": \"chấp nhận thỏa hiệp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compromise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-cori-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru0-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru5-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru6-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru10-faaabf11.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru9-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru3-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru7-faaabf11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compromise-aru8-faaabf11.