('c937006a-81c2-54b7-8656-cfcbd687b1fb', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'exclusive', '/ɪkˈskluːsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dành riêng cho một nhóm hoặc cá nhân cụ thể, không bao gồm người khác.', 'limited to only one person or group of people and not shared with others.', 'Our agency signed an exclusive contract to distribute these imported products.', 'Đại lý của chúng tôi đã ký hợp đồng độc quyền để phân phối các sản phẩm nhập khẩu này.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers exclusive discounts to clients who sign a long-term service contract today.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp các ưu đãi độc quyền cho khách hàng ký hợp đồng dịch vụ dài hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-ljspeech-341efea4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-cori-341efea4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exclusive-b2cfbeb7.webp', '[\"restricted\", \"private\"]', '[\"inclusive\", \"shared\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exclusive rights\", \"meaning\": \"quyền độc quyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exclusive access\", \"meaning\": \"quyền truy cập riêng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inclusive\", \"note_vi\": \"inclusive là bao gồm, exclusive là loại trừ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exclude\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exclusion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-cori-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru0-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru5-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru6-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru10-341efea4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru9-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru3-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru7-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru8-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-aru2-341efea4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-ljspeech-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt408-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt138-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt624-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt396-341efea4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt498-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt132-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt288-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt42-341efea4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclusive-lt90-341efea4.mp3\"]}}', 'Exclusive thường dùng trong exclusive rights (quyền độc quyền) hoặc exclusive offer (ưu đãi đặc biệt).', 'business', 1, 27),
('50678951-ae42-52b6-8488-afd4fb36cddc', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'stability', '/stəˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái vững vàng, không thay đổi hoặc dao động.', 'the state of being steady and not changing or failing easily.', 'The country\'s economic stability is crucial for attracting foreign investment.', 'Sự ổn định kinh tế của đất nước là rất quan trọng để thu hút đầu tư nước ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The new financial policy aims to maintain market stability during economic changes.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách tài chính mới nhằm duy trì sự ổn định của thị trường trong thời kỳ biến động kinh tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-ljspeech-e70647c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-cori-e70647c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stability-2ac6cd97.webp', '[\"steadiness\", \"firmness\", \"solidity\"]', '[\"instability\", \"fluctuation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic stability\", \"meaning\": \"sự ổn định kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial stability\", \"meaning\": \"sự ổn định tài chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ability\", \"note_vi\": \"ability là khả năng, stability là sự ổn định\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stable\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stabilize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-cori-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru0-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru5-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru6-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru10-e70647c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru9-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru3-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru7-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru8-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-aru2-e70647c6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-ljspeech-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt408-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt138-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt624-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt396-e70647c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt498-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt132-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt288-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt42-e70647c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stability-lt90-e70647c6.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa là instability (sự không ổn định).', 'finance', 1, 28),
('4b827ce6-f405-52fc-89b3-c0fa73e3f2fd', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '289f5db8-3633-5621-bf32-19d0d4666fce', 'bf0c8991-5c3f-5a3c-a1fa-eb2887259518', 'albeit', '/ˌɔːlˈbiːɪt/', 'C1', 'conjunction', 'Dù cho, mặc dù (dùng để thêm thông tin đối lập).', 'although it is true that; even though.', 'He finally accepted the offer, albeit with some hesitation.', 'Cuối cùng anh ấy đã chấp nhận lời đề nghị, mặc dù có một chút do dự.', '{\"en\": \"The company recorded a small profit, albeit much lower than the previous year\'s figures.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã ghi nhận một khoản lợi nhuận nhỏ, mặc dù thấp hơn nhiều so với số liệu năm trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-ljspeech-ef77b751.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-cori-ef77b751.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/albeit-a4a396ef.webp', '[\"although\", \"though\", \"even though\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"albeit briefly\", \"meaning\": \"dù chỉ trong thời gian ngắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"albeit slowly\", \"meaning\": \"mặc dù chậm chạp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"although\", \"note_vi\": \"although có thể đứng đầu câu làm mệnh đề, albeit thường nối cụm từ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-cori-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru0-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru5-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru6-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru10-ef77b751.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru9-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru3-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru7-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru8-ef77b751.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/albeit-aru2-ef77b751.mp3\"]}, \