('0700e960-364b-5ac5-8ef6-6de53e5ef1af', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2c1ab0a6-04a6-5ea9-a47b-72c50bdcd06d', '8554edb3-0707-5f91-b7cf-6309889568ff', 'hopeful', '/ˈhəʊpfl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy hoặc thể hiện sự lạc quan, tin tưởng vào điều tốt đẹp.', 'Expressing or harboring positive expectations regarding future outcomes or success.', 'The company executives are hopeful about expanding their retail market into Southeast Asia.', 'Các lãnh đạo công ty đang hy vọng về việc mở rộng thị trường bán lẻ sang Đông Nam Á.', '{\"en\": \"Management is hopeful that the new marketing campaign will boost sales next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý hy vọng rằng chiến dịch tiếp thị mới sẽ thúc đẩy doanh số bán hàng trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-ljspeech-05a2a1ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-cori-05a2a1ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hopeful-e0d503d4.webp', '[\"optimistic\", \"confident\", \"promising\"]', '[\"hopeless\", \"pessimistic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hopeful sign\", \"meaning\": \"dấu hiệu đầy hy vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain hopeful\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn giữ hy vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hopeless\", \"note_vi\": \"hopeless nghĩa là vô vọng, trái ngược với hopeful\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hope\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hope\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hopefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-cori-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru0-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru5-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru6-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru10-05a2a1ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru9-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru3-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru7-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru8-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-aru2-05a2a1ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-ljspeech-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt408-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt138-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt624-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt396-05a2a1ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt498-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt132-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt288-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt42-05a2a1ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopeful-lt90-05a2a1ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: \'be hopeful that + mệnh đề\' hoặc \'be hopeful of + V-ing\'.', 'business', 1, 11),
('65cad621-d1a8-5439-a34a-43d2c4057506', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2c1ab0a6-04a6-5ea9-a47b-72c50bdcd06d', '8554edb3-0707-5f91-b7cf-6309889568ff', 'enrol', '/ɪnˈrəʊl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đăng ký, ghi danh vào.', 'to put your name on an official list to join a course, school, or group.', 'Hundreds of new staff members will enrol in the mandatory safety workshop tomorrow.', 'Hàng trăm nhân viên mới sẽ đăng ký tham gia xưởng tập huấn an toàn bắt buộc vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"All new employees must enrol in the health insurance program within their first thirty days.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên mới phải đăng ký chương trình bảo hiểm y tế trong vòng ba mươi ngày đầu tiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-ljspeech-95e1c2ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-cori-95e1c2ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enrol-9f6a1961.webp', '[\"register\", \"join\"]', '[\"withdraw\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enrol in a course\", \"meaning\": \"đăng ký một khóa học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enrol at a university\", \"meaning\": \"ghi danh vào trường đại học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"register\", \"note_vi\": \"Cả hai đều là đăng ký, nhưng enrol thường dùng cho khóa học, trường học.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enrollment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-cori-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru0-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru5-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru6-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru10-95e1c2ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru9-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru3-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru7-95e1c2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enrol-aru