('ce05798d-8573-5298-b6c3-6377d2db27d6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2c1ab0a6-04a6-5ea9-a47b-72c50bdcd06d', '8554edb3-0707-5f91-b7cf-6309889568ff', 'opposition', 'UK: /ˌɒpəˈzɪʃən/ | US: /ˌɑːpəˈzɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự phản đối', 'Strong disagreement with or resistance to a particular plan, policy, or decision.', 'There was strong opposition to the new government policy.', 'Có sự phản đối mạnh mẽ đối với chính sách mới của chính phủ.', '{\"en\": \"The proposed budget cuts met with strong opposition from department heads.\", \"vi\": \"Đề xuất cắt giảm ngân sách đã gặp phải sự phản đối mạnh mẽ từ các trưởng bộ phận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-ljspeech-4a152678.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-cori-4a152678.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/opposition-e461d404.webp', '[\"resistance\", \"disagreement\", \"objection\"]', '[\"approval\", \"support\", \"agreement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strong opposition\", \"meaning\": \"sự phản đối mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face opposition\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với sự phản đối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"oppose\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"opposed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-cori-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru0-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru5-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru6-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru10-4a152678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru9-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru3-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru7-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru8-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-aru2-4a152678.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-ljspeech-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt408-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt138-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt624-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt396-4a152678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt498-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt132-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt288-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt42-4a152678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opposition-lt90-4a152678.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cấu trúc \'in opposition to something\' (thể hiện sự phản đối đối với cái gì đó).', 'business management', 1, 29),
('e5214dd2-17a7-54a8-b16a-7d3c8f5be22d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'establishment', '/ɪˈstæblɪʃmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thành lập hoặc một tổ chức, cơ sở kinh doanh lớn.', 'an organization, business, or institution that has been set up and is well known.', 'The restaurant has been a popular establishment in the city for over fifty years.', 'Nhà hàng này đã là một cơ sở nổi tiếng trong thành phố hơn năm mươi năm.', '{\"en\": \"The new branch will be our largest establishment in the Southeast Asia region.\", \"vi\": \"Chi nhánh mới sẽ là cơ sở lớn nhất của chúng tôi ở khu vực Đông Nam Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-ljspeech-15e523ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-cori-15e523ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/establishment-d0540f64.webp', '[\"institution\", \"organization\", \"firm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business establishment\", \"meaning\": \"cơ sở kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"establishment of\", \"meaning\": \"sự thành lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"well-known establishment\", \"meaning\": \"cơ sở nổi tiếng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"institution\", \"note_vi\": \"institution thường chỉ tổ chức phi lợi nhuận/giáo dục, establishment rộng hơn, gồm cả kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"establish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"established\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-cori-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru0-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru5-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru6-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru10-15e523ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru9-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru3-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru7-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru8-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-aru2-15e523ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-ljspeech-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt408-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt138-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt624-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt396-15e523ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt498-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt132-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt288-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt42-15e523ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/establishment-lt90-15e523ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Establishment có hai nghĩa: sự thành lập (danh từ trừu tượng) và cơ sở/tổ chức (danh từ cụ thể).', 'business', 1, 0),
('1b9a59d5-80bd-516b-ba50-eb2a529160cc', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'merge', '/mɜːdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Kết hợp hai hoặc nhiều thứ thành một.', 'to combine or join two or more things together to form a single unit.', 'The two small companies decided to merge to form a larger, more competitive entity.', 'Hai công ty nhỏ quyết định hợp nhất để tạo thành một thực thể lớn hơn, cạnh tranh hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The two telecommunications companies plan to merge next year to increase their market share.\", \"vi\": \"Hai công ty viễn thông dự kiến sáp nhập vào năm tới để tăng thị phần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-ljspeech-14091a9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-cori-14091a9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/merge-18388ac6.webp', '[\"combine\", \"unite\", \"join\"]', '[\"separate\", \"divide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"merge with\", \"meaning\": \"sáp nhập với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"merge into\", \"meaning\": \"hòa vào, gộp vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"acquire\", \"note_vi\": \"acquire là mua lại/thâu tóm, merge là sáp nhập ngang hàng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"merger\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-cori-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru0-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru5-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru6-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru10-14091a9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru9-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru3-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru7-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merge-aru8-14091a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun