('26331094-fc56-5e0c-95ac-41a70ac2fac2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'commissioner', '/kəˈmɪʃənə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một thành viên của một ủy ban hoặc một quan chức cấp cao.', 'an official who is in charge of a government department or a public organization.', 'The trade commissioner met with foreign leaders to expand international export agreements.', 'Ủy viên thương mại đã gặp gỡ các lãnh đạo nước ngoài để mở rộng các thỏa thuận xuất khẩu quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The trade commissioner will meet with foreign business leaders to discuss export policies.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy viên thương mại sẽ gặp các nhà lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp nước ngoài để thảo luận về chính sách xuất khẩu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-ljspeech-1303263e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-cori-1303263e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commissioner-2fb5d09c.webp', '[\"official\", \"delegate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"police commissioner\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh sát trưởng / ủy viên cảnh sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trade commissioner\", \"meaning\": \"ủy viên thương mại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commission\", \"note_vi\": \"tiền hoa hồng hoặc ủy ban, không chỉ người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commission\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commission\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-cori-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru0-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru5-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru6-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru10-1303263e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru9-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru3-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru7-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru8-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-aru2-1303263e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-ljspeech-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt408-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt138-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt624-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt396-1303263e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt498-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt132-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt288-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt42-1303263e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commissioner-lt90-1303263e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường chỉ người đứng đầu một cơ quan, ủy ban hoặc bộ phận quản lý nhà nước.', 'business', 1, 2),
('fc2c88d7-197f-5ec5-85c7-9b16682600db', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'boom', '/buːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tiếng nổ lớn, tiếng vang hoặc giai đoạn phát triển nhanh chóng.', 'a period of sudden economic growth or a loud deep sound.', 'The local tourism industry experienced a sudden economic boom after the new airport opened.', 'Ngành du lịch địa phương đã trải qua sự bùng nổ kinh tế đột ngột sau khi sân bay mới mở cửa.', '{\"en\": \"The recent economic boom has led to a significant increase in new business startups.\", \"vi\": \"Sự bùng nổ kinh tế gần đây đã dẫn đến sự gia tăng đáng kể các doanh nghiệp khởi nghiệp mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-ljspeech-c53d2f1a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-cori-c53d2f1a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boom-145a074e.webp', '[\"growth\", \"expansion\", \"explosion\"]', '[\"bust\", \"recession\", \"slump\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic boom\", \"meaning\": \"sự bùng nổ kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baby boom\", \"meaning\": \"sự bùng nổ trẻ sơ sinh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bloom\", \"note_vi\": \"bloom là nở hoa hoặc thời kỳ rực rỡ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"boom\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"booming\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-cori-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru0-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru5-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru6-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru10-c53d2f1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru9-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru3-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru7-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru8-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-aru2-c53d2f1a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-ljspeech-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt408-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt138-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt624-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt396-c53d2f1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt498-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt132-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt288-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt42-c53d2f1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boom-lt90-c53d2f1a.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'boom\' thường mang nghĩa bùng nổ kinh tế hoặc doanh số.', 'business', 1, 3),
('c7257358-5dbc-5982-aa86-1ff02cb1f0f7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'ensue', '/ɪnˈsjuː/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Xảy ra ngay sau một sự kiện khác, thường là kết quả của nó.', 'to happen as a direct result of something that occurred just before.', 'A heated debate ensued after the controversial announcement was made.', 'Một cuộc tranh luận gay gắt đã xảy ra sau khi thông báo gây tranh cãi được đưa ra.', '{\"en\": \"A lengthy negotiation ensued after both parties disagreed on the contract terms.\", \"vi\": \"Một cuộc đàm phán kéo dài đã xảy ra sau khi hai bên không đồng ý về các điều khoản hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-ljspeech-e0d17189.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-cori-e0d17189.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ensue-ca603680.webp', '[\"follow\", \"result\", \"arise\"]', '[\"precede\", \"cause\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chaos ensued\", \"meaning\": \"sự hỗn loạn xảy ra tiếp theo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"debate ensued\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tranh luận nổ ra sau đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the days that ensued\", \"meaning\": \"trong những ngày tiếp theo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ensure\", \"note_vi\": \"\'ensure\' nghĩa là đảm bảo; \'ensue\' nghĩa là xảy ra tiếp theo — khác nhau hoàn toàn về nghĩa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ensuing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-cori-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru0-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru5-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru6-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru10-e0d17189.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru9-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru3-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru7-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru8-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-aru2-e0d17189.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-ljspeech-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt408-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt138-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt624-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt396-e0d17189.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt498-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt132-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt288-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt42-e0d17189.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensue-lt90-e0d17189.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất dễ nhầm \'ensue\' với \'ensure\' vì gần giống nhau — nhớ \'ensue\' là \'xảy ra sau\', \'ensure\' là \'đảm bảo\'.', 'business', 1, 4),
('f40652a5-778a-59fa-8e98-4b089ff51733', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'intake', '/ˈɪnteɪk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lượng thức ăn, đồ uống hoặc không khí được đưa vào cơ thể.', 'the amount of food, drink, or air that you put into your body.', 'Athletes need to monitor their daily protein intake to support muscle recovery.', 'Các vận động viên cần theo dõi lượng protein hấp thụ hàng ngày để hỗ trợ phục hồi cơ bắp.', '{\"en\": \"The wellness program encourages employees to reduce their daily sugar intake for better health.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe khuyến khích nhân viên giảm lượng đường tiêu thụ hàng ngày để có sức khỏe tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-ljspeech-a0039c22.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-cori-a0039c22.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intake-d9a53199.webp', '[\"consumption\", \"absorption\", \"ingestion\"]', '[\"output\", \"discharge\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"daily intake\", \"meaning\": \"lượng tiêu thụ hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"caloric intake\", \"meaning\": \"lượng calo đưa vào cơ thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"food intake\", \"meaning\": \"lượng thức ăn đưa vào cơ thể\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-cori-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru0-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru5-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru6-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru10-a0039c22.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru9-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru3-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-aru7-a0039c22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intake-a