('27af9f87-ac90-5049-9443-54289fa37f35', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'interval', 'UK: /ˈɪntəvəl/ | US: /ˈɪntərvəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'khoảng thời gian', 'A period of time occurring between two events, actions, or points in a sequence.', 'The machine needs service at regular intervals.', 'Chiếc máy cần được bảo dưỡng theo những khoảng thời gian đều đặn.', '{\"en\": \"Routine maintenance should be performed at regular intervals to keep the machinery efficient.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo trì định kỳ nên được thực hiện theo những khoảng thời gian đều đặn để duy trì hiệu suất máy móc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-ljspeech-84f4675c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-cori-84f4675c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interval-6db7132a.webp', '[\"gap\", \"period\", \"span\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"at regular intervals\", \"meaning\": \"theo định kỳ/khoảng thời gian đều đặn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"short interval\", \"meaning\": \"khoảng thời gian ngắn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-cori-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru0-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru5-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru6-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru10-84f4675c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru9-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru3-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru7-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru8-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-aru2-84f4675c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-ljspeech-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt408-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt138-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt624-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt396-84f4675c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt498-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt132-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt288-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt42-84f4675c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interval-lt90-84f4675c.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi trong cụm cố định \'at regular intervals\' (theo định kỳ / ở những khoảng thời gian đều đặn).', 'maintenance', 1, 6),
('43a99510-e788-51a4-b75c-94a5ae139fa6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'exaggerate', '/ɪɡˈzædʒəreɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó có vẻ lớn hơn, tốt hơn hoặc tệ hơn thực tế.', 'to make something seem larger, better, or worse than it really is in reality.', 'He tends to exaggerate his achievements to impress people.', 'Anh ấy có xu hướng phóng đại thành tích của mình để gây ấn tượng với mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The sales manager did not exaggerate the potential profits during the quarterly budget meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc kinh doanh đã không phóng đại lợi nhuận tiềm năng trong cuộc họp ngân sách quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-ljspeech-1461b27b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-cori-1461b27b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exaggerate-3b8e4607.webp', '[\"overstate\", \"overemphasize\"]', '[\"understate\", \"downplay\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exaggerate the importance\", \"meaning\": \"phóng đại tầm quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grossly exaggerate\", \"meaning\": \"phóng đại quá mức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exaggeration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-cori-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru0-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru5-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru6-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru10-1461b27b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru9-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru3-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru7-1461b27b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggerate-aru8-1461b27b.m