('b507e6ec-c159-5092-a6d4-18267952e6e6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'functional', '/ˈfʌŋkʃənl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng hoạt động tốt; thiết thực, hữu dụng.', 'designed to be practical and useful rather than attractive or decorative.', 'The new design is not only stylish but also highly functional.', 'Thiết kế mới không chỉ thời trang mà còn rất hữu dụng.', '{\"en\": \"The office furniture should be functional and comfortable for employees working long hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nội thất văn phòng nên hữu dụng và thoải mái cho nhân viên làm việc nhiều giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-ljspeech-f3605082.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-cori-f3605082.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/functional-a20a3f38.webp', '[\"practical\", \"useful\", \"utilitarian\"]', '[\"decorative\", \"impractical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fully functional\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động đầy đủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"functional design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế thực dụng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"function\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"functionally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-cori-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru0-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru5-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru6-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru10-f3605082.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru9-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru3-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru7-f3605082.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/functional-aru8-f3605082.mp3\", \