('93d76f64-8bca-5322-bf56-dd17a6ce2996', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2d7bf282-f6ac-5983-a98d-8dd10f75e9c0', '6d9bc752-c8a2-5ee7-bc6c-b4980081e6d6', 'atrocity', '/əˈtrɒsəti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động vô cùng tàn ác, dã man.', 'an extremely cruel and violent action, especially during a war.', 'The reports described terrible atrocities committed during the war.', 'Các báo cáo mô tả những hành động tàn bạo khủng khiếp đã xảy ra trong chiến tranh.', '{\"en\": \"The international news agency reported on the shocking atrocity committed against innocent civilians.\", \"vi\": \"Hãng tin quốc tế đã đưa tin về hành động tàn ác gây sốc đối với những thường dân vô tội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-ljspeech-11751d0a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-cori-11751d0a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atrocity-90ad15ef.webp', '[\"cruelty\", \"barbarity\", \"outrage\"]', '[\"kindness\", \"humanity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commit an atrocity\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội ác tàn bạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wartime atrocity\", \"meaning\": \"tội ác chiến tranh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"atrocious\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"atrociously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-cori-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru0-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru5-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru6-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru10-11751d0a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru9-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru3-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru7-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru8-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/