('19f3d519-865d-545b-8489-bb8d62e15fd4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2dce828a-709a-5b78-bacd-4aa4ea608d52', 'f860580a-d9bc-582a-9f56-0748364aaba4', 'assurance', '/əˈʃʊərəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời cam đoan, sự đảm bảo chắc chắn.', 'a confident promise or guarantee that something will happen or is true.', 'The company gave us an assurance that the product would be delivered on time.', 'Công ty đã cam đoan với chúng tôi rằng sản phẩm sẽ được giao đúng hẹn.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier provided written assurance that all orders would arrive before the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đã đưa ra cam đoan bằng văn bản rằng mọi đơn hàng sẽ đến trước hạn chót.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-ljspeech-f3753f1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-cori-f3753f1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assurance-d34064da.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"promise\", \"pledge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give assurance\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lời cam đoan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written assurance\", \"meaning\": \"cam đoan bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quality assurance\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo chất lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insurance\", \"note_vi\": \"insurance là bảo hiểm tài chính, assurance là lời cam đoan bằng lời hoặc văn bản\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"assured\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"assuredly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-cori-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru0-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru5-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru6-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru10-f3753f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru9-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru3-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru7-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru8-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru2-f3753f1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-ljspeech-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt408-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt138-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt624-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt396-f3753f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt498-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt132-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt288-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt42-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt90-f3753f1b.mp3\"]}}', 'quality assurance (QA) là cụm rất hay gặp trong đề TOEIC liên quan đến sản xuất và dịch vụ.', 'business', 1, 5),
('60f92047-dc1e-5f8b-ab19-1ef33d1de4fd', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2dce828a-709a-5b78-bacd-4aa4ea608d52', 'f860580a-d9bc-582a-9f56-0748364aaba4', 'violate', '/ˈvaɪəleɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm trái hoặc không tuân thủ một luật, quy tắc, hay thỏa thuận.', 'to break or act against a formal agreement, law, or rule set by an authority.', 'Parking in this area will violate the city\'s traffic regulations.', 'Đỗ xe ở khu vực này sẽ vi phạm các quy định giao thông của thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Employees who violate company safety policies will face immediate disciplinary action from the human resources department.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên vi phạm các chính sách an toàn của công ty sẽ phải đối mặt với kỷ luật ngay lập tức từ bộ phận nhân sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-ljspeech-a5ec4bde.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-cori-a5ec4bde.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/violate-77f6b893.webp', '[\"break\", \"disobey\"]', '[\"obey\", \"comply\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"violate a rule\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm quy tắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"violate an agreement\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm thỏa thuận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"violation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"violator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-cori-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru0-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru5-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru6-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru10-a5ec4bde.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru9-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru3-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru7-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru8-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-aru2-a5ec4bde.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-ljspeech-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt408-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt138-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt624-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt396-a5ec4bde.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt498-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt132-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt288-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt42-a5ec4bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violate-lt90-a5ec4bde.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý hoặc quy định công ty.', 'law', 1, 6),
('f99aa788-28a6-524a-820f-2689dd5f53a2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2dce828a-709a-5b78-bacd-4aa4ea608d52', 'f860580a-d9bc-582a-9f56-0748364aaba4', 'venture', '/ˈventʃə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một dự án hoặc công việc kinh doanh mới mang tính rủi ro.', 'a new business activity or project that involves taking risks in order to make money.', 'Starting a new business is always a risky venture.', 'Bắt đầu một doanh nghiệp mới luôn là một sự mạo hiểm đầy rủi ro.', '{\"en\": \"The two technology companies have formed a joint venture to develop advanced software solutions.\", \"vi\": \"Hai công ty công nghệ đã thành lập một liên doanh để phát triển các giải pháp phần mềm tiên tiến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-ljspeech-36c53fa4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-cori-36c53fa4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/venture-82b49caf.webp', '[\"enterprise\", \"project\", \"undertaking\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"joint venture\", \"meaning\": \"công ty liên doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business venture\", \"meaning\": \"dự án kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adventure\", \"note_vi\": \"adventure là chuyến phiêu lưu, venture là dự án kinh doanh rủi ro.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"venturous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-cori-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru0-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru5-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru6-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru10-36c53fa4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru9-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru3-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venture-aru7-36c53fa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v