('31b736ab-0afa-5c53-b11c-fcd132b8df5e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2dce828a-709a-5b78-bacd-4aa4ea608d52', 'f860580a-d9bc-582a-9f56-0748364aaba4', 'investigation', 'UK: /ɪnˌvɛstɪˈɡeɪʃən/ | US: /ɪnˌvɛstɪˈɡeɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nghiên cứu, điều tra', 'A detailed examination or inquiry into a matter to uncover facts, truth, or causes.', 'The team concluded their investigation into the customer complaints.', 'Nhóm đã kết thúc cuộc điều tra về các khiếu nại của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The regulatory board launched a thorough investigation into the accounting discrepancies.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản lý đã khởi xướng một cuộc điều tra kỹ lưỡng về sự bất hợp lý trong kế toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-ljspeech-b6af7691.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-cori-b6af7691.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/investigation-b90c5f01.webp', '[\"inquiry\", \"examination\", \"inspection\", \"scrutiny\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct an investigation\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành cuộc điều tra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under investigation\", \"meaning\": \"đang trong quá trình bị điều tra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"investment\", \"note_vi\": \"khoản đầu tư tài chính, tránh nhầm lẫn với investigation (cuộc điều tra)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"investigate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"investigative\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"investigator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-cori-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru0-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru5-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru6-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru10-b6af7691.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru9-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru3-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru7-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru8-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-aru2-b6af7691.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-ljspeech-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt408-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt138-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt624-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt396-b6af7691.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt498-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt132-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt288-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt42-b6af7691.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/investigation-lt90-b6af7691.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường kết hợp thành cụm \'conduct / carry out an investigation into something\' (tiến hành cuộc điều tra về cái gì).', 'corporate policy', 1, 8),
('0090ece4-fdbb-5a16-aec6-9e557572bdc7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2dce828a-709a-5b78-bacd-4aa4ea608d52', 'f860580a-d9bc-582a-9f56-0748364aaba4', 'terminal', '/ˈtɜːmɪnl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Ga cuối, bến cuối hoặc thiết bị đầu cuối.', 'a building or station at the end of a transport line or a computer device for inputting data.', 'Passengers should proceed directly to the international departure terminal after checking in.', 'Hành khách nên đi thẳng đến nhà ga khởi hành quốc tế sau khi làm thủ tục.', '{\"en\": \"All passengers must proceed to the international terminal for security checks before boarding their flight.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả hành khách phải đến nhà ga quốc tế để kiểm tra an ninh trước khi lên máy bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-ljspeech-46d551da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-cori-46d551da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terminal-4ebc4faa.webp', '[\"station\", \"depot\", \"hub\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"airport terminal\", \"meaning\": \"nhà ga sân bay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"computer terminal\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị đầu cuối máy tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"terminate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-cori-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru0-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru5-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru6-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru10-46d551da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru9-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru3-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru7-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru8-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun