('cea72c81-0d15-50cd-8e66-9e21abd0d17d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2e89aa07-2bfc-5410-9a3a-6875447ccbdd', '38b95549-adc0-5eb3-ad14-3f21a7c6d873', 'query', '/ˈkwɪəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một câu hỏi hoặc yêu cầu thông tin.', 'a question or request for information about something that is not clear.', 'The customer sent a query about the status of their order.', 'Khách hàng đã gửi một câu hỏi về trạng thái đơn hàng của họ.', '{\"en\": \"Please forward any customer query regarding billing to our accounting department immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng chuyển bất kỳ thắc mắc nào của khách hàng về hóa đơn đến bộ phận kế toán của chúng tôi ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-ljspeech-7cd9148e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-cori-7cd9148e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/query-04039279.webp', '[\"question\", \"inquiry\", \"request\"]', '[\"answer\", \"response\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"submit a query\", \"meaning\": \"gửi một thắc mắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle queries\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý các câu hỏi thắc mắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inquiry\", \"note_vi\": \"Inquiry đồng nghĩa nhưng mang tính trang trọng hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"query\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-cori-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru0-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru5-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru6-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru10-7cd9148e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru9-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru3-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru7-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru8-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru2-7cd9148e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-ljspeech-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt408-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt138-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt624-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt396-7cd9148e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt498-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt132-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt288-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt42-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt90-7cd9148e.mp3\"]}}', 'Query vừa là danh từ (câu hỏi/thắc mắc) vừa là động từ (hỏi, thắc mắc).', 'office', 1, 19),
('3ede80db-d780-5f6c-a546-405fb54f29cd', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2e89aa07-2bfc-5410-9a3a-6875447ccbdd', '38b95549-adc0-5eb3-ad14-3f21a7c6d873', 'precision', '/prɪˈsɪʒn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự chính xác, tỉ mỉ.', 'the quality of being exact, careful, and accurate in every detail.', 'Engineers designed the tiny machine components with extraordinary precision to prevent mechanical failure.', 'Các kỹ sư đã thiết kế các linh kiện máy móc nhỏ bé với độ chính xác phi thường để ngăn ngừa sự cố cơ khí.', '{\"en\": \"Our engineers work with great precision to ensure every product meets quality standards.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư của chúng tôi làm việc với độ chính xác cao để đảm bảo mọi sản phẩm đáp ứng tiêu chuẩn chất lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-ljspeech-13800272.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-cori-13800272.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/precision-9679786e.webp', '[\"accuracy\", \"exactness\", \"meticulousness\"]', '[\"inaccuracy\", \"carelessness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"with precision\", \"meaning\": \"với sự chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"precision tool\", \"meaning\": \"dụng cụ chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high precision\", \"meaning\": \"độ chính xác cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concision\", \"note_vi\": \"concision là sự ngắn gọn trong văn phong, không liên quan đến độ chính xác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"precise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"precisely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"imprecision\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-cori-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru0-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru5-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru6-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru10-13800272.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru9-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru3-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru7-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru8-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-aru2-13800272.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-ljspeech-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt408-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt138-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt624-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt396-13800272.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt498-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt132-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt288-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt42-13800272.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precision-lt90-13800272.mp3\"]}}', 'precision (danh từ) đi với giới từ \'with\', ví dụ: \'with precision\'.', 'manufacturing', 1, 20),
('9cc6468e-98b5-500c-80b0-d511385c05b6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2e89aa07-2bfc-5410-9a3a-6875447ccbdd', '38b95549-adc0-5eb3-ad14-3f21a7c6d873', 'effectiveness', '/ɪˈfektɪvnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'tính hiệu quả, sự có tác dụng', 'the degree to which something is successful in producing a desired result.', 'The marketing team is currently testing the effectiveness of this advertising strategy.', 'Đội ngũ tiếp thị đang kiểm tra tính hiệu quả của chiến lược quảng cáo này.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will review the effectiveness of the new marketing strategy next month.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý sẽ xem xét tính hiệu quả của chiến lược tiếp thị mới vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-ljspeech-509bb702.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-cori-509bb702.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/effectiveness-1fc9dec3.webp', '[\"efficiency\", \"efficacy\", \"success\"]', '[\"ineffectiveness\", \"failure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cost effectiveness\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu quả về chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measure the effectiveness\", \"meaning\": \"đo lường tính hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficiency\", \"note_vi\": \"nhấn mạnh việc hoàn thành công việc với ít tài nguyên nhất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"effective\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"effectively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-cori-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru0-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru5-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru6-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru10-509bb702.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru9-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru3-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru7-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru8-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-aru2-509bb702.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-ljspeech-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt408-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt138-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt624-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt396-509bb702.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt498-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt132-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt288-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt42-509bb702.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effectiveness-lt90-509bb702.mp3\"]}}', 'Effectiveness là đạt được mục tiêu, còn efficiency là làm việc năng suất.', 'business', 1, 21),
('dee981cc-712c-5d00-bb79-e8fe45743d0a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '2e89aa07-2bfc-5410-9a3a-6875447ccbdd', '38b95549-adc0-5eb3-ad14-3f21a7c6d873', 'tender', '/ˈtendə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mềm mại, dễ nhai hoặc dễ cắt (thường dùng cho thức ăn).', 'easy to cut or chew because it is soft and not tough at all.', 'The steak was cooked perfectly, very tender and juicy.', 'Miếng bít tết được nấu hoàn hảo, rất mềm và mọng nước.', '{\"en\": \"The chef prepared a tender steak that was served with a special red wine sauce.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp đã chuẩn bị món bít tết mềm được phục vụ kèm với nước sốt rượu vang đỏ đặc biệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-ljspeech-245d1e8a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-cori-245d1e8a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tender-6ae55409.webp', '[\"soft\", \"delicate\"]', '[\"tough\", \"hard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tender meat\", \"meaning\": \"thịt mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tender steak\", \"meaning\": \"bít tết mềm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tender\", \"note_vi\": \"Danh từ nghĩa là gói thầu hoặc sự đấu thầu. (noun)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tenderness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-cori-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru0-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru5-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru6-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru10-245d1e8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru9-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru3-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru7-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru8-245d1e8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tender-aru2-245d1e8a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {