('4df0eb27-cfd9-5c0c-94a1-af11f3da8179', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '35900222-75a8-5dc1-bab2-911efde642f6', '43bafd45-9c69-5aae-a325-ba45f896a5ad', 'straightforward', '/ˌstreɪtˈfɔːwəd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ hiểu, đơn giản, thẳng thắn.', 'easy to understand or simple to do, without complications or secret motives.', 'The instructions for assembling the furniture were surprisingly straightforward.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp đồ nội thất thật đáng ngạc nhiên là rất đơn giản.', '{\"en\": \"The updated user manual provides a straightforward guide for installing the new software.\", \"vi\": \"Sách hướng dẫn sử dụng cập nhật cung cấp chỉ dẫn đơn giản để cài đặt phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-ljspeech-ffaecb2c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-cori-ffaecb2c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/straightforward-c8cef9cd.webp', '[\"simple\", \"uncomplicated\", \"direct\"]', '[\"complicated\", \"complex\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"straightforward answer\", \"meaning\": \"câu trả lời thẳng thắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"straightforward process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình đơn giản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"straight\", \"note_vi\": \"straight là thẳng (hướng đi), straightforward là đơn giản hoặc thẳng thắn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"straightforwardly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"straightforwardness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-cori-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru0-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru5-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru6-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru10-ffaecb2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru9-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v