('6754d45c-5a12-57f5-8557-2391f94221cd', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '35900222-75a8-5dc1-bab2-911efde642f6', '43bafd45-9c69-5aae-a325-ba45f896a5ad', 'conceal', '/kənˈsiːl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Giấu giếm, che đậy.', 'to keep something secret or hidden so that others cannot see or find it easily.', 'She tried to conceal her disappointment with a smile.', 'Cô ấy cố gắng che giấu sự thất vọng của mình bằng một nụ cười.', '{\"en\": \"The company tried to conceal the financial loss from the shareholders until the annual report.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã cố gắng che giấu khoản lỗ tài chính với các cổ đông cho đến khi có báo cáo thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-ljspeech-3191ab37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-cori-3191ab37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conceal-0f42d214.webp', '[\"hide\", \"mask\"]', '[\"reveal\", \"disclose\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conceal the truth\", \"meaning\": \"che giấu sự thật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conceal information\", \"meaning\": \"giấu thông tin\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"concealment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-cori-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru0-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru5-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru6-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru10-3191ab37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru9-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru3-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru7-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru8-3191ab37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceal-aru2-3191ab37.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu