('85b4d999-cc63-5e42-bf83-de70f1687157', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '35900222-75a8-5dc1-bab2-911efde642f6', '43bafd45-9c69-5aae-a325-ba45f896a5ad', 'crush', '/krʌʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự nghiền nát, ép chặt.', 'a situation where something is pressed or squeezed with great force until it breaks or flattens.', 'The metal can was flattened by the crush of the machine.', 'Lon kim loại bị làm bẹp bởi lực ép của cỗ máy.', '{\"en\": \"The heavy machinery caused a crush of the shipping boxes during the loading process.\", \"vi\": \"Máy móc hạng nặng đã làm các thùng hàng bị nghiền nát trong quá trình bốc xếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-ljspeech-54eda0d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-cori-54eda0d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crush-f151626d.webp', '[\"pressure\", \"compression\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crush injury\", \"meaning\": \"chấn thương do bị đè ép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under the crush\", \"meaning\": \"dưới sức ép\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"crushing\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"crush\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-cori-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru0-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru5-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru6-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru10-54eda0d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru9-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru3-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru7-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru8-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru2-54eda0d3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-ljspeech-5