('8dfeea3c-6eb7-5402-87fc-491a08bb1c09', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '3e8a49a1-ebe3-5967-ae03-a76aece185e5', '552ac931-5784-5986-9edf-26ed21c87b1a', 'inequality', '/ˌɪnɪˈkwɒləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự không công bằng hoặc không đồng đều.', 'a situation where some people have more rights or money than others.', 'The report highlighted the growing income inequality in the country.', 'Báo cáo đã nêu bật sự bất bình đẳng thu nhập ngày càng tăng trong nước.', '{\"en\": \"The company is addressing the wage inequality between different departments to improve staff morale.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang giải quyết sự bất bình đẳng về tiền lương giữa các phòng ban để cải thiện tinh thần nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-ljspeech-9d5452c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-cori-9d5452c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inequality-e0d98667.webp', '[\"imbalance\", \"disparity\"]', '[\"equality\", \"fairness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"social inequality\", \"meaning\": \"bất bình đẳng xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"income inequality\", \"meaning\": \"bất bình đẳng thu nhập\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"equal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-cori-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru0-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru5-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru6-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru10-9d5452c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru9-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru3-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru7-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inequality-aru8-9d5452c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o