('31eccf86-8895-5a1b-ba3b-4d1ae95114bb', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '478c5437-b25f-5ac2-bde0-b9fda43beb4d', '8411aebb-97d9-5f7f-ae0f-bca133fb535d', 'privatization', '/ˌpraɪvətaɪˈzeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Quá trình chuyển giao quyền sở hữu từ nhà nước sang tư nhân.', 'the act of changing a business or industry from being owned by the government to private ownership.', 'The privatization of public services often sparks heated debate.', 'Việc tư nhân hóa các dịch vụ công thường gây ra những cuộc tranh luận gay gắt.', '{\"en\": \"The government announced the privatization of the national railway system to improve overall service efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã công bố việc tư nhân hóa hệ thống đường sắt quốc gia để cải thiện hiệu quả dịch vụ tổng thể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-ljspeech-ebc68bf5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-cori-ebc68bf5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/privatization-e82aabd1.webp', '[\"denationalization\"]', '[\"nationalization\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"full privatization\", \"meaning\": \"tư nhân hóa hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lead to privatization\", \"meaning\": \"dẫn đến tư nhân hóa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"private\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-cori-ebc68bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru0-ebc68bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru5-ebc68bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru6-ebc68bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru10-ebc68bf5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru9-ebc68bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru3-ebc68bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privatization-aru7-ebc68bf5.mp3