('d09738cb-520c-5710-b5f3-48625887ddac', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '48ce5f7b-e31f-53ea-8da5-975faee5ae49', 'f8e2a09a-0226-554a-aed9-fafebe821713', 'hail', '/heɪl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Những viên đá nhỏ rơi từ trên trời xuống, mưa đá.', 'Frozen precipitation that falls in solid pellets of ice during severe weather conditions.', 'A sudden storm brought heavy rain and large hail that damaged the crops.', 'Một cơn bão bất ngờ đã mang theo mưa lớn và mưa đá to làm hỏng mùa màng.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck was delayed because heavy hail made the roads too dangerous to drive.\", \"vi\": \"Xe giao hàng bị trễ vì mưa đá lớn khiến đường sá quá nguy hiểm để lái xe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-ljspeech-71cd3baa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-cori-71cd3baa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hail-385d5da2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy hail\", \"meaning\": \"mưa đá lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hail storm\", \"meaning\": \"trận mưa đá\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-cori-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru0-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru5-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru6-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru10-71cd3baa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru9-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru3-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru7-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru8-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru2-71cd3baa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-ljspeech-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt408-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/stor