('9fa61c85-e8d6-5867-8c5c-35c20bc8dbad', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '48ce5f7b-e31f-53ea-8da5-975faee5ae49', 'f8e2a09a-0226-554a-aed9-fafebe821713', 'alike', '/əˈlaɪk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Tương tự hoặc giống nhau ở một khía cạnh nào đó.', 'very similar to each other in appearance, character, or behavior.', 'The two sisters look very much alike, though they are not twins.', 'Hai chị em trông rất giống nhau, mặc dù họ không phải là sinh đôi.', '{\"en\": \"The two office buildings are alike in design but differ in size.\", \"vi\": \"Hai tòa nhà văn phòng giống nhau về thiết kế nhưng khác nhau về kích thước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-ljspeech-b79634d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-cori-b79634d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alike-ef77ad5c.webp', '[\"similar\", \"identical\", \"resembling\"]', '[\"different\", \"dissimilar\", \"unlike\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look alike\", \"meaning\": \"trông giống nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shareholders and employees alike\", \"meaning\": \"cả cổ đông lẫn nhân viên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"like\", \"note_vi\": \"like đứng trước danh từ, alike đứng sau động từ liên kết\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"likeness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-cori-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru0-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru5-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru6-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru10-b79634d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru9-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru3-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru7-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru8-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub