('473b7848-a31c-5098-978b-6d2f34335dd6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'internship', 'UK: /ˈɪntɜːnʃɪp/ | US: /ˈɪntɜrnˌʃɪp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'kỳ thực tập', 'A period of temporary work experience offered by an organization for a student or graduate.', 'She completed a summer internship at a marketing firm.', 'Cô ấy đã hoàn thành kỳ thực tập hè tại một công ty tiếp thị.', '{\"en\": \"After successfully completing her internship, she was offered a full-time contract.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi hoàn thành xuất sắc kỳ thực tập, cô ấy đã được đề nghị một hợp đồng chính thức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-ljspeech-d543318b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-cori-d543318b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/internship-0f3346ca.webp', '[\"practicum\", \"training period\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"internship program\", \"meaning\": \"chương trình thực tập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complete an internship\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn thành kỳ thực tập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intern\", \"note_vi\": \"Intern chỉ người thực tập, internship chỉ đợt/chương trình thực tập.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intern\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-cori-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru0-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru5-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru6-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru10-d543318b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru9-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru3-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru7-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru8-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-aru2-d543318b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-ljspeech-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt408-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt138-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt624-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt396-d543318b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt498-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt132-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt288-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt42-d543318b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internship-lt90-d543318b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Internship\' là khoảng thời gian/chương trình thực tập, khác với \'intern\' là người thực tập.', 'human resources', 1, 15),
('149a2069-0243-5414-ab09-878a2b004215', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'grief', '/ɡriːf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nỗi buồn sâu sắc, thường do mất mát.', 'a feeling of extreme sadness, especially when someone you love dies.', 'She found it hard to cope with the immense grief after losing her beloved pet.', 'Cô ấy thấy khó mà vượt qua nỗi đau buồn vô hạn sau khi mất đi thú cưng yêu quý.', '{\"en\": \"The company offered counseling services to help employees cope with their grief after the tragedy.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã cung cấp dịch vụ tư vấn để giúp nhân viên vượt qua nỗi đau buồn sau thảm kịch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-ljspeech-ef3d624e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-cori-ef3d624e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grief-c5f0889c.webp', '[\"sadness\", \"sorrow\", \"misery\"]', '[\"joy\", \"happiness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overcome grief\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua nỗi đau buồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep grief\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi buồn sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"grieve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"grievous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-cori-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru0-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru5-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru6-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru10-ef3d624e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru9-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru3-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru7-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru8-ef3d624e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grief-aru2-ef