('039cb809-a12e-5f81-89c3-0c2e06df076a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'anonymous', '/əˈnɒnɪməs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không tiết lộ tên hoặc danh tính của mình.', 'having a name that is not known or not made public.', 'Employees can complete the annual workplace survey using an anonymous online form.', 'Nhân viên có thể hoàn thành khảo sát nơi làm việc hàng năm bằng biểu mẫu trực tuyến ẩn danh.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can submit anonymous feedback about the workplace environment through the online portal.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể gửi phản hồi ẩn danh về môi trường làm việc thông qua cổng thông tin trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-ljspeech-0a92fab3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-cori-0a92fab3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anonymous-d8108085.webp', '[\"unnamed\", \"unidentified\"]', '[\"identified\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anonymous donor\", \"meaning\": \"người quyên góp ẩn danh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"anonymous source\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn tin ẩn danh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anonymity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-cori-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru0-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru5-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru6-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru10-0a92fab3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru9-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru3-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru7-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru8-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-aru2-0a92fab3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-ljspeech-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt408-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt138-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt624-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt396-0a92fab3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt498-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt132-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt288-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt42-0a92fab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anonymous-lt90-0a92fab3.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'an-\' nghĩa là không, \'onym\' nghĩa là tên.', 'office', 1, 24),
('c31cf806-8380-570a-aa1e-8721bcf35d57', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'landlord', '/ˈlændlɔːd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người sở hữu và cho thuê nhà hoặc đất.', 'a person who rents a building, room, or land to another person.', 'Our landlord is very responsive and quickly fixes any issues in the apartment.', 'Chủ nhà của chúng tôi rất nhiệt tình và nhanh chóng khắc phục mọi vấn đề trong căn hộ.', '{\"en\": \"The company negotiated with the landlord to extend the office lease for three years.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thương lượng với chủ nhà để gia hạn hợp đồng thuê văn phòng thêm ba năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-ljspeech-3a3c2036.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-cori-3a3c2036.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/landlord-b1d9b177.webp', '[\"property owner\", \"lessor\"]', '[\"tenant\", \"renter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commercial landlord\", \"meaning\": \"chủ cho thuê bất động sản thương mại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contact the landlord\", \"meaning\": \"liên hệ chủ nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tenant\", \"note_vi\": \"landlord là chủ nhà (cho thuê), tenant là người thuê nhà.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-cori-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru0-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru5-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru6-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru10-3a3c2036.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru9-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru3-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru7-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru8-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-aru2-3a3c2036.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-ljspeech-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt408-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt138-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt624-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt396-3a3c2036.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt498-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt132-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt288-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt42-3a3c2036.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/landlord-lt90-3a3c2036.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt landlord (chủ nhà cho thuê) và tenant (người thuê).', 'housing', 1, 25),
('8038b983-bb4d-561b-a098-9ea385bf6de6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'buddy', '/ˈbʌdi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một người bạn thân thiết, đồng đội.', 'a person that you spend a lot of time with and have a friendly relationship.', 'My old buddy from college is coming to visit me next weekend.', 'Người bạn thân cũ của tôi từ thời đại học sẽ đến thăm tôi cuối tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"I met my old work buddy at the industry conference in Chicago last week.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi đã gặp người đồng nghiệp cũ của mình tại hội nghị ngành ở Chicago tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-ljspeech-efc6b7d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-cori-efc6b7d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buddy-299a9137.webp', '[\"friend\", \"companion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"work buddy\", \"meaning\": \"đồng nghiệp thân thiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"best buddy\", \"meaning\": \"bạn thân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-cori-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru0-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru5-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru6-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru10-efc6b7d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru9-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru3-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru7-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru8-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-aru2-efc6b7d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-ljspeech-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buddy-lt408-efc6b7d6.mp3\", \"