('caa5b812-fd89-5c35-93c8-908520b8353d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'resemble', '/rɪˈzembl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Trông hoặc có vẻ giống ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'to look like or be similar to another person, object, or situation.', 'The new building closely resembles the old one that was destroyed in the fire.', 'Tòa nhà mới rất giống với tòa nhà cũ đã bị phá hủy trong trận hỏa hoạn.', '{\"en\": \"The prototype of the new smartphone model closely resembles the previous generation\'s design.\", \"vi\": \"Mẫu thử nghiệm của điện thoại thông minh mới rất giống với thiết kế của thế hệ trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-ljspeech-25cbac59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-cori-25cbac59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resemble-39220eb3.webp', '[\"look like\", \"take after\", \"mirror\"]', '[\"differ from\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"closely resemble\", \"meaning\": \"rất giống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bear a strong resemblance to\", \"meaning\": \"có sự giống nhau mạnh mẽ với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assemble\", \"note_vi\": \"resemble nghĩa là giống nhau, assemble nghĩa là lắp ráp hoặc tập hợp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"resemblance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-cori-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru0-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru5-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru6-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru10-25cbac59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru9-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru3-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru7-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru8-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-aru2-25cbac59.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-ljspeech-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt408-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt138-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt624-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt396-25cbac59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt498-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt132-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt288-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt42-25cbac59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resemble-lt90-25cbac59.mp3\"]}}', 'Resemble là ngoại động từ, đi thẳng với tân ngữ (không dùng resemble to/with).', 'technology', 1, 27),
('17953308-afd6-58bb-bd74-a21b7404b98e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'transparent', '/trænsˈpærənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Trong suốt, có thể nhìn xuyên qua; hoặc minh bạch, rõ ràng.', 'easy to see through; or open and easy to understand without hidden information.', 'The glass was so clean it looked almost transparent, as if there was no barrier at all.', 'Tấm kính sạch đến mức gần như trong suốt, như thể không có bất kỳ rào cản nào.', '{\"en\": \"The new management adopted a transparent policy on employee promotions and salaries.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý mới áp dụng chính sách minh bạch về thăng chức và lương nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-ljspeech-038e6f38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-cori-038e6f38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transparent-3d7cffb1.webp', '[\"clear\", \"open\", \"honest\"]', '[\"opaque\", \"secretive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"transparent process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình minh bạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transparent communication\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp rõ ràng, cởi mở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transparent material\", \"meaning\": \"vật liệu trong suốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"translucent\", \"note_vi\": \"translucent chỉ cho ánh sáng qua mờ, không nhìn rõ như transparent\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"transparency\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"transparently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-cori-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru0-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru5-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru6-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru10-038e6f38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru9-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru3-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru7-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru8-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-aru2-038e6f38.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-ljspeech-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt408-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt138-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt624-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt396-038e6f38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt498-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt132-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt288-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt42-038e6f38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparent-lt90-038e6f38.mp3\"]}}', 'transparent có hai nghĩa: vật lý (trong suốt) và nghĩa bóng (minh bạch); trong TOEIC thường gặp nghĩa minh bạch.', 'office', 1, 28),
('6ca5b881-35eb-5afd-b043-3264edb20436', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4a790630-448d-543f-8836-0a3e860b6e11', '2b023f44-d97b-5f34-bef7-23fbc84cc31e', 'missile', '/ˈmɪsaɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Vũ khí tự đẩy, có điều khiển hoặc không điều khiển, dùng để tấn công mục tiêu.', 'a weapon that can fly over long distances and explode on target.', 'The country\'s defense system is designed to intercept incoming missiles.', 'Hệ thống phòng thủ của quốc gia được thiết kế để chặn các tên lửa đang đến.', '{\"en\": \"The defense contractor won a lucrative government contract to supply advanced missile systems.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu quốc phòng đã giành được hợp đồng béo bở của chính phủ để cung cấp các hệ thống tên lửa tiên tiến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-ljspeech-520b856d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-cori-520b856d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/missile-840cba5d.webp', '[\"rocket\", \"projectile\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"guided missile\", \"meaning\": \"tên lửa có điều hướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"missile system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống tên lửa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mission\", \"note_vi\": \"Missile là tên lửa (vũ khí), mission là nhiệm vụ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-cori-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru0-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru5-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru6-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru10-520b856d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru9-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru3-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru7-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru8-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-aru2-520b856d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-ljspeech-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt408-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt138-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt624-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt396-520b856d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt498-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt132-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt288-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt42-520b856d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/missile-lt90-520b856d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với mission (nhiệm vụ, sứ mệnh).', 'other', 1, 29),
('9e4ab361-cb85-53d7-b31a-7833de04f416', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4e58d36e-4db3-58bb-bc0f-0ba698815db4', 'f7d2898d-cfc0-5345-9da8-389f2d0431f4', 'mistakenly', 'UK: /mɪˈsteɪkənli/ | US: /mɪˈsteɪkənli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách nhầm lẫn', 'In a way that involves an error or incorrect judgment.', 'She mistakenly sent the email to the wrong client.', 'Cô ấy đã nhầm lẫn gửi email cho nhầm khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting department mistakenly billed the client twice for the same invoice.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận kế toán đã nhầm lẫn tính tiền khách hàng hai lần cho cùng một hóa đơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-ljspeech-ffcd79b8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-cori-ffcd79b8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mistakenly-c3271415.webp', '[\"erroneously\", \"by mistake\", \"accidentally\", \"incorrectly\"]', '[\"correctly\", \"intentionally\", \"accurately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mistakenly send\", \"meaning\": \"gửi nhầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mistakenly charge\", \"meaning\": \"tính tiền nhầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intentionally\", \"note_vi\": \"Intentionally là cố ý, trái ngược với mistakenly (làm sai do nhầm lẫn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mistake\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mistaken\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mistake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-cori-ffcd79b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-aru0-ffcd79b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-aru5-ffcd79b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-aru6-ffcd79b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-aru10-ffcd79b8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-aru9-ffcd79b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistakenly-aru3-ffcd79b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje