('7b4f4d79-ed7c-5d13-b762-6e9bda8ad536', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4e58d36e-4db3-58bb-bc0f-0ba698815db4', 'f7d2898d-cfc0-5345-9da8-389f2d0431f4', 'utterly', '/ˈʌtəli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Hoàn toàn, tuyệt đối.', 'completely and without any doubt, often used to emphasize a negative quality.', 'The new policy was utterly rejected by the public.', 'Chính sách mới đã bị công chúng bác bỏ hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The proposed changes to the vacation policy were utterly confusing to most of the staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Những thay đổi được đề xuất đối với chính sách nghỉ phép hoàn toàn gây bối rối cho hầu hết các nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-ljspeech-4ced1e69.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-cori-4ced1e69.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/utterly-9d294592.webp', '[\"completely\", \"totally\", \"absolutely\"]', '[\"partially\", \"slightly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"utterly ridiculous\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn nực cười\"}, {\"phrase\": \"utterly impossible\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn không thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"utterly different\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn khác biệt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"utter\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"utter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-cori-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru0-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru5-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru6-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru10-4ced1e69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru9-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru3-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru7-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru8-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-aru2-4ced1e69.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-ljspeech-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt408-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt138-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt624-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt396-4ced1e69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt498-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt132-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt288-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt42-4ced1e69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utterly-lt90-4ced1e69.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để nhấn mạnh các tính từ mang nghĩa tiêu cực hoặc cực đoan.', 'office', 1, 5),
('b505493a-0e88-57a4-98a9-baee15734d25', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4e58d36e-4db3-58bb-bc0f-0ba698815db4', 'f7d2898d-cfc0-5345-9da8-389f2d0431f4', 'exceptional', '/ɪkˈsepʃənl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất đặc biệt, xuất sắc hoặc vượt trội.', 'much better than average, showing unusual and outstanding ability or quality.', 'Her exceptional talent for music was evident from a very young age.', 'Tài năng âm nhạc xuất chúng của cô ấy đã thể hiện rõ từ khi còn rất nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The board praised the marketing team for their exceptional performance this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã khen ngợi đội ngũ tiếp thị vì hiệu suất xuất sắc của họ trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-ljspeech-f8157a88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-cori-f8157a88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exceptional-901d1ea5.webp', '[\"outstanding\", \"extraordinary\", \"superb\"]', '[\"ordinary\", \"average\", \"mediocre\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exceptional service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ xuất sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exceptional talent\", \"meaning\": \"tài năng kiệt xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exceptional circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"trường hợp ngoại lệ đặc biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"acceptable\", \"note_vi\": \"acceptable là có thể chấp nhận được, exceptional là xuất sắc vượt trội\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exception\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"exceptionally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-cori-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru0-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru5-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru6-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru10-f8157a88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru9-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru3-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru7-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru8-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-aru2-f8157a88.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-ljspeech-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt408-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt138-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt624-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt396-f8157a88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt498-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt132-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt288-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt42-f8157a88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exceptional-lt90-f8157a88.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang nghĩa tích cực (xuất sắc), bắt nguồn từ \'exception\' (ngoại lệ).', 'hr', 1, 6),
('2a122578-c459-5364-891b-1633f1fd42ae', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4e58d36e-4db3-58bb-bc0f-0ba698815db4', 'f7d2898d-cfc0-5345-9da8-389f2d0431f4', 'vein', '/veɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mạch máu mang máu về tim; mạch khoáng sản.', 'a tube that carries blood to the heart, or a narrow layer of a substance underground.', 'The nurse found a suitable vein to draw blood from.', 'Y tá tìm thấy một tĩnh mạch phù hợp để lấy máu.', '{\"en\": \"The mining company discovered a rich vein of silver during their recent exploration in the mountains.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khai thác mỏ đã phát hiện ra một mạch bạc phong phú trong chuyến thám hiểm gần đây của họ trên núi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-ljspeech-9c795e6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-cori-9c795e6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vein-26ed127a.webp', '[\"blood vessel\", \"seam\", \"lode\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in the same vein\", \"meaning\": \"theo cùng một cách/chủ đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rich vein\", \"meaning\": \"mạch (khoáng sản) dồi dào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vain\", \"note_vi\": \"kiêu ngạo hoặc vô ích (in vain), phát âm giống hệt\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-cori-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru0-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru5-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru6-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru10-9c795e6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru9-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru3-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru7-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru8-9c795e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vein-aru2-9c795e6a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st