('bf949e70-846f-5eb0-8c47-e417cb17adf1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4e58d36e-4db3-58bb-bc0f-0ba698815db4', 'f7d2898d-cfc0-5345-9da8-389f2d0431f4', 'headquarters', 'UK: /ˈhɛdˌkwɔːtəz/ | US: /ˈhɛdˌkwɔːrtərz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'trụ sở chính', 'The main administrative center or central office from which an organization is controlled.', 'The company\'s headquarters are located downtown.', 'Trụ sở chính của công ty nằm ở trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate headquarters will be relocated to Tokyo early next year.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở chính của tập đoàn sẽ được chuyển đến Tokyo vào đầu năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-ljspeech-66fe0da6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-cori-66fe0da6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/headquarters-17f6fe6f.webp', '[\"head office\", \"main office\", \"central office\"]', '[\"branch\", \"subsidiary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate headquarters\", \"meaning\": \"trụ sở chính của tập đoàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"headquarters location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí trụ sở chính\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-cori-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru0-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru5-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru6-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru10-66fe0da6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru9-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru3-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru7-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru8-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-aru2-66fe0da6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-ljspeech-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt408-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt138-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt624-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt396-66fe0da6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt498-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt132-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt288-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt42-66fe0da6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headquarters-lt90-66fe0da6.mp3\"]}}', '\'Headquarters\' luôn có \'s\' ở cuối dù là số ít hay số nhiều (viết tắt phổ biến là HQ).', 'company', 1, 9),
('54a41152-e366-57c8-8d73-c94ec33262cf', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '4e58d36e-4db3-58bb-bc0f-0ba698815db4', 'f7d2898d-cfc0-5345-9da8-389f2d0431f4', 'contention', '/kənˈtenʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự bất đồng hoặc tranh luận về một vấn đề.', 'anger or disagreement between people who argue about something.', 'The main point of contention in the debate was the budget allocation for public services.', 'Điểm tranh cãi chính trong cuộc tranh luận là việc phân bổ ngân sách cho các dịch vụ công cộng.', '{\"en\": \"The main point of contention during the meeting was the new office policy.\", \"vi\": \"Điểm tranh cãi chính trong cuộc họp là chính sách văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-ljspeech-f08d0c59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-cori-f08d0c59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contention-b1de9df8.webp', '[\"disagreement\", \"dispute\", \"conflict\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"harmony\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"point of contention\", \"meaning\": \"điểm tranh cãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bone of contention\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên nhân gây tranh cãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contentment\", \"note_vi\": \"contentment nghĩa là sự hài lòng, mãn nguyện.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"contend\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"contentious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-cori-f08d0c59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-aru0-f08d0c59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-aru5-f08d0c59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-aru6-f08d0c59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-aru10-f08d0c59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-aru9-f08d0c59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contention-aru3-f08d0c59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/