('1d2622bc-b36f-5245-ad3a-67098356b71a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '51244b8a-7dbe-587c-b492-4942b8ebf192', 'f85c9ee5-48ea-56aa-9298-6c5c4ef38c37', 'expertise', 'UK: /ˌɛkspɜːˈtiːz/ | US: /ˌɛkspərˈtiːz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'kiến thức chuyên môn, kinh nghiệm chuyên sâu', 'high level of practical skill or specialized knowledge in a particular field.', 'Our team offers expertise in digital marketing strategies.', 'Nhóm của chúng tôi cung cấp kiến thức chuyên môn về các chiến lược tiếp thị kỹ thuật số.', '{\"en\": \"Her technical expertise was essential in completing the software project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến thức chuyên môn kỹ thuật của cô ấy rất quan trọng trong việc hoàn thành dự án phần mềm đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-ljspeech-b389d89c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-cori-b389d89c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expertise-4d3ab240.webp', '[\"know-how\", \"proficiency\", \"skill\"]', '[\"incompetence\", \"inexperience\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"area of expertise\", \"meaning\": \"lĩnh vực chuyên môn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"technical expertise\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên môn kỹ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expert\", \"note_vi\": \"Expert là chuyên gia (người), còn expertise là kỹ năng chuyên môn (danh từ không đếm được).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expert\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"expert\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-cori-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru0-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru5-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru6-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru10-b389d89c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru9-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru3-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru7-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru8-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-aru2-b389d89c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-ljspeech-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt408-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt138-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt624-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt396-b389d89c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt498-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt132-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt288-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt42-b389d89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expertise-lt90-b389d89c.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ không đếm được. Thường dùng trong các cụm như \'technical expertise\' hoặc \'area of expertise\'.', 'business', 1, 29),
('996705c4-e581-5031-96e8-52002a870da7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '51b5b4f5-ce1e-52d5-8b93-212c5f721df6', '9ad55d95-df7b-59de-b184-9729d0780819', 'specimen', '/ˈspesɪmən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mẫu vật, vật mẫu (dùng để nghiên cứu, trưng bày).', 'a single item or part taken from a group to be studied or shown to others.', 'The museum has a rare butterfly specimen collected from the Amazon.', 'Bảo tàng có một mẫu bướm quý hiếm được thu thập từ Amazon.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory technician carefully analyzed the blood specimen before sending the report to the doctor.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phòng thí nghiệm đã phân tích cẩn thận mẫu máu trước khi gửi báo cáo cho bác sĩ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-ljspeech-e28ae40d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-cori-e28ae40d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/specimen-9b9103a2.webp', '[\"sample\", \"example\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"test specimen\", \"meaning\": \"mẫu thử nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"collect a specimen\", \"meaning\": \"thu thập mẫu vật\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-cori-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru0-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru5-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru6-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru10-e28ae40d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru9-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru3-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru7-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru8-e28ae40d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specimen-aru2-e28ae40d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sp