('758a64d1-b3e2-53b3-bfab-8961d5cfbb29', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '51f4441b-e8bf-5972-9860-1100ea64fdb7', '91bf1e19-74d1-5008-a872-f772f660cd83', 'ash', '/æʃ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phần còn lại dạng bột của một vật đã cháy.', 'Powdery residue left behind when organic material or substance undergoes complete combustion.', 'After the campfire burned out, only a pile of white ash was left.', 'Sau khi đống lửa trại tàn, chỉ còn lại một đống tro trắng.', '{\"en\": \"The cleaner swept the ash from the fireplace in the hotel lobby.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên dọn dẹp quét lớp tro từ lò sưởi ở sảnh khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-ljspeech-cb101192.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-cori-cb101192.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ash-939255b6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cigarette ash\", \"meaning\": \"tro thuốc lá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"volcanic ash\", \"meaning\": \"tro núi lửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ash pile\", \"meaning\": \"đống tro\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cash\", \"note_vi\": \"cash là tiền mặt, không liên quan tro.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ashen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-cori-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru0-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru5-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru6-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru10-cb101192.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru9-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru3-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru7-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru8-cb101192.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash-aru2-cb101192.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ash