('9158785f-5721-5eea-ad4d-dc9a2997795a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '51f4441b-e8bf-5972-9860-1100ea64fdb7', '91bf1e19-74d1-5008-a872-f772f660cd83', 'replacement', '/rɪˈpleɪsmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thay thế hoặc người/vật thay thế.', 'a person or thing that takes the place of another one.', 'The human resources department is searching for a qualified replacement for the retiring director.', 'Bộ phận nhân sự đang tìm kiếm một sự thay thế đủ năng lực cho vị giám đốc sắp nghỉ hưu.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department is actively looking for a replacement for the retired manager.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự đang tích cực tìm kiếm người thay thế cho vị quản lý đã nghỉ hưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-ljspeech-91b5c0a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-cori-91b5c0a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/replacement-5951d80c.webp', '[\"substitute\", \"successor\", \"alternative\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"find a replacement\", \"meaning\": \"tìm người/vật thay thế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"replacement part\", \"meaning\": \"linh kiện thay thế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"replace\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"replaceable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-cori-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru0-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru5-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru6-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru10-91b5c0a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru9-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru3-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru7-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru8-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-aru2-91b5c0a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-ljspeech-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt408-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt138-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt624-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt396-91b5c0a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt498-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt132-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt288-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt42-91b5c0a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replacement-lt90-91b5c0a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Replacement vừa chỉ hành động thay thế, vừa chỉ người hoặc vật thay thế.', 'hr', 1, 24),
('9305dda1-94ab-505d-a13e-9d47186d14c7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '51f4441b-e8bf-5972-9860-1100ea64fdb7', '91bf1e19-74d1-5008-a872-f772f660cd83', 'parish', '/ˈpærɪʃ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Giáo xứ, một khu vực thuộc quyền quản lý của một nhà thờ.', 'an area that has its own church and a priest or minister.', 'Our local church serves a large parish that covers several neighborhoods.', 'Nhà thờ địa phương của chúng tôi phục vụ một giáo xứ lớn bao gồm nhiều khu dân cư.', '{\"en\": \"The local parish council organized a charity event to support the community center.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng giáo xứ địa phương đã tổ chức một sự kiện từ thiện để hỗ trợ trung tâm cộng đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-ljspeech-9ac61bf1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-cori-9ac61bf1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/parish-61b2e23e.webp', '[\"district\", \"community\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"parish church\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thờ giáo xứ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"parish priest\", \"meaning\": \"linh mục giáo xứ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"perish\", \"note_vi\": \"perish là động từ nghĩa là diệt vong, tàn lụi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"parishioner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-cori-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru0-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru5-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru6-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru10-9ac61bf1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru9-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru3-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru7-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parish-aru8-9ac61bf1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/