('1e9531f9-587c-5a26-9014-7a59f6100783', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '56008906-8741-5527-85f9-e370803ed4f2', '67af5de2-064d-5d53-ab87-037cb72d681d', 'custody', '/ˈkʌstədi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Quyền nuôi dưỡng và chăm sóc trẻ em.', 'the legal right to take care of and make decisions for a child.', 'After the divorce, the parents shared joint custody of their children.', 'Sau khi ly hôn, cha mẹ chia sẻ quyền nuôi con chung.', '{\"en\": \"The court granted sole custody of the child to the mother after the trial.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa án đã trao quyền nuôi con duy nhất cho người mẹ sau phiên tòa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-ljspeech-bb610c5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-cori-bb610c5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/custody-aa8b0683.webp', '[\"guardianship\", \"care\", \"keeping\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"joint custody\", \"meaning\": \"chung quyền nuôi con\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sole custody\", \"meaning\": \"quyền nuôi con duy nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take custody\", \"meaning\": \"nhận quyền chăm sóc/giam giữ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"custom\", \"note_vi\": \"Custom là phong tục hoặc hải quan, không liên quan đến custody.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"custodian\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"custodial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-cori-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru0-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru5-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru6-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru10-bb610c5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru9-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru3-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru7-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/