('3ca8b6c8-6775-53b5-aede-0876f1ed65f2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '59597962-9c44-5a51-ae44-5c9a4e066dca', '0b8d437e-fd57-5125-a152-1b4a7522e330', 'flesh', '/fleʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phần thịt mềm của cơ thể người hoặc động vật; phần cùi của quả.', 'the soft part of a person or animal that is between the bones.', 'The doctor examined the wound, noting that the flesh was healing well.', 'Bác sĩ kiểm tra vết thương, nhận thấy phần thịt đang lành tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The food safety inspector checked the quality of the fresh flesh of the imported fish.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra an toàn thực phẩm đã kiểm tra chất lượng phần thịt tươi của cá nhập khẩu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-ljspeech-3496ae53.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-cori-3496ae53.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flesh-1914afea.webp', '[\"meat\", \"muscle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh flesh\", \"meaning\": \"thịt tươi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-cori-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru0-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru5-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru6-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru10-3496ae53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru9-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru3-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru7-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru8-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru2-3496ae53.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-ljspeech-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt408-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt138-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt624-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt396-3496ae53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt498-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt132-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt288-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt42-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt90-3496ae53.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh thực phẩm hoặc y tế.', 'dining', 1, 23),
('11ef4522-36fe-5d06-99fc-d9253c669639', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '59597962-9c44-5a51-ae44-5c9a4e066dca', '0b8d437e-fd57-5125-a152-1b4a7522e330', 'consent', '/kənˈsent/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự cho phép hoặc đồng thuận để điều gì đó xảy ra.', 'official permission or agreement given by someone in authority for something to happen or be done.', 'The doctor cannot perform the operation without the patient\'s written consent.', 'Bác sĩ không thể thực hiện phẫu thuật nếu không có sự đồng ý bằng văn bản của bệnh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The medical center requires written consent from patients before conducting any major surgical procedure.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm y tế yêu cầu sự đồng ý bằng văn bản từ bệnh nhân trước khi tiến hành bất kỳ ca phẫu thuật lớn nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-ljspeech-15b61788.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-cori-15b61788.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consent-1fcf55bd.webp', '[\"permission\", \"agreement\", \"approval\"]', '[\"refusal\", \"denial\", \"disapproval\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"written consent\", \"meaning\": \"sự đồng ý bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prior consent\", \"meaning\": \"sự đồng ý trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"content\", \"note_vi\": \"content là nội dung hoặc hài lòng, khác với consent là sự đồng ý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-cori-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru0-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru5-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru6-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru10-15b61788.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru9-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru3-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru7-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru8-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru2-15b61788.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-ljspeech-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt408-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt138-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt624-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt396-15b61788.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt498-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt132-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt288-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt42-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt90-15b61788.mp3\"]}}', '\'Written consent\' (sự đồng ý bằng văn bản) là cụm từ rất hay xuất hiện trong hợp đồng TOEIC.', 'law', 1, 24),
('3703cc6d-66dc-5417-b89c-58f7c199476f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '59597962-9c44-5a51-ae44-5c9a4e066dca', '0b8d437e-fd57-5125-a152-1b4a7522e330', 'suspicion', '/səˈspɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác nghi ngờ, không tin tưởng ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'a feeling that someone May be guilty or something is wrong.', 'The security guard viewed the unattended bag with deep suspicion and called the police.', 'Nhân viên bảo vệ nhìn chiếc túi không ai quản lý với sự nghi ngờ sâu sắc và đã gọi cảnh sát.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s suspicion arose after noticing discrepancies in the financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Sự nghi ngờ của quản lý nảy sinh sau khi thấy sai sót trong báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-ljspeech-15f3df9e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-cori-15f3df9e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suspicion-7c16407d.webp', '[\"doubt\", \"mistrust\"]', '[\"trust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"under suspicion\", \"meaning\": \"bị nghi ngờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arouse suspicion\", \"meaning\": \"gây nghi ngờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suspicion of fraud\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ gian lận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"suspense\", \"note_vi\": \"suspense là sự hồi hộp, không phải nghi ngờ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"suspect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suspicious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-cori-15f3df9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-aru0-15f3df9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-aru5-15f3df9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-aru6-15f3df9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-aru10-15f3df9e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-aru9-15f3df9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspicion-aru3-15f3df9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o