('d7c52062-a304-5538-96a3-73e707a737d4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '59597962-9c44-5a51-ae44-5c9a4e066dca', '0b8d437e-fd57-5125-a152-1b4a7522e330', 'misery', '/ˈmɪzəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng đau khổ, bất hạnh cùng cực.', 'a state of extreme unhappiness or physical suffering that lasts for a long time.', 'The war brought nothing but misery and destruction to the region.', 'Cuộc chiến không mang lại gì ngoài đau khổ và sự tàn phá cho khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The poor management caused misery for the staff, leading to high turnover rates.\", \"vi\": \"Sự quản lý tồi tệ đã gây ra sự đau khổ cho nhân viên, dẫn đến tỷ lệ nghỉ việc cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-ljspeech-f40b6f1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-cori-f40b6f1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/misery-9610b6d6.webp', '[\"distress\", \"suffering\"]', '[\"happiness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"human misery\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi khổ của con người\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep misery\", \"meaning\": \"sự đau khổ sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"miserable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-cori-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru0-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru5-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru6-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru10-f40b6f1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru9-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru3-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru7-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru8-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru2-f40b6f1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/