('9f4f755d-17d7-508b-9b83-bb2ce64d7e38', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '5a4fefda-514c-5dcf-9f53-66ec9e7264f3', 'bc998eee-ed4b-5653-a198-63dc3469a329', 'minimize', '/ˈmɪnɪmaɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Giảm đến mức tối thiểu, làm cho nhỏ nhất.', 'to make something as small or as little as possible in order to save resources.', 'We need to minimize the risks associated with this new project.', 'Chúng ta cần giảm thiểu rủi ro liên quan đến dự án mới này.', '{\"en\": \"Our primary goal is to minimize operational costs while maintaining the quality of our services.\", \"vi\": \"Mục tiêu chính của chúng tôi là giảm thiểu chi phí vận hành trong khi vẫn duy trì chất lượng dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-ljspeech-0c3639c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-cori-0c3639c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/minimize-37a1956b.webp', '[\"reduce\", \"decrease\"]', '[\"maximize\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"minimize risk\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minimize impact\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu tác động\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"minimal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"minimum\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-cori-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru0-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru5-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru6-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru10-0c3639c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru9-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru3-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru7-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru8-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/