('3e903dea-6652-524d-9849-5172668ed4bf', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '5a4fefda-514c-5dcf-9f53-66ec9e7264f3', 'bc998eee-ed4b-5653-a198-63dc3469a329', 'eternal', '/ɪˈtɜːnl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tồn tại mãi mãi, không có điểm dừng.', 'lasting forever or for a very long time without changing or ending.', 'Many cultures believe in the concept of an eternal soul.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa tin vào khái niệm linh hồn bất diệt.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to build eternal relationships with its clients based on mutual trust.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đặt mục tiêu xây dựng mối quan hệ lâu dài mãi mãi với khách hàng dựa trên sự tin tưởng lẫn nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-ljspeech-2162c6ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-cori-2162c6ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eternal-7448c442.webp', '[\"everlasting\", \"perpetual\", \"endless\"]', '[\"temporary\", \"finite\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eternal flame\", \"meaning\": \"ngọn lửa vĩnh cửu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eternal youth\", \"meaning\": \"sự trẻ trung vĩnh viễn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"external\", \"note_vi\": \"external nghĩa là bên ngoài, dễ nhầm với eternal là vĩnh cửu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eternity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"eternally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-cori-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru0-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru5-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru6-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru10-2162c6ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru9-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru3-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru7-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru8-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-aru2-2162c6ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-ljspeech-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt408-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt138-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt624-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt396-2162c6ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt498-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt132-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt288-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt42-2162c6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eternal-lt90-2162c6ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy cẩn thận tránh nhầm lẫn mặt chữ giữa \'eternal\' (vĩnh cửu) và \'external\' (bên ngoài).', 'business', 1, 10),
('0d97ae5f-ba6b-5033-969c-e3a2e3c61703', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '5a4fefda-514c-5dcf-9f53-66ec9e7264f3', 'bc998eee-ed4b-5653-a198-63dc3469a329', 'duo', '/ˈdjuːəʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hai người hoặc hai vật hoạt động cùng nhau', 'a pair of people or things that work well together or are closely connected.', 'The musical duo performed a beautiful acoustic set.', 'Bộ đôi âm nhạc đã trình diễn một tiết mục acoustic tuyệt đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The dynamic duo from the marketing department successfully presented the new campaign to clients.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ đôi năng động từ phòng tiếp thị đã trình bày thành công chiến dịch mới cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-ljspeech-16ef1d43.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-cori-16ef1d43.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/duo-d28b29e5.webp', '[\"pair\", \"couple\", \"partnership\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dynamic duo\", \"meaning\": \"bộ đôi năng động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"comedy duo\", \"meaning\": \"bộ đôi hài kịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dual\", \"note_vi\": \"là tính từ mang nghĩa \'kép\', không phải danh từ chỉ người/vật\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-cori-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru0-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru5-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru6-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru10-16ef1d43.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru9-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru3-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru7-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru8-16ef1d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duo-aru2-16ef1d43.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/