('291c52d3-8817-594a-9e10-e19c08957437', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '5a4fefda-514c-5dcf-9f53-66ec9e7264f3', 'bc998eee-ed4b-5653-a198-63dc3469a329', 'irony', '/ˈaɪrəni/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Tình huống hoặc lời nói trái ngược với điều mong đợi, gây ra sự mỉa mai.', 'a situation where the result is the opposite of what you expected to happen.', 'The irony is that he got fired on the day he was supposed to get a promotion.', 'Điều trớ trêu là anh ấy bị sa thải đúng vào ngày đáng lẽ được thăng chức.', '{\"en\": \"There is a clear irony in the fact that the safety officer caused the accident.\", \"vi\": \"Có một sự mỉa mai rõ ràng trong việc nhân viên an toàn lại là người gây ra tai nạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-ljspeech-5f55c737.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-cori-5f55c737.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/irony-99178e82.webp', '[\"paradox\", \"sarcasm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bitter irony\", \"meaning\": \"sự mỉa mai cay đắng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ironic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-cori-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru0-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru5-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru6-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru10-5f55c737.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru9-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru3-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru7-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru8-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-aru2-5f55c737.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irony-ljspeech-5f55c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu