('bdbe9340-3459-50c1-ac8a-9b1da6c8dbe8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '5a4fefda-514c-5dcf-9f53-66ec9e7264f3', 'bc998eee-ed4b-5653-a198-63dc3469a329', 'breakthrough', '/ˈbreɪkθruː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một khám phá hoặc phát triển quan trọng, mang tính cách mạng.', 'an important development or achievement that helps solve a difficult problem or situation.', 'Engineers achieved a technical breakthrough that significantly reduces battery charging time.', 'Các kỹ sư đã đạt được một bước đột phá kỹ thuật giúp giảm đáng kể thời gian sạc pin.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update is a major breakthrough that significantly improves our data processing speed.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới là một bước đột phá lớn giúp cải thiện đáng kể tốc độ xử lý dữ liệu của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-ljspeech-593b158c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-cori-593b158c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breakthrough-52a558e7.webp', '[\"advance\", \"innovation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"major breakthrough\", \"meaning\": \"bước đột phá lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"technological breakthrough\", \"meaning\": \"đột phá công nghệ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-cori-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru0-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru5-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru6-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru10-593b158c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru9-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru3-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru7-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru8-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-aru2-593b158c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-ljspeech-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt408-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt138-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt624-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt396-593b158c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt498-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt132-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt288-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt42-593b158c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakthrough-lt90-593b158c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh đổi mới sáng tạo hoặc khoa học.', 'technology', 1, 13),
('d60849d6-52d4-5ccd-b504-6d0a4b4295a0', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '5a4fefda-514c-5dcf-9f53-66ec9e7264f3', 'bc998eee-ed4b-5653-a198-63dc3469a329', 'supportive', '/səˈpɔːtɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Luôn ủng hộ, động viên và giúp đỡ.', 'providing help, encouragement, or approval to someone who is in a difficult situation.', 'Her family was very supportive during her difficult time, offering constant encouragement.', 'Gia đình cô ấy rất ủng hộ trong khoảng thời gian khó khăn của cô, luôn động viên không ngừng.', '{\"en\": \"The company provides a supportive environment for employees to develop their professional skills.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp một môi trường hỗ trợ để nhân viên phát triển các kỹ năng chuyên môn của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-ljspeech-4ceafbc4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-cori-4ceafbc4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supportive-e2318c1c.webp', '[\"helpful\", \"encouraging\"]', '[\"unsupportive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"supportive environment\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường hỗ trợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supportive role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò hỗ trợ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"support\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-cori-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru0-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru5-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru6-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru10-4ceafbc4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru9-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru3-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru7-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru8-4ceafbc4.m