('cf7363c4-9feb-5d01-b37d-dd4dc3369ea8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'craft', '/krɑːft/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nghề đòi hỏi kỹ năng đặc biệt, thường là làm bằng tay.', 'an activity or job that needs special skill and experience to do well.', 'She learned the craft of pottery from her grandmother.', 'Cô ấy đã học nghề làm gốm từ bà của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The local artisan has mastered the craft of making high-quality furniture for export.\", \"vi\": \"Người thợ thủ công địa phương đã thành thạo nghề làm đồ nội thất chất lượng cao để xuất khẩu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-ljspeech-8e3e95f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-cori-8e3e95f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/craft-38a75b6b.webp', '[\"trade\", \"skill\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"master the craft\", \"meaning\": \"thành thạo nghề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traditional craft\", \"meaning\": \"nghề truyền thống\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"crafty\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"craftsman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-cori-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru0-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru5-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru6-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru10-8e3e95f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru9-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru3-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru7-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru8-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru2-8e3e95f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cra