('f0519210-52ca-5c1d-8378-ab4192b01b10', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'deployment', '/dɪˈplɔɪmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự đưa vào sử dụng hoặc bố trí một hệ thống, quân đội, v.v.', 'the act of putting something into action or using it in an effective way.', 'The successful deployment of the new software improved efficiency across the company.', 'Việc triển khai thành công phần mềm mới đã cải thiện hiệu quả trên toàn công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The deployment of the new security system will start after the final testing phase finishes.\", \"vi\": \"Việc triển khai hệ thống an ninh mới sẽ bắt đầu sau khi giai đoạn kiểm tra kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-ljspeech-7233fb36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-cori-7233fb36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deployment-16cf1fa6.webp', '[\"implementation\", \"installation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"deployment of\", \"meaning\": \"sự triển khai của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful deployment\", \"meaning\": \"sự triển khai thành công\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deploy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-cori-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru0-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru5-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru6-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru10-7233fb36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru9-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru3-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru7-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deployment-aru8-7233fb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec