('244f1821-559c-53a4-bc69-5c85a494db41', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'smash', '/smæʃ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đập vỡ, làm tan nát thành nhiều mảnh.', 'to break something noisily into many small pieces.', 'The tennis player hit the ball with such force, it looked like he would smash it.', 'Cầu thủ quần vợt đánh bóng mạnh đến nỗi trông như thể anh ta sẽ đập nát nó.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery driver accidentally dropped the box and managed to smash the glass cups inside.\", \"vi\": \"Tài xế giao hàng vô tình làm rơi chiếc hộp và làm vỡ tan những chiếc cốc thủy tinh bên trong.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-ljspeech-31fe827a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-cori-31fe827a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/smash-c2428af6.webp', '[\"break\", \"shatter\", \"crush\"]', '[\"mend\", \"repair\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"smash a window\", \"meaning\": \"đập vỡ cửa sổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"smash a record\", \"meaning\": \"phá vỡ kỷ lục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crash\", \"note_vi\": \"Crash là va chạm mạnh, còn smash nhấn mạnh việc vỡ vụn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"smash\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"smashing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-cori-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru0-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru5-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru6-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru10-31fe827a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru9-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru3-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru7-31fe827a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smash-aru8-31fe827a.mp3