('19bab1a2-d19d-5108-8e0c-ab5148e800d5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'restraint', '/rɪˈstreɪnt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự kiềm chế, hạn chế hoặc kiểm soát.', 'the act of controlling your feelings or actions to keep them within reasonable or acceptable limits.', 'The police showed great restraint when dealing with the angry crowd.', 'Cảnh sát đã thể hiện sự kiềm chế lớn khi đối phó với đám đông giận dữ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager showed great restraint by not responding immediately to the client\'s aggressive email message.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã thể hiện sự kiềm chế tuyệt vời bằng cách không phản hồi ngay lập tức email hung hăng của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-ljspeech-6167795c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-cori-6167795c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restraint-2a172727.webp', '[\"self-control\", \"moderation\"]', '[\"impulsiveness\", \"excess\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exercise restraint\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự kiềm chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"show restraint\", \"meaning\": \"cho thấy sự tự chủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"restrain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-cori-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru0-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru5-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru6-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru10-6167795c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru9-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru3-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru7-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru8-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-aru2-6167795c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-ljspeech-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt408-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt138-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt624-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt396-6167795c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt498-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt132-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt288-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt42-6167795c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restraint-lt90-6167795c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong ngữ cảnh chuyên nghiệp để chỉ việc giữ bình tĩnh hoặc kiểm soát chi tiêu.', 'office', 1, 9),
('ad78dffd-2a3e-5da7-8b9b-740aeeee0e9b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'merely', '/ˈmɪəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Chỉ đơn thuần là, không hơn không kém.', 'used to emphasize that something is only what you say and not anything more important.', 'It was merely a suggestion, not a command.', 'Đó chỉ đơn thuần là một gợi ý, không phải là một mệnh lệnh.', '{\"en\": \"The new policy is merely a guideline and does not require strict compliance from employees.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách mới chỉ đơn thuần là một hướng dẫn và không yêu cầu sự tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt từ nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-ljspeech-8d468af9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-cori-8d468af9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/merely-7c809522.webp', '[\"only\", \"simply\", \"just\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"merely a matter of\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ đơn thuần là vấn đề về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"not merely... but also\", \"meaning\": \"không chỉ... mà còn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nearly\", \"note_vi\": \"nearly là gần như, xấp xỉ; merely là chỉ đơn thuần\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mere\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-cori-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru0-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru5-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru6-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru10-8d468af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru9-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru3-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru7-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru8-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-aru2-8d468af9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-ljspeech-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt408-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt138-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt624-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt396-8d468af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt498-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt132-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt288-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt42-8d468af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merely-lt90-8d468af9.mp3\"]}}', 'Merely đồng nghĩa với \'only\' hoặc \'just\' nhưng mang sắc thái trang trọng hơn.', 'office', 1, 10),
('9980ef00-2e84-507f-8acf-eabf76770196', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'distinct', 'UK: /dɪˈstɪŋkt/ | US: /dɪˈstɪŋkt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'riêng biệt, khác biệt', 'clearly separate and noticeable as being different from other things.', 'Each department has distinct responsibilities.', 'Mỗi phòng ban có những trách nhiệm riêng biệt.', '{\"en\": \"There is a distinct difference in price between the standard and premium models.\", \"vi\": \"Có một sự khác biệt rõ rệt về giá giữa phiên bản tiêu chuẩn và phiên bản cao cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-ljspeech-21a08d67.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-cori-21a08d67.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distinct-e23ea845.webp', '[\"clear\", \"definite\", \"noticeable\", \"discrete\"]', '[\"vague\", \"indistinct\", \"similar\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"distinct advantage\", \"meaning\": \"lợi thế rõ rệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distinct impression\", \"meaning\": \"ấn tượng rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"distinctive\", \"note_vi\": \"Distinct = rõ rệt, khác biệt; Distinctive = mang tính đặc trưng, độc đáo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"distinctly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distinction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"distinctive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-cori-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru0-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru5-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru6-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru10-21a08d67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru9-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru3-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru7-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru8-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-aru2-21a08d67.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-ljspeech-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt408-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt138-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt624-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt396-21a08d67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt498-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt132-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt288-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt42-21a08d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinct-lt90-21a08d67.mp3\"]}}', 'Distinct mang nghĩa \'rõ rệt, khác biệt hẳn\' (distinct advantage, distinct difference), khác với distinctive (đặc trưng, làm nên bản sắc).', 'business strategy', 1, 11),
('00f58911-b308-5828-81c2-ff3ee37daca1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'greatly', 'UK: /ˈɡreɪtli/ | US: /ˈɡreɪtli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'rất nhiều, đáng kể', 'to a very large extent or high degree, significantly enhancing or affecting a situation', 'The team\'s efforts greatly contributed to the project\'s success.', 'Những nỗ lực của nhóm đã đóng góp đáng kể vào thành công của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The new software system has greatly improved our team\'s overall productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống phần mềm mới đã cải thiện đáng kể năng suất tổng thể của đội chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-ljspeech-9f3a9b55.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-cori-9f3a9b55.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/greatly-12f3e89a.webp', '[\"significantly\", \"considerably\", \"immensely\", \"substantially\"]', '[\"slightly\", \"hardly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"greatly appreciate\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá rất cao / vô cùng cảm kích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"greatly reduce\", \"meaning\": \"giảm đáng kể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"great\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-cori-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru0-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru5-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru6-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru10-9f3a9b55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru9-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru3-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru7-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru8-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-aru2-9f3a9b55.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-ljspeech-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt408-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt138-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt624-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt396-9f3a9b55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt498-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt132-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt288-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt42-9f3a9b55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greatly-lt90-9f3a9b55.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ \'greatly\' thường đứng trước động từ chỉ sự cải thiện, thay đổi hoặc đánh giá cao như \'greatly appreciate\', \'greatly improve\', \'greatly influence\'.', 'general business', 1, 12),
('d08f9173-5883-587d-a609-9c51d4b8eca4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'bylaw', 'UK: /ˈbaɪlɔː/ | US: /ˈbaɪˌlɔ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'điều lệ, quy tắc nội bộ', 'a rule made by an organization or local authority to manage its internal affairs', 'The company\'s bylaws govern employee conduct.', 'Điều lệ của công ty quy định hành vi của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"According to the company bylaws, any major expenditure over $50,000 must be approved by the board.\", \"vi\": \"Theo điều lệ công ty, bất kỳ khoản chi tiêu lớn nào trên 50.000 đô la đều phải được ban giám đốc phê duyệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-ljspeech-69176d8c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-cori-69176d8c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bylaw-a2b1ff0c.webp', '[\"regulation\", \"rule\", \"statute\", \"ordinance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"company bylaws\", \"meaning\": \"định ước / điều lệ công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"municipal bylaw\", \"meaning\": \"quy định pháp lý của địa phương\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-cori-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru0-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru5-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru6-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru10-69176d8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru9-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru3-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru7-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru8-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-aru2-69176d8c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-ljspeech-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt408-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt138-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt624-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt396-69176d8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt498-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt132-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt288-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt42-69176d8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bylaw-lt90-69176d8c.mp3\"]}}', 'Đôi khi được viết là \'by-law\'. Thường ám chỉ điều lệ hoạt động nội bộ của doanh nghiệp hoặc hiệp hội.', 'legal', 1, 13),
('ed30be5f-6d59-5838-b97e-b2e9eaa085eb', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'grin', '/ɡrɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nụ cười rộng, tươi rói, thường thể hiện sự vui vẻ hoặc hài lòng.', 'a wide smile that shows your teeth because you are happy or amused.', 'A mischievous grin spread across his face as he thought of a prank.', 'Một nụ cười tinh quái nở trên khuôn mặt anh ta khi anh ta nghĩ ra một trò đùa.', '{\"en\": \"The manager welcomed the new clients with a warm grin and a handshake.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng chào đón các khách hàng mới bằng một nụ cười rạng rỡ và một cái bắt tay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-ljspeech-a2669868.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-cori-a2669868.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grin-fc0a2133.webp', '[\"smile\", \"beam\"]', '[\"frown\", \"scowl\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"broad grin\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười toe toét\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wipe the grin off someone\'s face\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó tắt nụ cười tự mãn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grim\", \"note_vi\": \"grim là tính từ chỉ sự tồi tệ, nghiêm trọng, dễ nhầm chính tả.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"grin\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-cori-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru0-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru5-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru6-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru10-a2669868.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru9-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru3-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru7-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru8-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-aru2-a2669868.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-ljspeech-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt408-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt138-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt624-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt396-a2669868.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt498-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt132-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt288-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt42-a2669868.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-lt90-a2669868.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt grin (nụ cười toe toét) với smile (nụ cười nói chung).', 'daily', 1, 14),
('0ebe76b5-e8dd-5c02-be48-3db31ee6fd3f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'hook', '/hʊk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một vật cong dùng để treo hoặc móc cái gì đó.', 'a curved object used for hanging or holding things.', 'She hung her keys on the hook next to the door.', 'Cô ấy treo chìa khóa lên cái móc cạnh cửa.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provided a hook behind the door for hanging coats.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã cung cấp một móc treo sau cửa để treo áo khoác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-ljspeech-6bab147e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-cori-6bab147e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hook-fbf7107b.webp', '[\"hanger\", \"peg\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coat hook\", \"meaning\": \"móc treo áo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hook and eye\", \"meaning\": \"móc và vòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"look\", \"note_vi\": \"look là nhìn, phát âm khác hook\"}, {\"word\": \"book\", \"note_vi\": \"book là sách, không phải móc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hook\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hooked\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-cori-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru0-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru5-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru6-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru10-6bab147e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru9-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru3-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru7-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru8-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru2-6bab147e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-ljspeech-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt408-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt138-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt624-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt396-6bab147e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt498-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt132-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt288-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt42-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt90-6bab147e.mp3\"]}}', 'Hook là móc; off the hook nghĩa bóng là thoát tội.', 'travel', 1, 15),
('e8a7d590-1ad9-55d5-b845-965b6e91461c', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'introductory', 'UK: /ˌɪntrəˈdʌktəri/ | US: /ˌɪntrəˈdʌktəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'mở đầu, giới thiệu', 'Serving as an initial step, presentation, or basic overview before the main content begins.', 'The introductory offer is valid for new customers only.', 'Ưu đãi giới thiệu chỉ có giá trị cho khách hàng mới.', '{\"en\": \"New subscribers will receive a ten percent discount during the introductory period.\", \"vi\": \"Những người đăng ký mới sẽ nhận được mức giảm giá 10% trong thời gian ưu đãi mở đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-ljspeech-352adde4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-cori-352adde4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/introductory-e0d8cca6.webp', '[\"initial\", \"preliminary\", \"opening\", \"preliminary\"]', '[\"final\", \"concluding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"introductory price\", \"meaning\": \"giá chào bán ban đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"introductory offer\", \"meaning\": \"ưu đãi trải nghiệm ban đầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"introverted\", \"note_vi\": \"hướng nội (thuộc về tính cách con người)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"introduce\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"introduction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-cori-352adde4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-aru0-352adde4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-aru5-352adde4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-aru6-352adde4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-aru10-352adde4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-aru9-352adde4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introductory-aru3-352adde4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/