('d3dcb7f1-a03d-5bc0-9834-ce92c9761609', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'corrupt', '/kəˈrʌpt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó trở nên không trung thực, thường bằng cách đưa tiền.', 'to cause someone to act dishonestly or illegally, usually in exchange for money or power.', 'The politician was accused of trying to corrupt the jury with bribes.', 'Chính trị gia đó bị buộc tội cố gắng mua chuộc bồi thẩm đoàn bằng hối lộ.', '{\"en\": \"The audit revealed attempts to corrupt senior managers during the tender process for the building contract.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc kiểm toán tiết lộ những nỗ lực làm tha hóa các quản lý cấp cao trong quá trình đấu thầu hợp đồng xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-ljspeech-a1ce829a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-cori-a1ce829a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corrupt-a51b4cad.webp', '[\"bribe\", \"pervert\"]', '[\"purify\", \"reform\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"corrupt officials\", \"meaning\": \"làm tha hóa quan chức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corrupt data\", \"meaning\": \"làm hỏng dữ liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disrupt\", \"note_vi\": \"disrupt là gián đoạn, corrupt là làm hỏng/tha hóa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"corruption\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"corrupt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-cori-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru0-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru5-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru6-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru10-a1ce829a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru9-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru3-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ