('71bcefb6-702f-5dc9-b475-1c0a50072c33', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'suite', '/swiːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'một bộ phòng liền kề trong khách sạn hoặc văn phòng.', 'a set of connected rooms in a hotel or a group of offices.', 'They booked a luxurious suite with a view of the ocean for their honeymoon.', 'Họ đã đặt một dãy phòng sang trọng có tầm nhìn ra biển cho tuần trăng mật của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The executive team held their strategy meeting in the hotel\'s largest conference suite.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ điều hành đã tổ chức cuộc họp chiến lược tại phòng họp lớn nhất của khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-ljspeech-5cd55651.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-cori-5cd55651.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suite-b31ed21c.webp', '[\"apartment\", \"rooms\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hotel suite\", \"meaning\": \"phòng hạng sang khách sạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"office suite\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sweet\", \"note_vi\": \"Sweet là ngọt, suite là bộ phòng (phát âm giống nhau).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-cori-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru0-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru5-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru6-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru10-5cd55651.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru9-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru3-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru7-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru8-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-aru2-5cd55651.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-ljspeech-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt408-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt138-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt624-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt396-5cd55651.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt498-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt132-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt288-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt42-5cd55651.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suite-lt90-5cd55651.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm là /swiːt/, giống hệt từ \'sweet\' (ngọt).', 'travel', 1, 22),
('062cc391-07a4-5698-b6cc-43ae63b601c1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'on account of', '', 'B2', 'preposition', 'bởi vì, do', 'As a result of or because of a specific reason or circumstance.', 'The project was delayed on account of bad weather.', 'Dự án bị trì hoãn do thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor promotional event was postponed on account of bad weather.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện quảng bá ngoài trời đã bị hoãn lại do thời tiết xấu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-ljspeech-11ecdd86.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-cori-11ecdd86.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-account-of-929934a3.webp', '[\"because of\", \"due to\", \"owing to\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on account of bad weather\", \"meaning\": \"do thời tiết xấu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on account of technical issues\", \"meaning\": \"do sự cố kỹ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"on no account\", \"note_vi\": \"\'On no account\' nghĩa là tuyệt đối không, không vì bất cứ lý do gì (khác hoàn toàn với on account of).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-cori-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru0-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru5-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru6-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru10-11ecdd86.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru9-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru3-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru7-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru8-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-aru2-11ecdd86.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-ljspeech-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt408-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt138-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt624-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt396-11ecdd86.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt498-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt132-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt288-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt42-11ecdd86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-account-of-lt90-11ecdd86.mp3\"]}}', '\'On account of\' đóng vai trò như một giới từ, theo sau phải là Danh từ, Cụm danh từ hoặc V-ing (tương tự như \'because of\' hay \'due to\').', 'office', 1, 23),
('0612c7e0-0981-5345-af1e-4093b8fa6007', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'thereafter', '/ˌðeərˈɑːftə(r)/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Sau thời điểm hoặc sự kiện đã được đề cập.', 'after the time or event that has just been mentioned before.', 'She moved to London in 2010 and lived there for five years; thereafter, she moved to Paris.', 'Cô ấy chuyển đến London vào năm 2010 và sống ở đó năm năm; sau đó, cô ấy chuyển đến Paris.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting ended at noon; thereafter, the team went to lunch.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp kết thúc lúc trưa; sau đó, đội ngũ đi ăn trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-ljspeech-8d781104.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-cori-8d781104.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thereafter-a1d83cfa.webp', '[\"afterwards\", \"subsequently\", \"then\"]', '[\"beforehand\", \"previously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soon thereafter\", \"meaning\": \"không lâu sau đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immediately thereafter\", \"meaning\": \"ngay sau đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thereafter known as\", \"meaning\": \"từ đó về sau được gọi là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"therefore\", \"note_vi\": \"therefore nghĩa là vì vậy, không phải sau đó\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-cori-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru0-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru5-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru6-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru10-8d781104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru9-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru3-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru7-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru8-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-aru2-8d781104.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-ljspeech-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt408-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt138-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt624-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt396-8d781104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt498-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt132-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt288-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt42-8d781104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thereafter-lt90-8d781104.mp3\"]}}', 'Thereafter trang trọng, dùng trong văn viết, không dùng trong hội thoại.', 'office', 1, 24),
('b32dd53b-eb86-5a69-8a77-67451315e595', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'feminist', '/ˈfemənɪst/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người ủng hộ quyền bình đẳng cho phụ nữ.', 'a person who supports equal rights, opportunities, and fair treatment for women in society.', 'As a feminist, she actively campaigned for women\'s rights in the workplace.', 'Là một người ủng hộ nữ quyền, cô ấy đã tích cực vận động cho quyền phụ nữ tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker, a prominent feminist, discussed gender equality in corporate leadership positions.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính, một người ủng hộ nữ quyền nổi tiếng, đã thảo luận về bình đẳng giới trong các vị trí lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-ljspeech-cb0724c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-cori-cb0724c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feminist-9a989084.webp', '[\"women\'s rights advocate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"intersectional feminist\", \"meaning\": \"người đấu tranh nữ quyền giao thoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avowed feminist\", \"meaning\": \"người công khai ủng hộ nữ quyền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"feminine\", \"note_vi\": \"tính từ chỉ vẻ nữ tính, dịu dàng của phụ nữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"feminism\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feministic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-cori-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru0-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru5-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru6-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru10-cb0724c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru9-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru3-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru7-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru8-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-aru2-cb0724c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-ljspeech-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt408-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt138-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt624-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt396-cb0724c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt498-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt132-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt288-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt42-cb0724c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feminist-lt90-cb0724c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa là danh từ (người ủng hộ nữ quyền) vừa là tính từ (thuộc nữ quyền).', 'other', 1, 25),
('10959552-77fc-5b5e-a28e-330726ed22d1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'extensively', 'UK: /ɪkˈstɛnsɪvli/ | US: /ɪkˈstɛnsɪvli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách rộng rãi, chuyên sâu', 'in a way that covers a wide range, large area, or thorough degree.', 'The team researched the market extensively.', 'Nhóm đã nghiên cứu thị trường một cách chuyên sâu.', '{\"en\": \"The main conference room was extensively renovated before the annual shareholder meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng họp chính đã được cải tạo toàn diện trước cuộc họp cổ đông hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-ljspeech-2f90b716.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-cori-2f90b716.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extensively-a0fe0b5b.webp', '[\"widely\", \"broadly\", \"thoroughly\", \"comprehensively\"]', '[\"narrowly\", \"slightly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"travel extensively\", \"meaning\": \"đi lại nhiều nơi/rộng rãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"test extensively\", \"meaning\": \"thử nghiệm kỹ lưỡng/rộng rãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exclusively\", \"note_vi\": \"exclusively nghĩa là \'dành riêng\', phân biệt với extensively là \'rộng rãi, chuyên sâu\'\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"extend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"extensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-cori-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru0-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru5-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru6-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru10-2f90b716.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensively-aru9-2f90b716.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati