('46095ee7-ef25-5c4f-a5d3-ed43a15bedd1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6241024d-8323-5ac8-8fa9-ef22c1117878', '11054889-5f75-5b84-ae77-1e83a9e6c502', 'efficiency', '/ɪˈfɪʃnsi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'hiệu suất, sự hiệu quả', 'the ability to do a task with minimal waste of time.', 'The new engine design improves fuel efficiency significantly.', 'Thiết kế động cơ mới cải thiện đáng kể hiệu suất nhiên liệu.', '{\"en\": \"Our manager praised the team\'s efficiency in processing customer orders.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý khen ngợi sự hiệu quả của đội ngũ trong xử lý đơn hàng khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-ljspeech-fff33dfb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-cori-fff33dfb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/efficiency-315843be.webp', '[\"effectiveness\", \"productivity\"]', '[\"inefficiency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"improve efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao hiệu suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"energy efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất năng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"effectiveness\", \"note_vi\": \"effectiveness là tính hiệu quả kết quả, efficiency là tối ưu nguồn lực\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"efficient\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"efficiently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-cori-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru0-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru5-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru6-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru10-fff33dfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru9-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru3-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiency-aru7-fff33dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e