('c4f8320f-1fab-5237-a999-b3052c5f2c12', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '65f15a04-48c5-58b9-bc22-ca21788b24f0', '6ba11ede-cad4-5650-8524-7c585dbf4781', 'hydrogen', '/ˈhaɪdrədʒən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một nguyên tố hóa học không màu, không mùi, là khí nhẹ nhất.', 'a light chemical element that exists as a gas and has no color or smell.', 'Water is composed of two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom.', 'Nước được cấu tạo từ hai nguyên tử hydro và một nguyên tử oxy.', '{\"en\": \"The research team is testing hydrogen as a clean fuel source for new delivery trucks.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đang thử nghiệm hydro như một nguồn nhiên liệu sạch cho các xe tải giao hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-ljspeech-23b07c55.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-cori-23b07c55.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hydrogen-1e61ef8f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hydrogen fuel\", \"meaning\": \"nhiên liệu hydro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hydrogen atom\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên tử hydro\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-cori-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru0-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru5-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru6-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru10-23b07c55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru9-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru3-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru7-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru8-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-aru2-23b07c55.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrogen-ljspeech-23b07c55.mp3\", \"/