('e9c034c1-3fd8-53b1-9163-d094d5554725', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '66692ded-f4ee-51aa-a192-61997b0c60cb', '0447b078-b703-5884-a19d-1682e2760202', 'intellectual', '/ˌɪntəˈlektʃuəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về trí óc, khả năng suy nghĩ và học hỏi.', 'connected with the ability to think logically and understand complex ideas well.', 'Protecting intellectual property rights is essential for technology start-ups seeking funding.', 'Việc bảo vệ quyền sở hữu trí tuệ là vô cùng quan trọng đối với các công ty khởi nghiệp công nghệ đang tìm kiếm nguồn vốn.', '{\"en\": \"The company protects its intellectual property by filing patents for all new technology designs.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty bảo vệ tài sản trí tuệ của mình bằng cách nộp đơn đăng ký sáng chế cho tất cả thiết kế công nghệ mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-ljspeech-3c29719b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-cori-3c29719b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intellectual-e43052bf.webp', '[\"mental\", \"cognitive\", \"rational\"]', '[\"physical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intellectual property\", \"meaning\": \"sở hữu trí tuệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intellectual ability\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng trí tuệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intelligent\", \"note_vi\": \"Intelligent chỉ người thông minh, intellectual thuộc về trí tuệ/trí óc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intellect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intellectually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-cori-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru0-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru5-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru6-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru10-3c29719b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru9-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru3-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru7-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru8-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru2-3c29719b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-ljspeech-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt408-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt138-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt624-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt396-3c29719b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt498-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt132-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt288-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt42-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt90-3c29719b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'intellectual property\' (sở hữu trí tuệ) gặp rất nhiều trong TOEIC.', 'law', 1, 21),
('831611d6-cba5-5332-a772-224ef1617eb7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '66692ded-f4ee-51aa-a192-61997b0c60cb', '0447b078-b703-5884-a19d-1682e2760202', 'off-season', 'UK: /ˈɒfˌsiːzn/ | US: /ˈɔfˌsiːzn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'mùa thấp điểm', 'A period of reduced business, tourist activity, or sports competition in a year.', 'The hotel offers lower rates during the off-season.', 'Khách sạn giảm giá vào mùa thấp điểm.', '{\"en\": \"Hotels usually lower their room rates during the off-season to attract more travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Các khách sạn thường giảm giá phòng trong mùa thấp điểm để thu hút nhiều du khách hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-ljspeech-923c63cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-cori-923c63cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/off-season-a58384e5.webp', '[\"low season\", \"quiet period\"]', '[\"peak season\", \"high season\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"off-season discount\", \"meaning\": \"mức chiết khấu mùa thấp điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"travel in the off-season\", \"meaning\": \"đi du lịch vào mùa thấp điểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"peak season\", \"note_vi\": \"Mùa cao điểm (ngược nghĩa hoàn toàn với off-season).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"off-season\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"off-season\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-cori-923c63cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru0-923c63cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru5-923c63cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru6-923c63cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru10-923c63cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru9-923c63cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru3-923c63cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-season-aru7-923c