('732cb39c-22ff-5658-b05c-fa7ccd7b91e9', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6c4c1683-1477-5d00-b148-1a0e838b6ad2', '2a2a1092-bbc2-550c-9f78-4941c2a8bc16', 'aerospace', 'UK: /ˈɛərəʊˌspeɪs/ | US: /ˈɛroʊˌspeɪs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'công nghiệp hàng không vũ trụ', 'the industry concerned with designing and building aircraft and spacecraft.', 'The aerospace industry is rapidly developing cutting-edge technologies.', 'Ngành hàng không vũ trụ đang nhanh chóng phát triển các công nghệ tiên tiến.', '{\"en\": \"The aerospace company announced a major contract to supply components for commercial jets.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hàng không vũ trụ đã thông báo một hợp đồng lớn cung cấp linh kiện cho máy bay thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-ljspeech-c6670de6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-cori-c6670de6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aerospace-5d6aa3f9.webp', '[\"aviation\", \"aeronautics\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"aerospace industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành công nghiệp hàng không vũ trụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aerospace engineer\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ sư hàng không vũ trụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aerospace technology\", \"meaning\": \"công nghệ hàng không vũ trụ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-cori-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru0-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru5-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru6-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru10-c6670de6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru9-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru3-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru7-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru8-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-aru2-c6670de6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-ljspeech-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt408-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt138-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt624-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt396-c6670de6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt498-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt132-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt288-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt42-c6670de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aerospace-lt90-c6670de6.mp3\"]}}', 'Aerospace ghép từ \'aero\' (hàng không) và \'space\' (vũ trụ), hay đứng trước danh từ khác làm bổ ngữ như \'aerospace industry\' hay \'aerospace engineer\'.', 'industry', 1, 13),
('8fe5f9a3-7ce1-5227-82b3-c2503faddf06', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6c4c1683-1477-5d00-b148-1a0e838b6ad2', '2a2a1092-bbc2-550c-9f78-4941c2a8bc16', 'influential', '/ˌɪnfluˈenʃl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng tác động mạnh mẽ đến người khác hoặc sự việc.', 'having a lot of power to affect how someone thinks or behaves.', 'Her research paper had an influential impact on modern financial policy.', 'Bài báo nghiên cứu của cô ấy có ảnh hưởng mạnh mẽ đến chính sách tài chính hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"She is an influential marketing expert who has helped many brands grow rapidly.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy là một chuyên gia tiếp thị có tầm ảnh hưởng lớn, người đã giúp nhiều thương hiệu phát triển nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-ljspeech-fd542a5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-cori-fd542a5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/influential-014b991d.webp', '[\"powerful\", \"important\", \"dominant\"]', '[\"insignificant\", \"powerless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly influential\", \"meaning\": \"có sức ảnh hưởng lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"influential figure\", \"meaning\": \"nhân vật có tầm ảnh hưởng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"influence\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"influence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-cori-fd542a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru0-fd542a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru5-fd542a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru6-fd542a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru10-fd542a5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru9-fd542a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru3-fd542a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/influential-aru7-fd542a5d.mp3