('58fa3c7b-c691-5011-a22f-199710c352b5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6c4c1683-1477-5d00-b148-1a0e838b6ad2', '2a2a1092-bbc2-550c-9f78-4941c2a8bc16', 'say', '/seɪ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Phát ra lời hoặc diễn đạt ý kiến bằng lời nói.', 'to speak words in order to express a thought, feeling, or idea.', 'Please say hello to your parents for me when you see them.', 'Khi gặp bố mẹ bạn, hãy gửi lời chào của tôi đến họ nhé.', '{\"en\": \"The director will say a few words at the opening of the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc sẽ phát biểu vài lời tại lễ khai mạc hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-ljspeech-dc01c6b7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-cori-dc01c6b7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/say-469366ea.webp', '[\"state\", \"express\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"say a few words\", \"meaning\": \"phát biểu vài lời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"that is to say\", \"meaning\": \"tức là, nghĩa là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tell\", \"note_vi\": \"Tell đi kèm tân ngữ chỉ người (tell somebody), say thì không trực tiếp cần tân ngữ chỉ người.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"saying\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-cori-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru0-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru5-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru6-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru10-dc01c6b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru9-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru3-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru7-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru8-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-aru2-dc01c6b7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-ljspeech-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt408-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt138-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt624-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt396-dc01c6b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt498-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt132-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt288-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt42-dc01c6b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/say-lt90-dc01c6b7.mp3\"]}}', 'Không dùng \'say somebody something\', phải dùng \'say something to somebody\'.', 'office', 1, 16),
('084a0f47-ae92-501b-b6ae-895690b7239d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6c4c1683-1477-5d00-b148-1a0e838b6ad2', '2a2a1092-bbc2-550c-9f78-4941c2a8bc16', 'congratulate', '/kənˈɡrætʃəleɪt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Chúc mừng ai đó vì thành công.', 'To express pleasure or praise to a person upon their achievement or fortunate event.', 'I called to congratulate my sister on her graduation from university.', 'Tôi gọi điện để chúc mừng em gái tôi tốt nghiệp đại học.', '{\"en\": \"The director stopped by to congratulate the marketing team on their successful product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã ghé qua để chúc mừng đội ngũ tiếp thị về buổi ra mắt sản phẩm thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-ljspeech-d740ea12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-cori-d740ea12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/congratulate-eb897e45.webp', '[\"praise\", \"commend\"]', '[\"criticize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"congratulate someone on\", \"meaning\": \"chúc mừng ai về việc gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"congratulation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-cori-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru0-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru5-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru6-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru10-d740ea12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru9-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru3-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru7-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru8-d740ea12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congratulate-aru2-d740ea12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/sto