('2dad571b-9b7e-5b8a-ad75-269e3bdd574f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6c990281-735e-5aa0-9434-a596bc7fd806', '69e41474-634d-5cb7-9fcd-577f43c8dbc9', 'miracle', '/ˈmɪrəkl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'phép màu, điều kỳ diệu', 'an unusual and wonderful event that cannot be explained by natural laws.', 'Doctors said his full recovery after the accident was an absolute miracle.', 'Các bác sĩ nói rằng sự phục hồi hoàn toàn của anh ấy sau tai nạn là một phép màu tuyệt đối.', '{\"en\": \"It was a total miracle that the company recovered from severe financial losses.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một điều kỳ diệu hoàn toàn khi công ty phục hồi từ những tổn thất tài chính nặng nề.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-ljspeech-bf5b4554.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-cori-bf5b4554.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/miracle-4a276f37.webp', '[\"wonder\", \"marvel\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"minor miracle\", \"meaning\": \"phép màu nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work miracles\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra phép màu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"miraculous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"miraculously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-cori-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru0-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru5-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru6-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru10-bf5b4554.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru9-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru3-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru7-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru8-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-aru2-bf5b4554.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-ljspeech-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt408-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt138-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt624-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt396-bf5b4554.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt498-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt132-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt288-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt42-bf5b4554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miracle-lt90-bf5b4554.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'work miracles\' rất hay gặp với nghĩa mang lại kết quả kỳ diệu.', 'business', 1, 1),
('90bac877-8a92-567f-a85d-e7469ee4ff8a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '6c990281-735e-5aa0-9434-a596bc7fd806', '69e41474-634d-5cb7-9fcd-577f43c8dbc9', 'finest', 'UK: /ˈfaɪnɪst/ | US: /ˈfaɪnɪst/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tốt nhất, cao cấp nhất', 'of the highest quality, superior standard, or greatest degree of excellence available.', 'We use only the finest ingredients in our products.', 'Chúng tôi chỉ sử dụng những nguyên liệu tốt nhất trong sản phẩm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our hotel offers the finest amenities to ensure a comfortable stay for business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn của chúng tôi cung cấp các tiện nghi tốt nhất để đảm bảo kỳ nghỉ thoải mái cho khách đi công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-ljspeech-725b58e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-cori-725b58e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/finest-00fb9e58.webp', '[\"best\", \"top-quality\", \"superior\", \"premium\"]', '[\"worst\", \"inferior\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"finest quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng tốt nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"one of the finest\", \"meaning\": \"một trong những cái tốt nhất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fine\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-cori-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru0-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru5-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru6-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru10-725b58e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru9-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru3-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru7-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finest-aru8-725b58e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fi