('01bb6f5a-0d90-5475-8786-aca623020c21', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'excellence', '/ˈeksələns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất lượng vượt trội, sự ưu tú.', 'the quality of being extremely good or better than others in a particular area.', 'The school strives for excellence in all its academic programs.', 'Trường học luôn phấn đấu đạt được sự xuất sắc trong tất cả các chương trình học thuật của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our company received an award for excellence in customer service this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã nhận được giải thưởng vì sự xuất sắc trong dịch vụ khách hàng năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-ljspeech-3d5f97fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-cori-3d5f97fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excellence-aa26a61e.webp', '[\"superiority\", \"distinction\", \"quality\"]', '[\"mediocrity\", \"inferiority\", \"poorness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strive for excellence\", \"meaning\": \"phấn đấu vì sự xuất sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"award for excellence\", \"meaning\": \"giải thưởng xuất sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"excellence in service\", \"meaning\": \"sự xuất sắc trong dịch vụ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"excellent\", \"note_vi\": \"excellent là tính từ; excellence là danh từ chỉ phẩm chất xuất sắc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excellent\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excel\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"excellently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-cori-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru0-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru5-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru6-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru10-3d5f97fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru9-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru3-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru7-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru8-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-aru2-3d5f97fa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-ljspeech-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt408-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt138-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt624-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt396-3d5f97fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt498-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt132-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt288-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt42-3d5f97fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excellence-lt90-3d5f97fa.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'strive for excellence\' rất hay xuất hiện trong văn bản công ty và đề TOEIC.', 'business', 1, 8),
('b991d72d-c533-59b8-8b97-1a8733c6d451', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'just', '/dʒʌst/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'chính xác, đúng như vậy; hoặc chỉ mới, vừa mới.', 'exactly at this moment, or a very short time ago.', 'The train arrived just on time, as scheduled.', 'Chuyến tàu đã đến đúng giờ, theo lịch trình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager has just signed the contract with our new supplier.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc vừa mới ký hợp đồng với nhà cung cấp mới của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-ljspeech-d95b79cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-cori-d95b79cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/just-cc2023ec.webp', '[\"recently\", \"exactly\", \"merely\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"just now\", \"meaning\": \"vừa mới đây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"just in time\", \"meaning\": \"vừa kịp lúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"just\", \"note_vi\": \"tính từ nghĩa là công bằng, khác với phó từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"justice\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"justify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"justly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-cori-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru0-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru5-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru6-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru10-d95b79cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru9-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru3-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru7-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru8-d95b79cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/just-aru2-d95b79cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pron