('d08fe7ca-b0b0-5d27-8774-9198204b7448', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'fine', '/faɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tiền phạt do vi phạm luật.', 'Financial penalty imposed by an authority on someone who has violated a law or regulation.', 'He had to pay a large fine for parking illegally in the city center.', 'Anh ấy phải nộp một khoản tiền phạt lớn vì đỗ xe trái phép ở trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The company had to pay a heavy fine for failing to follow safety regulations properly.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phải nộp một khoản tiền phạt lớn vì không tuân thủ đúng các quy định an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-ljspeech-2a1b875b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-cori-2a1b875b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fine-32aa1c29.webp', '[\"penalty\", \"charge\"]', '[\"reward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pay a fine\", \"meaning\": \"nộp phạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impose a fine\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt mức phạt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fee\", \"note_vi\": \"fee là lệ phí dịch vụ, fine là tiền phạt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fine\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-cori-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru0-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru5-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru6-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru10-2a1b875b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru9-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru3-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru7-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru8-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-aru2-2a1b875b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-ljspeech-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt408-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt138-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt624-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt396-2a1b875b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt498-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt132-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt288-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt42-2a1b875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fine-lt90-2a1b875b.mp3\"]}}', 'Fine là danh từ (tiền phạt) hoặc tính từ (tốt, ổn).', 'law', 1, 13),
('c6c823f7-7bf4-5331-928d-0068145aca62', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'angel', '/ˈeɪndʒl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiên thần, sinh vật thần thánh thường được miêu tả có cánh.', 'a spiritual messenger or servant of God, often shown with wings.', 'Many cultures believe in guardian angels who protect people.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa tin vào các thiên thần hộ mệnh bảo vệ con người.', '{\"en\": \"An angel investor provided the necessary capital to launch our new software startup.\", \"vi\": \"Một nhà đầu tư thiên thần đã cung cấp số vốn cần thiết để khởi chạy khởi nghiệp phần mềm mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-ljspeech-c8a50f63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-cori-c8a50f63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/angel-c63a04ea.webp', '[\"messenger\", \"cherub\"]', '[\"devil\", \"demon\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"guardian angel\", \"meaning\": \"thiên thần hộ mệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"angel investor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà đầu tư thiên thần (đầu tư vốn ban đầu)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"angle\", \"note_vi\": \"angle là góc (trong hình học), rất dễ viết nhầm với angel.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"angelic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-cori-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru0-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru5-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru6-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru10-c8a50f63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru9-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru3-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru7-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru8-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru2-c8a50f63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-ljspeech-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt408-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt138-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt624-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt396-c8a50f63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt498-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt132-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt288-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt42-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-lt90-c8a50f63.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt cách viết angel (thiên thần) và angle (góc độ).', 'finance', 1, 14),
('7685a13c-79c7-5d44-aadb-06e73687eb73', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'confrontation', '/ˌkɒnfrʌnˈteɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một cuộc đối mặt hoặc tranh cãi trực tiếp giữa hai hoặc nhiều bên.', 'a situation in which people or groups fight, oppose, or argue fiercely with each other.', 'The leader tried to avoid a direct confrontation with the striking workers.', 'Người lãnh đạo đã cố gắng tránh một cuộc đối đầu trực tiếp với những công nhân đình công.', '{\"en\": \"HR managed to resolve the workplace conflict quickly to avoid a direct confrontation.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân sự đã giải quyết xung đột nơi làm việc nhanh chóng để tránh sự đối đầu trực tiếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-ljspeech-fb324e23.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-cori-fb324e23.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confrontation-866a5255.webp', '[\"conflict\", \"clash\", \"dispute\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"harmony\", \"peace\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"avoid confrontation\", \"meaning\": \"tránh đối đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"direct confrontation\", \"meaning\": \"sự đối đầu trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face-to-face confrontation\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc đối mặt trực diện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conflict\", \"note_vi\": \"confrontation là cuộc đối đầu trực diện, conflict là mâu thuẫn chung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confront\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confrontational\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-cori-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru0-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru5-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru6-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru10-fb324e23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru9-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru3-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru7-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru8-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-aru2-fb324e23.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-ljspeech-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt408-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt138-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt624-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt396-fb324e23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt498-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt132-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt288-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt42-fb324e23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confrontation-lt90-fb324e23.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các động từ như avoid (tránh) hoặc lead to (dẫn đến).', 'hr', 1, 15),
('486c658c-8e95-528d-a3f2-4add2e7257d2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'endure', '/ɪnˈdjʊə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'chịu đựng khó khăn, kéo dài qua thời gian', 'to continue to exist for a long time or deal with a difficult situation patiently.', 'Marathon runners must endure extreme fatigue before reaching the final finish line.', 'Các vận động viên chạy marathon phải chịu đựng sự mệt mỏi cực độ trước khi tới vạch đích cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"Our company has managed to endure several economic downturns over the past twenty years.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã xoay xở để chịu đựng qua vài đợt suy thoái kinh tế trong hai mươi năm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-ljspeech-2953e6c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-cori-2953e6c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/endure-91887c30.webp', '[\"withstand\", \"tolerate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"endure hardship\", \"meaning\": \"chịu đựng gian khổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"endure pain\", \"meaning\": \"chịu đựng nỗi đau\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"endurance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-cori-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru0-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru5-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru6-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru10-2953e6c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru9-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru3-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru7-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru8-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-aru2-2953e6c9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-ljspeech-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt408-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt138-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt624-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt396-2953e6c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt498-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt132-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt288-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt42-2953e6c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endure-lt90-2953e6c9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh sự kiên trì vượt qua khó khăn kéo dài.', 'business', 1, 16),
('ece3b26a-8c6f-560e-8143-4ae69b1db5e7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'intriguing', '/ɪnˈtriːɡɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất thú vị, hấp dẫn và khơi gợi sự tò mò.', 'very interesting because of being unusual, mysterious, or unexpected, causing curiosity.', 'The detective found an intriguing clue that could solve the mystery.', 'Thám tử đã tìm thấy một manh mối hấp dẫn có thể giải quyết được bí ẩn.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant presented an intriguing proposal for reducing operational costs across all departments.\", \"vi\": \"Vị cố vấn đã trình bày một đề xuất rất thú vị nhằm giảm chi phí vận hành trên tất cả các phòng ban.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-ljspeech-56640cdc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-cori-56640cdc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intriguing-8d1b5618.webp', '[\"fascinating\", \"captivating\", \"engaging\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intriguing possibility\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng đầy hứa hẹn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find something intriguing\", \"meaning\": \"thấy cái gì đó thú vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intricate\", \"note_vi\": \"Intriguing là thú vị khơi gợi tò mò, intricate là phức tạp, tỉ mỉ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intrigue\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intrigue\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intriguingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-cori-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru0-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru5-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru6-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru10-56640cdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru9-56640cdc.mp3\", 