('4f8bbb5e-9f44-571b-824c-4ef4f72f79f5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'phase', 'UK: /feɪz/ | US: /feɪz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'giai đoạn', 'a distinct period or stage in a series of events or process of development.', 'The project is currently in its final phase of development.', 'Dự án hiện đang ở giai đoạn phát triển cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"Construction of the new corporate headquarters will be completed in three distinct phases.\", \"vi\": \"Việc xây dựng trụ sở chính mới của công ty sẽ được hoàn thành theo ba giai đoạn riêng biệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-ljspeech-fe77c82b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-cori-fe77c82b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/phase-252118a1.webp', '[\"stage\", \"step\", \"period\", \"interval\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"initial phase\", \"meaning\": \"giai đoạn đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trial phase\", \"meaning\": \"giai đoạn dùng thử / thử nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"phase out\", \"meaning\": \"ngừng sử dụng / loại bỏ dần dần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"faze\", \"note_vi\": \"faze (động từ) nghĩa là làm bối rối/nản lòng, đồng âm nhưng khác nghĩa hoàn toàn với phase.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"phase\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-cori-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru0-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru5-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru6-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru10-fe77c82b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru9-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru3-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru7-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru8-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru2-fe77c82b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-ljspeech-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt408-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt138-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt624-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt396-fe77c82b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt498-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt132-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt288-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt42-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-lt90-fe77c82b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'in phases\' (theo từng giai đoạn) hoặc động từ ghép \'phase out\' (loại bỏ dần dần).', 'project management', 1, 23),
('d585be91-455a-5ea2-8d4c-cd4bd89918c7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'substantially', '/səbˈstænʃəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách đáng kể, phần lớn hoặc về cơ bản.', 'to a large degree or by a very significant amount in many ways.', 'Upgrading the regional rail network substantially reduced commuting times for factory workers.', 'Nâng cấp mạng lưới đường sắt khu vực đã làm giảm đáng kể thời gian đi lại của công nhân nhà máy.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s profits have increased substantially since they launched the new product line last year.\", \"vi\": \"Lợi nhuận của công ty đã tăng đáng kể kể từ khi họ ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-ljspeech-f0d248b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-cori-f0d248b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/substantially-d2f0b6a0.webp', '[\"significantly\", \"considerably\"]', '[\"slightly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"substantially higher\", \"meaning\": \"cao hơn đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"substantially reduced\", \"meaning\": \"giảm đáng kể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"substantial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-cori-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru0-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru5-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru6-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru10-f0d248b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru9-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru3-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substantially-aru7-f0d248b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pron