('c35c8e97-373d-5cac-a4db-97db84fda2a6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'activation', '/ˌæktɪˈveɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự khởi động hoặc làm cho hoạt động.', 'the process of starting something or making it begin to work or function.', 'The activation of the new security system will happen next week.', 'Việc kích hoạt hệ thống an ninh mới sẽ diễn ra vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The activation of your new account requires a confirmation email from our team.\", \"vi\": \"Việc kích hoạt tài khoản mới của bạn yêu cầu một email xác nhận từ nhóm của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-ljspeech-6d183114.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-cori-6d183114.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/activation-1e33e685.webp', '[\"initiation\", \"launch\", \"startup\"]', '[\"deactivation\", \"shutdown\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"account activation\", \"meaning\": \"kích hoạt tài khoản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"activation code\", \"meaning\": \"mã kích hoạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"system activation\", \"meaning\": \"khởi động hệ thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"motivation\", \"note_vi\": \"motivation là động lực thúc đẩy, không phải sự khởi động\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"activate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"active\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"actively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-cori-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru0-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru5-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru6-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru10-6d183114.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru9-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru3-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru7-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru8-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-aru2-6d183114.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-ljspeech-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt408-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt138-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt624-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt396-6d183114.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt498-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt132-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt288-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt42-6d183114.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activation-lt90-6d183114.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp trong TOEIC dạng \'activation code\' hoặc \'account activation\'.', 'technology', 1, 25),
('e0844559-1d2b-5723-a2f9-ebb892ca2845', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '75545901-833c-55cc-a2e0-02391d3a15b9', 'f7b8f5f7-81a9-5812-855c-2b5be9720dfc', 'sigh', '/saɪ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Thở ra một hơi dài, thường thể hiện sự mệt mỏi, buồn bã hoặc nhẹ nhõm.', 'to breathe out slowly showing tiredness, sadness or relief.', 'She let out a deep sigh of relief when she finally finished her exams.', 'Cô ấy thở phào nhẹ nhõm khi cuối cùng cũng hoàn thành các kỳ thi của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The tired employee sighed loudly after reading the long list of new tasks.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mệt mỏi thở dài sau khi đọc danh sách dài các công việc mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-ljspeech-49ac96a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-cori-49ac96a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sigh-42454ec2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sigh heavily\", \"meaning\": \"thở dài nặng nề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sigh wearily\", \"meaning\": \"thở dài mệt mỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sigh with relief\", \"meaning\": \"thở phào nhẹ nhõm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sign\", \"note_vi\": \"sign là ký hoặc dấu hiệu, sigh là thở dài.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-cori-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru0-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru5-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru6-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru10-49ac96a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru9-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru3-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru7-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru8-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru2-49ac96a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o