('8f88cd12-7abb-5a33-92f2-98b89402b782', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '7ce5e6d3-ae49-5dec-b5ec-93ee5c241649', 'b58f5fe7-a694-5127-8668-58fe6ff45174', 'submission', '/səbˈmɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hành động gửi hoặc nộp một tài liệu, đề xuất.', 'the act of giving a document or proposal to someone for their decision.', 'All project proposals require online submission before the end of the day.', 'Tất cả đề xuất dự án đều yêu cầu nộp trực tuyến trước khi kết thúc ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure the final project submission is uploaded to the portal before the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo việc nộp dự án cuối cùng được tải lên cổng thông tin trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-ljspeech-4da0c3de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-cori-4da0c3de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/submission-3e98ff17.webp', '[\"handing-in\", \"presentation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"deadline for submission\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chót nộp bài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online submission\", \"meaning\": \"nộp trực tuyến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"submit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-cori-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru0-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru5-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru6-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru10-4da0c3de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru9-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru3-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru7-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru8-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-aru2-4da0c3de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-ljspeech-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt408-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt138-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt624-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt396-4da0c3de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt498-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt132-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt288-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt42-4da0c3de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/submission-lt90-4da0c3de.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ khóa quan trọng trong các thông báo về quy trình làm việc.', 'office', 1, 18),
('424f2758-6afd-504a-baa2-67f116066a33', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '7ce5e6d3-ae49-5dec-b5ec-93ee5c241649', 'b58f5fe7-a694-5127-8668-58fe6ff45174', 'financially', 'UK: /faɪˈnænʃəli/ | US: /faɪˈnænʃəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'về mặt tài chính', 'in a manner that relates to monetary matters, funding, or economic stability.', 'The project is not financially viable without more investment.', 'Dự án không khả thi về mặt tài chính nếu không có thêm đầu tư.', '{\"en\": \"The newly acquired branch is expected to become financially self-sufficient by next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chi nhánh mới được mua lại dự kiến sẽ tự chủ về mặt tài chính vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-ljspeech-a4cfe25b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-cori-a4cfe25b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/financially-624194ef.webp', '[\"economically\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financially stable\", \"meaning\": \"ổn định về tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financially viable\", \"meaning\": \"có khả năng sinh lời / khả thi về tài chính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"finance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"financial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-cori-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru0-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru5-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru6-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru10-a4cfe25b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru9-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru3-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru7-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/financially-aru8-a4cfe25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/