('810b2d27-372c-5465-b9a8-50080c22cfac', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8b66d7bf-dade-507a-af84-2e2faa614ec3', 'e0532063-1233-5a7a-9f74-7a3880af410d', 'manipulation', '/məˌnɪpjuˈleɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự thao túng, điều khiển một cách khéo léo nhưng thường là tiêu cực.', 'the act of controlling or influencing a person or situation in a clever way.', 'The politician was accused of market manipulation to benefit his allies.', 'Chính trị gia đó bị buộc tội thao túng thị trường để trục lợi cho đồng minh của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The investigation focused on the illegal manipulation of financial data to inflate company profits.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc điều tra tập trung vào việc thao túng dữ liệu tài chính bất hợp pháp để thổi phồng lợi nhuận công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-ljspeech-010015ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-cori-010015ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/manipulation-f63c9cdb.webp', '[\"influence\", \"control\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"market manipulation\", \"meaning\": \"thao túng thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"data manipulation\", \"meaning\": \"thao túng dữ liệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"manipulate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-cori-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru0-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru5-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru6-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru10-010015ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru9-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru3-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru7-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru8-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-aru2-010015ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-ljspeech-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt408-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt138-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt624-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt396-010015ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt498-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt132-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt288-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt42-010015ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manipulation-lt90-010015ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực, ám chỉ hành vi gian lận.', 'finance', 1, 9),
('c419e58d-8e58-5932-b473-5af3a67661c0', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8b66d7bf-dade-507a-af84-2e2faa614ec3', 'e0532063-1233-5a7a-9f74-7a3880af410d', 'in-house', 'UK: /ˌɪnˈhaʊs/ | US: /ˌɪnˈhaʊs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nội bộ', 'Conducted or existing within an organization rather than using outside help or vendors.', 'The company decided to handle all its marketing in-house.', 'Công ty quyết định tự xử lý tất cả hoạt động tiếp thị nội bộ.', '{\"en\": \"Our company decided to develop an in-house software solution to reduce operational costs.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã quyết định phát triển giải pháp phần mềm nội bộ nhằm giảm chi phí vận hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-ljspeech-60d53356.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-cori-60d53356.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-house-31ededd7.webp', '[\"internal\", \"on-site\"]', '[\"outsourced\", \"external\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in-house training\", \"meaning\": \"đào tạo nội bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in-house team\", \"meaning\": \"đội ngũ nội bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"internal\", \"note_vi\": \"\'internal\' mang nghĩa rộng hơn (bên trong cơ thể, tổ chức), còn \'in-house\' nhấn mạnh việc tự thực hiện thay vì thuê ngoài.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-cori-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru0-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru5-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru6-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru10-60d53356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru9-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru3-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-house-aru7-60d53356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/i