('519569b5-5ee5-592c-9b77-d64455ac2f43', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8b66d7bf-dade-507a-af84-2e2faa614ec3', 'e0532063-1233-5a7a-9f74-7a3880af410d', 'forbid', 'UK: /fəˈbɪd/ | US: /fərˈbɪd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'cấm', 'To officially refuse to allow something, or to order someone not to act.', 'The company forbids employees from disclosing confidential information.', 'Công ty cấm nhân viên tiết lộ thông tin bảo mật.', '{\"en\": \"Company policy strictly forbids employees from sharing confidential client data with third parties.\", \"vi\": \"Quy định công ty nghiêm cấm nhân viên chia sẻ dữ liệu bảo mật của khách hàng với bên thứ ba.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-ljspeech-062b0bd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-cori-062b0bd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forbid-c8e67ed5.webp', '[\"prohibit\", \"ban\", \"bar\", \"disallow\"]', '[\"allow\", \"permit\", \"authorize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strictly forbid\", \"meaning\": \"nghiêm cấm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"forbid access\", \"meaning\": \"cấm truy cập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prevent\", \"note_vi\": \"Prevent là ngăn chặn một sự việc diễn ra, còn forbid là ban hành lệnh cấm chính thức đối với ai đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"forbidden\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-cori-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru0-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru5-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru6-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru10-062b0bd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru9-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru3-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru7-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru8-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-aru2-062b0bd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-ljspeech-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt408-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt138-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt624-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt396-062b0bd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt498-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt132-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt288-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt42-062b0bd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forbid-lt90-062b0bd8.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: \'forbid someone from doing something\' hoặc \'forbid someone to do something\'. Quá khứ là \'forbade\', quá khứ phân từ là \'forbidden\'.', 'rules', 1, 25),
('da135d1a-c618-5912-bac2-754472f8985e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8b66d7bf-dade-507a-af84-2e2faa614ec3', 'e0532063-1233-5a7a-9f74-7a3880af410d', 'warfare', '/ˈwɔːfeə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động chiến đấu giữa các quốc gia hoặc nhóm.', 'the activity of fighting a war or using specific methods to defeat an opponent.', 'Modern warfare often involves advanced technology and cyber attacks.', 'Chiến tranh hiện đại thường liên quan đến công nghệ tiên tiến và các cuộc tấn công mạng.', '{\"en\": \"The firm is preparing for competitive warfare by launching a new marketing campaign against rivals.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang chuẩn bị cho cuộc chiến cạnh tranh bằng cách tung ra chiến dịch tiếp thị mới chống lại đối thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-ljspeech-d6071776.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-cori-d6071776.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warfare-25e24d71.webp', '[\"combat\", \"fighting\"]', '[\"peace\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic warfare\", \"meaning\": \"chiến tranh kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cyber warfare\", \"meaning\": \"chiến tranh mạng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"welfare\", \"note_vi\": \"Welfare là phúc lợi, warfare là chiến tranh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"war\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-cori-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru0-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru5-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru6-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru10-d6071776.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru9-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru3-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru7-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru8-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-aru2-d6071776.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-ljspeech-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt408-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt138-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt624-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt396-d6071776.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt498-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt132-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt288-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt42-d6071776.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warfare-lt90-d6071776.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, nó ám chỉ sự cạnh tranh cực kỳ khốc liệt.', 'business', 1, 26),
('48fa8288-7b80-5ba2-b6e3-c0980ac23de8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8b66d7bf-dade-507a-af84-2e2faa614ec3', 'e0532063-1233-5a7a-9f74-7a3880af410d', 'elite', '/eɪˈliːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nhóm người ưu tú, xuất sắc nhất trong một lĩnh vực hoặc xã hội.', 'a select group of people with the highest status or ability.', 'The university attracts the intellectual elite from all over the world.', 'Trường đại học thu hút giới tinh hoa trí thức từ khắp nơi trên thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The company formed an elite team to handle key international accounts.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty thành lập một đội ngũ tinh hoa để xử lý các tài khoản quốc tế trọng yếu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-ljspeech-8fc09b91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-cori-8fc09b91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elite-93e7662f.webp', '[\"cream\", \"nobility\"]', '[\"masses\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elite group\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm tinh hoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"social elite\", \"meaning\": \"giới thượng lưu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elite forces\", \"meaning\": \"lực lượng tinh nhuệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"elate\", \"note_vi\": \"elate là làm phấn khích, khác elite\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"elite\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"elitism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-cori-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru0-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru5-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru6-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru10-8fc09b91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru9-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru3-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-aru7-8fc09b91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elite-