('d8bb1726-fa37-5a8a-879d-cbe67785288e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8e48e975-f301-586f-b537-2ac1ff34f905', '426ab081-10ed-514d-a4b9-d986868ead8a', 'stun', '/stʌn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khiến ai đó bất tỉnh hoặc rất sốc.', 'to make someone feel very surprised or shocked so they cannot speak or act.', 'The unexpected news seemed to stun everyone in the room into silence.', 'Tin tức bất ngờ dường như làm choáng váng mọi người trong phòng, khiến họ im lặng.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden announcement of the merger seemed to stun the entire staff during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Thông báo bất ngờ về việc sáp nhập dường như làm toàn bộ nhân viên sững sờ trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-ljspeech-fea71c3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-cori-fea71c3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stun-f582f9d7.webp', '[\"shock\", \"amaze\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stunned silence\", \"meaning\": \"sự im lặng sững sờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be stunned by\", \"meaning\": \"bị sốc bởi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stunning\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-cori-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru0-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru5-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru6-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru10-fea71c3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru9-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru3-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru7-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru8-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru2-fea71c3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-ljspeech-fea71c3b.mp3\", 