('eabc92c6-2757-559f-ad46-5535a10cde05', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8e48e975-f301-586f-b537-2ac1ff34f905', '426ab081-10ed-514d-a4b9-d986868ead8a', 'allegedly', '/əˈledʒɪdli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Theo lời đồn hoặc thông tin chưa được xác minh, được cho là.', 'used to say that something is claimed to be true without any proof yet.', 'The suspect allegedly stole several valuable items from the museum.', 'Nghi phạm được cho là đã đánh cắp một số món đồ có giá trị từ bảo tàng.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO allegedly misused company funds, leading to an immediate investigation by the board members.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành được cho là đã sử dụng sai quỹ công ty, dẫn đến cuộc điều tra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-ljspeech-a47d0180.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-cori-a47d0180.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/allegedly-b40aa2fd.webp', '[\"supposedly\", \"reportedly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"allegedly involved\", \"meaning\": \"được cho là có liên quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"allegedly stolen\", \"meaning\": \"được cho là đã bị đánh cắp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"allegation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-cori-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru0-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru5-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru6-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru10-a47d0180.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru9-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru3-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru7-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allegedly-aru8-a47d0180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/al