('c7b9febd-826b-59aa-adbe-5fa9c28cf377', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8e48e975-f301-586f-b537-2ac1ff34f905', '426ab081-10ed-514d-a4b9-d986868ead8a', 'courtesy', '/ˈkɜːtəsi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thái độ hoặc hành vi lịch thiệp, tôn trọng người khác.', 'polite behavior showing respect and good manners toward other people.', 'It\'s common courtesy to hold the door open for someone behind you.', 'Giữ cửa cho người đi sau là phép lịch sự thông thường.', '{\"en\": \"As a courtesy, the hotel provided free shuttle service for all conference attendees.\", \"vi\": \"Như một sự lịch thiệp, khách sạn đã cung cấp dịch vụ đưa đón miễn phí cho tất cả đại biểu hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-ljspeech-d95df593.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-cori-d95df593.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/courtesy-95d56dbd.webp', '[\"politeness\", \"civility\"]', '[\"rudeness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"common courtesy\", \"meaning\": \"sự lịch thiệp tối thiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"courtesy call\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc thăm xã giao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"courtesy service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ miễn phí do khách sạn/nhà hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"curtsy\", \"note_vi\": \"curtsy là hành động cúi chào, không phải thái độ lịch thiệp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"courteous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"courteously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-cori-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru0-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru5-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru6-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru10-d95df593.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru9-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru3-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru7-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru8-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru2-d95df593.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-ljspeech-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt408-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt138-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt624-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt396-d95df593.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt498-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt132-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt288-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt42-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt90-d95df593.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ courtesy là danh từ chỉ sự lịch thiệp, đừng nhầm với curtsy (cúi chào).', 'travel', 1, 23),
('ba91b555-1170-5e42-87bb-c312004f0f8b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8e48e975-f301-586f-b537-2ac1ff34f905', '426ab081-10ed-514d-a4b9-d986868ead8a', 'mobility', '/məʊˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng di chuyển dễ dàng hoặc thay đổi vị trí.', 'the ability to move easily from one place, job, or level to another.', 'Improved public transport will increase the mobility of residents in the city.', 'Giao thông công cộng được cải thiện sẽ tăng khả năng di chuyển của cư dân trong thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers good career mobility for employees who demonstrate high sales performance.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty mang lại khả năng thăng tiến nghề nghiệp tốt cho nhân viên có hiệu suất bán hàng cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-ljspeech-1e03a399.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-cori-1e03a399.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mobility-2b6ae8df.webp', '[\"flexibility\", \"maneuverability\"]', '[\"immobility\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"career mobility\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng thăng tiến nghề nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"social mobility\", \"meaning\": \"sự dịch chuyển xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unrestricted mobility\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng di chuyển không bị hạn chế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mobile\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mobilize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-cori-1e03a399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-aru0-1e03a399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-aru5-1e03a399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-aru6-1e03a399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-aru10-1e03a399.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-aru9-1e03a399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mobility-aru3-1e03a399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu