('f9be0992-64c8-5141-85e6-d4cfce36bea8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8e48e975-f301-586f-b537-2ac1ff34f905', '426ab081-10ed-514d-a4b9-d986868ead8a', 'reside', '/rɪˈzaɪd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Sinh sống hoặc có nơi ở thường xuyên tại một địa điểm cụ thể.', 'to live in a particular place for a long time or permanently.', 'Many retired people choose to reside in warmer climates during winter.', 'Nhiều người về hưu chọn sinh sống ở những vùng khí hậu ấm hơn vào mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"Employees who reside outside the city are eligible for a monthly travel allowance.\", \"vi\": \"Những nhân viên cư trú bên ngoài thành phố đủ điều kiện nhận phụ cấp đi lại hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-ljspeech-d6426dd6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-cori-d6426dd6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reside-ad08abf2.webp', '[\"live\", \"dwell\", \"inhabit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reside in\", \"meaning\": \"cư trú tại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"permanently reside\", \"meaning\": \"cư trú lâu dài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"live\", \"note_vi\": \"live dùng thông dụng hàng ngày, reside trang trọng hơn và mang tính pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"resident\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"residence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"residential\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-cori-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru0-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru5-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru6-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru10-d6426dd6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru9-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru3-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru7-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru8-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-aru2-d6426dd6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-ljspeech-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt408-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt138-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt624-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt396-d6426dd6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt498-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt132-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt288-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt42-d6426dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reside-lt90-d6426dd6.mp3\"]}}', 'Reside thường đi với giới từ \'in\' hoặc \'at\'.', 'housing', 1, 28),
('a78e3d35-30fb-5200-9300-07b624a677c3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '8e48e975-f301-586f-b537-2ac1ff34f905', '426ab081-10ed-514d-a4b9-d986868ead8a', 'look into', 'UK: /ˈlʊk ˈɪntuː/ | US: /ˈlʊk ˈɪntu/', 'B2', 'v.phr', 'điều tra, xem xét', 'to examine, investigate, or research facts about a situation or problem carefully to find solutions.', 'I will look into the possibility of a new supplier.', 'Tôi sẽ xem xét khả năng có một nhà cung cấp mới.', '{\"en\": \"Our technical support team will look into the cause of the system malfunction immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ hỗ trợ kỹ thuật của chúng tôi sẽ điều tra nguyên nhân sự cố hệ thống ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-ljspeech-44814002.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-cori-44814002.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/look-into-d5313ce7.webp', '[\"investigate\", \"examine\", \"explore\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"overlook\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look into a complaint\", \"meaning\": \"điều tra/xem xét khiếu nại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look into the matter\", \"meaning\": \"xem xét vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"look over\", \"note_vi\": \"Look into là điều tra chuyên sâu, look over là kiểm tra lướt qua\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-cori-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru0-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru5-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru6-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru10-44814002.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru9-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru3-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru7-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru8-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-aru2-44814002.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-ljspeech-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt408-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt138-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt624-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt396-44814002.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt498-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt132-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt288-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt42-44814002.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-into-lt90-44814002.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đề thi TOEIC, cụm \'look into\' rất hay dùng đồng nghĩa với động từ \'investigate\'.', 'customer service', 1, 29),
('73150e7a-ead3-5cda-b9a4-eb3353a1cde9', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'intervention', '/ˌɪntəˈvenʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động tham gia vào một tình huống để cải thiện hoặc ngăn chặn điều xấu.', 'the act of getting involved to change a result.', 'Government intervention was necessary to prevent the economic crisis from worsening.', 'Sự can thiệp của chính phủ là cần thiết để ngăn chặn cuộc khủng hoảng kinh tế trở nên tồi tệ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Managerial intervention resolved the conflict between the two departments quickly.\", \"vi\": \"Sự can thiệp của cấp quản lý đã giải quyết xung đột giữa hai phòng ban nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-ljspeech-a615d64b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-cori-a615d64b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intervention-fcfc5157.webp', '[\"involvement\", \"interference\", \"mediation\"]', '[\"noninterference\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"government intervention\", \"meaning\": \"can thiệp chính phủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"early intervention\", \"meaning\": \"can thiệp sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"military intervention\", \"meaning\": \"can thiệp quân sự\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"invention\", \"note_vi\": \"invention là phát minh, không phải sự can thiệp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intervene\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"interventional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-cori-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru0-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru5-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru6-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru10-a615d64b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru9-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru3-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru7-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru8-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-aru2-a615d64b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-ljspeech-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt408-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt138-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt624-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt396-a615d64b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt498-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt132-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt288-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt42-a615d64b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intervention-lt90-a615d64b.mp3\"]}}', 'Intervention là can thiệp, đừng nhầm với invention (phát minh).', 'business', 1, 0),
('c79ca971-243d-5644-a2fd-c5a71cfeff48', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'unprecedented', '/ʌnˈpresɪdentɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'chưa từng xảy ra, chưa từng có tiền lệ', 'never having happened or existed in the past.', 'The company experienced unprecedented growth last quarter.', 'Công ty đã trải qua sự tăng trưởng chưa từng có trong quý trước.', '{\"en\": \"The tech startup received an unprecedented amount of funding from venture capitalists this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp công nghệ đã nhận được một lượng vốn tài trợ chưa từng có từ các nhà đầu tư mạo hiểm năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-ljspeech-afbeeda5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-cori-afbeeda5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unprecedented-48a75a06.webp', '[\"unparalleled\", \"exceptional\", \"novel\"]', '[\"precedented\", \"common\", \"normal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unprecedented demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu chưa từng có\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unprecedented growth\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng chưa từng có\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"precedent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-cori-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru0-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru5-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru6-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru10-afbeeda5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru9-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru3-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru7-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unpr