('10c34b16-b82e-5a6a-ac66-50880044a892', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'tactical', '/ˈtæktɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến chiến thuật, cách thức cụ thể để đạt được mục tiêu.', 'related to detailed actions planned and taken to achieve a specific short-term objective or goal.', 'The firm executed a tactical maneuver to gain an advantage over its main competitor.', 'Công ty đã thực hiện một bước đi chiến thuật nhằm giành lợi thế trước đối thủ cạnh tranh chính.', '{\"en\": \"The manager proposed a tactical shift in our social media advertising campaign to reach younger demographics.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đề xuất một sự thay đổi chiến thuật trong chiến dịch quảng cáo trên mạng xã hội để tiếp cận nhóm khách hàng trẻ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-ljspeech-192cb80b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-cori-192cb80b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tactical-4b8626e5.webp', '[\"strategic\", \"calculated\", \"planned\"]', '[\"unplanned\", \"impulsive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tactical move\", \"meaning\": \"nước đi chiến thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tactical decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định chiến thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strategic\", \"note_vi\": \"strategic mang tính chiến lược dài hạn, tactical mang tính chiến thuật ngắn hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tactic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tactically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-cori-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru0-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru5-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru6-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru10-192cb80b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru9-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru3-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru7-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru8-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-aru2-192cb80b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-ljspeech-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt408-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt138-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt624-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt396-192cb80b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt498-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt132-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt288-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt42-192cb80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tactical-lt90-192cb80b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tactic là danh từ (chiến thuật), tactical là tính từ (thuộc về chiến thuật).', 'marketing', 1, 2),
('53c7baa9-540c-54af-a7d9-b5abd07b21b2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'gear', '/ɡɪə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bánh răng, bộ phận truyền động trong máy móc; hoặc trang bị, dụng cụ.', 'a set of metal wheels with teeth that work together to make a machine move properly.', 'He shifted into a higher gear to accelerate the car.', 'Anh ấy chuyển sang số cao hơn để tăng tốc xe.', '{\"en\": \"The factory technician replaced the broken gear to ensure the production line runs smoothly again.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên nhà máy đã thay thế bánh răng bị hỏng để đảm bảo dây chuyền sản xuất hoạt động trơn tru trở lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-ljspeech-d0e14302.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-cori-d0e14302.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gear-d3df4396.webp', '[\"cog\", \"mechanism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shift gears\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gear up\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị sẵn sàng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-cori-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru0-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru5-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru6-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru10-d0e14302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru9-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru3-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru7-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru8-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-aru2-d0e14302.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-ljspeech-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt408-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt138-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt624-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt396-d0e14302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt498-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt132-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt288-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt42-d0e14302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gear-lt90-d0e14302.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng \'gear up\' có nghĩa là chuẩn bị cho một dự án lớn.', 'manufacturing', 1, 3),
('54f85a76-c2cc-55a0-ae2a-79879babe5e4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'coordinator', '/kəʊˈɔːdɪˌneɪtə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người điều phối, sắp xếp các hoạt động hoặc sự kiện.', 'a person who organizes the different parts of an activity to work together.', 'Our project coordinator scheduled regular weekly meetings to track team progress accurately.', 'Điều phối viên dự án của chúng tôi đã lên lịch các cuộc họp hàng tuần định kỳ để theo dõi chính xác tiến độ của nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics coordinator will arrange the shipment of all office supplies to the new branch.\", \"vi\": \"Điều phối viên hậu cần sẽ sắp xếp việc vận chuyển tất cả văn phòng phẩm đến chi nhánh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-ljspeech-b1ba516c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-cori-b1ba516c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coordinator-b1afbc99.webp', '[\"organizer\", \"manager\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"event coordinator\", \"meaning\": \"người điều phối sự kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"logistics coordinator\", \"meaning\": \"điều phối viên hậu cần\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coordinate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coordination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-cori-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru0-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru5-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru6-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru10-b1ba516c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru9-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru3-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru7-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru8-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-aru2-b1ba516c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-ljspeech-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt408-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt138-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt624-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt396-b1ba516c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt498-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt132-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt288-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt42-b1ba516c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coordinator-lt90-b1ba516c.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với manager, coordinator tập trung vào việc kết nối các bên.', 'office', 1, 4),
('e200464b-62b2-55a8-b7a6-096958e4eeb2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'productive', '/prəˈdʌktɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Tạo ra nhiều kết quả hoặc lợi ích, hiệu quả.', 'achieving a lot of results or benefits in a short amount of time, efficient.', 'We had a very productive meeting and made good progress on the project.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một cuộc họp rất hiệu quả và đạt được nhiều tiến bộ trong dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The team had a productive brainstorming session and finalized the marketing plan.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã có một buổi động não hiệu quả và hoàn thiện kế hoạch marketing.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productive-7335048c.webp', '[\"efficient\", \"effective\", \"fruitful\"]', '[\"unproductive\", \"inefficient\", \"fruitless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"productive meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly productive\", \"meaning\": \"rất hiệu quả, năng suất cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"productive day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày làm việc hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficient\", \"note_vi\": \"efficient nhấn mạnh không lãng phí, productive nhấn mạnh tạo ra nhiều kết quả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"productivity\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"productively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"production\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru0-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru5-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru6-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru10-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru9-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru3-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru7-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru8-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru2-f3f80621.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt408-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt138-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt624-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt396-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt498-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt132-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt288-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt42-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt90-f3f80621.mp3\"]}}', 'Productive rất phổ biến trong đề TOEIC phần đọc về môi trường làm việc và quản lý.', 'office', 1, 5),
('04b9116d-b8a3-5ee7-8ee1-4a7baf7ba05c', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'leak', '/liːk/', 'B1', 'verb', 'để chất lỏng, khí hoặc thông tin thoát ra ngoài một cách không mong muốn.', 'to allow liquid, gas, or secret information to escape through a hole or crack.', 'Water started to leak from the old pipe in the basement.', 'Nước bắt đầu rò rỉ từ đường ống cũ trong tầng hầm.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team was called because the air conditioning unit began to leak water.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã được gọi vì thiết bị điều hòa bắt đầu bị rò rỉ nước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-ljspeech-065c5c29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-cori-065c5c29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leak-6126916b.webp', '[\"drip\", \"escape\", \"reveal\"]', '[\"contain\", \"seal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"leak information\", \"meaning\": \"rò rỉ thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leak gas\", \"meaning\": \"rò rỉ khí ga\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"leek\", \"note_vi\": \"leek là tỏi tây (rau), phát âm giống hệt leak.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"leak\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"leakage\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"leaky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-cori-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru0-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru5-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru6-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru10-065c5c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru9-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru3-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru7-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru8-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru2-065c5c29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-ljspeech-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt408-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt138-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt624-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt396-065c5c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt498-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt132-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt288-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt42-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt90-065c5c29.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa dùng cho chất lỏng vật lý, vừa dùng cho thông tin mật.', 'manufacturing', 1, 6),
('be8aaa58-3d2d-5b72-97dd-44aae9f81cc8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'amid', '/əˈmɪd/', 'B2', 'preposition', 'Ở giữa hoặc trong số nhiều người, vật hoặc sự kiện.', 'in the middle of or surrounded by other things.', 'The small boat sailed calmly amid the choppy waves of the ocean.', 'Chiếc thuyền nhỏ lướt đi bình yên giữa những con sóng dập dềnh của đại dương.', '{\"en\": \"The company managed to increase its sales amid growing concerns about the global economy.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thành công trong việc tăng doanh số bán hàng giữa bối cảnh lo ngại ngày càng tăng về nền kinh tế toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-ljspeech-ca7db6d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-cori-ca7db6d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amid-11a7e061.webp', '[\"among\", \"during\", \"amidst\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"amid rumors of\", \"meaning\": \"giữa những tin đồn về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amid speculation that\", \"meaning\": \"giữa những suy đoán rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"among\", \"note_vi\": \"among thường đi với danh từ số nhiều đếm được, amid đi với danh từ không đếm được.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-cori-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru0-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru5-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru6-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru10-ca7db6d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru9-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru3-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru7-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru8-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-aru2-ca7db6d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-ljspeech-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt408-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt138-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt624-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt396-ca7db6d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt498-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt132-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt288-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt42-ca7db6d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amid-lt90-ca7db6d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Amid thường dùng trong văn phong trang trọng hoặc báo chí.', 'business', 1, 7),
('b91d020e-fef8-5ae8-93cf-327723d6af4f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'render', '/ˈrendə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'cung cấp (dịch vụ, hỗ trợ); làm cho (ai/cái gì trở nên như thế nào)', 'to give help or a service, or to cause someone to be in a particular state.', 'We are obliged to render assistance to anyone in distress.', 'Chúng tôi có nghĩa vụ phải cung cấp sự hỗ trợ cho bất kỳ ai đang gặp nạn.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department worked overnight to render the system fully operational by morning.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận CNTT đã làm việc qua đêm để giúp hệ thống hoạt động bình thường vào buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-ljspeech-37eca575.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-cori-37eca575.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/render-e2f34f36.webp', '[\"provide\", \"make\", \"deliver\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"render assistance\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp sự trợ giúp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"render a service\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp dịch vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"render something useless\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho cái gì trở nên vô dụng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rendering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-cori-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru0-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru5-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru6-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru10-37eca575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru9-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru3-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru7-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru8-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-aru2-37eca575.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-ljspeech-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt408-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt138-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt624-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt396-37eca575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt498-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt132-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt288-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt42-37eca575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/render-lt90-37eca575.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cấu trúc: render + tân ngữ + tính từ (làm cho ai/cái gì trở nên như thế nào).', 'business', 1, 8),
('a8b23ae2-3409-5938-bb3a-249e9623d38c', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'coalition', '/ˌkəʊəˈlɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự liên kết, hợp tác tạm thời giữa các nhóm, đảng phái để đạt mục tiêu chung.', 'a temporary group formed by different people or organizations to work together for a common goal.', 'Environmental groups created a strong coalition to promote clean energy policies across the country.', 'Các nhóm môi trường đã tạo ra một liên minh mạnh mẽ để thúc đẩy chính sách năng lượng sạch trên toàn quốc.', '{\"en\": \"The industry leaders formed a coalition to lobby for better trade policies in the region.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà lãnh đạo ngành đã thành lập một liên minh để vận động cho các chính sách thương mại tốt hơn trong khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-ljspeech-d3fa0ebb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-cori-d3fa0ebb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coalition-0e6e044c.webp', '[\"alliance\", \"union\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"form a coalition\", \"meaning\": \"thành lập liên minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broad coalition\", \"meaning\": \"liên minh rộng rãi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-cori-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru0-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru5-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru6-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru10-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru9-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru3-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru7-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru8-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru2-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-ljspeech-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt408-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt138-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt624-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt396-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt498-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt132-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt288-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt42-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt90-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh tính tạm thời và mục tiêu chung.', 'business', 1, 9),
('d32ee1a4-9499-5664-8e69-7ffa9e109b0d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'passionate', 'UK: /ˈpæʃ.ən.ət/ | US: /ˈpæʃ.ən.ət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đam mê, nhiệt huyết', 'showing or caused by strong feelings, enthusiasm, or strong belief in something.', 'He is passionate about his work.', 'Anh ấy rất nhiệt huyết với công việc của mình.', '{\"en\": \"We are looking for a passionate marketing manager to lead our new product campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đang tìm kiếm một quản lý tiếp thị đầy nhiệt huyết để dẫn dắt chiến dịch sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-ljspeech-26c3d35a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-cori-26c3d35a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passionate-ee46910b.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"dedicated\", \"ardent\", \"committed\"]', '[\"indifferent\", \"apathetic\", \"unenthusiastic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"passionate about\", \"meaning\": \"đam mê về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"passionate worker\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên nhiệt huyết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"passion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"passionately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-cori-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru0-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru5-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru6-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru10-26c3d35a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru9-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru3-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru7-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru8-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-aru2-26c3d35a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-ljspeech-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt408-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt138-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt624-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt396-26c3d35a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt498-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt132-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt288-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt42-26c3d35a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passionate-lt90-26c3d35a.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: \'be passionate about something\' (hào hứng/nhiệt huyết về cái gì).', 'personnel', 1, 10),
('e82d670b-9721-5913-b463-467a28c23607', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'retreat', '/rɪˈtriːt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự rút lui; nơi ẩn náu, tĩnh dưỡng', 'a quiet or safe place where you can go to be away from other people.', 'The general ordered a strategic retreat after heavy losses.', 'Vị tướng ra lệnh rút lui chiến lược sau những tổn thất nặng nề.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a weekend retreat for managers to discuss long-term goals in a quiet environment.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một chuyến tĩnh dưỡng cuối tuần cho các quản lý để thảo luận về các mục tiêu dài hạn trong một môi trường yên tĩnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-ljspeech-eb5b9a3e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-cori-eb5b9a3e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/retreat-8dd388ce.webp', '[\"refuge\", \"shelter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate retreat\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến tĩnh dưỡng của công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strategic retreat\", \"meaning\": \"sự rút lui chiến lược\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"retreat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-cori-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru0-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru5-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru6-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru10-eb5b9a3e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru9-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru3-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru7-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru8-eb5b9a3e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retreat-aru2-eb5b9a3e.mp3\"]}, 