('960a9ef5-72f5-5905-9c69-587ad57715e4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'aggression', '/əˈɡreʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành vi thù địch, gây hấn hoặc tấn công.', 'angry or violent behavior that is intended to hurt or attack someone.', 'The country\'s act of aggression was condemned by the international community.', 'Hành động gây hấn của quốc gia đó đã bị cộng đồng quốc tế lên án.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a zero-tolerance policy for any verbal aggression in the workplace.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có chính sách không khoan nhượng đối với bất kỳ hành vi gây hấn bằng lời nói nào tại nơi làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-ljspeech-eb8c026c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-cori-eb8c026c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aggression-0c1ca3ad.webp', '[\"hostility\", \"violence\", \"belligerence\"]', '[\"friendliness\", \"gentleness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"show aggression\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự hung hăng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verbal aggression\", \"meaning\": \"gây hấn bằng lời nói\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"aggressive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"aggressively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-cori-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru0-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru5-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru6-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru10-eb8c026c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru9-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru3-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggression-aru7-eb8c026c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu