('a7af30e3-7006-58e8-b868-b397d961cdba', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', '92b43d3f-4263-5ddf-b6d1-8b2f0ed6afba', '724c1209-a76c-5ca0-b19a-6297f67a7fe3', 'residential', '/ˌrezɪˈdenʃl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về khu vực dân cư, nơi mọi người sinh sống.', 'related to areas where people live rather than where they work or do business.', 'The new zoning laws will limit commercial development in residential areas.', 'Luật quy hoạch mới sẽ hạn chế phát triển thương mại ở các khu dân cư.', '{\"en\": \"The real estate developer is planning to build a new residential complex near the city center.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà phát triển bất động sản đang có kế hoạch xây dựng một khu dân cư mới gần trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-ljspeech-ae373ebf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-cori-ae373ebf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/residential-606fbe3b.webp', '[\"domestic\", \"living\"]', '[\"commercial\", \"industrial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"residential area\", \"meaning\": \"khu dân cư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"residential building\", \"meaning\": \"tòa nhà chung cư\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"residence\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reside\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-cori-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru0-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru5-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru6-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru10-ae373ebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru9-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru3-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/residential-aru7-ae373ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati