('141f32ca-4e01-536e-89bb-2b8432e1cde9', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'a77e3db2-b2ae-58aa-8c48-1d8a9b80f3bd', '258387d4-d9f0-53ee-9d8d-ac3db1c0c3b9', 'integrate', 'UK: /ˈɪntɪˌɡreɪt/ | US: /ˈɪntəˌɡreɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'tích hợp, hợp nhất', 'to combine two or more components so they function together as one.', 'We need to integrate new features into the software.', 'Chúng ta cần tích hợp các tính năng mới vào phần mềm.', '{\"en\": \"The new software allows users to integrate their email accounts with the project management tool.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới cho phép người dùng tích hợp tài khoản email của họ với công cụ quản lý dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-ljspeech-33d3f70d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-cori-33d3f70d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/integrate-5ed75289.webp', '[\"incorporate\", \"combine\", \"merge\", \"assimilate\"]', '[\"separate\", \"isolate\", \"divide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"integrate into\", \"meaning\": \"tích hợp vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seamlessly integrate\", \"meaning\": \"tích hợp một cách mượt mà\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"integration\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"integrated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-cori-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru0-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru5-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru6-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru10-33d3f70d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru9-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru3-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru7-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru8-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-aru2-33d3f70d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-ljspeech-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt408-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt138-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt624-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt396-33d3f70d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt498-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt132-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt288-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt42-33d3f70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/integrate-lt90-33d3f70d.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'into\' hoặc \'with\' (integrate A into B / integrate with B).', 'technology', 1, 1),
('579596c2-b58a-5bc4-b515-9177654be80f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'a77e3db2-b2ae-58aa-8c48-1d8a9b80f3bd', '258387d4-d9f0-53ee-9d8d-ac3db1c0c3b9', 'ego', '/ˈiːɡəʊ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Phần của tâm trí con người chịu trách nhiệm về ý thức bản thân và sự tự trọng.', 'the way you feel about yourself and your own importance or value.', 'You should set aside your ego and listen carefully to team members\' advice.', 'Bạn nên gạt bỏ cái tôi của mình và lắng nghe kỹ lời khuyên của các thành viên trong nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"He needs to put his ego aside and listen to the team\'s feedback on the project.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy cần gạt cái tôi sang một bên và lắng nghe phản hồi của nhóm về dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-ljspeech-c13571db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-cori-c13571db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ego-e1c33038.webp', '[\"self-esteem\", \"pride\"]', '[\"humility\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"boost one\'s ego\", \"meaning\": \"tăng sự tự tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bruised ego\", \"meaning\": \"cái tôi bị tổn thương\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"egotistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-cori-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru0-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru5-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru6-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru10-c13571db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru9-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru3-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru7-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru8-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru2-c13571db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia