('101959c0-d7c9-506b-ab7f-0448b12b97ee', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'a77e3db2-b2ae-58aa-8c48-1d8a9b80f3bd', '258387d4-d9f0-53ee-9d8d-ac3db1c0c3b9', 'confession', '/kənˈfeʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thừa nhận một lỗi lầm hoặc tội.', 'a statement in which you admit that you have done something wrong or illegal.', 'After hours of questioning, he finally made a full confession.', 'Sau nhiều giờ thẩm vấn, cuối cùng anh ta đã thú nhận toàn bộ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a confession that he had made a mistake in the financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã thú nhận rằng ông đã mắc sai lầm trong báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-ljspeech-7acc00d8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-cori-7acc00d8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confession-64af52ed.webp', '[\"admission\", \"acknowledgment\"]', '[\"denial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a confession\", \"meaning\": \"thú nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"signed confession\", \"meaning\": \"bản thú tội có chữ ký\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concession\", \"note_vi\": \"concession là sự nhượng bộ, confession là sự thú nhận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confess\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confessional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-cori-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru0-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru5-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru6-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru10-7acc00d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru9-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru3-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confession-aru7-7acc00d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc