('04eb6000-c0df-5124-9892-3c98bb168bc0', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'acaa0e37-bdbd-5d51-bd74-61e4c23c9640', '04eee2ee-0697-58ec-aaf0-7d25c20dbfff', 'complexity', '/kəmˈpleksəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng hoặc mức độ của sự phức tạp, khó hiểu.', 'the state of having many different parts that are difficult to understand or explain.', 'The complexity of the legal case required a team of experienced lawyers.', 'Sự phức tạp của vụ án pháp lý đòi hỏi một đội ngũ luật sư giàu kinh nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"The complexity of the new tax regulations makes it difficult for small business owners.\", \"vi\": \"Sự phức tạp của các quy định thuế mới gây khó khăn cho các chủ doanh nghiệp nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-ljspeech-8d08946e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-cori-8d08946e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/complexity-89c4c20e.webp', '[\"intricacy\", \"difficulty\"]', '[\"simplicity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"add complexity\", \"meaning\": \"thêm sự phức tạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce complexity\", \"meaning\": \"giảm bớt sự phức tạp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"complex\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-cori-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru0-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru5-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru6-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru10-8d08946e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru9-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru3-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru7-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexity-aru8-8d08946e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat