('d85c111c-7c94-5d44-b219-6a267cdce79d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'acaa0e37-bdbd-5d51-bd74-61e4c23c9640', '04eee2ee-0697-58ec-aaf0-7d25c20dbfff', 'cutting', '/ˈkʌtɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc quá trình cắt, xén.', 'the act of reducing the amount of something, especially money or resources.', 'The budget cutting will unfortunately lead to some job losses.', 'Việc cắt giảm ngân sách không may sẽ dẫn đến một số mất việc làm.', '{\"en\": \"The department is facing severe budget cutting due to the decrease in annual sales revenue.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận đang phải đối mặt với việc cắt giảm ngân sách nghiêm trọng do doanh thu bán hàng hàng năm giảm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-ljspeech-2fa40299.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-cori-2fa40299.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cutting-d761a3e3.webp', '[\"reduction\", \"decrease\"]', '[\"increase\", \"expansion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"budget cutting\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm ngân sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost cutting\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi phí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cut\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-cori-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru0-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru5-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru6-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru10-2fa40299.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru9-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru3-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru7-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru8-2fa40299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cutting-aru2-2fa40299.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v