('cf65f629-0e9f-5f45-bc96-1b375ac9d8f2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'acaa0e37-bdbd-5d51-bd74-61e4c23c9640', '04eee2ee-0697-58ec-aaf0-7d25c20dbfff', 'multimedia', 'UK: /ˌmʌltiˈmiːdiə/ | US: /ˌmʌltiˈmiːdiə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đa phương tiện', 'the combined integration of text, audio, images, and video in computer applications or presentations.', 'The presentation used various multimedia elements.', 'Bài thuyết trình sử dụng nhiều yếu tố đa phương tiện.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team prepared an engaging multimedia presentation for the annual client summit.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã chuẩn bị một bài thuyết trình đa phương tiện lôi cuốn cho hội nghị khách hàng hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-ljspeech-40718650.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-cori-40718650.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/multimedia-c12f4abc.webp', '[\"mixed-media\", \"digital media\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"multimedia presentation\", \"meaning\": \"bài thuyết trình đa phương tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"multimedia content\", \"meaning\": \"nội dung đa phương tiện\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-cori-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru0-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru5-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru6-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru10-40718650.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru9-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru3-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru7-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru8-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-aru2-40718650.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-ljspeech-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt408-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt138-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt624-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt396-40718650.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt498-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt132-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt288-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt42-40718650.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multimedia-lt90-40718650.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ không đếm được, hay đóng vai trò làm bổ ngữ đứng trước danh từ khác (multimedia presentation/content).', 'technology', 1, 16),
('99dedd71-1a74-594c-b0b6-f19bfa1c95a2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'acaa0e37-bdbd-5d51-bd74-61e4c23c9640', '04eee2ee-0697-58ec-aaf0-7d25c20dbfff', 'fierce', '/fɪəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dữ dội, ác liệt, mạnh mẽ hoặc quyết liệt.', 'showing strong feelings or energetic activity, often in a competitive way.', 'The competition for the top spot was fierce among the athletes.', 'Cuộc cạnh tranh giành vị trí dẫn đầu giữa các vận động viên rất khốc liệt.', '{\"en\": \"The two tech giants are in fierce competition to dominate the smartphone market.\", \"vi\": \"Hai gã khổng lồ công nghệ đang cạnh tranh gay gắt để thống trị thị trường điện thoại thông minh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-ljspeech-bb3a4039.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-cori-bb3a4039.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fierce-b562aa99.webp', '[\"intense\", \"ferocious\", \"aggressive\"]', '[\"mild\", \"gentle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fierce competition\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh tranh khốc liệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fierce debate\", \"meaning\": \"tranh luận dữ dội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fiercely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fierceness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-cori-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru0-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru5-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru6-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru10-bb3a4039.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru9-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru3-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru7-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fierce-aru8-bb3a4039.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fie