('5021e6d2-07d4-5fcf-80f5-bb9701dc0fe5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'b81560a6-a705-5b84-899a-4509c1e266b2', 'bc3de058-23b0-5fdf-88f8-12f3105665ba', 'guilt', '/ɡɪlt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác tội lỗi hoặc trách nhiệm về một hành động sai trái.', 'a feeling of sadness or regret because you believe you have done something wrong or failed someone.', 'He felt a strong sense of guilt after realizing he had forgotten his friend\'s birthday.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy một cảm giác tội lỗi mạnh mẽ sau khi nhận ra mình đã quên sinh nhật bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed deep guilt for failing to support his team during the difficult project phase.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bày tỏ sự hối hận sâu sắc vì đã không hỗ trợ đội ngũ trong giai đoạn dự án khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-ljspeech-8867f2bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-cori-8867f2bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guilt-c828e789.webp', '[\"remorse\", \"regret\"]', '[\"pride\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel guilt\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy tội lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of guilt\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác tội lỗi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"guilty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-cori-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru0-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru5-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru6-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru10-8867f2bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru9-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru3-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru7-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilt-aru8-8867f2bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guil