('bb90f684-1eb8-590c-be87-470c9c2f72f7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'b9ef3070-cae9-59ed-b379-50536ccf5845', '415f3631-9471-57b4-975d-100bc8bfd8af', 'sensation', '/senˈseɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một cảm nhận vật lý hoặc cảm xúc mà bạn trải nghiệm.', 'a physical feeling or perception resulting from something that happens to the body.', 'I felt a strange tingling sensation in my fingers after touching the cold metal.', 'Tôi cảm thấy một cảm giác ngứa ran lạ ở các ngón tay sau khi chạm vào kim loại lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The new organic tea created a pleasant sensation of warmth and relaxation.\", \"vi\": \"Trà hữu cơ mới tạo ra một cảm giác ấm áp và thư giãn dễ chịu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-ljspeech-d2ce90c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-cori-d2ce90c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sensation-10400c0e.webp', '[\"feeling\", \"perception\", \"impression\"]', '[\"numbness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"burning sensation\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác bỏng rát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause a sensation\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra một sự chấn động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sensibility\", \"note_vi\": \"khả năng cảm thụ, độ nhạy cảm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sensational\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sensationalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-cori-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru0-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru5-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru6-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru10-d2ce90c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru9-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru3-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru7-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru8-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-aru2-d2ce90c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-ljspeech-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt408-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt138-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt624-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt396-d2ce90c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt498-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt132-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt288-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt42-d2ce90c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensation-lt90-d2ce90c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa cảm giác thể chất, nó còn chỉ một sự kiện gây xôn xao dư luận.', 'dining', 1, 7),
('2320f486-ae99-510e-b3c1-d2b6c2a124b5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'b9ef3070-cae9-59ed-b379-50536ccf5845', '415f3631-9471-57b4-975d-100bc8bfd8af', 'dramatically', 'UK: /drəˈmætɪkli/ | US: /drəˈmætɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'đáng kể, mạnh mẽ', 'in a sudden, impressive, and noticeable manner that attracts significant attention.', 'Sales have increased dramatically this quarter.', 'Doanh số đã tăng đáng kể trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"Online sales rose dramatically following the launch of the new mobile application.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến đã tăng lên đáng kể sau khi ra mắt ứng dụng di động mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-ljspeech-3a210a49.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-cori-3a210a49.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dramatically-2f937fdb.webp', '[\"significantly\", \"substantially\", \"sharply\", \"markedly\"]', '[\"slightly\", \"modestly\", \"gradually\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase dramatically\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng vượt bậc / đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drop dramatically\", \"meaning\": \"giảm mạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"drastically\", \"note_vi\": \"Dramatically nhấn mạnh sự ấn tượng, gây chú ý; Drastically nhấn mạnh tính cực đoan, quyết liệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drama\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dramatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-cori-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru0-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru5-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru6-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru10-3a210a49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru9-3a210a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dramatically-aru3-3a