('2f6d642f-9a22-5b50-8e4e-4f32611f7b28', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba6291ce-2ec1-5a36-8c74-5ed8d4531f3d', '89afd5b0-4d02-5628-8560-0d66b1b1ada8', 'seize', '/siːz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nắm lấy, bắt giữ một cách nhanh chóng hoặc mạnh mẽ.', 'to take hold of something suddenly and with a lot of force.', 'The police managed to seize a large quantity of illegal goods during the raid.', 'Cảnh sát đã tóm giữ được một lượng lớn hàng hóa bất hợp pháp trong cuộc đột kích.', '{\"en\": \"Local businesses must seize the opportunity to expand their market share during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Các doanh nghiệp địa phương phải nắm bắt cơ hội để mở rộng thị phần trong mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-ljspeech-44b55eac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-cori-44b55eac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seize-cf13452e.webp', '[\"grab\", \"grasp\", \"capture\"]', '[\"release\", \"let go\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seize an opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"nắm bắt cơ hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seize control\", \"meaning\": \"giành quyền kiểm soát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cease\", \"note_vi\": \"cease nghĩa là dừng lại, phát âm gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"seizure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-cori-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru0-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru5-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru6-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru10-44b55eac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru9-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru3-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru7-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seize-aru8-44b55eac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob