('4967f394-8539-5a5c-9d31-6a1fc9fb344e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba6291ce-2ec1-5a36-8c74-5ed8d4531f3d', '89afd5b0-4d02-5628-8560-0d66b1b1ada8', 'execution', '/ˌeksɪˈkjuːʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thực hiện, thi hành hoặc sự hành quyết.', 'the process of doing something or carrying out a plan or order.', 'The execution of the project went smoothly, thanks to careful planning.', 'Việc thực hiện dự án diễn ra suôn sẻ nhờ kế hoạch cẩn thận.', '{\"en\": \"The team was praised for the efficient execution of the marketing strategy last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ đã được khen ngợi vì việc thực hiện hiệu quả chiến lược tiếp thị trong quý vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-ljspeech-1e214745.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-cori-1e214745.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/execution-adc1ea8e.webp', '[\"implementation\", \"performance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"successful execution\", \"meaning\": \"việc thực hiện thành công\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"execute\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-cori-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru0-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru5-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru6-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru10-1e214745.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru9-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru3-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru7-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru8-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-aru2-1e214745.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-ljspeech-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt408-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt138-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt624-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt396-1e214745.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt498-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt132-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt288-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt42-1e214745.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/execution-lt90-1e214745.mp3\"]}}', 'nghĩa phổ biến trong công sở là \'thực hiện dự án\', không phải \'hành quyết\'.', 'business', 1, 6),
('8dd5aaad-1724-5819-b7ec-4ae2992c3231', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba6291ce-2ec1-5a36-8c74-5ed8d4531f3d', '89afd5b0-4d02-5628-8560-0d66b1b1ada8', 'flexibility', '/ˌfleksəˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự linh hoạt, khả năng uốn dẻo.', 'the ability to change or be changed easily according to the situation.', 'Modern working contracts usually offer employee schedule flexibility and remote options.', 'Hợp đồng lao động hiện đại thường cung cấp cho nhân viên sự linh hoạt về lịch trình và các lựa chọn làm việc từ xa.', '{\"en\": \"We offer great flexibility in scheduling to help employees balance work and personal life.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cung cấp sự linh hoạt tuyệt vời trong việc xếp lịch để giúp nhân viên cân bằng công việc và cuộc sống cá nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-ljspeech-ca406905.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-cori-ca406905.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flexibility-94d2e20b.webp', '[\"adaptability\", \"versatility\", \"elasticity\"]', '[\"rigidity\", \"inflexibility\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"workplace flexibility\", \"meaning\": \"sự linh hoạt nơi làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial flexibility\", \"meaning\": \"sự linh hoạt tài chính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"flexible\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"flexibly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-cori-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru0-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru5-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru6-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru10-ca406905.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru9-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru3-ca406905.mp3\", \"/sto