('c5e6ab0d-d6cb-5bb9-aa38-b6130ae5d1c3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba6291ce-2ec1-5a36-8c74-5ed8d4531f3d', '89afd5b0-4d02-5628-8560-0d66b1b1ada8', 'post-war', '/ˌpəʊstˈwɔː/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về thời kỳ ngay sau một cuộc chiến tranh.', 'happening or existing in the period after a war.', 'The country experienced a period of rapid economic growth in the post-war era.', 'Đất nước đã trải qua một thời kỳ tăng trưởng kinh tế nhanh chóng trong kỷ nguyên hậu chiến.', '{\"en\": \"The post-war reconstruction project created thousands of new jobs in the construction sector.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án tái thiết sau chiến tranh đã tạo ra hàng ngàn việc làm mới trong ngành xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-ljspeech-41ebe457.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-cori-41ebe457.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/post-war-f5eafde1.webp', NULL, '[\"pre-war\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"post-war era\", \"meaning\": \"thời kỳ sau chiến tranh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"post-war reconstruction\", \"meaning\": \"tái thiết sau chiến tranh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-cori-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru0-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru5-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru6-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru10-41ebe457.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru9-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru3-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru7-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru8-41ebe457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-war-aru2-41ebe457.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun