('6fafb105-5f7b-5d5d-a109-5964c0532007', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'refusal', '/rɪˈfjuːzl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động không chấp nhận hoặc đồng ý làm gì.', 'the act of saying no to a request, offer, or an invitation from someone else.', 'Her refusal to cooperate made the investigation more difficult.', 'Việc cô ấy từ chối hợp tác đã khiến cuộc điều tra khó khăn hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The client\'s refusal to sign the contract caused a significant delay in our project timeline.\", \"vi\": \"Việc khách hàng từ chối ký hợp đồng đã gây ra sự chậm trễ đáng kể trong tiến độ dự án của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-ljspeech-f15c5a0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-cori-f15c5a0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/refusal-32646088.webp', '[\"rejection\", \"denial\"]', '[\"acceptance\", \"agreement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flat refusal\", \"meaning\": \"từ chối thẳng thừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"refusal to\", \"meaning\": \"từ chối làm gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"refuse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-cori-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru0-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru5-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru6-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru10-f15c5a0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru9-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru3-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru7-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru8-f15c5a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refusal-aru2-f15c5a0d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": 