('e5b0ec54-3dbe-5f04-9fec-1c77e8ac97f7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'prevail', '/prɪˈveɪl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Thắng thế, chiếm ưu thế hoặc phổ biến.', 'to be the most common or strongest feeling or opinion in a particular situation or place.', 'Despite the initial difficulties, justice eventually prevailed.', 'Mặc dù có những khó khăn ban đầu, công lý cuối cùng đã thắng thế.', '{\"en\": \"Optimism continued to prevail among investors despite the recent fluctuations in the global stock market.\", \"vi\": \"Sự lạc quan vẫn tiếp tục chiếm ưu thế trong giới đầu tư bất chấp những biến động gần đây trên thị trường chứng khoán toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-ljspeech-a1de3fef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-cori-a1de3fef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prevail-f59afd74.webp', '[\"dominate\", \"triumph\"]', '[\"fail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prevail over\", \"meaning\": \"chiếm ưu thế hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevailing trend\", \"meaning\": \"xu hướng phổ biến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prevalence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prevalent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-cori-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru0-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru5-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru6-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru10-a1de3fef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru9-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru3-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru7-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-aru8-a1de3fef.mp3\", \"/storage