('c19662c9-a706-5326-bef6-872e3b89270d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'stem', '/stem/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thân cây, cọng của một loài thực vật.', 'the thin part of a plant that supports leaves, flowers, or fruits and connects to roots.', 'The rose had a long, thorny stem that made it difficult to pick without gloves.', 'Bông hồng có một thân dài, đầy gai nên khó hái nếu không đeo găng tay.', '{\"en\": \"The florist carefully trimmed the long stem of the flower before placing it in water.\", \"vi\": \"Người bán hoa cẩn thận cắt tỉa phần cọng dài của bông hoa trước khi cắm vào nước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-ljspeech-e1d3fe39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-cori-e1d3fe39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stem-ab2a4a3b.webp', '[\"stalk\", \"trunk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plant stem\", \"meaning\": \"thân cây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flower stem\", \"meaning\": \"cọng hoa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stem\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-cori-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru0-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru5-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru6-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru10-e1d3fe39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru9-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru3-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru7-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru8-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-aru2-e1d3fe39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stem-ljspeech-e1d3fe39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public