('feb9935e-b066-53ae-9bcc-65d02caad4c3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'layout', '/ˈleɪaʊt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cách sắp xếp các phần tử trên một trang, không gian hoặc thiết kế.', 'the way in which the parts of something are arranged or organized.', 'The layout of the new office makes it feel more spacious and organized.', 'Bố cục của văn phòng mới khiến nó trông rộng rãi và có tổ chức hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The graphic designer changed the layout of the brochure to make it more attractive.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đồ họa đã thay đổi bố cục của cuốn tài liệu quảng cáo để làm nó thu hút hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-ljspeech-207b877e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-cori-207b877e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/layout-a0537ede.webp', '[\"arrangement\", \"design\", \"format\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"office layout\", \"meaning\": \"bố cục văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"page layout\", \"meaning\": \"bố cục trang\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"outlay\", \"note_vi\": \"outlay là chi phí ban đầu để bắt đầu một dự án.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lay out\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-cori-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru0-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru5-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru6-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru10-207b877e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru9-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru3-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru7-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru8-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-aru2-207b877e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-ljspeech-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt408-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt138-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt624-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt396-207b877e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt498-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt132-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt288-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt42-207b877e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/layout-lt90-207b877e.mp3\"]}}', 'Layout là danh từ viết liền, còn động từ cụm là lay out.', 'office', 1, 26),
('71382df4-7fa5-5f8b-b9cd-07fe324c76be', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'mileage', 'UK: /ˈmaɪlɪdʒ/ | US: /ˈmaɪlɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'quãng đường đã đi, mức tiêu thụ nhiên liệu', 'the total distance traveled by a vehicle or its fuel efficiency level.', 'This car gets good mileage on the highway.', 'Chiếc xe này tiết kiệm nhiên liệu tốt trên đường cao tốc.', '{\"en\": \"Sales representatives can submit a claim for mileage reimbursement after visiting client offices.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện kinh doanh có thể nộp đơn xin hoàn trả chi phí công tác phí dựa trên quãng đường đi sau khi thăm văn phòng khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-ljspeech-0e84936d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-cori-0e84936d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mileage-57297c5a.webp', '[\"distance\", \"travel allowance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mileage reimbursement\", \"meaning\": \"khoản hoàn trả chi phí đi lại tính theo quãng đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high mileage\", \"meaning\": \"số dặm/km đã đi cao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mile\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-cori-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru0-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru5-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru6-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru10-0e84936d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru9-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru3-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru7-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru8-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-aru2-0e84936d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-ljspeech-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt408-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt138-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt624-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt396-0e84936d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt498-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt132-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt288-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt42-0e84936d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mileage-lt90-0e84936d.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp trong cụm \'mileage reimbursement\' (khoản thanh toán hoàn lại tiền xăng/chi phí đi công tác).', 'travel', 1, 27),
('48bffff1-72e8-5df7-9906-8920e231a179', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'resume', '/rɪˈzjuːm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bắt đầu lại sau một khoảng dừng.', 'to start doing something again after a temporary stop or interruption.', 'After a short break, the meeting will resume at 2 PM.', 'Sau một thời gian nghỉ ngắn, cuộc họp sẽ tiếp tục vào lúc 2 giờ chiều.', '{\"en\": \"Construction work will resume next Monday after the heavy rain stops completely.\", \"vi\": \"Công việc xây dựng sẽ bắt đầu lại vào thứ Hai tuần tới sau khi mưa lớn dứt hẳn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-ljspeech-a2b41bba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-cori-a2b41bba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resume-c47962b5.webp', '[\"restart\", \"recommence\", \"continue\"]', '[\"suspend\", \"halt\", \"pause\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"resume work\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"resume operations\", \"meaning\": \"khôi phục hoạt động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"résumé\", \"note_vi\": \"résumé là sơ yếu lý lịch, resume là tiếp tục\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"resumption\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-cori-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru0-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru5-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru6-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru10-a2b41bba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru9-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru3-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru7-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru8-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-aru2-a2b41bba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-ljspeech-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt408-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt138-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt624-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt396-a2b41bba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt498-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt132-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt288-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt42-a2b41bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resume-lt90-a2b41bba.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt động từ resume /rɪˈzjuːm/ (tiếp tục) với danh từ résumé /ˈrezjuːmeɪ/ (CV xin việc).', 'office', 1, 28),
('d9af920f-fe11-5744-94a3-5dd60e94c98b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ba646ebe-7bc5-555c-8ad3-9cec32f140b1', '87fc8f21-b191-5f0e-9de8-b68303cd3f1b', 'outstanding', 'UK: /ˌaʊtˈstændɪŋ/ | US: /ˌaʊtˈstændɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'xuất sắc, nổi bật', 'extremely good, excellent, or much better than average performance or quality', 'Her outstanding performance earned her a promotion.', 'Màn trình diễn xuất sắc của cô ấy đã giúp cô ấy được thăng chức.', '{\"en\": \"Please settle all outstanding invoices before the end of the fiscal quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thanh toán tất cả các hóa đơn còn tồn đọng trước khi kết thúc quý tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-ljspeech-b5efd490.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-cori-b5efd490.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outstanding-d4ed2ef1.webp', '[\"exceptional\", \"unpaid\", \"unresolved\", \"remarkable\"]', '[\"ordinary\", \"paid\", \"settled\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"outstanding balance\", \"meaning\": \"số dư chưa thanh toán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outstanding achievement\", \"meaning\": \"thành tựu xuất sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outstanding invoice\", \"meaning\": \"hóa đơn chưa trả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"upstanding\", \"note_vi\": \"Upstanding chỉ tính cách con người thẳng thắn, chính trực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"outstandingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-cori-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru0-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru5-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru6-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru10-b5efd490.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru9-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru3-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru7-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru8-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-aru2-b5efd490.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-ljspeech-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt408-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt138-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt624-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt396-b5efd490.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt498-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt132-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt288-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt42-b5efd490.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outstanding-lt90-b5efd490.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'outstanding\' có 2 nghĩa quan trọng: 1) Xuất sắc (performance); 2) Chưa thanh toán / tồn đọng (balance, invoice).', 'finance', 1, 29),
('2d45ad38-b241-5bcc-b2e8-3750f20656f7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'c43fd9e9-bf9b-545a-b2f9-7599fe26a9a4', '8a1450ba-4d1e-5c1b-86bd-0d9c152ccb84', 'canvas', '/ˈkænvəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một loại vải dày, chắc chắn dùng để vẽ tranh, làm lều hoặc túi.', 'a strong heavy cloth used for making tents, bags, and for oil painting.', 'The artist stretched a new canvas before starting her painting.', 'Người họa sĩ đã căng một tấm vải bạt mới trước khi bắt đầu bức tranh của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The factory ordered high-quality canvas to manufacture durable travel backpacks for clients.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã đặt mua vải bạt chất lượng cao để sản xuất balo du lịch bền cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-ljspeech-7aa15835.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-cori-7aa15835.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/canvas-f5c4e6d5.webp', '[\"fabric\", \"cloth\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"canvas bag\", \"meaning\": \"túi vải bạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oil on canvas\", \"meaning\": \"tranh sơn dầu trên vải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"canvass\", \"note_vi\": \"thêm chữ s nghĩa là vận động bầu cử hoặc điều tra dư luận\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-cori-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru0-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru5-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru6-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru10-7aa15835.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru9-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru3-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru7-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru8-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-aru2-7aa15835.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-ljspeech-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt408-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt138-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt624-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt396-7aa15835.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt498-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt132-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt288-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt42-7aa15835.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/canvas-lt90-7aa15835.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt canvas (vải bạt/tranh canvas) và canvass (vận động ý kiến, thăm dò).', 'manufacturing', 1, 0),
('ebab5f52-3b2a-59cd-aa89-e40961df4f62', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'c43fd9e9-bf9b-545a-b2f9-7599fe26a9a4', '8a1450ba-4d1e-5c1b-86bd-0d9c152ccb84', 'circulate', '/ˈsɜːkjəleɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Di chuyển hoặc truyền bá trong một khu vực hoặc nhóm người.', 'to move around within a system, or to pass from person to person.', 'News of the event began to circulate quickly through the town.', 'Tin tức về sự kiện bắt đầu lưu truyền nhanh chóng khắp thị trấn.', '{\"en\": \"Please circulate this memo to all department heads before the meeting on Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng luân chuyển bản ghi nhớ này cho tất cả các trưởng bộ phận trước cuộc họp vào thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-ljspeech-f1771dbd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-cori-f1771dbd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/circulate-d0be9fc7.webp', '[\"spread\", \"distribute\", \"flow\"]', '[\"stagnate\", \"stop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"circulate a document\", \"meaning\": \"luân chuyển tài liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blood circulates\", \"meaning\": \"máu lưu thông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"calculate\", \"note_vi\": \"calculate là tính toán, circulate là luân chuyển, lưu thông.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"circulation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-cori-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru0-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru5-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru6-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru10-f1771dbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru9-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru3-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru7-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru8-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-aru2-f1771dbd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-ljspeech-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt408-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt138-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt624-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt396-f1771dbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt498-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt132-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt288-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt42-f1771dbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circulate-lt90-f1771dbd.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường văn phòng, circulate thường dùng với nghĩa truyền tay tài liệu, thông báo.', 'office', 1, 1),
('0de74185-6381-596c-9877-231727e9bc91', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'c43fd9e9-bf9b-545a-b2f9-7599fe26a9a4', '8a1450ba-4d1e-5c1b-86bd-0d9c152ccb84', 'overwhelm', '/ˌəʊvəˈwelm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó cảm thấy quá nhiều cảm xúc hoặc công việc đến mức khó đối phó.', 'to cause someone to feel sudden strong emotion or have too much work.', 'The sheer amount of information can sometimes overwhelm new students.', 'Lượng thông tin khổng lồ đôi khi có thể làm choáng ngợp các sinh viên mới.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service department was overwhelmed by the high volume of calls today.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận dịch vụ khách hàng đã bị quá tải bởi lượng cuộc gọi lớn ngày hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-ljspeech-95c65348.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-cori-95c65348.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overwhelm-83358abb.webp', '[\"overload\", \"inundate\", \"swamp\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"overwhelm with work\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho quá tải công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be overwhelmed by\", \"meaning\": \"bị choáng ngợp hoặc quá tải bởi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overtake\", \"note_vi\": \"overtake là vượt qua, bắt kịp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"overwhelming\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"overwhelmingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-cori-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru0-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru5-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru6-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru10-95c65348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru9-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru3-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru7-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru8-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru2-95c65348.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-ljspeech-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt408-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt138-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt624-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt396-95c65348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt498-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt132-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt288-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt42-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt90-95c65348.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng ở dạng bị động \'be overwhelmed by/with\' để chỉ sự quá tải.', 'hr', 1, 2),
('7b2ff156-80dc-5b28-a3e8-1e5ff3669641', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'c43fd9e9-bf9b-545a-b2f9-7599fe26a9a4', '8a1450ba-4d1e-5c1b-86bd-0d9c152ccb84', 'conception', '/kənˈsepʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự thụ thai, sự hình thành phôi thai.', 'the process of a woman or female animal becoming pregnant with a baby.', 'The precise moment of conception is often difficult to determine.', 'Thời điểm thụ thai chính xác thường rất khó xác định.', '{\"en\": \"Medical specialists at the clinic provided guidance to couples seeking assistance with conception.\", \"vi\": \"Các chuyên gia y tế tại phòng khám đã đưa ra hướng dẫn cho các cặp vợ chồng tìm kiếm trợ giúp về việc thụ thai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-ljspeech-52bb76fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-cori-52bb76fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conception-98ab3f4c.webp', '[\"fertilization\", \"impregnation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"from conception to birth\", \"meaning\": \"từ khi thụ thai đến khi sinh ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moment of conception\", \"meaning\": \"thời điểm thụ thai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"perception\", \"note_vi\": \"perception là sự nhận thức hoặc cảm nhận\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conceive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conceptual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-cori-52bb76fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-aru0-52bb76fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-aru5-52bb76fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-aru6-52bb76fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-aru10-52bb76fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-aru9-52bb76fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-aru3-52bb76fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conception-ar