('57022263-0a5f-55fa-9301-a8b4c195c8f9', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'c43fd9e9-bf9b-545a-b2f9-7599fe26a9a4', '8a1450ba-4d1e-5c1b-86bd-0d9c152ccb84', 'sound', '/saʊnd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Cái mà tai nghe được, một rung động truyền qua không khí.', 'something that you can hear, caused by vibrations moving through the air or water.', 'The sound of waves crashing on the shore was very relaxing.', 'Âm thanh sóng vỗ vào bờ rất thư giãn.', '{\"en\": \"The technician adjusted the sound settings to ensure clear audio during the video conference.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã điều chỉnh cài đặt âm thanh để đảm bảo âm thanh rõ ràng trong cuộc họp trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-ljspeech-5e2e97c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-cori-5e2e97c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sound-61ccca67.webp', '[\"noise\", \"audio\"]', '[\"silence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sound quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng âm thanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sound system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống âm thanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sound\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-cori-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru0-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru5-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru6-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru10-5e2e97c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru9-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru3-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru7-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru8-5e2e97c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-aru2-5e2e97c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-ljspeech