('e69e7e54-d0b6-5b34-82cd-5bc6dceb882d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'intensify', '/ɪnˈtensɪfaɪ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'làm cho cái gì đó trở nên mạnh mẽ, dữ dội hoặc lớn hơn.', 'to become greater, stronger, or more extreme, or to make something do this.', 'The storm is expected to intensify overnight, bringing heavier rain.', 'Cơn bão dự kiến sẽ tăng cường trong đêm, mang theo mưa lớn hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team decided to intensify their advertising efforts before the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị quyết định gia tăng các nỗ lực quảng cáo trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-ljspeech-b1cf0ab0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-cori-b1cf0ab0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intensify-0fe3b6db.webp', '[\"escalate\", \"heighten\"]', '[\"weaken\", \"diminish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intensify efforts\", \"meaning\": \"gia tăng nỗ lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intensify competition\", \"meaning\": \"làm gia tăng sự cạnh tranh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intent\", \"note_vi\": \"intent là ý định, intensify là gia tăng/làm mạnh thêm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intensity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intense\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-cori-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru0-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru5-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru6-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru10-b1cf0ab0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru9-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru3-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/st