('52aeba22-2755-5f55-b030-75935bb11de5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'legislature', '/ˈledʒɪslətʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cơ quan chính phủ có quyền làm luật.', 'a group of people who have the power to make and change the laws of a country.', 'The new bill needs to be approved by the state legislature before it becomes law.', 'Dự luật mới cần được cơ quan lập pháp bang thông qua trước khi trở thành luật.', '{\"en\": \"The state legislature will vote on the proposed tax reform bill early next month.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ quan lập pháp tiểu bang sẽ bỏ phiếu về dự luật cải cách thuế vào đầu tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-ljspeech-16affee5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-cori-16affee5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/legislature-0afbf5a2.webp', '[\"parliament\", \"congress\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"state legislature\", \"meaning\": \"cơ quan lập pháp tiểu bang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pass a law\", \"meaning\": \"thông qua luật\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"legislative\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"legislate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-cori-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru0-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru5-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru6-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru10-16affee5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru9-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru3-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru7-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru8-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-aru2-16affee5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-ljspeech-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt408-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt138-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt624-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt396-16affee5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt498-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt132-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt288-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt42-16affee5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislature-lt90-16affee5.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'legis\' nghĩa là luật, \'lature\' chỉ nhóm người thực hiện.', 'law', 1, 9),
('d81ccc79-523a-523e-bc8d-3ce073be7d06', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'hesitant', 'UK: /ˈhɛzɪtənt/ | US: /ˈhɛzɪtənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'do dự, ngần ngại', 'Slow to act or speak due to feelings of uncertainty, doubt, or reluctance.', 'She was hesitant to accept the new project at first.', 'Cô ấy ban đầu do dự không muốn nhận dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"Investors were hesitant to fund the startup until the market stabilized.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà đầu tư đã ngần ngại rót vốn cho công ty khởi nghiệp cho đến khi thị trường ổn định.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-ljspeech-7c65a42e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-cori-7c65a42e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hesitant-6a869513.webp', '[\"reluctant\", \"uncertain\", \"indecisive\", \"cautious\"]', '[\"decisive\", \"confident\", \"certain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be hesitant to\", \"meaning\": \"ngần ngại làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hesitant response\", \"meaning\": \"câu phản hồi ngập ngừng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hesitation\", \"note_vi\": \"\'hesitant\' là tính từ (do dự), còn \'hesitation\' là danh từ (sự do dự).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hesitate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hesitation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hesitantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-cori-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru0-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru5-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru6-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru10-7c65a42e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru9-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru3-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru7-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru8-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-aru2-7c65a42e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-ljspeech-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt408-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt138-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt624-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt396-7c65a42e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt498-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt132-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt288-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt42-7c65a42e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hesitant-lt90-7c65a42e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'about\' hoặc động từ nguyên mẫu \'to do something\' (hesitant about doing sth / hesitant to do sth).', 'business strategy', 1, 10),
('660baf7e-7e35-5216-83ef-ea10cc3ace3c', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'isolate', 'UK: /ˈaɪsəleɪtɪd/ | US: /ˈaɪsəleɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'hẻo lánh, biệt lập', 'Far away from other places, buildings, or people, and difficult to reach.', 'The village is located in an isolated region.', 'Ngôi làng nằm ở một vùng hẻo lánh.', '{\"en\": \"The resort is located in an isolate area, far from the noise of the city center.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng nằm ở một khu vực biệt lập, xa khỏi tiếng ồn của trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-ljspeech-eb5779e2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-cori-eb5779e2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/isolate-d36ff4b8.webp', '[\"isolated\", \"remote\", \"secluded\"]', '[\"accessible\", \"central\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"isolate location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí biệt lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"isolate area\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực hẻo lánh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insulate\", \"note_vi\": \"insulate nghĩa là cách nhiệt hoặc cách điện\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"isolate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"isolation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-cori-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru0-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru5-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru6-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru10-eb5779e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru9-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru3-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru7-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru8-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-aru2-eb5779e2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-ljspeech-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt408-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt138-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt624-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt396-eb5779e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt498-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt132-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt288-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt42-eb5779e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isolate-lt90-eb5779e2.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong bài thi TOEIC, tính từ thường gặp hơn là \'isolated\', dùng miêu tả địa điểm xa xôi hoặc cơ sở vật chất nằm biệt lập.', 'travel', 1, 11),
('dc5e9de4-9fd0-5c12-9c8f-4046c2f59ee3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'tribute', '/ˈtrɪbjuːt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời nói, hành động hoặc vật thể thể hiện sự tôn kính, ngưỡng mộ hoặc tưởng nhớ.', 'something that you say, write, or do to show respect and admiration for someone.', 'The concert was a beautiful tribute to the late musician.', 'Buổi hòa nhạc là một sự tưởng nhớ tuyệt vời dành cho cố nhạc sĩ.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a special dinner as a tribute to the retiring chief executive officer.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một bữa tối đặc biệt như một sự tri ân đối với giám đốc điều hành sắp nghỉ hưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-ljspeech-aa4798cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-cori-aa4798cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tribute-2f72e486.webp', '[\"homage\", \"testimonial\", \"accolade\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pay tribute to\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ lòng tôn kính/tri ân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fitting tribute\", \"meaning\": \"sự tri ân phù hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contribution\", \"note_vi\": \"tribute là sự tri ân/tôn kính, contribution là sự đóng góp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tributary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-cori-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru0-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru5-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru6-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru10-aa4798cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru9-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru3-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tribute-aru7-aa4798cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi