('c6b2553a-0626-5a32-9cfe-def2e7f9ab55', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'weaken', '/ˈwiːkən/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho yếu đi, suy giảm.', 'to make something less strong or less powerful than it was before.', 'The long illness began to weaken his body.', 'Căn bệnh kéo dài bắt đầu làm suy yếu cơ thể anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in sales will weaken our position in the competitive market.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm doanh số đột ngột sẽ làm suy yếu vị thế của chúng ta trên thị trường cạnh tranh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-ljspeech-fcb9e7c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-cori-fcb9e7c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weaken-67de41c9.webp', '[\"undermine\", \"impair\"]', '[\"strengthen\", \"reinforce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"weaken the position\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy yếu vị thế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weaken the economy\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy yếu nền kinh tế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weakness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weak\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-cori-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru0-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru5-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru6-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru10-fcb9e7c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru9-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru3-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru7-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru8-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru2-fcb9e7c6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun