('60ff4434-0aa9-5f67-a358-2af49136a1f8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'dual', '/ˈdjuːəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có hai phần, chức năng hoặc đặc điểm.', 'having two parts, functions, or aspects that work together or exist at once.', 'The car has a dual purpose: it can be used for both city driving and off-road adventures.', 'Chiếc xe có mục đích kép: nó có thể dùng để lái trong thành phố lẫn phiêu lưu off-road.', '{\"en\": \"Our new printer has a dual function for scanning and faxing documents.\", \"vi\": \"Máy in mới của chúng tôi có chức năng kép để quét và gửi fax tài liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-ljspeech-618693d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-cori-618693d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dual-e0d39f86.webp', '[\"double\", \"twofold\"]', '[\"single\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dual purpose\", \"meaning\": \"mục đích kép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dual role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò kép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dual citizenship\", \"meaning\": \"quốc tịch kép\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"duel\", \"note_vi\": \"Duel là cuộc đấu (kiếm/súng), dual nghĩa là hai phần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"duality\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"dually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-cori-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru0-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru5-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru6-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru10-618693d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru9-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru3-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dual-aru7-618693d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati