('30e23806-bec2-5f42-8d26-456f35bd157a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'congregation', '/ˌkɒŋɡrɪˈɡeɪʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người tụ họp lại vì mục đích tôn giáo, giáo đoàn.', 'a group of people who are gathered together in a church for a religious service.', 'The pastor addressed the entire congregation during the Sunday service.', 'Mục sư đã nói chuyện với toàn bộ giáo đoàn trong buổi lễ Chủ Nhật.', '{\"en\": \"The community center hall was rented out to accommodate the large congregation for the event.\", \"vi\": \"Hội trường trung tâm cộng đồng đã được thuê để phục vụ giáo đoàn đông đảo cho sự kiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-ljspeech-47c688b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-cori-47c688b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/congregation-2cc345ee.webp', '[\"assembly\", \"parishioners\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"large congregation\", \"meaning\": \"giáo đoàn đông đảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"address the congregation\", \"meaning\": \"phát biểu trước giáo đoàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"congregate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-cori-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru0-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru5-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru6-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru10-47c688b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru9-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru3-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru7-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru8-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-aru2-47c688b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-ljspeech-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt408-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt138-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt624-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt396-47c688b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt498-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt132-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt288-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt42-47c688b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congregation-lt90-47c688b5.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng trong ngữ cảnh tôn giáo hoặc các buổi lễ trang trọng.', 'other', 1, 21),
('b8a5da7c-8fdf-5db4-b6f8-c128612fa0f6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'sovereignty', '/ˈsɒvrənti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Quyền lực tối cao của một quốc gia tự quyết định mọi việc.', 'the complete power and authority of a country to govern itself without outside control.', 'The treaty respects the complete national sovereignty of both participating nations.', 'Hiệp ước tôn trọng chủ quyền quốc gia hoàn toàn của cả hai quốc gia tham gia.', '{\"en\": \"The international trade agreement respects the economic sovereignty of each participating member nation.\", \"vi\": \"Hiệp định thương mại quốc tế tôn trọng chủ quyền kinh tế của mỗi quốc gia thành viên tham gia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-ljspeech-3cbf4111.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-cori-3cbf4111.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sovereignty-c27e2f7d.webp', '[\"autonomy\", \"independence\", \"self-rule\"]', '[\"dependence\", \"subjugation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"national sovereignty\", \"meaning\": \"chủ quyền quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"protect sovereignty\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ chủ quyền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solitary\", \"note_vi\": \"Solitary có nghĩa là cô đơn, đơn độc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sovereign\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-cori-3cbf4111.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-aru0-3cbf4111.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-aru5-3cbf4111.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-aru6-3cbf4111.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-aru10-3cbf4111.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-aru9-3cbf4111.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sovereignty-aru3-3cbf4111.mp3\", \"/stor