('d13bb30b-7f7f-57eb-9976-0c9e98b99f8b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'cb0b507b-1a94-5fa6-aa5d-3303b78f0bdf', '0a78b57d-474e-5189-8b3c-3c0f062b9ebb', 'countless', '/ˈkaʊntləs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất nhiều, không thể đếm hết.', 'a very large number of things that is impossible to calculate or list completely.', 'The engineering team devoted countless hours to testing the software before its launch.', 'Đội ngũ kỹ thuật đã dành vô số giờ để thử nghiệm phần mềm trước khi ra mắt.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service team has received countless complaints regarding the recent software update issues.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ chăm sóc khách hàng đã nhận được vô số lời phàn nàn về các vấn đề cập nhật phần mềm gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-ljspeech-852aa71d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-cori-852aa71d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/countless-a4d6af86.webp', '[\"numerous\", \"innumerable\"]', '[\"few\", \"limited\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"countless hours\", \"meaning\": \"vô số giờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"countless opportunities\", \"meaning\": \"vô số cơ hội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"count\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-cori-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru0-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru5-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru6-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru10-852aa71d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru9-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru3-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru7-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countless-aru8-852aa71d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr