('a29c242d-8e08-5760-b545-3c4cfacaccee', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce3c0e8e-c23a-5086-b7f3-06e616064205', '42302bb6-0ecd-57ac-9a71-dbbbadd95dd9', 'farewell', 'UK: /ˌfeəˈwel/ | US: /ˌferˈwel/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lời tạm biệt, tiệc chia tay', 'An expression of good wishes at parting, or an event marking someone\'s departure.', 'The team hosted a farewell dinner for the retiring manager.', 'Nhóm đã tổ chức một bữa tiệc tối chia tay cho người quản lý về hưu.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department organized a farewell party for Mr. Henderson, who is retiring after twenty years of service.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã tổ chức một buổi tiệc chia tay cho ông Henderson, người sắp nghỉ hưu sau 20 năm cống hiến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-ljspeech-43c86a6f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-cori-43c86a6f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/farewell-d0a7ffce.webp', '[\"send-off\", \"goodbye\", \"departure\"]', '[\"welcome\", \"greeting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"farewell party\", \"meaning\": \"tiệc chia tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bid farewell to\", \"meaning\": \"gửi lời chào tạm biệt tới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"welfare\", \"note_vi\": \"welfare nghĩa là phúc lợi, an sinh; khác với farewell là lời chào tạm biệt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-cori-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru0-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru5-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru6-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru10-43c86a6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru9-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru3-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru7-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru8-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-aru2-43c86a6f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-ljspeech-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt408-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt138-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt624-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt396-43c86a6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt498-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt132-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt288-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt42-43c86a6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/farewell-lt90-43c86a6f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong các cụm như \'farewell party\' (tiệc chia tay đồng nghiệp) hoặc \'bid farewell\' (gửi lời tạm biệt).', 'office', 1, 20),
('2dd5e9bd-bef7-59ce-9748-f007b4620966', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce3c0e8e-c23a-5086-b7f3-06e616064205', '42302bb6-0ecd-57ac-9a71-dbbbadd95dd9', 'obsess', '/əbˈses/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ám ảnh, bận tâm quá mức về điều gì đó.', 'to think about one specific thing all the time in a way that is not healthy.', 'Some people tend to obsess over their appearance, constantly worrying about how they look.', 'Một số người có xu hướng ám ảnh về ngoại hình của mình, liên tục lo lắng về vẻ ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The manager tends to obsess over minor details in every report submitted by the staff.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý có xu hướng bận tâm quá mức đến những chi tiết nhỏ trong mọi báo cáo do nhân viên nộp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-ljspeech-edbad88c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-cori-edbad88c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obsess-b9e61f45.webp', '[\"fixate\", \"preoccupy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"obsess over\", \"meaning\": \"ám ảnh về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obsess about\", \"meaning\": \"bận tâm về\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obsession\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obsessive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-cori-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru0-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru5-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru6-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru10-edbad88c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru9-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru3-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru7-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru8-edbad88c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsess-aru2-edbad88