('e739fff1-35c5-5bd1-8415-4424b828d119', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'insertion', '/ɪnˈsɜːʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự chèn vào, sự đưa vào.', 'the act of putting something inside or into something else during a process.', 'The insertion of the new chapter improved the book\'s flow.', 'Việc chèn thêm chương mới đã cải thiện mạch lạc của cuốn sách.', '{\"en\": \"The manual explains the correct insertion of the memory card into the digital camera.\", \"vi\": \"Hướng dẫn giải thích cách chèn thẻ nhớ vào máy ảnh kỹ thuật số một cách chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-ljspeech-af556bb0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-cori-af556bb0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insertion-1b485c36.webp', '[\"introduction\", \"inclusion\"]', '[\"removal\", \"extraction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"correct insertion\", \"meaning\": \"sự chèn đúng cách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"insertion of\", \"meaning\": \"sự chèn vào\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"insert\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-cori-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru0-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru5-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru6-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru10-af556bb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru9-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru3-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru7-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru8-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-aru2-af556bb0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-ljspeech-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt408-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt138-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt624-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt396-af556bb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt498-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt132-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt288-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt42-af556bb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insertion-lt90-af556bb0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong hướng dẫn sử dụng thiết bị kỹ thuật.', 'technology', 1, 17),
('e33bdaeb-5358-5f5d-ae34-751a7947d1ac', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'compelling', '/kəmˈpelɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'rất lôi cuốn, thuyết phục', 'very interesting or exciting so that you have to pay attention to it.', 'Her argument for environmental protection was so compelling that everyone listened intently.', 'Lập luận của cô ấy về bảo vệ môi trường thuyết phục đến nỗi mọi người đều lắng nghe chăm chú.', '{\"en\": \"The sales representative presented a compelling reason for clients to switch to our new software.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện bán hàng đã đưa ra lý do thuyết phục để khách hàng chuyển sang phần mềm mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-ljspeech-2bf274e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-cori-2bf274e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compelling-29b7aef1.webp', '[\"persuasive\", \"convincing\"]', '[\"unconvincing\", \"weak\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"compelling evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng thuyết phục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compelling reason\", \"meaning\": \"lý do thuyết phục\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compel\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-cori-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru0-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru5-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru6-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru10-2bf274e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru9-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru3-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru7-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru8-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-aru2-2bf274e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-ljspeech-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt408-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt138-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt624-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt396-2bf274e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt498-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt132-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt288-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt42-2bf274e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compelling-lt90-2bf274e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả lý do hoặc bằng chứng rất thuyết phục.', 'marketing', 1, 18),
('0a3ab473-8cfc-5d78-a488-f9d9724bf7e3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'on behalf of', '', 'B2', 'phrase', 'thay mặt cho', 'As a representative of or in the interest of another person or group.', 'She accepted the award on behalf of the whole team.', 'Cô ấy đã nhận giải thưởng thay mặt cho cả đội.', '{\"en\": \"On behalf of the management team, I would like to thank everyone for their hard work this year.\", \"vi\": \"Thay mặt cho ban quản lý, tôi xin cảm ơn mọi người vì sự nỗ lực làm việc trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-ljspeech-3082878b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-cori-3082878b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-behalf-of-17fc847c.webp', '[\"in place of\", \"representing\", \"as a representative of\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"speak on behalf of\", \"meaning\": \"발표하다 / phát biểu thay mặt cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sign on behalf of\", \"meaning\": \"ký tên thay mặt cho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in terms of\", \"note_vi\": \"\'In terms of\' nghĩa là xét về mặt/về phần, khác với \'on behalf of\' là đại diện/thay mặt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-cori-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru0-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru5-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru6-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru10-3082878b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru9-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru3-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru7-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru8-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-aru2-3082878b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-ljspeech-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt408-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt138-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt624-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt396-3082878b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt498-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt132-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt288-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt42-3082878b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-behalf-of-lt90-3082878b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cấu trúc \'on behalf of somebody/something\'. Hay dùng trong bài phát biểu đại diện hoặc ký kết hợp đồng thay mặt cá nhân/tổ chức.', 'corporate management', 1, 19),
('edf97583-7ade-5c61-9f5b-3e2d2aab5231', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'guidance', '/ˈɡaɪdns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lời khuyên hoặc sự giúp đỡ chỉ dẫn ai đó làm gì.', 'help or advice that is given to someone to show them what to do.', 'The students received excellent guidance from their academic advisor.', 'Các sinh viên đã nhận được sự hướng dẫn tuyệt vời từ cố vấn học tập của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The new employees received helpful guidance from their manager during the training session.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên mới đã nhận được sự hướng dẫn hữu ích từ quản lý của họ trong buổi đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-ljspeech-30292007.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-cori-30292007.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guidance-47d4cc73.webp', '[\"advice\", \"direction\", \"instruction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under the guidance of\", \"meaning\": \"dưới sự hướng dẫn của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide guidance\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp sự chỉ dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"career guidance\", \"meaning\": \"hướng nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"guideline\", \"note_vi\": \"guideline là nguyên tắc chỉ đạo, guidance là sự chỉ dẫn cụ thể.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"guide\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guide\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-cori-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru0-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru5-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru6-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru10-30292007.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru9-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru3-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru7-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru8-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-aru2-30292007.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-ljspeech-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt408-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt138-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt624-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt396-30292007.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt498-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt132-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt288-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt42-30292007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guidance-lt90-30292007.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với guideline (hướng dẫn mang tính nguyên tắc, quy định).', 'hr', 1, 20),
('39e71c2f-a249-5382-8636-f844862f3e18', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'arbitrary', '/ˈɑːbɪtrəri/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'dựa trên lựa chọn ngẫu nhiên hoặc ý thích cá nhân, không có lý do rõ ràng', 'based on personal chance or impulse rather than any reason or system.', 'The decision to close the park was arbitrary and lacked any scientific basis.', 'Quyết định đóng cửa công viên là tùy tiện và không có cơ sở khoa học nào.', '{\"en\": \"Employees complained that the supervisor made an arbitrary decision regarding holiday schedules.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phàn nàn rằng người giám sát đã đưa ra một quyết định tùy tiện liên quan đến lịch nghỉ lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-ljspeech-e349674c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-cori-e349674c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arbitrary-b68d3212.webp', '[\"random\", \"capricious\", \"unreasonable\"]', '[\"rational\", \"systematic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"arbitrary decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định tùy tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arbitrary choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn ngẫu nhiên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"arbitrarily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-cori-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru0-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru5-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru6-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru10-e349674c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru9-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru3-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru7-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru8-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-aru2-e349674c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-ljspeech-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt408-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt138-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt624-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt396-e349674c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt498-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt132-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt288-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt42-e349674c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitrary-lt90-e349674c.mp3\"]}}', 'Arbitrary miêu tả quyết định cảm tính, không dựa trên quy tắc hay căn cứ rõ ràng.', 'hr', 1, 21),
('2b7825f6-c3c4-52be-b3b7-db5c69936c10', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'nominee', '/ˌnɒmɪˈniː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người được đề cử cho một chức vụ, giải thưởng, hoặc vai trò nào đó.', 'a person who is formally chosen to be considered for a job, position, or award.', 'Each department manager proposed one nominee to join the company safety committee.', 'Mỗi trưởng bộ phận đã đề xuất một ứng cử viên tham gia vào ủy ban an toàn của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The committee will announce the final nominee for the position of marketing director tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban sẽ công bố người được đề cử cuối cùng cho vị trí giám đốc tiếp thị vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-ljspeech-9399d69f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-cori-9399d69f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nominee-5c7d73bb.webp', '[\"candidate\", \"contender\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"award nominee\", \"meaning\": \"người được đề cử giải thưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"presidential nominee\", \"meaning\": \"ứng cử viên tổng thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nominator\", \"note_vi\": \"nominator là người đề cử, nominee là người được đề cử\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"nominate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nomination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-cori-9399d69f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-aru0-9399d69f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-aru5-9399d69f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-aru6-9399d69f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-aru10-9399d69f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-aru9-9399d69f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nominee-aru3-9399d69f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio