('809f1194-8c89-54c9-b531-26b8d20ba6b6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ce7f04fd-f211-5dc4-8803-09f93f153795', '1e470a9b-2283-5856-a068-de4750e8b883', 'conviction', '/kənˈvɪkʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Việc tuyên bố một người có tội sau phiên tòa.', 'the official decision in a court of law that someone is guilty of a crime.', 'The jury returned a unanimous conviction, finding the defendant guilty.', 'Bồi thẩm đoàn đã đưa ra một phán quyết kết án nhất trí, tuyên bị cáo có tội.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department is preparing for the potential conviction of the former business partner.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng pháp lý đang chuẩn bị cho khả năng đối tác kinh doanh cũ bị kết án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-ljspeech-3d4057c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-cori-3d4057c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conviction-b9c0b20c.webp', '[\"sentence\", \"guilt\"]', '[\"acquittal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"secure a conviction\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được bản án kết tội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"previous conviction\", \"meaning\": \"tiền án\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"convict\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"convict\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-cori-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru0-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru5-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru6-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru10-3d4057c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru9-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru3-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru7-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru8-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu