('5fabd44c-7f89-5359-8be0-b78e09c5b107', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'mainstream', '/ˈmeɪnstriːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Các ý tưởng, hoạt động, hoặc quan điểm được chấp nhận rộng rãi nhất.', 'the common ideas or methods that are accepted by most people in a society.', 'Her unique artistic style eventually moved from the fringes to the mainstream.', 'Phong cách nghệ thuật độc đáo của cô ấy cuối cùng đã từ bên lề đi vào dòng chính.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team decided to move the brand into the mainstream to reach more customers.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã quyết định đưa thương hiệu vào xu hướng chủ đạo để tiếp cận nhiều khách hàng hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-ljspeech-e3493be6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-cori-e3493be6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mainstream-7432935d.webp', '[\"trend\", \"norm\"]', '[\"fringe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enter the mainstream\", \"meaning\": \"gia nhập xu hướng chủ đạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mainstream culture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa đại chúng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-cori-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru0-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru5-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru6-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru10-e3493be6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru9-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru3-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru7-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru8-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru2-e3493be6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-ljspeech-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt408-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt138-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt624-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt396-e3493be6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt498-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt132-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt288-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt42-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-lt90-e3493be6.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ cụm \'mainstream media\' để chỉ các phương tiện truyền thông chính thống.', 'marketing', 1, 4),
('f4a08a6e-cdbd-5529-8472-54f0a0e19bde', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'presumably', '/prɪˈzjuːməbli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Có thể cho rằng, có lẽ là như vậy.', 'used to say what you think is likely to happen or be true.', 'They left early, presumably to avoid the rush hour traffic.', 'Họ đã rời đi sớm, có lẽ là để tránh giờ cao điểm.', '{\"en\": \"The regional manager will presumably approve our budget request by the end of this week.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc khu vực có lẽ sẽ phê duyệt yêu cầu ngân sách của chúng tôi vào cuối tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-ljspeech-c23090e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-cori-c23090e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/presumably-1602d748.webp', '[\"probably\", \"supposedly\", \"likely\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"presumably because\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ vì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"presumably intended\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ nhằm mục đích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supposedly\", \"note_vi\": \"Supposedly hàm ý nghi ngờ, còn presumably dựa trên suy đoán hợp lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"presume\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"presumption\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"presumptive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-cori-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru0-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru5-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru6-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru10-c23090e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru9-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru3-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru7-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru8-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru2-c23090e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-ljspeech-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt408-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt138-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt624-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt396-c23090e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt498-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt132-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt288-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt42-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt90-c23090e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Đứng đầu câu hoặc trước động từ chính để thể hiện suy đoán dựa trên lý lẽ.', 'business', 1, 5),
('26864812-2c25-5b23-8965-85d3780363e6', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'impulsive', 'UK: /ɪmˈpʌlsɪv/ | US: /ɪmˈpʌlsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'bốc đồng, hấp tấp', 'Acting or done quickly without carefully thinking about the consequences beforehand.', 'His impulsive choices often led to unexpected results.', 'Những lựa chọn bốc đồng của anh ấy thường dẫn đến kết quả không mong đợi.', '{\"en\": \"Marketing strategies near checkout counters are designed to encourage impulsive purchases.\", \"vi\": \"Các chiến lược tiếp thị gần quầy thanh toán được thiết kế để khuyến khích việc mua hàng ngẫu hứng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-ljspeech-6a47dc3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-cori-6a47dc3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impulsive-565b2755.webp', '[\"hasty\", \"rash\", \"spontaneous\", \"reckless\"]', '[\"cautious\", \"deliberate\", \"calculated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impulsive buying\", \"meaning\": \"việc mua sắm ngẫu hứng/bốc đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impulsive decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định hấp tấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compulsive\", \"note_vi\": \"mang tính cưỡng chế/nghiện (vd: compulsive shopping là cuồng mua sắm do bệnh lý, khác impulsive)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"impulse\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"impulsively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-cori-6a47dc3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-aru0-6a47dc3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-aru5-6a47dc3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-aru6-6a47dc3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-aru10-6a47dc3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impulsive-aru9-6a47dc3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun