('cad3706c-014a-51ef-afc9-e90ecb9990e1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'sphere', '/sfɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một vật thể hình tròn hoàn hảo trong không gian ba chiều.', 'an object that is completely round, like a ball.', 'The Earth is not a perfect sphere; it\'s slightly flattened at the poles.', 'Trái Đất không phải là một hình cầu hoàn hảo; nó hơi dẹt ở hai cực.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing director operates mainly in the sphere of international public relations.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị hoạt động chủ yếu trong lĩnh vực quan hệ công chúng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-ljspeech-f2954408.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-cori-f2954408.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sphere-878e5854.webp', '[\"globe\", \"orb\", \"domain\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sphere of influence\", \"meaning\": \"phạm vi ảnh hưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public sphere\", \"meaning\": \"lĩnh vực công cộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spear\", \"note_vi\": \"spear là cái giáo/mác, phát âm khác sphere.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spherical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-cori-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru0-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru5-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru6-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru10-f2954408.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru9-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru3-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru7-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru8-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru2-f2954408.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-ljspeech-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt408-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt138-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt624-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt396-f2954408.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt498-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt132-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt288-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt42-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt90-f2954408.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa hình cầu, từ này thường dùng với nghĩa \'lĩnh vực hoạt động\'.', 'marketing', 1, 9),
('5edd1163-bd0b-555e-8854-659c9dee531e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'productivity', '/ˌprɒdʌkˈtɪvəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Năng suất làm việc hoặc sản xuất.', 'the rate at which a worker, a company, or a country produces goods and services.', 'Flexible working hours have greatly improved overall productivity across all department teams.', 'Giờ làm việc linh hoạt đã cải thiện đáng kể năng suất tổng thể trong tất cả các nhóm phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"The new software system was installed to improve employee productivity in the accounting department.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống phần mềm mới được cài đặt để cải thiện năng suất của nhân viên trong bộ phận kế toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-ljspeech-0d117e42.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-cori-0d117e42.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productivity-082c041a.webp', '[\"efficiency\", \"output\", \"yield\"]', '[\"inefficiency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase productivity\", \"meaning\": \"tăng năng suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high productivity\", \"meaning\": \"năng suất cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"productivity growth\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng năng suất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"production\", \"note_vi\": \"production là sự sản xuất, productivity là năng suất (hiệu quả).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"productive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"product\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-cori-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru0-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru5-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru6-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru10-0d117e42.mp3\"]