('92d725a4-ddc9-5dc8-96e4-6115b92020de', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'faction', '/ˈfækʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm nhỏ người có quan điểm khác biệt trong một nhóm lớn hơn.', 'A dissenting subgroup functioning inside a major organization or political entity.', 'The political party was divided into several factions, each with its own agenda.', 'Đảng chính trị bị chia thành nhiều phe phái, mỗi phe có chương trình nghị sự riêng.', '{\"en\": \"A small faction of the board members disagreed with the proposed merger during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Một nhóm nhỏ các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã không đồng ý với vụ sáp nhập được đề xuất trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-ljspeech-53763a7f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-cori-53763a7f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/faction-e6e3f40b.webp', '[\"group\", \"clique\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"political faction\", \"meaning\": \"phe phái chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opposing faction\", \"meaning\": \"phe đối lập\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"factional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-cori-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru0-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru5-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru6-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru10-53763a7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru9-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru3-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru7-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru8-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-aru2-53763a7f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-ljspeech-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt408-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt138-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt624-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt396-53763a7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt498-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt132-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt288-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt42-53763a7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faction-lt90-53763a7f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ sự chia rẽ trong nội bộ tổ chức.', 'business', 1, 12),
('e43f35b8-9a43-5d8f-89be-8c9f2233d59b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'deputy', '/ˈdepjuti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người được ủy quyền hoặc được bầu làm đại diện hoặc cấp phó.', 'a person who is the second most important person in an organization or department.', 'The deputy director will take charge while the director is away.', 'Phó giám đốc sẽ phụ trách khi giám đốc vắng mặt.', '{\"en\": \"The deputy manager will handle the daily operations while the general manager is on leave.\", \"vi\": \"Phó quản lý sẽ điều hành các hoạt động hàng ngày khi quản lý tổng đi vắng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-ljspeech-75685494.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-cori-75685494.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deputy-983d4856.webp', '[\"assistant\", \"second-in-command\"]', '[\"chief\", \"leader\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deputy director\", \"meaning\": \"phó giám đốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deputy manager\", \"meaning\": \"phó quản lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"department\", \"note_vi\": \"department là phòng ban, deputy là cấp phó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deputize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-cori-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru0-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru5-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru6-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru10-75685494.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru9-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru3-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru7-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru8-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-aru2-75685494.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-ljspeech-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt408-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt138-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt624-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt396-75685494.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt498-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt132-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt288-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt42-75685494.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deputy-lt90-75685494.mp3\"]}}', 'Deputy là cấp phó, người thay thế khi sếp vắng mặt.', 'office', 1, 13),
('f785b0f7-4373-51bb-a7bf-3143c012fb4d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'slam', '/slæm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đóng mạnh hoặc ném cái gì đó với tiếng động lớn.', 'to shut a door or lid forcefully and with a loud noise.', 'He was so angry that he slammed the door shut behind him.', 'Anh ấy giận đến mức đóng sầm cửa lại phía sau.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not slam the conference room door during the board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng không đóng sầm cửa phòng hội nghị trong suốt cuộc họp ban giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-ljspeech-233c2903.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-cori-233c2903.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slam-a0d88473.webp', '[\"bang\", \"shut\", \"crash\"]', '[\"open\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slam the door\", \"meaning\": \"đóng sầm cửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slam shut\", \"meaning\": \"đóng sầm lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slap\", \"note_vi\": \"slap là vỗ hoặc tát bằng bàn tay\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-cori-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru0-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru5-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru6-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru10-233c2903.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru9-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru3-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru7-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru8-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru2-233c2903.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-ljspeech-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt408-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt138-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt624-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt396-233c2903.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt498-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt132-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt288-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt42-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt90-233c2903.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng với cửa hoặc nắp hộp khi đóng mạnh phát ra tiếng.', 'office', 1, 14),
('6225ad95-621c-5fdc-b9a2-628b852f3eba', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'oral', '/ˈɔːrəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến miệng hoặc được nói ra bằng lời.', 'relating to the mouth, or expressed by speaking rather than writing.', 'Students had to give an oral presentation on their research.', 'Học sinh phải thuyết trình miệng về nghiên cứu của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The job interview included an oral test to assess the candidate\'s communication skills.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi phỏng vấn xin việc bao gồm một bài kiểm tra nói để đánh giá kỹ năng giao tiếp của ứng viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-ljspeech-1a1fd237.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-cori-1a1fd237.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oral-71be18a9.webp', '[\"spoken\", \"verbal\", \"vocal\"]', '[\"written\", \"textual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"oral presentation\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết trình miệng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oral exam\", \"meaning\": \"thi vấn đáp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oral communication\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp bằng lời nói\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"verbal\", \"note_vi\": \"verbal có thể chỉ cả lời nói lẫn chữ viết, oral chỉ dùng cho lời nói\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"orally\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"orality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-cori-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru0-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru5-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru6-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru10-1a1fd237.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru9-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru3-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru7-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru8-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-aru2-1a1fd237.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-ljspeech-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt408-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt138-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt624-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt396-1a1fd237.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt498-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt132-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt288-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt42-1a1fd237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oral-lt90-1a1fd237.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'oral\' với \'verbal\': oral chỉ bằng miệng, verbal bao gồm cả ngôn ngữ viết lẫn nói.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('c18cfa98-d606-5df5-95ce-d67988b25302', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'd191e012-ccc1-5637-af4a-8d8dd1ee3278', '89f9e15a-d8fd-5b93-b49e-8bc1a071984f', 'shrink', '/ʃrɪŋk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Trở nên nhỏ hơn về kích thước hoặc số lượng.', 'to become smaller in size, amount, or value, or to make something smaller.', 'Certain fabrics may shrink if you dry them at high heat temperatures.', 'Một số loại vải có thể bị co lại nếu bạn sấy chúng ở nhiệt độ cao.', '{\"en\": \"Our company budget began to shrink after the sudden decline in quarterly product sales.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân sách công ty chúng tôi bắt đầu thu hẹp sau khi doanh số sản phẩm hàng quý giảm đột ngột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-ljspeech-b083875b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-cori-b083875b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shrink-f9d94394.webp', '[\"contract\", \"dwindle\", \"decrease\"]', '[\"expand\", \"grow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shrink in size\", \"meaning\": \"co lại về kích thước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shrink dramatically\", \"meaning\": \"sụt giảm mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sink\", \"note_vi\": \"Sink là chìm xuống, shrink là co lại/thu nhỏ lại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shrinkage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-cori-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru0-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru5-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru6-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru10-b083875b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru9-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru3-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru7-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrink-aru8-b083875b.mp3\", \"/storag