('541c8b7d-6ec9-5908-a99d-986983cde6a4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'da7bf345-d4a8-5e4b-a72c-f0b2119b8e85', '75baae7c-8f98-5041-a6ed-9587066b7562', 'beam', '/biːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thanh gỗ hoặc kim loại lớn dùng làm trụ đỡ trong xây dựng.', 'a long, thick piece of wood or metal used to support a building.', 'Construction workers installed heavy steel beams to reinforce the new bridge.', 'Các công nhân xây dựng đã lắp đặt những thanh xà thép nặng để gia cố cây cầu mới.', '{\"en\": \"The construction crew installed steel beams to ensure the new warehouse is structurally safe.\", \"vi\": \"Đội xây dựng đã lắp đặt các dầm thép để đảm bảo nhà kho mới an toàn về mặt kết cấu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-ljspeech-300faa5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-cori-300faa5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beam-521c6217.webp', '[\"joist\", \"pillar\", \"support\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steel beam\", \"meaning\": \"dầm thép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wooden beam\", \"meaning\": \"dầm gỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"support beam\", \"meaning\": \"dầm chịu lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"column\", \"note_vi\": \"cột, thường đứng dọc, còn từ này thường nằm ngang\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-cori-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru0-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru5-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru6-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru10-300faa5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru9-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru3-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru7-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru8-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-aru2-300faa5d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-ljspeech-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt408-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt138-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt624-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt396-300faa5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt498-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt132-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt288-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt42-300faa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beam-lt90-300faa5d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt với nghĩa \'tia sáng\' (ví dụ: a beam of light) cũng rất phổ biến.', 'housing', 1, 1),
('9e48bafe-dd37-579a-b05a-5a5ae8c5a1a4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'da7bf345-d4a8-5e4b-a72c-f0b2119b8e85', '75baae7c-8f98-5041-a6ed-9587066b7562', 'overturn', '/ˌəʊvəˈtɜːn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Lật đổ, bác bỏ một quyết định hoặc kết quả.', 'to reject or reverse a decision or result officially.', 'The court decided to overturn the previous ruling due to new evidence.', 'Tòa án đã quyết định bác bỏ phán quyết trước đó vì có bằng chứng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The board voted to overturn the old policy on remote work hours.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng đã bỏ phiếu bác bỏ chính sách cũ về giờ làm việc từ xa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-ljspeech-4688c554.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-cori-4688c554.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overturn-6a4333ec.webp', '[\"reverse\", \"cancel\", \"repeal\"]', '[\"uphold\", \"maintain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overturn a decision\", \"meaning\": \"bác bỏ quyết định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overturn a ruling\", \"meaning\": \"lật ngược phán quyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overturn a verdict\", \"meaning\": \"bác bỏ bản án\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overtake\", \"note_vi\": \"overtake là vượt qua, không phải bác bỏ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"overturned\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-cori-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru0-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru5-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru6-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru10-4688c554.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru9-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru3-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overturn-aru7-4688c554.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/over