('ea3cb149-a43b-5c6c-8d19-892e785b990b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e465fa16-5996-5b86-a793-ad24734c8757', '00896825-c753-5745-a4bc-c55c7287170c', 'surge', '/sɜːdʒ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tăng lên đột ngột và mạnh mẽ.', 'To experience a sudden, dramatic rise or upward movement in quantity or intensity.', 'Online orders began to surge immediately after the company launched its annual discount event.', 'Các đơn hàng trực tuyến bắt đầu tăng vọt ngay sau khi công ty tung ra sự kiện giảm giá hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"Online orders surged after the company launched its summer sale.\", \"vi\": \"Đơn đặt hàng trực tuyến tăng vọt sau khi công ty khởi động đợt giảm giá mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-ljspeech-c5b9c04c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-cori-c5b9c04c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surge-8ca74d7d.webp', '[\"spike\", \"soar\", \"rocket\"]', '[\"plummet\", \"drop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"surge in\", \"meaning\": \"tăng mạnh trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surge forward\", \"meaning\": \"tiến lên mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surge of\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng vọt của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"urge\", \"note_vi\": \"urge là thúc giục, surge là tăng đột ngột\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surge\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surging\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-cori-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru0-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru5-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru6-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru10-c5b9c04c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru9-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru3-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru7-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/stora