('189e501a-db6e-58b9-a292-80ba39840a6d', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e465fa16-5996-5b86-a793-ad24734c8757', '00896825-c753-5745-a4bc-c55c7287170c', 'well-being', '/wɛlˈbiːɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng khỏe mạnh, hạnh phúc và thoải mái về thể chất lẫn tinh thần.', 'the state of feeling healthy, happy, and comfortable in your life.', 'Regular exercise is essential for both physical and mental well-being.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên là điều cần thiết cho cả sức khỏe thể chất và tinh thần.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers a new fitness program to improve employee well-being and productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp một chương trình thể hình mới để cải thiện sức khỏe và năng suất của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-ljspeech-19591ab8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-cori-19591ab8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/well-being-75d1c3ac.webp', '[\"welfare\", \"health\", \"happiness\"]', '[\"illness\", \"misery\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"physical well-being\", \"meaning\": \"sức khỏe thể chất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"emotional well-being\", \"meaning\": \"sức khỏe tinh thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promote well-being\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy sự khỏe mạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"welfare\", \"note_vi\": \"welfare thường nói về phúc lợi xã hội, well-being nhấn mạnh sức khỏe cá nhân\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-cori-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru0-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru5-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru6-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru10-19591ab8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru9-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru3-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru7-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru8-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-aru2-19591ab8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-ljspeech-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt408-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt138-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt624-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt396-19591ab8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt498-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt132-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt288-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt42-19591ab8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-being-lt90-19591ab8.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý có dấu gạch ngang giữa \'well\' và \'being\'.', 'hr', 1, 26),
('b1c2f033-884c-54ff-9d16-581054225ca0', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e465fa16-5996-5b86-a793-ad24734c8757', '00896825-c753-5745-a4bc-c55c7287170c', 'protective', '/prəˈtektɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Mang tính bảo vệ, che chở.', 'used or intended to keep someone or something safe from harm or damage.', 'Parents are naturally protective of their children, especially when they are young.', 'Cha mẹ đương nhiên có tính bảo vệ con cái, đặc biệt là khi chúng còn nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"All visitors must wear protective gear before entering the construction site.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả khách tham quan phải mặc đồ bảo hộ trước khi vào công trường xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-ljspeech-a17a0a05.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-cori-a17a0a05.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/protective-bc04e2b3.webp', '[\"defensive\", \"shielding\", \"safeguarding\"]', '[\"harmful\", \"destructive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"protective clothing\", \"meaning\": \"quần áo bảo hộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"protective gear\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị bảo hộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"protective barrier\", \"meaning\": \"rào chắn bảo vệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"protected\", \"note_vi\": \"protected là được bảo vệ (bị động), protective là có tính chất bảo vệ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"protect\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"protection\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"protectively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-cori-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru0-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru5-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru6-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru10-a17a0a05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru9-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru3-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru7-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru8-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-aru2-a17a0a05.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-ljspeech-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt408-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt138-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt624-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt396-a17a0a05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt498-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt132-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt288-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt42-a17a0a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protective-lt90-a17a0a05.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ive chỉ tính chất, phân biệt với dạng bị động -ed (protected).', 'manufacturing', 1, 27),
('d5cea334-b299-5930-af9e-396bef3e1f8e', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e465fa16-5996-5b86-a793-ad24734c8757', '00896825-c753-5745-a4bc-c55c7287170c', 'defensive', '/dɪˈfensɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nhằm bảo vệ bản thân khỏi bị tấn công hoặc chỉ trích.', 'showing a desire to protect oneself from criticism or being attacked by others.', 'The team played a very strong defensive game, preventing the opponents from scoring.', 'Đội đã chơi một trận đấu phòng thủ rất tốt, ngăn cản đối thủ ghi bàn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager became defensive when the client questioned the delay in the project schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý trở nên phòng thủ khi khách hàng đặt câu hỏi về sự chậm trễ trong tiến độ dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-ljspeech-802d2a9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-cori-802d2a9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defensive-5d45d840.webp', '[\"guarded\", \"protective\"]', '[\"open\", \"receptive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"defensive attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ phòng thủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"defensive position\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí phòng thủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"defend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"defense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-cori-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru0-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru5-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru6-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru10-802d2a9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru9-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru3-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-aru7-802d2a9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defensive-ar