('5c4ba34c-d538-5f75-8770-2ccef6b3f157', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e465fa16-5996-5b86-a793-ad24734c8757', '00896825-c753-5745-a4bc-c55c7287170c', 'obligation', 'UK: /ˌɒblɪˈɡeɪʃən/ | US: /ˌɑblɪˈɡeɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nghĩa vụ, bổn phận', 'A course of action that someone is required to take by law or moral duty.', 'Employers have an obligation to ensure safety.', 'Người sử dụng lao động có nghĩa vụ đảm bảo an toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a financial obligation to clear all outstanding debts before the end of the fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có nghĩa vụ tài chính phải thanh toán tất cả các khoản nợ còn tồn đọng trước khi kết thúc năm tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-ljspeech-b44936d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-cori-b44936d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obligation-0df27add.webp', '[\"duty\", \"responsibility\", \"commitment\", \"requirement\"]', '[\"choice\", \"option\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fulfill an obligation\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn thành nghĩa vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial obligation\", \"meaning\": \"nghĩa vụ tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"without obligation\", \"meaning\": \"không bắt buộc / không có nghĩa vụ ràng buộc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"obligate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obligatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-cori-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru0-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru5-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru6-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru10-b44936d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru9-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru3-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru7-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru8-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-aru2-b44936d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-ljspeech-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt408-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt138-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt624-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt396-b44936d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt498-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt132-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt288-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt42-b44936d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligation-lt90-b44936d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với động từ \'fulfill\' hoặc \'meet\' (hoàn thành nghĩa vụ) và \'under obligation\' (chịu nghĩa vụ).', 'contracts', 1, 29),
('6fa50d77-2910-5274-b53c-e5c744a1d1ff', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e954406b-00cc-591f-a139-bb07def60828', 'be540341-793b-5fe4-9d6f-7c7a0857bb72', 'upgrade', '/ˌʌpˈɡreɪd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cải thiện hoặc nâng cao chất lượng, hiệu suất của cái gì đó.', 'to improve the quality, value, or performance of something by replacing parts.', 'We decided to upgrade our computer to a newer model for better performance.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định nâng cấp máy tính của mình lên một mẫu mới hơn để có hiệu suất tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager plans to upgrade all office laptops to boost employee productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý có kế hoạch nâng cấp tất cả máy tính xách tay văn phòng để tăng năng suất làm việc của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-ljspeech-7c5e83d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-cori-7c5e83d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upgrade-f0dff446.webp', '[\"improve\", \"enhance\", \"update\"]', '[\"downgrade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upgrade the system\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cấp hệ thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upgrade software\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cấp phần mềm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"update\", \"note_vi\": \"Update là cập nhật thông tin, upgrade là nâng cấp chất lượng phần cứng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"upgrade\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-cori-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru0-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru5-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru6-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru10-7c5e83d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru9-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru3-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru7-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru8-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru2-7c5e83d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-ljspeech-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt408-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt138-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt624-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt396-7c5e83d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt498-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt132-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt288-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt42-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt90-7c5e83d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Upgrade tập trung vào cải thiện chất lượng hoặc cấu hình máy móc, thiết bị.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('5f3d1f30-22e1-5d30-a50d-002b7c240860', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e954406b-00cc-591f-a139-bb07def60828', 'be540341-793b-5fe4-9d6f-7c7a0857bb72', 'maximize', '/ˈmæksɪmaɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó đạt mức cao nhất hoặc tốt nhất có thể.', 'to increase something to the greatest possible amount or level of effectiveness.', 'The company aims to maximize profits by reducing production costs.', 'Công ty đặt mục tiêu tối đa hóa lợi nhuận bằng cách giảm chi phí sản xuất.', '{\"en\": \"We need to maximize our office efficiency to meet the upcoming project deadline next month.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần tối đa hóa hiệu quả văn phòng để kịp thời hạn dự án vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-ljspeech-faab8bc6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-cori-faab8bc6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/maximize-3146d625.webp', '[\"optimize\", \"increase\"]', '[\"minimize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"maximize profit\", \"meaning\": \"tối đa hóa lợi nhuận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maximize efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"tối đa hóa hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"minimize\", \"note_vi\": \"Trái nghĩa hoàn toàn, nghĩa là giảm xuống mức thấp nhất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"maximum\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"maximal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-cori-faab8bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru0-faab8bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru5-faab8bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru6-faab8bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru10-faab8bc6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru9-faab8bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru3-faab8bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maximize-aru7-faab8bc6.mp3\",