('99372638-9240-5a0c-bc6f-2984c1a42e17', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e954406b-00cc-591f-a139-bb07def60828', 'be540341-793b-5fe4-9d6f-7c7a0857bb72', 'identical', 'UK: /aɪˈdentɪkl/ | US: /aɪˈdentɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'giống hệt như, hệt như', 'Exactly the same in every detail or sharing the same characteristics.', 'The two twins wore identical outfits to the party.', 'Hai anh em sinh đôi đã mặc trang phục giống hệt nhau đến bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The two financial reports contained almost identical sales figures.\", \"vi\": \"Hai bản báo cáo tài chính chứa các số liệu doanh số gần như giống hệt nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-ljspeech-d3f23119.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-cori-d3f23119.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/identical-b8fab11a.webp', '[\"exact\", \"duplicate\", \"matching\"]', '[\"different\", \"distinct\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"identical to\", \"meaning\": \"giống hệt với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"identical twin\", \"meaning\": \"sinh đôi cùng trứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"similar\", \"note_vi\": \"\'similar\' chỉ tương tự/tương đồng, còn \'identical\' là giống hệt 100%.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"identically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-cori-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru0-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru5-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru6-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru10-d3f23119.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru9-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru3-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru7-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru8-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-aru2-d3f23119.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-ljspeech-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt408-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt138-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt624-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt396-d3f23119.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt498-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt132-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt288-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt42-d3f23119.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/identical-lt90-d3f23119.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'to\' (identical to something) để so sánh hai đối tượng giống hệt nhau.', 'office', 1, 3),
('9f64fc37-50c8-53f6-b43f-f16fcbeb6085', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e954406b-00cc-591f-a139-bb07def60828', 'be540341-793b-5fe4-9d6f-7c7a0857bb72', 'suspension', '/səˈspenʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự đình chỉ, tạm ngưng một hoạt động hoặc vị trí.', 'the act of stopping something for a period of time, often as a punishment.', 'The school issued a one-week suspension to the student for disruptive behavior.', 'Trường học đã ra quyết định đình chỉ học một tuần đối với học sinh vì hành vi gây rối.', '{\"en\": \"The employee received a three-day suspension for violating the company\'s safety regulations.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã bị đình chỉ ba ngày vì vi phạm các quy định an toàn của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-ljspeech-066b4eb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-cori-066b4eb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suspension-ac1b2a18.webp', '[\"interruption\", \"pause\"]', '[\"continuation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"temporary suspension\", \"meaning\": \"sự đình chỉ tạm thời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"receive a suspension\", \"meaning\": \"bị đình chỉ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"suspend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-cori-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru0-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru5-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru6-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru10-066b4eb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru9-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru3-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru7-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspension-aru8-066b4eb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pron