('8fcd3732-71da-556b-954b-bd33b57a27c1', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'e954406b-00cc-591f-a139-bb07def60828', 'be540341-793b-5fe4-9d6f-7c7a0857bb72', 'gaze', '/ɡeɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'nhìn chằm chằm, nhìn đăm đắm', 'To stare steadily and intently, often driven by admiration, deep thought, or curiosity.', 'He would often gaze out the window, lost in thought.', 'Anh ấy thường nhìn đăm đắm ra ngoài cửa sổ, chìm đắm trong suy nghĩ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager paused to gaze at the impressive sales figures displayed on the large screen.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dừng lại để nhìn đăm đắm vào những con số doanh thu ấn tượng trên màn hình lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-ljspeech-7d0e828e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-cori-7d0e828e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gaze-87309cd2.webp', '[\"stare\", \"look\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gaze at\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn chằm chằm vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fixed gaze\", \"meaning\": \"cái nhìn cố định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"glance\", \"note_vi\": \"Glance là nhìn lướt qua, gaze là nhìn lâu.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-cori-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru0-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru5-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru6-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru10-7d0e828e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru9-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru3-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru7-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru8-7d0e828e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-aru2-7d0e828e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gaze-ljspeech-7d0e828e.