('b2eee7fb-c223-54c7-8461-9dd678e72523', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ec53b9a2-3878-5a90-bb3f-252ad9f63e15', '8bc152ed-2196-5303-9665-947cfaa3765b', 'inexperience', 'UK: /ˌɪnɪkˈspɪəriənst/ | US: /ˌɪnɪkˈspɪəriənst/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thiếu kinh nghiệm', 'lacking the knowledge or skill gained from past work or practice.', 'The company offers training for inexperienced staff.', 'Công ty cung cấp đào tạo cho nhân viên thiếu kinh nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"Despite her relative inexperience, the new hire demonstrated remarkable problem-solving skills.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù sự thiếu kinh nghiệm tương đối của mình, nhân viên mới đã thể hiện kỹ năng giải quyết vấn đề xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-ljspeech-c04864f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-cori-c04864f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inexperience-0b19542b.webp', '[\"unfamiliarity\", \"naivety\"]', '[\"experience\", \"expertise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lack of experience\", \"meaning\": \"sự thiếu kinh nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"due to inexperience\", \"meaning\": \"do thiếu kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inexperienced\", \"note_vi\": \"inexperienced là tính từ mô tả người thiếu kinh nghiệm (an inexperienced applicant).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inexperienced\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"experience\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-cori-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru0-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru5-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru6-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru10-c04864f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru9-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru3-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru7-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru8-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-aru2-c04864f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-ljspeech-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt408-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt138-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt624-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt396-c04864f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt498-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt132-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt288-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt42-c04864f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inexperience-lt90-c04864f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ \'inexperience\' trong thực tế là danh từ (sự thiếu kinh nghiệm), còn tính từ chuẩn là \'inexperienced\'. Hãy chú ý đuôi -ce vs -ced trong bài thi.', 'career', 1, 2),
('d7d508af-2c53-5254-aa8e-65e04a2d4b69', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ec53b9a2-3878-5a90-bb3f-252ad9f63e15', '8bc152ed-2196-5303-9665-947cfaa3765b', 'high-rise', 'UK: /ˈhaɪˌraɪz/ | US: /ˈhaɪˌraɪz/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'cao tầng', 'Describing a building that has many stories or vertical levels above ground.', 'Many companies have offices in high-rise buildings.', 'Nhiều công ty có văn phòng trong các tòa nhà cao tầng.', '{\"en\": \"The construction company plan to build a new high-rise office complex downtown.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty xây dựng có kế hoạch dựng một khu phức hợp văn phòng cao tầng mới ở trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-ljspeech-1c3ba16e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-cori-1c3ba16e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/high-rise-7b00f448.webp', '[\"multi-story\", \"towering\"]', '[\"low-rise\", \"single-story\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high-rise building\", \"meaning\": \"tòa nhà cao tầng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high-rise apartment\", \"meaning\": \"chung cư cao tầng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"skyscraper\", \"note_vi\": \"\'high-rise\' là từ rộng chỉ tòa nhà nhiều tầng, còn \'skyscraper\' là tòa nhà chọc trời cực kỳ cao.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-cori-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru0-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru5-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru6-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru10-1c3ba16e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru9-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru3-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru7-1c3ba16e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-rise-aru8-1c3ba16e.m