('fbc38ea1-cb26-5b5e-9bfe-bfaf18c15ea5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ec53b9a2-3878-5a90-bb3f-252ad9f63e15', '8bc152ed-2196-5303-9665-947cfaa3765b', 'induce', '/ɪnˈdjuːs/', 'B2', 'verb', 'gây ra hoặc thuyết phục ai làm gì đó.', 'To bring about a specific outcome or convince an individual to take action.', 'The advertisement was designed to induce customers to buy the new product.', 'Quảng cáo được thiết kế để thuyết phục khách hàng mua sản phẩm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The special discount induced many clients to sign the service contract.\", \"vi\": \"Mức chiết khấu đặc biệt đã thuyết phục nhiều khách hàng ký hợp đồng dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-ljspeech-674cf21e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-cori-674cf21e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/induce-cbb1ab5e.webp', '[\"persuade\", \"prompt\", \"convince\"]', '[\"dissuade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"induce demand\", \"meaning\": \"kích thích nhu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"induce someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deduce\", \"note_vi\": \"deduce là suy luận, không phải thuyết phục\"}, {\"word\": \"induct\", \"note_vi\": \"induct là kết nạp, đưa vào\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inducement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inductive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-cori-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru0-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru5-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru6-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru10-674cf21e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru9-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru3-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru7-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru8-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-aru2-674cf21e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-ljspeech-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt408-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt138-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt624-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt396-674cf21e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt498-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt132-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt288-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt42-674cf21e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/induce-lt90-674cf21e.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với deduce (suy luận) và induce (gây/thuyết phục).', 'marketing', 1, 12),
('8f53f491-c7b1-5ddc-8fcf-9ef3d7ba793b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ec53b9a2-3878-5a90-bb3f-252ad9f63e15', '8bc152ed-2196-5303-9665-947cfaa3765b', 'crawl', '/krɔːl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kiểu di chuyển chậm chạp bằng tay và đầu gối, hoặc một kiểu bơi.', 'a very slow movement or speed of progress in transportation or human activity.', 'The baby\'s first crawl across the living room floor was a memorable moment.', 'Lần đầu tiên em bé bò qua sàn phòng khách là một khoảnh khắc đáng nhớ.', '{\"en\": \"Traffic on the main highway slowed to a crawl during the morning rush hour.\", \"vi\": \"Giao thông trên xa lộ chính đã chậm lại như rùa bò trong giờ cao điểm buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-ljspeech-3b8eaaf7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-cori-3b8eaaf7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crawl-db5b1ef1.webp', '[\"slowness\", \"creep\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"slow to a crawl\", \"meaning\": \"chậm lại như rùa bò\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at a crawl\", \"meaning\": \"ở tốc độ rất chậm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crow\", \"note_vi\": \"crow là con quạ hoặc tiếng gà gáy, crawl là bò.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"crawl\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-cori-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru0-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru5-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru6-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru10-3b8eaaf7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru9-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru3-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru7-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru8-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-aru2-3b8eaaf7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-ljspeech-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt408-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt138-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt624-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt396-3b8eaaf7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt498-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt132-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt288-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt42-3b8eaaf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crawl-lt90-3b8eaaf7.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'slow to a crawl\' thường miêu tả tình trạng kẹt xe.', 'travel', 1, 13),
('bd7e124a-f235-593c-90e1-8442a56759b0', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ec53b9a2-3878-5a90-bb3f-252ad9f63e15', '8bc152ed-2196-5303-9665-947cfaa3765b', 'clarity', '/ˈklærəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự rõ ràng, dễ hiểu hoặc minh bạch của một điều gì đó.', 'the quality of being easy to understand or clear in a simple and direct way.', 'The teacher explained the complex concept with great clarity, making it easy for everyone to understand.', 'Giáo viên giải thích khái niệm phức tạp một cách rất rõ ràng, khiến mọi người dễ hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The report was written with great clarity, allowing the board members to make quick decisions.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo được viết với sự rõ ràng tuyệt vời, cho phép các thành viên hội đồng đưa ra quyết định nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-ljspeech-30f5602e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-cori-30f5602e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clarity-33aff905.webp', '[\"precision\", \"lucidity\"]', '[\"confusion\", \"ambiguity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"with clarity\", \"meaning\": \"một cách rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide clarity\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp sự rõ ràng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clear\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-cori-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru0-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru5-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru6-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru10-30f5602e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru9-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru3-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru7-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarity-aru8-30f5602e.mp3\", \"/