('37a27b4f-3bff-5d3f-bfc7-7a41931c3dee', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ede6c18b-991c-57b0-99ce-a7fd8c2214de', 'b1095498-c353-55aa-ba52-777c4d789cb0', 'explicitly', '/ɪkˈsplɪsɪtli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách rõ ràng, minh bạch, không mơ hồ.', 'in a way that is stated clearly and directly, leaving no room for doubt.', 'The contract explicitly mentions the safety regulations all contractors must follow.', 'Hợp đồng nêu rõ ràng các quy định an toàn mà tất cả nhà thầu phải tuân theo.', '{\"en\": \"The contract explicitly states that the service fee must be paid within thirty business days.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng quy định rõ ràng rằng phí dịch vụ phải được thanh toán trong vòng ba mươi ngày làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-ljspeech-f29fb922.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-cori-f29fb922.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/explicitly-9e4c8ea8.webp', '[\"clearly\", \"precisely\"]', '[\"vaguely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"explicitly state\", \"meaning\": \"nêu rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"explicitly mention\", \"meaning\": \"đề cập cụ thể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"explicit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-cori-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru0-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru5-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru6-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru10-f29fb922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru9-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru3-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru7-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicitly-aru8-f29fb922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc