('7dfc5f39-362a-53e9-b82e-1b8dc68624e2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ede6c18b-991c-57b0-99ce-a7fd8c2214de', 'b1095498-c353-55aa-ba52-777c4d789cb0', 'in a row', '', 'B2', 'phrase', 'liền nhau, thành một hàng', 'Arranged in a straight line or occurring one after another without interruption.', 'The chairs were placed in a row.', 'Những chiếc ghế được đặt thành một hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported record-breaking quarterly profits for three consecutive years in a row.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo lợi nhuận hàng quý kỷ lục trong ba năm liên tiếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-ljspeech-87fbcab0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-cori-87fbcab0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-a-row-0a8b6bb3.webp', '[\"consecutively\", \"successively\", \"continuously\"]', '[\"intermittently\", \"randomly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"days in a row\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều ngày liên tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stand in a row\", \"meaning\": \"đứng thành một hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"win three times in a row\", \"meaning\": \"thắng ba lần liên tiếp\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-cori-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru0-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru5-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru6-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru10-87fbcab0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru9-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru3-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru7-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru8-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-aru2-87fbcab0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-ljspeech-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt408-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt138-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt624-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt396-87fbcab0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt498-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt132-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt288-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt42-87fbcab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-a-row-lt90-87fbcab0.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi chỉ thời gian, có nghĩa là \'liên tiếp\' (e.g., three months in a row). Đứng sau khoảng thời gian.', 'business', 1, 15),
('d376ce95-e270-5b4b-b8b3-eb60a478ac7f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'ede6c18b-991c-57b0-99ce-a7fd8c2214de', 'b1095498-c353-55aa-ba52-777c4d789cb0', 'confirmation', '/ˌkɒnfəˈmeɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc bằng chứng xác nhận sự thật hoặc tính đúng đắn của điều gì đó.', 'a statement or document that says that something is definitely true or correct now.', 'We are waiting for official confirmation of the flight details.', 'Chúng tôi đang chờ xác nhận chính thức về chi tiết chuyến bay.', '{\"en\": \"Please check your email inbox for a confirmation of your hotel reservation for next week.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra hộp thư email để nhận xác nhận đặt phòng khách sạn cho tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-ljspeech-38bd340c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-cori-38bd340c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confirmation-160757b2.webp', '[\"verification\", \"proof\"]', '[\"denial\", \"cancellation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"receive confirmation\", \"meaning\": \"nhận xác nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written confirmation\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận bằng văn bản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conform\", \"note_vi\": \"conform là tuân thủ, confirmation là sự xác nhận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confirm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confirmed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-cori-38bd340c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-aru0-38bd340c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-aru5-38bd340c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-aru6-38bd340c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-aru10-38bd340c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-aru9-38bd340c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confirmation-aru3-38bd340c.mp3\", \"/sto