('886c3d52-8173-5647-939f-d77735e7232f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'vocal', '/ˈvəʊkl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về giọng nói, phát ra từ giọng nói.', 'relating to the human voice or produced by it.', 'She has excellent vocal control, which is essential for a singer.', 'Cô ấy có khả năng kiểm soát giọng hát rất tốt, điều cần thiết cho một ca sĩ.', '{\"en\": \"The vocal training course helped our staff improve phone manners.\", \"vi\": \"Khóa đào tạo thanh nhạc giúp nhân viên cải thiện cách ứng xử điện thoại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-ljspeech-5a293c2f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-cori-5a293c2f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vocal-0736474b.webp', '[\"oral\", \"spoken\"]', '[\"silent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vocal cord\", \"meaning\": \"dây thanh âm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vocal music\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc thanh nhạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vocal training\", \"meaning\": \"đào tạo thanh nhạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"local\", \"note_vi\": \"local nghĩa là địa phương, không liên quan giọng nói.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"voice\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vocally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-cori-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru0-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru5-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru6-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru10-5a293c2f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru9-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru3-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru7-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vocal-aru8-5a293c2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob