('d27b314a-6364-55bb-872a-738c8a72f02f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'hygienist', 'UK: /ˌhaɪˈdʒiːnɪst/ | US: /ˌhaɪˈdʒiːnɪst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chuyên gia vệ sinh (răng miệng)', 'A trained healthcare professional who cleans teeth and helps maintain oral health.', 'The dental hygienist cleaned my teeth thoroughly.', 'Chuyên gia vệ sinh răng miệng đã làm sạch răng tôi rất kỹ.', '{\"en\": \"Please contact the receptionist if you need to reschedule your appointment with the hygienist.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng liên hệ với nhân viên lễ tân nếu bạn cần đổi lịch hẹn với chuyên viên vệ sinh răng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-ljspeech-3bbc8027.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-cori-3bbc8027.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hygienist-354ee796.webp', '[\"sanitarian\", \"dental assistant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dental hygienist\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên viên vệ sinh răng miệng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hygiene\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ việc giữ gìn vệ sinh nói chung, không phải người làm công tác vệ sinh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hygiene\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hygienic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-cori-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru0-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru5-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru6-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru10-3bbc8027.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru9-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru3-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru7-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru8-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-aru2-3bbc8027.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-ljspeech-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt408-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt138-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt624-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt396-3bbc8027.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt498-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt132-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt288-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt42-3bbc8027.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hygienist-lt90-3bbc8027.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp cụm \'dental hygienist\' (chuyên viên vệ sinh răng) trong bài đọc thông báo hẹn khám y tế (Part 7).', 'medical', 1, 15),
('0b7057f7-09ea-58e6-bb0e-fe09c53472be', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'commentary', '/ˈkɒməntri/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Bài phân tích, giải thích hoặc ý kiến cá nhân về một sự kiện, tác phẩm.', 'a spoken or written discussion that gives opinions or explains an event.', 'The sports commentator provided an excellent live commentary on the football match.', 'Bình luận viên thể thao đã đưa ra một bài bình luận trực tiếp xuất sắc về trận đấu bóng đá.', '{\"en\": \"The financial report includes a detailed commentary on the company\'s performance this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo tài chính bao gồm một bài bình luận chi tiết về hiệu quả hoạt động của công ty trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-ljspeech-a589b559.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-cori-a589b559.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commentary-19d7294f.webp', '[\"analysis\", \"review\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"provide commentary\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra bình luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political commentary\", \"meaning\": \"bình luận chính trị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comment\", \"note_vi\": \"Comment là ý kiến ngắn, commentary là bài phân tích dài.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"comment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-cori-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru0-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru5-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru6-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru10-a589b559.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru9-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru3-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru7-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru8-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-aru2-a589b559.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-ljspeech-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt408-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt138-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt624-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt396-a589b559.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt498-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt132-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt288-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt42-a589b559.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commentary-lt90-a589b559.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc hiểu về báo cáo hoặc tin tức.', 'media', 1, 16),
('6d135c45-4b1f-572d-bbad-6778c915c234', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'concede', '/kənˈsiːd/', 'C1', 'verb', 'miễn cưỡng chấp nhận rằng điều gì đó là đúng hoặc hợp lệ.', 'to admit that something is true, often unwillingly.', 'After much debate, he had to concede that her argument was stronger.', 'Sau nhiều tranh cãi, anh ấy phải thừa nhận rằng lập luận của cô ấy mạnh mẽ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The director had to concede that the new marketing campaign was unsuccessful.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã phải thừa nhận rằng chiến dịch tiếp thị mới không thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-ljspeech-5cb248ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-cori-5cb248ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concede-47c4ee32.webp', '[\"admit\", \"acknowledge\", \"grant\"]', '[\"deny\", \"refuse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"concede defeat\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận thất bại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"concede a point\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận một điểm đúng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conceal\", \"note_vi\": \"conceal là che giấu, concede là thừa nhận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"concession\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-cori-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru0-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru5-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru6-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru10-5cb248ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru9-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru3-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru7-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru8-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-aru2-5cb248ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-ljspeech-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt408-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt138-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt624-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt396-5cb248ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt498-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt132-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt288-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt42-5cb248ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concede-lt90-5cb248ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Concede diễn tả việc thừa nhận điều gì đó đúng dù bản thân không muốn.', 'business', 1, 17),
('fe379934-6b12-5c18-9639-4b52ae28ddf8', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'lean', 'UK: /liːn/ | US: /liːn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'tựa, nghiêng', 'to slope or incline your body or an object away from an upright position', 'Please do not lean against the glass door.', 'Vui lòng không tựa vào cửa kính.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not lean against the glass partition while waiting in the reception area.\", \"vi\": \"Xin vui lòng không dựa vào vách ngăn kính trong lúc chờ tại khu vực lễ tân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-ljspeech-8be47d2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-cori-8be47d2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lean-0a4f332c.webp', '[\"incline\", \"tilt\", \"bend\", \"recline\"]', '[\"straighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lean against\", \"meaning\": \"dựa vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lean forward\", \"meaning\": \"nghiêng người về phía trước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lean\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-cori-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru0-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru5-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru6-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru10-8be47d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru9-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru3-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru7-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru8-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru2-8be47d2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-ljspeech-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt408-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt138-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt624-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt396-8be47d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt498-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt132-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt288-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt42-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-lt90-8be47d2b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ: lean against (dựa vào cái gì) hoặc lean forward (nghiêng/chồm người về trước).', 'office', 1, 18),
('893b7312-a132-531a-bf2f-6b5cc1166ab7', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'confront', '/kənˈfrʌnt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đối mặt trực tiếp với một vấn đề hoặc người nào đó.', 'to face, meet, or deal with a difficult situation or person directly.', 'It\'s important to confront your fears to overcome them.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải đối mặt với nỗi sợ hãi của bạn để vượt qua chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to confront the employee about his repeated lateness to meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã phải đối chất với nhân viên về việc anh ta liên tục đi họp muộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-ljspeech-221422a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-cori-221422a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confront-14c4f817.webp', '[\"face\", \"tackle\", \"encounter\"]', '[\"avoid\", \"evade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confront a challenge\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với thử thách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confront an issue\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với một vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"affront\", \"note_vi\": \"affront là xúc phạm công khai, confront là đối mặt giải quyết\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confrontation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confrontational\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-cori-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru0-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru5-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru6-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru10-221422a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru9-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru3-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru7-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru8-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-aru2-221422a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-ljspeech-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt408-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt138-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt624-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt396-221422a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt498-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt132-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt288-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt42-221422a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confront-lt90-221422a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'affront\' (lăng mạ, xúc phạm).', 'office', 1, 19),
('d1f9da2c-cd55-5c99-bd89-465747fc25b4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'inclusion', '/ɪnˈkluːʒn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự bao gồm, sự hòa nhập; việc đưa ai đó/cái gì đó vào một nhóm.', 'the act of adding someone or something to a group or total.', 'The school promotes the inclusion of students with disabilities in all activities.', 'Trường học khuyến khích sự hòa nhập của học sinh khuyết tật vào tất cả các hoạt động.', '{\"en\": \"The company policy emphasizes diversity and full inclusion of all new employees.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách của công ty nhấn mạnh sự đa dạng và sự hòa nhập hoàn toàn của tất cả nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-ljspeech-efb36fd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-cori-efb36fd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inclusion-dcc99b5c.webp', '[\"incorporation\", \"integration\"]', '[\"exclusion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"promote inclusion\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy sự hòa nhập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"social inclusion\", \"meaning\": \"sự hòa nhập xã hội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"illusion\", \"note_vi\": \"Illusion nghĩa là ảo tưởng, khác với inclusion là sự hòa nhập.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"include\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inclusive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-cori-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru0-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru5-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru6-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru10-efb36fd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru9-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru3-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru7-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru8-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-aru2-efb36fd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-ljspeech-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt408-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt138-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt624-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt396-efb36fd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt498-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt132-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt288-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt42-efb36fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclusion-lt90-efb36fd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với illusion (ảo tưởng) do phát âm và mặt chữ gần giống.', 'hr', 1, 20),
('63c05940-8bc9-57d9-ae4e-14c6771d1959', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f1f53b2a-9164-51be-85b3-deaac1bbcb9b', '5acf8b9f-249e-57c8-953b-dda107d4a2aa', 'philosophical', '/ˌfɪləˈsɒfɪkl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'thuộc về triết học; có tính triết lý', 'relating to the study of the meaning of life and the nature of human knowledge.', 'She often has deep, philosophical discussions about life and existence.', 'Cô ấy thường có những cuộc thảo luận sâu sắc, mang tính triết lý về cuộc sống và sự tồn tại.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO shared some philosophical thoughts about the long-term mission of our global corporation.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã chia sẻ vài suy nghĩ triết lý về sứ mệnh dài hạn của tập đoàn toàn cầu chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-ljspeech-cfa5a7a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-cori-cfa5a7a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/philosophical-43855fb7.webp', '[\"theoretical\", \"thoughtful\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"philosophical approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận mang tính triết lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"philosophical debate\", \"meaning\": \"tranh luận triết học\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"philosophy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"philosopher\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-cori-cfa5a7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru0-cfa5a7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru5-cfa5a7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru6-cfa5a7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru10-cfa5a7a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru9-cfa5a7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru3-cfa5a7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/philosophical-aru7-