('9ba49574-c3a0-58b9-85f6-dd24ac20892f', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f2bb4911-ea8a-5305-ab7f-d62f2b6e20f1', '0104184a-c491-596c-ba1e-ee1e34260ca1', 'applicable', '/əˈplɪkəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có thể áp dụng được hoặc thích hợp.', 'relevant or appropriate to a particular person, place, or situation.', 'These rules are applicable to all employees, regardless of their position.', 'Những quy tắc này áp dụng cho tất cả nhân viên, bất kể vị trí của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The new tax regulations are only applicable to businesses with over fifty employees.\", \"vi\": \"Các quy định thuế mới chỉ áp dụng cho các doanh nghiệp có trên năm mươi nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-ljspeech-1530aadb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-cori-1530aadb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/applicable-8b1d2a8a.webp', '[\"relevant\", \"appropriate\", \"suitable\"]', '[\"inapplicable\", \"irrelevant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"applicable to\", \"meaning\": \"áp dụng cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"where applicable\", \"meaning\": \"khi thích hợp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"apply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"application\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-cori-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru0-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru5-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru6-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru10-1530aadb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru9-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru3-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru7-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru8-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-aru2-1530aadb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-ljspeech-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt408-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt138-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt624-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt396-1530aadb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt498-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt132-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt288-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt42-1530aadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicable-lt90-1530aadb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ to (applicable to).', 'law', 1, 22),
('13b90c41-dad5-54ff-a268-7d8569a4f64a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f2bb4911-ea8a-5305-ab7f-d62f2b6e20f1', '0104184a-c491-596c-ba1e-ee1e34260ca1', 'councillor', '/ˈkaʊnsələ(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thành viên được bầu vào hội đồng địa phương hoặc cơ quan chính phủ.', 'a person who is elected to serve as a member of a local government council.', 'The local councillor promised to address the community\'s concerns about public transport.', 'Thành viên hội đồng địa phương hứa sẽ giải quyết những lo ngại của cộng đồng về giao thông công cộng.', '{\"en\": \"The local councillor met with business owners to discuss new regulations for the city center.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy viên hội đồng địa phương đã gặp gỡ các chủ doanh nghiệp để thảo luận về các quy định mới cho trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-ljspeech-aa3ec211.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-cori-aa3ec211.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/councillor-d2ca1581.webp', '[\"representative\", \"member\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"city councillor\", \"meaning\": \"ủy viên hội đồng thành phố\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local councillor\", \"meaning\": \"ủy viên hội đồng địa phương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"counselor\", \"note_vi\": \"Counselor là người tư vấn, councillor là ủy viên hội đồng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"council\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-cori-aa3ec211.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-aru0-aa3ec211.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-aru5-aa3ec211.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-aru6-aa3ec211.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-aru10-aa3ec211.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-aru9-aa3ec211.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/councillor-aru3-aa3ec211.mp3\