('4ad233bf-739b-50d7-8e3f-82bb6b686e25', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f2bb4911-ea8a-5305-ab7f-d62f2b6e20f1', '0104184a-c491-596c-ba1e-ee1e34260ca1', 'prevention', '/prɪˈvenʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động ngăn chặn điều gì đó xảy ra.', 'the act of stopping something bad from happening or existing.', 'Disease prevention is better than cure.', 'Phòng bệnh hơn chữa bệnh.', '{\"en\": \"The safety officer introduced new procedures for fire prevention in the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên an toàn đã đưa ra các quy trình mới về phòng chống cháy nổ trong nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-ljspeech-94509ddf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-cori-94509ddf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prevention-bae844f6.webp', '[\"avoidance\", \"deterrence\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crime prevention\", \"meaning\": \"phòng chống tội phạm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accident prevention\", \"meaning\": \"phòng tránh tai nạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"protection\", \"note_vi\": \"prevention là ngăn không cho xảy ra; protection là bảo vệ khỏi tác hại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prevent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preventative\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preventable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-cori-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru0-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru5-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru6-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru10-94509ddf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru9-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru3-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru7-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/