('9d803aea-7bda-56e4-bf66-84accf21e6a5', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f2bb4911-ea8a-5305-ab7f-d62f2b6e20f1', '0104184a-c491-596c-ba1e-ee1e34260ca1', 'partition', 'UK: /pɑːˈtɪʃən/ | US: /pɑːrˈtɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'vách ngăn', 'a temporary structure or thin wall that divides a room into smaller areas.', 'The office used movable partitions to create separate spaces.', 'Văn phòng sử dụng các vách ngăn di động để tạo không gian riêng biệt.', '{\"en\": \"Glass partitions were installed to divide the open-plan office into separate meeting rooms.\", \"vi\": \"Các vách ngăn bằng kính đã được lắp đặt để chia văn phòng mở thành các phòng họp riêng biệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-ljspeech-88faac11.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-cori-88faac11.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/partition-cc8a9529.webp', '[\"divider\", \"barrier\", \"screen\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"glass partition\", \"meaning\": \"vách ngăn kính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"office partition\", \"meaning\": \"vách ngăn văn phòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"portion\", \"note_vi\": \"Portion có nghĩa là \'phần/khẩu phần\', còn partition là \'vách ngăn\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"partition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-cori-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru0-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru5-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru6-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru10-88faac11.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru9-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru3-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru7-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru8-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-aru2-88faac11.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-ljspeech-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt408-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt138-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt624-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt396-88faac11.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt498-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt132-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt288-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt42-88faac11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/partition-lt90-88faac11.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường văn phòng, \'partition\' thường chỉ vách ngăn chia các ô làm việc (cubicle).', 'office', 1, 25),
('062ed514-ebe9-52f3-a4b4-34f07e5e0763', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f2bb4911-ea8a-5305-ab7f-d62f2b6e20f1', '0104184a-c491-596c-ba1e-ee1e34260ca1', 'reassure', '/ˌriːəˈʃʊə(r)/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó bớt lo lắng hoặc sợ hãi, làm họ cảm thấy an toàn hơn.', 'to say or do something to remove another person\'s fear or worry.', 'The doctor tried to reassure the patient that the surgery would be safe and successful.', 'Bác sĩ đã cố gắng trấn an bệnh nhân rằng ca phẫu thuật sẽ an toàn và thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor reassured the client that the project would meet the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã trấn an khách hàng rằng dự án sẽ đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-ljspeech-7c4bcd61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-cori-7c4bcd61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reassure-e55e3c86.webp', '[\"comfort\", \"soothe\", \"calm\"]', '[\"alarm\", \"frighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reassure someone\", \"meaning\": \"trấn an ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reassure the public\", \"meaning\": \"trấn an công chúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reassure customers\", \"meaning\": \"trấn an khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ensure\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là đảm bảo, không phải làm bớt lo.\"}, {\"word\": \"insure\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là mua bảo hiểm, khác reassure.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reassurance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reassuring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-cori-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru0-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru5-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru6-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru10-7c4bcd61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru9-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"