('75910e20-23ba-5dea-9dfc-a01d89ff337c', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f2bb4911-ea8a-5305-ab7f-d62f2b6e20f1', '0104184a-c491-596c-ba1e-ee1e34260ca1', 'imminent', '/ˈɪmɪnənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Sắp xảy ra, rất gần kề.', 'happening or likely to happen very soon.', 'The dark clouds indicated that a storm was imminent.', 'Những đám mây đen cho thấy một cơn bão sắp xảy ra.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned the staff about the imminent deadline for the quarterly financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã cảnh báo nhân viên về thời hạn sắp tới của báo cáo tài chính hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-ljspeech-73da2f3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-cori-73da2f3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imminent-476c1dd4.webp', '[\"impending\", \"approaching\"]', '[\"distant\", \"remote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"imminent danger\", \"meaning\": \"nguy hiểm cận kề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"imminent threat\", \"meaning\": \"mối đe dọa sắp xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eminent\", \"note_vi\": \"Eminent là nổi tiếng, imminent là sắp xảy ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"imminence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-cori-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru0-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru5-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru6-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru10-73da2f3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru9-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru3-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru7-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru8-73da2f3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imminent-aru2-73da2f3f.mp3\"