('c51d0520-8947-5995-87b1-a2f135249875', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f656bae2-1285-5fd8-8ddf-6fa850d91f55', '6f366658-a670-55af-a8b0-f1956bcb7ea5', 'drain', '/dreɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Ống thoát nước hoặc hệ thống dẫn nước thải đi.', 'a pipe or hole that carries off dirty water or other liquids from a place.', 'The plumber had to clear a blockage in the kitchen sink drain.', 'Người thợ sửa ống nước phải thông tắc cống bồn rửa bát trong bếp.', '{\"en\": \"Maintenance staff inspected the main floor drain after the severe storm caused minor basement flooding.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã kiểm tra ống thoát nước sàn chính sau khi trận bão lớn gây ngập nhẹ tầng hầm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-ljspeech-2780acf0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-cori-2780acf0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drain-e2db9abb.webp', '[\"pipe\", \"gutter\", \"outlet\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"floor drain\", \"meaning\": \"cống thoát nước sàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"storm drain\", \"meaning\": \"mương thoát nước mưa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strain\", \"note_vi\": \"Strain là sự căng thẳng hoặc lọc nước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drain\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drainage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-cori-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru0-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru5-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru6-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru10-2780acf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru9-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru3-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru7-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru8-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-aru2-2780acf0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-ljspeech-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt408-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt138-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt624-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt396-2780acf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt498-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt132-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt288-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt42-2780acf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drain-lt90-2780acf0.mp3\"]}}', 'Drain vừa là danh từ (ống thoát nước) vừa là động từ (rút nước, làm cạn kiệt).', 'housing', 1, 14),
('c912d3f8-92de-55f9-a620-2474c40a9eb3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f656bae2-1285-5fd8-8ddf-6fa850d91f55', '6f366658-a670-55af-a8b0-f1956bcb7ea5', 'hazard', '/ˈhæzəd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một mối nguy hiểm hoặc rủi ro tiềm ẩn.', 'something that can cause danger, risk, or harm to people or things.', 'Potholes on the main road create a dangerous traffic hazard for drivers.', 'Những cái hố trên đường chính tạo ra mối nguy hiểm giao thông đáng ngại cho tài xế.', '{\"en\": \"The broken floor tiles in the lobby are a serious safety hazard for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Những viên gạch vỡ ở sảnh là mối nguy hiểm an toàn nghiêm trọng cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-ljspeech-6ad86b52.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-cori-6ad86b52.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hazard-41ccc601.webp', '[\"danger\", \"risk\", \"threat\"]', '[\"safety\", \"security\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"safety hazard\", \"meaning\": \"mối nguy hiểm về an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"health hazard\", \"meaning\": \"mối nguy hại cho sức khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"occupational hazard\", \"meaning\": \"rủi ro nghề nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"risk\", \"note_vi\": \"risk là khả năng xảy ra, hazard là nguồn gây nguy hiểm cụ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hazardous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hazardously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-cori-6ad86b52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-aru0-6ad86b52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-aru5-6ad86b52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-aru6-6ad86b52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-aru10-6ad86b52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-aru9-6ad86b52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hazard-aru3-6ad86b52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ