('63d4f822-dda3-5d39-ae0e-ae473b5100d0', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f656bae2-1285-5fd8-8ddf-6fa850d91f55', '6f366658-a670-55af-a8b0-f1956bcb7ea5', 'bare', '/beə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Trống trơn, không có gì che phủ; trần trụi.', 'not covered by any clothes, leaves, or other things that usually protect something.', 'After the move, the walls of the apartment were completely bare.', 'Sau khi chuyển đi, những bức tường của căn hộ hoàn toàn trống trơn.', '{\"en\": \"The new office space is currently bare, but furniture will arrive by next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Không gian văn phòng mới hiện đang trống trơn, nhưng đồ nội thất sẽ đến vào thứ Hai tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-ljspeech-b9e2c5c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-cori-b9e2c5c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bare-49e44248.webp', '[\"empty\", \"uncovered\", \"naked\"]', '[\"covered\", \"furnished\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bare hands\", \"meaning\": \"tay không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bare essentials\", \"meaning\": \"những thứ thiết yếu nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bear\", \"note_vi\": \"bear là chịu đựng hoặc con gấu, phát âm giống bare\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"barely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bareness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-cori-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru0-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru5-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru6-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru10-b9e2c5c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru9-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru3-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru7-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru8-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-aru2-b9e2c5c9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-ljspeech-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt408-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt138-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt624-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt396-b9e2c5c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt498-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt132-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt288-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt42-b9e2c5c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bare-lt90-b9e2c5c9.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt với \'bear\' (chịu đựng) dù phát âm hoàn toàn giống nhau.', 'housing', 1, 22),
('38249a9c-321e-5b47-bd7d-1956c08da923', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f656bae2-1285-5fd8-8ddf-6fa850d91f55', '6f366658-a670-55af-a8b0-f1956bcb7ea5', 'distinction', '/dɪˈstɪŋkʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một sự khác biệt rõ ràng giữa hai hoặc nhiều thứ.', 'a clear difference or contrast between two or more similar things or people.', 'The consultant drew a sharp distinction between long-term strategic goals and daily operations.', 'Vị cố vấn đã vạch ra sự khác biệt rõ rệt giữa mục tiêu chiến lược dài hạn và các hoạt động hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team made a clear distinction between the two target customer groups.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị đã đưa ra một sự phân biệt rõ ràng giữa hai nhóm khách hàng mục tiêu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-ljspeech-d4fd2289.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-cori-d4fd2289.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distinction-88e99797.webp', '[\"difference\", \"contrast\", \"differentiation\"]', '[\"similarity\", \"likeness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clear distinction\", \"meaning\": \"sự phân biệt rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a distinction\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra sự phân biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"extinction\", \"note_vi\": \"extinction là sự tuyệt chủng, phân biệt với distinction là sự khác biệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"distinct\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"distinguish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"distinctive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-cori-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru0-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru5-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru6-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru10-d4fd2289.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru9-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru3-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru7-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru8-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-aru2-d4fd2289.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-ljspeech-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt408-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt138-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt624-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt396-d4fd2289.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt498-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt132-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt288-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt42-d4fd2289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinction-lt90-d4fd2289.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này còn có nghĩa là sự xuất sắc, ưu tú (ví dụ: graduate with distinction).', 'marketing', 1, 23),
('3b6dc5b3-484f-527f-b12d-27e4751afb83', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'f656bae2-1285-5fd8-8ddf-6fa850d91f55', '6f366658-a670-55af-a8b0-f1956bcb7ea5', 'premium', '/ˈpriːmiəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Số tiền phải trả định kỳ để mua bảo hiểm.', 'an amount of money that you pay regularly to an insurance company for coverage.', 'Her car insurance premium went up after she had a minor accident.', 'Phí bảo hiểm xe ô tô của cô ấy đã tăng lên sau khi cô ấy gặp một tai nạn nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"You must pay your monthly insurance premium on time to keep your policy active today.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn phải thanh toán phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng đúng hạn để giữ cho hợp đồng của bạn còn hiệu lực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-ljspeech-5c0a4fc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-cori-5c0a4fc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/premium-a12d48b2.webp', '[\"payment\", \"fee\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pay a premium\", \"meaning\": \"đóng phí bảo hiểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"insurance premium\", \"meaning\": \"phí bảo hiểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"premier\", \"note_vi\": \"premier là thủ tướng hoặc hàng đầu, premium là phí bảo hiểm.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-cori-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru0-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru5-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru6-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru10-5c0a4fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru9-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru3-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru7-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru8-5c0a4fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premium-aru2-5c0a4