('afbf4485-77a8-5835-b507-3e9c591aedc2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fbacac51-bbca-5c25-b019-d0e220143485', 'a872e96e-41d5-5dbb-8555-b460b113d28b', 'vicious', '/ˈvɪʃəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Độc ác, hung dữ, tàn bạo.', 'violent and cruel, or expressing strong negative feelings in a way that intends to hurt.', 'The dog, though usually friendly, showed a vicious side when protecting its puppies.', 'Con chó, dù thường thân thiện, đã thể hiện một mặt hung dữ khi bảo vệ đàn con của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The competitor launched a vicious marketing campaign to damage our company\'s reputation in the market.\", \"vi\": \"Đối thủ cạnh tranh đã tung ra một chiến dịch tiếp thị ác ý nhằm hủy hoại uy tín của công ty chúng tôi trên thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-ljspeech-4644fd12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-cori-4644fd12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vicious-d145e511.webp', '[\"cruel\", \"brutal\", \"malicious\"]', '[\"gentle\", \"kind\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vicious circle\", \"meaning\": \"vòng luẩn quẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vicious attack\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tấn công tàn bạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"viscous\", \"note_vi\": \"viscous nghĩa là sền sệt, dính (chất lỏng), viết gần giống vicious\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vice\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"viciously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-cori-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru0-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru5-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru6-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru10-4644fd12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru9-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru3-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru7-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru8-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-aru2-4644fd12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-ljspeech-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt408-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt138-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt624-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt396-4644fd12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt498-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt132-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt288-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt42-4644fd12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vicious-lt90-4644fd12.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'vicious circle\' (vòng luẩn quẩn) cực kỳ phổ biến và hay ra trong các bài đọc.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('a9bab429-4ed6-5fd3-aed2-7eb51e88c6d4', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fbacac51-bbca-5c25-b019-d0e220143485', 'a872e96e-41d5-5dbb-8555-b460b113d28b', 'conversion', '/kənˈvɜːʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc quá trình thay đổi từ dạng này sang dạng khác.', 'the process of changing something from one form, state, or purpose to another.', 'The conversion of the old warehouse into modern apartments was a huge success.', 'Việc chuyển đổi nhà kho cũ thành căn hộ hiện đại là một thành công lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The conversion of the office space into a conference room will be completed by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Việc chuyển đổi không gian văn phòng thành phòng hội nghị sẽ hoàn thành trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-ljspeech-21faa67d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-cori-21faa67d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conversion-0023f414.webp', '[\"change\", \"transformation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"currency conversion\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển đổi tiền tệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conversion rate\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ lệ chuyển đổi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"convert\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-cori-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru0-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru5-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru6-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru10-21faa67d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru9-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru3-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru7-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru8-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-aru2-21faa67d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-ljspeech-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt408-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt138-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt624-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt396-21faa67d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt498-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt132-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt288-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt42-21faa67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversion-lt90-21faa67d.mp3\"]}}', 'rất phổ biến trong marketing (tỷ lệ chuyển đổi khách hàng).', 'business', 1, 12),
('bfe1a306-c69b-5d0f-9150-2a0600a3cb42', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fbacac51-bbca-5c25-b019-d0e220143485', 'a872e96e-41d5-5dbb-8555-b460b113d28b', 'selective', '/sɪˈlektɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có tính chọn lọc, chỉ chọn một số ít từ nhiều lựa chọn.', 'choosing carefully from a group of people or things that are available.', 'She is very selective about the books she reads.', 'Cô ấy rất chọn lọc về những cuốn sách mình đọc.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department is highly selective when hiring candidates for management roles.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự rất có tính chọn lọc khi tuyển dụng ứng viên cho các vị trí quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-ljspeech-eb4c0d15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-cori-eb4c0d15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/selective-adea36df.webp', '[\"discriminating\", \"choosy\", \"picky\"]', '[\"indiscriminate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be selective about\", \"meaning\": \"kén chọn về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly selective\", \"meaning\": \"tuyển chọn rất kỹ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"select\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"selection\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"selectively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-cori-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru0-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru5-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru6-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru10-eb4c0d15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru9-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru3-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru7-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru8-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-aru2-eb4c0d15.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-ljspeech-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt408-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt138-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt624-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt396-eb4c0d15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt498-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt132-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt288-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt42-eb4c0d15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selective-lt90-eb4c0d15.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'about\' hoặc \'in\' (ví dụ: selective about choosing).', 'hr', 1, 13),
('7fecf2c8-4329-55e5-8254-0444bb3c8607', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fbacac51-bbca-5c25-b019-d0e220143485', 'a872e96e-41d5-5dbb-8555-b460b113d28b', 'liberal', '/ˈlɪbərəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tự do, phóng khoáng; rộng lượng', 'willing to accept new ideas or behavior that are different from traditional ones.', 'The company introduced a liberal vacation policy to boost employee satisfaction and morale.', 'Công ty đã áp dụng một chính sách nghỉ phép phóng khoáng để nâng cao sự hài lòng và tinh thần của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a very liberal policy regarding remote work and flexible office hours.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có chính sách rất cởi mở liên quan đến làm việc từ xa và giờ làm việc linh hoạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-ljspeech-309d5759.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-cori-309d5759.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/liberal-befff38b.webp', '[\"open-minded\", \"progressive\"]', '[\"conservative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"liberal policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách cởi mở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"liberal view\", \"meaning\": \"quan điểm phóng khoáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"liberality\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"liberate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-cori-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru0-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru5-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru6-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru10-309d5759.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru9-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru3-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru7-309d5759.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liberal-aru8-309d5759.