('7f34a3d3-25e9-58b4-ad60-5c1ba5b26896', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'steer', '/stɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Điều khiển hướng đi của phương tiện hoặc con vật.', 'to control the direction of a vehicle, or to guide someone or something.', 'The captain managed to steer the ship safely through the stormy waters.', 'Thuyền trưởng đã lái con tàu an toàn qua vùng biển động.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager must steer the team in the right direction to meet the strict deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dự án phải lèo lái nhóm đi đúng hướng để đáp ứng thời hạn nghiêm ngặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-ljspeech-f8bfc15d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-cori-f8bfc15d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steer-5f24d50b.webp', '[\"guide\", \"direct\", \"navigate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steer a car\", \"meaning\": \"lái xe ô tô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steer a conversation\", \"meaning\": \"dẫn dắt cuộc trò chuyện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"steering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-cori-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru0-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru5-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru6-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru10-f8bfc15d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru9-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru3-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru7-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru8-f8bfc15d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-aru2-f8bfc15d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steer-ljsp