('2b410da0-12d9-557e-b24b-6ffd04468ba2', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'external', 'UK: /ɪkˈstɜːnəl/ | US: /ɪkˈstɜːr.nəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'bên ngoài', 'belonging to or coming from outside a particular organization, system, or structure.', 'The company hired an external consultant for the project.', 'Công ty đã thuê một nhà tư vấn bên ngoài cho dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The firm hired an external auditor to review its financial statements for compliance.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một kiểm toán viên độc lập bên ngoài để rà soát các báo cáo tài chính nhằm đảm bảo sự tuân thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-ljspeech-59d8f3ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-cori-59d8f3ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/external-5e9d6e02.webp', '[\"outside\", \"outward\", \"extraneous\"]', '[\"internal\", \"inner\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"external auditor\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm toán viên bên ngoài/độc lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"external consultant\", \"meaning\": \"cố vấn bên ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"external factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố bên ngoài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"internal\", \"note_vi\": \"internal là bên trong (nội bộ công ty), đối lập với external (từ bên ngoài)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"externally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-cori-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru0-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru5-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru6-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru10-59d8f3ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru9-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru3-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru7-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru8-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-aru2-59d8f3ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-ljspeech-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt408-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt138-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt624-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt396-59d8f3ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt498-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt132-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt288-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt42-59d8f3ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/external-lt90-59d8f3ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay dùng trong ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp: external audit (kiểm toán độc lập bên ngoài), external consultant (cố vấn bên ngoài), external factors (yếu tố bên ngoài).', 'corporate governance', 1, 7),
('850a057b-1e5a-5f3c-97d3-597b9e66ebb3', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'peninsula', 'UK: /pəˈnɪnsjələ/ | US: /pəˈnɪnsələ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bán đảo', 'A piece of land almost surrounded by water or projecting into a sea.', 'The company plans to develop a resort on the tropical peninsula.', 'Công ty dự định phát triển một khu nghỉ dưỡng trên bán đảo nhiệt đới.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury resort is located on a quiet peninsula overlooking the ocean.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng nằm trên một bán đảo yên bình hướng ra đại dương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-ljspeech-4d2e7473.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-cori-4d2e7473.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/peninsula-6fbc4f7a.webp', '[\"headland\", \"cape\", \"promontory\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coastal peninsula\", \"meaning\": \"bán đảo ven biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rocky peninsula\", \"meaning\": \"bán đảo nhiều đá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"peninsular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-cori-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru0-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru5-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru6-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru10-4d2e7473.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru9-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru3-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru7-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru8-4d2e7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peninsula-aru2-4d2e7473.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pro