('b595b3d7-045b-5d05-9fce-6efc82c48d31', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'glorious', '/ˈɡlɔːriəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất đẹp, lộng lẫy hoặc đáng ngưỡng mộ.', 'deserving great admiration, praise, or bringing much happiness and beauty to people.', 'The sunset over the mountains was a truly glorious sight.', 'Cảnh hoàng hôn trên núi là một cảnh tượng thực sự tuyệt vời.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offered guests a glorious view of the ocean from every luxury suite.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng mang đến cho khách hàng một tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp ra đại dương từ mọi phòng sang trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-ljspeech-ff6a0d51.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-cori-ff6a0d51.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glorious-29ac7202.webp', '[\"magnificent\", \"splendid\", \"wonderful\"]', '[\"miserable\", \"dismal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"glorious opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glorious weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết đẹp rực rỡ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"glory\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"gloriously\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"glorify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-cori-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru0-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru5-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru6-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru10-ff6a0d51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru9-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru3-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorious-aru7-ff6a0d51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorio