('29c2ea6a-27cc-5d6b-a551-0deb250df632', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'designate', '/ˈdezɪɡneɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Chỉ định, bổ nhiệm ai đó vào vị trí.', 'to officially choose someone for a particular role or position.', 'The committee will designate a new leader by the end of the month.', 'Ủy ban sẽ chỉ định một lãnh đạo mới vào cuối tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The board will designate a project manager for the new branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ chỉ định một quản lý dự án cho văn phòng chi nhánh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-ljspeech-08e0fe4a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-cori-08e0fe4a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/designate-de596c89.webp', '[\"appoint\", \"assign\", \"nominate\"]', '[\"dismiss\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"designate someone as\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ định ai đó là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"officially designate\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ định chính thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"designate a representative\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ định người đại diện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"delegate\", \"note_vi\": \"delegate là giao việc/ủy quyền, designate là chỉ định vào vị trí\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"designation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"designated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-cori-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru0-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru5-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru6-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru10-08e0fe4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru9-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru3-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru7-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru8-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-aru2-08e0fe4a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-ljspeech-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt408-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt138-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt624-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt396-08e0fe4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt498-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt132-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt288-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt42-08e0fe4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/designate-lt90-08e0fe4a.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp trong TOEIC dạng \'designate someone as + chức vụ\', đừng nhầm với delegate.', 'hr', 1, 17),
('dcafa80a-b194-5ccd-87d0-9a3f60c5003a', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'ironic', '/aɪˈrɒnɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Trớ trêu, mỉa mai, khi điều xảy ra ngược với mong đợi.', 'happening in a way that is the opposite of what you would expect.', 'It\'s ironic that he\'s a swimming instructor but can\'t swim very well himself.', 'Thật trớ trêu khi anh ấy là huấn luyện viên bơi lội nhưng bản thân lại bơi không giỏi lắm.', '{\"en\": \"It is ironic that the software company\'s own website was down during the tech conference.\", \"vi\": \"Thật trớ trêu khi trang web của chính công ty phần mềm lại bị sập trong hội nghị công nghệ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-ljspeech-08e133da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-cori-08e133da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ironic-733a4b1c.webp', '[\"paradoxical\", \"unexpected\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ironic situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống trớ trêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ironic twist\", \"meaning\": \"diễn biến trớ trêu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"irony\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-cori-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru0-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru5-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru6-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru10-08e133da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru9-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru3-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru7-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru8-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-aru2-08e133da.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-ljspeech-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt408-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt138-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt624-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt396-08e133da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt498-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt132-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt288-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt42-08e133da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironic-lt90-08e133da.mp3\"]}}', 'dùng khi kết quả trái ngược hoàn toàn với mong đợi ban đầu.', 'other', 1, 18),
('2b325f5f-1a05-5be2-9a28-e48b4cb7d285', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'ally', '/ˈælaɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người hoặc quốc gia là đồng minh, đối tác.', 'a person, group, or country that supports and cooperates with another for a common goal.', 'During the war, several countries formed an alliance and became allies.', 'Trong chiến tranh, một số quốc gia đã thành lập liên minh và trở thành đồng minh.', '{\"en\": \"Our firm partnered with a local ally to expand distribution across the southern region.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi hợp tác với một đối tác địa phương để mở rộng phân phối khắp miền Nam.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-ljspeech-0ab8140a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-cori-0ab8140a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ally-0aa12ef6.webp', '[\"partner\", \"associate\", \"supporter\"]', '[\"enemy\", \"opponent\", \"rival\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"close ally\", \"meaning\": \"đồng minh thân cận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strategic ally\", \"meaning\": \"đồng minh chiến lược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ally with\", \"meaning\": \"liên minh với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"alley\", \"note_vi\": \"alley là con hẻm, ally là đồng minh; phát âm và nghĩa hoàn toàn khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ally\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"alliance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"allied\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-cori-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru0-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru5-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru6-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru10-0ab8140a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru9-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru3-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru7-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru8-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-aru2-0ab8140a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-ljspeech-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt408-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt138-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt624-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt396-0ab8140a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt498-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt132-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt288-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt42-0ab8140a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ally-lt90-0ab8140a.mp3\"]}}', 'đừng nhầm ally (đồng minh) với alley (con hẻm); ally cũng dùng được như động từ: ally with someone.', 'business', 1, 19),
('4e53afbb-bf10-52fc-879c-9a3a539e247b', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'denounce', '/dɪˈnaʊns/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Lên án công khai, chỉ trích mạnh mẽ ai đó/điều gì đó.', 'to publicly state that someone or something is wrong, bad, or unacceptable.', 'The human rights organization decided to denounce the government\'s actions.', 'Tổ chức nhân quyền đã quyết định tố cáo hành động của chính phủ.', '{\"en\": \"The consumer group publicly denounced the company for its misleading advertising practices.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm người tiêu dùng đã công khai lên án công ty vì các hành vi quảng cáo gây hiểu lầm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-ljspeech-7803acfd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-cori-7803acfd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/denounce-fae72480.webp', '[\"condemn\", \"criticize\", \"censure\"]', '[\"praise\", \"commend\", \"endorse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"denounce publicly\", \"meaning\": \"lên án công khai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"denounce as unfair\", \"meaning\": \"lên án là không công bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly denounce\", \"meaning\": \"lên án mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"announce\", \"note_vi\": \"announce là thông báo trung lập, denounce là lên án với thái độ tiêu cực\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"denunciation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"denouncement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-cori-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru0-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru5-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru6-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru10-7803acfd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru9-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru3-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru7-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru8-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru2-7803acfd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-ljspeech-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt408-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt138-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt624-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt396-7803acfd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt498-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt132-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt288-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt42-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-lt90-7803acfd.mp3\"]}}', 'denounce mang nghĩa tiêu cực mạnh, đừng nhầm với announce (thông báo) hay renounce (từ bỏ).', 'media', 1, 20),
('a06eedb1-a795-557c-895e-badbf0057633', '62f0e566-4773-5470-a53e-c003eb8647cf', 'fda01aa4-4714-5902-bea5-110887d60212', 'b22508b3-c746-57c2-903f-d204bfa0be10', 'premier', '/ˈpremiə(r)/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Tốt nhất hoặc quan trọng nhất; hàng đầu.', 'the best or most important among similar things.', 'The company is known as a premier provider of luxury travel services.', 'Công ty này được biết đến là nhà cung cấp hàng đầu các dịch vụ du lịch sang trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Our premier client requested a customized report by the end of quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng hàng đầu của chúng tôi đã yêu cầu một báo cáo tùy chỉnh vào cuối quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-ljspeech-8080ff5f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-cori-8080ff5f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/premier-e8a7fdbe.webp', '[\"leading\", \"top\", \"foremost\"]', '[\"minor\", \"secondary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"premier provider\", \"meaning\": \"nhà cung cấp hàng đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"premier destination\", \"meaning\": \"điểm đến số một\"}, {\"phrase\": \"premier client\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng quan trọng nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"premium\", \"note_vi\": \"premium là cao cấp, premier là hàng đầu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"premiere\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-cori-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru0-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru5-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru6-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru10-8080ff5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru9-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru3-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/premier-aru7-8080ff5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro