('0ddaedd0-4da0-585f-8790-40cd8bd7f987', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '05fece22-49d2-55fb-9af3-4a3e7ce08819', '6d3d78cd-9b1b-50b7-9f73-b33937114df4', 'infection', '/ɪnˈfekʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tình trạng bị vi khuẩn hoặc virus tấn công, gây bệnh.', 'the process of becoming ill because of germs or bacteria entering the body.', 'You should clean the wound thoroughly to prevent a serious skin infection.', 'Bạn nên rửa sạch vết thương kỹ lưỡng để tránh bị nhiễm trùng da nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The office manager advised staff to sanitize desks to prevent the spread of any infection.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý văn phòng khuyên nhân viên nên khử trùng bàn làm việc để ngăn ngừa sự lây lan của bất kỳ bệnh truyền nhiễm nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-ljspeech-afb56160.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-cori-afb56160.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infection-e03ead4f.webp', '[\"disease\", \"illness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bacterial infection\", \"meaning\": \"nhiễm khuẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent infection\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa nhiễm trùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"infect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"infectious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-cori-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru0-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru5-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru6-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru10-afb56160.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru9-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru3-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru7-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru8-afb