('138ae877-4db8-55be-b8dd-970f20231ac3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '05fece22-49d2-55fb-9af3-4a3e7ce08819', '6d3d78cd-9b1b-50b7-9f73-b33937114df4', 'awareness', 'UK: /əˈwɛənəs/ | US: /əˈwɛərnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự nhận thức', 'the condition or level of having knowledge, consciousness, or perception of a particular topic or issue', 'Public awareness of the issue is growing.', 'Sự nhận thức của công chúng về vấn đề đang tăng lên.', '{\"en\": \"The advertising campaign effectively boosted brand awareness among target consumers.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch quảng cáo đã thúc đẩy nhận thức về thương hiệu một cách hiệu quả trong người tiêu dùng mục tiêu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-ljspeech-eee3afcf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-cori-eee3afcf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/awareness-03d214db.webp', '[\"consciousness\", \"understanding\", \"perception\", \"recognition\"]', '[\"ignorance\", \"unawareness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"brand awareness\", \"meaning\": \"nhận thức thương hiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raise awareness\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao nhận thức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"aware\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-cori-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru0-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru5-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru6-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru10-eee3afcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru9-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru3-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru7-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru8-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-aru2-eee3afcf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-ljspeech-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt408-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt138-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt624-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt396-eee3afcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt498-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt132-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt288-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt42-eee3afcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awareness-lt90-eee3afcf.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ rất hay xuất hiện trong tiếp thị: \'brand awareness\' (nhận thức thương hiệu) hoặc \'raise awareness\' (nâng cao nhận thức).', 'marketing', 1, 7),
('e0fc85df-8830-5fea-95cb-4983cf8fcc52', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '05fece22-49d2-55fb-9af3-4a3e7ce08819', '6d3d78cd-9b1b-50b7-9f73-b33937114df4', 'swear', '/sweə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nói lời thề trang trọng; dùng lời lẽ thô tục.', 'to make a serious promise to do something or to tell the truth.', 'He swore he would never tell anyone her secret.', 'Anh ấy thề rằng sẽ không bao giờ kể bí mật của cô ấy cho bất cứ ai.', '{\"en\": \"He had to swear under oath that he would tell the truth in court.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy phải thề dưới tuyên thệ rằng anh ấy sẽ nói sự thật tại tòa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-ljspeech-fec65869.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-cori-fec65869.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swear-fa8e8ac4.webp', '[\"vow\", \"pledge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swear an oath\", \"meaning\": \"thề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"swear by\", \"meaning\": \"tin tưởng tuyệt đối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swearing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-cori-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru0-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru5-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru6-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru10-fec65869.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru9-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru3-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru7-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru8-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-aru2-fec65869.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-ljspeech-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swear-lt408-fec65869.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/