('f65ee22d-59ae-502a-91c2-9f6195210a98', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '05fece22-49d2-55fb-9af3-4a3e7ce08819', '6d3d78cd-9b1b-50b7-9f73-b33937114df4', 'administration', '/ədˌmɪnɪˈstreɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động quản lý, điều hành một tổ chức hoặc chính phủ.', 'the process of managing and organizing the work of a company or a public institution.', 'The university administration announced new policies for student housing.', 'Ban quản lý trường đại học đã công bố các chính sách mới về ký túc xá sinh viên.', '{\"en\": \"The school administration decided to extend the library hours to support students during exam week.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản trị trường học quyết định kéo dài giờ mở cửa thư viện để hỗ trợ sinh viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-ljspeech-056cbe59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-cori-056cbe59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/administration-b2bb655b.webp', '[\"management\", \"governance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business administration\", \"meaning\": \"quản trị kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"school administration\", \"meaning\": \"ban quản trị trường học\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"administer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"administrative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-cori-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru0-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru5-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru6-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru10-056cbe59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru9-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru3-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru7-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru8-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru2-056cbe59.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-ljspeech-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt408-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt138-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt624-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt396-056cbe59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt498-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt132-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt288-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt42-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt90-056cbe59.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ bộ máy quản lý hoặc hành chính của một tổ chức.', 'office', 1, 12),
('e69d3572-63ed-5ac2-bf80-3223d6b57046', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '05fece22-49d2-55fb-9af3-4a3e7ce08819', '6d3d78cd-9b1b-50b7-9f73-b33937114df4', 'deliberately', '/dɪˈlɪbərətli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách có chủ đích, cố tình.', 'done in a way that is planned or intended, not by accident or mistake.', 'He deliberately left his phone at home so he wouldn\'t be distracted during the meeting.', 'Anh ấy cố tình để điện thoại ở nhà để không bị phân tâm trong cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The employee deliberately ignored the safety instructions, which led to a serious workplace accident.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó đã cố tình phớt lờ các hướng dẫn an toàn, dẫn đến một tai nạn lao động nghiêm trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-ljspeech-284c132a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-cori-284c132a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deliberately-8dbeeada.webp', '[\"intentionally\", \"purposely\"]', '[\"accidentally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deliberately choose\", \"meaning\": \"cố tình chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deliberately ignore\", \"meaning\": \"cố tình phớt lờ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deliberate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-cori-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru0-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru5-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru6-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru10-284c132a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru9-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru3-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru7-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru8-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-aru2-284c132a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-ljspeech-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt408-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt138-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt624-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt396-284c132a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt498-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt132-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt288-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt42-284c132a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberately-lt90-284c132a.mp3\"]}}', 'thể hiện hành động có ý thức, thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực.', 'office', 1, 13),
('24df0e61-e954-5bc3-bce9-e40fc1fa2cb2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '05fece22-49d2-55fb-9af3-4a3e7ce08819', '6d3d78cd-9b1b-50b7-9f73-b33937114df4', 'requirement', '/rɪˈkwaɪəmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Yêu cầu, điều kiện cần phải có.', 'something that is needed or must be done to achieve a goal or follow a rule.', 'Meeting all the requirements is essential for graduation.', 'Đáp ứng tất cả các yêu cầu là điều cần thiết để tốt nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"Applicants must meet all entry requirements before submitting their job application.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên phải đáp ứng tất cả các yêu cầu đầu vào trước khi nộp đơn xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-ljspeech-15320ae2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-cori-15320ae2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/requirement-c12651c4.webp', '[\"condition\", \"prerequisite\", \"necessity\"]', '[\"option\", \"choice\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"meet the requirements\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng các yêu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minimum requirement\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu tối thiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"legal requirement\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"request\", \"note_vi\": \"request là lời đề nghị, có thể từ chối; requirement là điều bắt buộc phải có\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"require\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"required\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"requisite\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-cori-15320ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-aru0-15320ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-aru5-15320ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-aru6-15320ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-aru10-15320ae2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requirement-aru9-15320ae2.mp3\", \"/st