('4fff14d4-7370-51c2-8d59-031f2e4cd6db', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'defend', '/dɪˈfend/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Bảo vệ khỏi sự tấn công hoặc làm hại.', 'to guard against injury, criticism, or danger by providing support or taking protective action.', 'The lawyer worked hard to defend his client\'s innocence in court.', 'Luật sư đã làm việc chăm chỉ để bảo vệ sự vô tội của thân chủ mình trước tòa.', '{\"en\": \"The security team worked quickly to defend the company\'s servers from a cyber attack.\", \"vi\": \"Đội an ninh đã làm việc nhanh chóng để bảo vệ máy chủ của công ty khỏi một cuộc tấn công mạng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-ljspeech-a4555a4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-cori-a4555a4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defend-9f9a76a7.webp', '[\"protect\", \"guard\"]', '[\"attack\", \"abandon\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"defend against\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ chống lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"defend rights\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ quyền lợi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"defense\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"defensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-cori-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru0-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru5-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru6-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru10-a4555a4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru9-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru3-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru7-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru8-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/def