('d73480b8-7f83-5061-9df3-3911510947d5', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'accessibly', 'UK: /əkˈsɛsəbli/ | US: /əkˈsɛsəbli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách có thể tiếp cận được, dễ hiểu', 'in a clear manner that allows information or facilities to be easily understood or reached.', 'This information is clearly accessibly presented.', 'Thông tin này được trình bày rõ ràng, dễ hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The new policy guide is accessibly written so that all staff members can understand their obligations.\", \"vi\": \"Hướng dẫn chính sách mới được viết rất dễ hiểu để tất cả nhân viên có thể nắm rõ nghĩa vụ của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-ljspeech-b6298040.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-cori-b6298040.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accessibly-51119fd1.webp', '[\"understandably\", \"clearly\", \"conveniently\"]', '[\"inaccessibly\", \"obscurely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accessibly priced\", \"meaning\": \"được định giá vừa túi tiền/dễ tiếp cận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accessibly presented\", \"meaning\": \"được trình bày một cách dễ hiểu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accessibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accessible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-cori-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru0-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru5-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru6-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru10-b6298040.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru9-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru3-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru7-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru8-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru2-b6298040.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-ljspeech-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt408-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt138-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt624-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt396-b6298040.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt498-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt132-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt288-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt42-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt90-b6298040.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ly chỉ cách thức. Thường đi kèm các động từ phân nhánh như written, presented (được trình bày/viết dễ hiểu).', 'office', 1, 7),
('78e15b68-c38e-5a38-8bb6-a512c27917e9', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'authorization', 'UK: /ˌɔːθəraɪˈzeɪʃən/ | US: /ˌɔːθərəˈzeɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự cho phép, sự ủy quyền', 'official permission, approval, or power given to perform a specific action or task.', 'You need proper authorization to access these files.', 'Bạn cần có sự cho phép thích hợp để truy cập các tệp này.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must obtain written authorization before requesting reimbursement for travel expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải có sự cho phép bằng văn bản trước khi yêu cầu hoàn trả chi phí đi lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-ljspeech-2abb6437.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-cori-2abb6437.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/authorization-2589bdae.webp', '[\"permission\", \"approval\", \"consent\", \"clearance\"]', '[\"prohibition\", \"denial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"written authorization\", \"meaning\": \"sự cho phép/ủy quyền bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prior authorization\", \"meaning\": \"sự cho phép/cấp phép trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"authority\", \"note_vi\": \"authorization là sự chấp thuận/cấp phép, còn authority là tư cách thẩm quyền/quyền hạn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"authorize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"authority\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-cori-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru0-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru5-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru6-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru10-2abb6437.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru9-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o