('20dae05d-57d8-581a-9f3c-06fee9ef55b3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'settle', '/ˈsetl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thiết lập nơi ở lâu dài; giải quyết một vấn đề.', 'to establish a home permanently or resolve a problem.', 'Many immigrants came to this country hoping to settle and build a new life.', 'Nhiều người nhập cư đến đất nước này với hy vọng định cư và xây dựng cuộc sống mới.', '{\"en\": \"We need to settle the payment dispute with the supplier today.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần giải quyết tranh chấp thanh toán với nhà cung cấp hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-ljspeech-d424af29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-cori-d424af29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/settle-b2b56afc.webp', '[\"resolve\", \"establish\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"settle a dispute\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết tranh chấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"settle down\", \"meaning\": \"ổn định cuộc sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"settle an account\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán tài khoản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"silver\", \"note_vi\": \"silver là bạc, khác settle giải quyết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"settlement\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"settler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-cori-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru0-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru5-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru6-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru10-d424af29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru9-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru3-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru7-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru8-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru2-d424af29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-ljspeech-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt408-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt138-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt624-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt396-d424af29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt498-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt132-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt288-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt42-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt90-d424af29.mp3\"]}}', 'Settle nghĩa giải quyết hoặc định cư, không nhầm với silver (bạc).', 'business', 1, 18),
('a5c16e7b-9dcd-5bc9-afce-9b809a9faa58', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'joy', '/dʒɔɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác hạnh phúc và vui sướng tột độ.', 'a feeling of great happiness and pleasure that you experience strongly.', 'The children jumped with joy when they saw the presents under the Christmas tree.', 'Bọn trẻ nhảy cẫng lên vì vui sướng khi nhìn thấy những món quà dưới cây thông Noel.', '{\"en\": \"The team expressed great joy after winning the annual sales competition.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã bày tỏ niềm vui lớn sau khi giành chiến thắng trong cuộc thi doanh số hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-ljspeech-c7d56fc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-cori-c7d56fc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/joy-044a8209.webp', '[\"happiness\", \"delight\", \"pleasure\"]', '[\"sorrow\", \"misery\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel joy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy niềm vui\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bring joy\", \"meaning\": \"mang lại niềm vui\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jump with joy\", \"meaning\": \"nhảy lên vì vui sướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enjoy\", \"note_vi\": \"enjoy là động từ \'tận hưởng\', joy là danh từ \'niềm vui\'\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"joyful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"joyfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"joyous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-cori-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru0-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru5-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru6-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru10-c7d56fc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru9-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru3-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru7-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru8-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-aru2-c7d56fc0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-ljspeech-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt408-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt138-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt624-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt396-c7d56fc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt498-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt132-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt288-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt42-c7d56fc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joy-lt90-c7d56fc0.mp3\"]}}', 'Joy là danh từ chỉ niềm vui mạnh mẽ, không dùng thay cho \'fun\' trong ngữ cảnh giải trí nhẹ nhàng.', 'daily', 1, 19),
('dbbff2c4-2b84-5639-a468-550a50ac5903', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'institution', '/ˌɪnstɪˈtjuːʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một tổ chức lớn như trường học, bệnh viện hoặc ngân hàng.', 'a large organization that provides a specific service to the public or a community.', 'This prominent financial institution provides loan services to small businesses nationwide.', 'Tổ chức tài chính nổi tiếng này cung cấp dịch vụ cho vay đối với các doanh nghiệp nhỏ trên toàn quốc.', '{\"en\": \"Our financial institution offers low interest rates for small business loans to new entrepreneurs.\", \"vi\": \"Tổ chức tài chính của chúng tôi cung cấp lãi suất thấp cho các khoản vay kinh doanh nhỏ cho doanh nhân mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-ljspeech-1adc83a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-cori-1adc83a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/institution-4d766614.webp', '[\"organization\", \"establishment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial institution\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"educational institution\", \"meaning\": \"cơ sở giáo dục\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"institutional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-cori-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru0-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru5-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru6-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru10-1adc83a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru9-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru3-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/institution-aru7-1adc83a3.mp3\", \"/stor