('d36fd9bf-a623-5023-a76c-8a9ffc99c1e2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '14ec40b5-c2a2-5f61-aa97-d5732e55cd9e', '4274b93b-d6ed-5607-802b-f0a20aa5e5e9', 'numerous', '/ˈnjuːmərəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất nhiều, nhiều về số lượng.', 'existing in a very large number of items or people.', 'There were numerous complaints about the new policy.', 'Có rất nhiều lời phàn nàn về chính sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"The applicant has received numerous job offers from several international companies this month.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên đã nhận được rất nhiều lời mời làm việc từ một số công ty quốc tế trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-ljspeech-4bca8a0e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-cori-4bca8a0e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/numerous-88e280c7.webp', '[\"many\", \"several\"]', '[\"few\", \"scarce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"numerous reasons\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều lý do\"}, {\"phrase\": \"numerous studies\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều nghiên cứu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"number\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-cori-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru0-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru5-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru6-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru10-4bca8a0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru9-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru3-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru7-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru8-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru2-4bca8a0e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-ljspeech-4bca8a