('26b4a0a0-0f17-5fdf-a651-ce1a3e3c0c64', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1723b56b-aecb-562b-8a2d-793b28e9be75', 'aea9797b-b55b-536f-aad0-6e0266ac3db2', 'level', '/ˈlevl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Mức, cấp độ hoặc trình độ.', 'a position on a scale of amount, quality, or importance in a specific area.', 'Her English speaking skills have reached an advanced level.', 'Kỹ năng nói tiếng Anh của cô ấy đã đạt đến trình độ cao cấp.', '{\"en\": \"The noise level in the office must be kept low to ensure staff productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Mức độ tiếng ồn trong văn phòng phải được giữ thấp để đảm bảo năng suất nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-ljspeech-ad60c535.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-cori-ad60c535.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/level-587cd790.webp', '[\"standard\", \"degree\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high level\", \"meaning\": \"cấp độ cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at all levels\", \"meaning\": \"ở mọi cấp độ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"leveling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-cori-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru0-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru5-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru6-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru10-ad60c535.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru9-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru3-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru7-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru8-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-aru2-ad60c535.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-ljspeech-ad60c535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/level-lt408-