('07811547-baa2-5dc1-89fb-563103326ef2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1723b56b-aecb-562b-8a2d-793b28e9be75', 'aea9797b-b55b-536f-aad0-6e0266ac3db2', 'advisable', 'UK: /ədˈvaɪzəbəl/ | US: /ədˈvaɪzəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nên làm, được khuyến nghị', 'sensible and recommended to be done in a particular situation.', 'It is advisable to book flights in advance.', 'Nên đặt vé máy bay trước.', '{\"en\": \"It is advisable to make hotel reservations well before peak travel season.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn nên đặt phòng khách sạn trước mùa du lịch cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-ljspeech-ebcd3ba3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-cori-ebcd3ba3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advisable-f86ea4a8.webp', '[\"recommended\", \"sensible\", \"prudent\", \"wise\"]', '[\"inadvisable\", \"unwise\", \"imprudent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"it is advisable to\", \"meaning\": \"được khuyến nghị nên...\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deem advisable\", \"meaning\": \"cho rằng là nên làm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"advised\", \"note_vi\": \"Advisable nghĩa là nên làm (dùng cho hành động); Advised là được tham vấn/cân nhắc kỹ (well-advised = khôn ngoan).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"advise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advice\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adviser\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-cori-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru0-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru5-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru6-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru10-ebcd3ba3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru9-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru3-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru7-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru8-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-aru2-ebcd3ba3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-ljspeech-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt408-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt138-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt624-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt396-ebcd3ba3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt498-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt132-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt288-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt42-ebcd3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advisable-lt90-ebcd3ba3.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cấu trúc lịch sự: \'It is advisable to do something\' (Nên làm việc gì đó).', 'travel', 1, 13),
('676d6f3b-36d7-5b79-90f7-29695f511812', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1723b56b-aecb-562b-8a2d-793b28e9be75', 'aea9797b-b55b-536f-aad0-6e0266ac3db2', 'advocate', 'UK: /ˈædvəˌkeɪt/ | US: /ˈædvəˌkeɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'ủng hộ', 'to publicly support or recommend a particular policy, cause, or action.', 'They advocate for environmental protection.', 'Họ ủng hộ việc bảo vệ môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"Many managers advocate implementing a flexible working schedule to boost employee morale.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều người quản lý ủng hộ việc áp dụng lịch làm việc linh hoạt để nâng cao tinh thần nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-ljspeech-3fb6871c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-cori-3fb6871c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advocate-08d45c2e.webp', '[\"support\", \"promote\", \"endorse\", \"champion\"]', '[\"oppose\", \"reject\", \"discourage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly advocate\", \"meaning\": \"mạnh mẽ ủng hộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"advocate policy changes\", \"meaning\": \"ủng hộ các thay đổi chính sách\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advocate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advocacy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-cori-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru0-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru5-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru6-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru10-3fb6871c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru9-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru3-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru7-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru8-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-aru2-3fb6871c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-ljspeech-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt408-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt138-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt624-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt396-3fb6871c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt498-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt132-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt288-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt42-3fb6871c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advocate-lt90-3fb6871c.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ advocate đi trực tiếp với tân ngữ danh từ hoặc V-ing (advocate doing sth), không cần thêm giới từ \'for\' ở đằng sau.', 'corporate policy', 1, 14),
('c2d50c47-1c14-50cd-a7cf-9d9fc905fa8c', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1723b56b-aecb-562b-8a2d-793b28e9be75', 'aea9797b-b55b-536f-aad0-6e0266ac3db2', 'imply', '/ɪmˈplaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hàm ý, nói bóng gió điều gì đó.', 'to suggest something in an indirect way without saying it clearly or directly.', 'The low sales figures imply that customers are dissatisfied with the recent price change.', 'Con số doanh số bán hàng thấp ngụ ý rằng khách hàng không hài lòng với thay đổi giá gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The director\'s comments seemed to imply that budget cuts would affect the marketing team.\", \"vi\": \"Bình luận của giám đốc dường như hàm ý rằng việc cắt giảm ngân sách sẽ ảnh hưởng đến nhóm marketing.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-ljspeech-8f6568c8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-cori-8f6568c8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imply-f5be27ef.webp', '[\"suggest\", \"hint\", \"indicate\"]', '[\"state\", \"declare\", \"assert\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"imply that\", \"meaning\": \"hàm ý rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem to imply\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ hàm ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly imply\", \"meaning\": \"hàm ý rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"infer\", \"note_vi\": \"infer là người nghe suy ra; imply là người nói gợi ý — hay bị nhầm lẫn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"implication\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"implied\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"implicit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-cori-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru0-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru5-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru6-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru10-8f6568c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru9-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o