('bd81690c-e4fe-56a3-a1f0-ea725026b8b3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1723b56b-aecb-562b-8a2d-793b28e9be75', 'aea9797b-b55b-536f-aad0-6e0266ac3db2', 'tough', '/tʌf/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khó thực hiện, đòi hỏi nhiều nỗ lực hoặc sức chịu đựng.', 'difficult to do or deal with, requiring a lot of physical or mental effort.', 'It was a tough decision, but we had to make it.', 'Đó là một quyết định khó khăn, nhưng chúng tôi buộc phải đưa ra.', '{\"en\": \"Negotiating the new contract with the suppliers was a tough process for the purchasing team.\", \"vi\": \"Việc đàm phán hợp đồng mới với các nhà cung cấp là một quá trình khó khăn đối với đội ngũ thu mua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-ljspeech-c1f0cd9e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-cori-c1f0cd9e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tough-fcba9b19.webp', '[\"difficult\", \"hard\", \"challenging\"]', '[\"easy\", \"simple\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tough decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tough competition\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh tranh gay gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tough time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian khó khăn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rough\", \"note_vi\": \"rough nghĩa là thô ráp, gồ ghề, dễ nhầm mặt chữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"toughness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"toughen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-cori-c1f0cd9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru0-c1f0cd9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru5-c1f0cd9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru6-c1f0cd9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru10-c1f0cd9e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru9-c1f0cd9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru3-c1f0cd9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tough-aru