('899ff300-0e9c-5815-964b-30d6a766a3b9', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'relief', '/rɪˈliːf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác nhẹ nhõm, bớt lo lắng hoặc đau đớn.', 'a feeling of comfort when something painful or worrying has ended.', 'It was a great relief to know that everyone was safe after the accident.', 'Thật là một sự nhẹ nhõm lớn khi biết rằng mọi người đều an toàn sau vụ tai nạn.', '{\"en\": \"It was a relief to hear that the delayed shipment finally arrived.\", \"vi\": \"Thật nhẹ nhõm khi nghe tin lô hàng bị trễ cuối cùng đã đến nơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-ljspeech-60cba265.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-cori-60cba265.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relief-fb7b1e7d.webp', '[\"comfort\", \"ease\", \"solace\"]', '[\"anxiety\", \"distress\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sigh of relief\", \"meaning\": \"thở phào nhẹ nhõm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bring relief\", \"meaning\": \"mang lại sự nhẹ nhõm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"belief\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là niềm tin, đức tin\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"relieve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-cori-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru0-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru5-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru6-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru10-60cba265.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru9-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru3-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru7-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru8-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru2-60cba265.mp3\"]}, \"us\