('f5321bf8-94b0-5315-b5af-f0ef27ef0ffe', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'enhance', '/ɪnˈhɑːns/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cải thiện, làm tăng chất lượng hoặc giá trị.', 'to make the quality, value, or effectiveness of something better than it was before.', 'This new software aims to enhance productivity in the workplace.', 'Phần mềm mới này nhằm mục đích nâng cao năng suất tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"The company plans to enhance its customer service by providing extra training for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dự định cải thiện dịch vụ khách hàng bằng cách đào tạo thêm cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-ljspeech-3f96894f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-cori-3f96894f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enhance-ff3a411b.webp', '[\"improve\", \"boost\"]', '[\"worsen\", \"diminish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enhance productivity\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao năng suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enhance performance\", \"meaning\": \"cải thiện hiệu suất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enhancement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-cori-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru0-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru5-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru6-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru10-3f96894f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru9-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru3-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru7-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru8-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru2-3f96894f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu