('5e640eff-7b54-5230-a4d2-f648096d6961', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'commission', '/kəˈmɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người được chính thức giao nhiệm vụ cụ thể.', 'a group of people officially chosen to find out about something or make decisions.', 'The special commission was formed to investigate the accident.', 'Ủy ban đặc biệt được thành lập để điều tra vụ tai nạn.', '{\"en\": \"The government appointed a special commission to investigate the safety of the new factory.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã bổ nhiệm một ủy ban đặc biệt để điều tra mức độ an toàn của nhà máy mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-ljspeech-f138cedf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-cori-f138cedf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commission-a4810738.webp', '[\"committee\", \"board\", \"delegation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"independent commission\", \"meaning\": \"ủy ban độc lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"joint commission\", \"meaning\": \"ủy ban liên hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"committee\", \"note_vi\": \"committee thường là ủy ban thường trực, commission thường được lập cho nhiệm vụ cụ thể.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commission\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commissioner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-cori-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru0-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru5-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru6-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru10-f138cedf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru9-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru3-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru7-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru8-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru2-f138cedf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-ljspeech-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt408-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt138-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt624-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt396-f138cedf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt498-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt132-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt288-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt42-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt90-f138cedf.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này còn có nghĩa phổ biến khác trong TOEIC là \'tiền hoa hồng\' khi bán hàng.', 'law', 1, 17),
('407a4ec4-7521-5540-8433-5fd71a2127e0', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'pregnant', '/ˈprɛɡnənt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Mang thai, có em bé trong bụng.', 'having an unborn baby growing inside the body of a female.', 'The company offers extended parental leave policies for pregnant employees.', 'Công ty cung cấp chính sách nghỉ thai sản kéo dài cho các nhân viên đang mang thai.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources manager explained the maternity leave benefits for pregnant workers.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng nhân sự đã giải thích các quyền lợi nghỉ thai sản cho nhân viên nữ đang mang thai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-ljspeech-cc5d56ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-cori-cc5d56ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pregnant-2f599f29.webp', '[\"expecting\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pregnant woman\", \"meaning\": \"phụ nữ mang thai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become pregnant\", \"meaning\": \"thụ thai / có thai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pregnancy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-cori-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru0-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru5-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru6-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru10-cc5d56ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru9-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru3-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru7-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru8-cc5d56ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pregnant-aru2-cc5d56ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/p