('4d2a27fd-e085-5a1e-bb2b-e956a56930c3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'actively', 'UK: /ˈæk.tɪv.li/ | US: /ˈæk.tɪv.li/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách tích cực', 'in a dynamic way that involves enthusiastic participation and direct effort', 'The team members actively participated in the training session.', 'Các thành viên trong nhóm đã tích cực tham gia vào buổi tập huấn.', '{\"en\": \"Our headhunting department is actively recruiting qualified software engineers for the new office.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận săn nhân tài của chúng tôi đang tích cực tuyển dụng các kỹ sư phần mềm đủ năng lực cho văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-ljspeech-bfbb15f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-cori-bfbb15f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/actively-893d7337.webp', '[\"energetically\", \"enthusiastically\", \"vigorously\"]', '[\"passively\", \"inactively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"actively seek\", \"meaning\": \"tích cực tìm kiếm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"actively participate\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia tích cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"active\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"activity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-cori-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru0-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru5-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru6-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru10-bfbb15f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru9-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru3-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru7-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru8-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru2-bfbb15f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-ljspeech-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt408-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt138-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt624-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt396-bfbb15f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt498-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt132-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt288-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt42-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt90-bfbb15f2.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay bổ nghĩa cho các động từ hành động như seek, recruit, participate, engage.', 'human resources', 1, 20),
('c788d5f3-d3a0-5018-835e-98dd0be402ff', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'virtual', '/ˈvɜːtʃuəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gần như hoặc mô phỏng bằng máy tính, không có thật về mặt vật lý.', 'created by computer technology and appearing to exist but not in reality.', 'Many companies now hold virtual meetings instead of in-person ones.', 'Nhiều công ty hiện tổ chức các cuộc họp ảo thay vì trực tiếp.', '{\"en\": \"Our team uses virtual software to collaborate on projects from different countries.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm của chúng tôi sử dụng phần mềm ảo để hợp tác dự án từ các quốc gia khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-ljspeech-af84d91f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-cori-af84d91f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/virtual-709b7213.webp', '[\"simulated\", \"digital\", \"online\"]', '[\"physical\", \"real\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"virtual assistant\", \"meaning\": \"trợ lý ảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"virtual reality\", \"meaning\": \"thực tế ảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"virtuous\", \"note_vi\": \"virtuous là có đạo đức, virtual là ảo\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"virtually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-cori-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru0-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru5-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru6-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru10-af84d91f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru9-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru3-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru7-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-aru8-af84d91f.mp3\", \"/storage/v