('7acc5c3e-e936-506d-a852-6c23f0f57eba', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'attribute', 'UK: /əˈtrɪbjuːt/ | US: /əˈtrɪbjuːt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'quy cho, cho là do', 'to regard something as being caused by or belonging to a specific person or factor.', 'The success of the project was attributed to the team\'s hard work.', 'Thành công của dự án được quy cho sự làm việc chăm chỉ của đội.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO attributes the strong quarterly profits to the dedication of the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc quy lợi nhuận quý tăng trưởng mạnh là nhờ sự nỗ lực của đội ngũ kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-ljspeech-2c317cd0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-cori-2c317cd0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attribute-ba975221.webp', '[\"ascribe\", \"credit\", \"assign\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"attribute A to B\", \"meaning\": \"quy A là do/nhờ B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attribute success to\", \"meaning\": \"quy thành công cho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contribute\", \"note_vi\": \"contribute to nghĩa là đóng góp vào, khác với attribute A to B là quy A cho B\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attribution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-cori-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru0-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru5-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru6-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru10-2c317cd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru9-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru3-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru7-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru8-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru2-2c317cd0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-ljspeech-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt408-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt138-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt624-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt396-2c317cd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt498-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt132-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt288-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt42-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt90-2c317cd0.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn nhớ cấu trúc \'attribute A to B\' (cho rằng A là nhờ/do B). Đừng nhầm với danh từ \'attribute\' /ˈæt.rɪ.bjuːt/ có nghĩa là đặc tính/thuộc tính.', 'management', 1, 28),
('e5635dc0-2f0e-59fe-af9d-8032463a5c74', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '184bf2d8-ab38-5bba-a223-eb2d8e237de7', '2bbe22b5-f58d-5f48-a882-e72836361da4', 'zone', '/zəʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một vùng hoặc khu vực cụ thể.', 'a specific area that is different from others because of its own rules or features.', 'This area is a no-parking zone, so you can\'t leave your car here.', 'Khu vực này là vùng cấm đỗ xe, vì vậy bạn không thể để xe ở đây.', '{\"en\": \"Visitors must park their vehicles only in the designated zone near the main entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Khách tham quan chỉ được đỗ xe trong khu vực được chỉ định gần lối vào chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-ljspeech-b6931b00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-cori-b6931b00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/zone-44164f0a.webp', '[\"area\", \"region\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"industrial zone\", \"meaning\": \"khu công nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"time zone\", \"meaning\": \"múi giờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-cori-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru0-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru5-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru6-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru10-b6931b00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru9-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru3-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru7-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru8-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-aru2-b6931b00.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-ljspeech-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zone-lt408-b6931b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/