('fa9180be-8623-586e-aa6b-acb6c340cd96', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'impose', '/ɪmˈpəʊz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Buộc ai đó chấp nhận hoặc tuân thủ một quy tắc, thuế, hoặc hình phạt.', 'to force someone to accept a rule, tax, or punishment.', 'The city council decided to impose a new tax on luxury goods.', 'Hội đồng thành phố đã quyết định áp đặt một loại thuế mới đối với hàng hóa xa xỉ.', '{\"en\": \"The government will impose new regulations on companies to reduce carbon emissions.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ sẽ áp đặt các quy định mới lên các công ty để giảm lượng khí thải carbon.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-ljspeech-e6f9382d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-cori-e6f9382d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impose-bb6519a2.webp', '[\"enforce\", \"inflict\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"impose a tax\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt thuế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impose restrictions\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt hạn chế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"imposition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-cori-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru0-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru5-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru6-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru10-e6f9382d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru9-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru3-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru7-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru8-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru2-e6f9382d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-ljspeech-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt408-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt138-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt624-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt396-e6f9382d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt498-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt132-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt288-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt42-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt90-e6f9382d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực hoặc bắt buộc.', 'law', 1, 9),
('3b948d26-23a4-5bae-9e83-f5481f21b0ac', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'core', '/kɔː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phần trung tâm hoặc quan trọng nhất của một vật hay vấn đề.', 'the most important or central part of something, such as a problem or system.', 'The core of the problem was a lack of communication between the teams.', 'Cốt lõi của vấn đề là thiếu giao tiếp giữa các đội.', '{\"en\": \"Customer service is at the core of our business strategy to retain clients.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ khách hàng là cốt lõi trong chiến lược kinh doanh của chúng tôi để giữ chân khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-ljspeech-94a0426e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-cori-94a0426e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/core-5d355be5.webp', '[\"center\", \"heart\", \"essence\"]', '[\"periphery\", \"exterior\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"core business\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động kinh doanh cốt lõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"core value\", \"meaning\": \"giá trị cốt lõi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"corps\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm giống hệt nhưng nghĩa là quân đoàn hoặc nhóm người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"core\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-cori-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru0-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru5-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru6-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru10-94a0426e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru9-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru3-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru7-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru8-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun