('82f080b4-a511-5c6e-b079-8c12b701c0ac', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'accurate', '/ˈæk.jʊ.rət/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đúng, không có lỗi lầm hoặc sai sót.', 'completely correct and without any mistakes or errors.', 'The weather forecast was surprisingly accurate today.', 'Dự báo thời tiết hôm nay chính xác đến bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"Please make sure all figures in the financial report are accurate before submission.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo tất cả các con số trong báo cáo tài chính đều chính xác trước khi nộp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-ljspeech-72c8f75b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-cori-72c8f75b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accurate-344f9fe3.webp', '[\"correct\", \"precise\", \"exact\"]', '[\"inaccurate\", \"incorrect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accurate information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accurate data\", \"meaning\": \"dữ liệu chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly accurate\", \"meaning\": \"rất chính xác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"precise\", \"note_vi\": \"\\\"precise\\\" nhấn mạnh sự tỉ mỉ, chi tiết; \\\"accurate\\\" nhấn mạnh sự đúng đắn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accuracy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"accurately\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inaccurate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-cori-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru0-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru5-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru6-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru10-72c8f75b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru9-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru3-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru7-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru8-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru2-72c8f75b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-ljspeech-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt408-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt138-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt624-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt396-72c8f75b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt498-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt132-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt288-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt42-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt90-72c8f75b.mp3\"]}}', '\"Accurate\" nhấn mạnh không có sai sót; \"precise\" nhấn mạnh mức độ chi tiết, tỉ mỉ.', 'office', 1, 22),
('e7759ea1-df92-5f9b-93ec-a4bd8734b55c', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'govern', '/ˈɡʌvən/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Điều hành, quản lý một đất nước, khu vực hoặc tổ chức.', 'to be in charge of a country or organization and make decisions for its people.', 'The new president promises to govern fairly and effectively for all citizens.', 'Tổng thống mới hứa sẽ cai trị một cách công bằng và hiệu quả cho tất cả người dân.', '{\"en\": \"The new board of directors will govern the company with a focus on sustainable growth.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị mới sẽ điều hành công ty với trọng tâm là tăng trưởng bền vững.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-ljspeech-a4880e87.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-cori-a4880e87.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/govern-163796f4.webp', '[\"manage\", \"control\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"govern a country\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý một quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"effectively govern\", \"meaning\": \"điều hành hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"government\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-cori-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru0-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru5-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru6-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru10-a4880e87.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru9-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru3-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru7-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru8-a4880e87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/govern-aru2-a4880e87.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag