('585ef96f-b850-5b68-8698-cf5168a43062', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'reach', '/riːtʃ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đạt tới, vươn tới một điểm hoặc mục tiêu.', 'to arrive at a place or achieve a specific goal after a long process.', 'She worked hard to reach her goals and achieve success.', 'Cô ấy đã làm việc chăm chỉ để đạt được mục tiêu và thành công.', '{\"en\": \"We hope to reach an agreement on the budget proposal by the end of this week.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi hy vọng sẽ đạt được thỏa thuận về đề xuất ngân sách vào cuối tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-ljspeech-baff1506.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-cori-baff1506.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reach-af0c2b70.webp', '[\"achieve\", \"attain\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reach a goal\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reach an agreement\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được thỏa thuận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-cori-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru0-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru5-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru6-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru10-baff1506.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru9-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru3-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru7-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru8-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-aru2-baff1506.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-ljspeech-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt408-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt138-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt624-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt396-baff1506.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt498-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt132-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt288-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt42-baff1506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reach-lt90-baff1506.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh đàm phán (reach an agreement).', 'business', 1, 24),
('1672413c-15e0-50a9-9cfc-ae8fb8a58909', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'interrupt', '/ˌɪntəˈrʌpt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Làm gián đoạn ai đó khi họ đang nói hoặc làm gì đó.', 'to temporarily disrupt a speaker or ongoing activity by unexpectedly inserting a remark or action.', 'Noise from nearby construction continuously interrupted our annual strategy meeting this morning.', 'Tiếng ồn từ công trình xây dựng lân cận liên tục làm gián đoạn cuộc họp chiến lược hàng năm của chúng tôi sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not interrupt the manager while she is presenting the quarterly sales report.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng không ngắt lời giám đốc khi cô ấy đang trình bày báo cáo doanh thu quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-ljspeech-691911bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-cori-691911bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interrupt-45dc24e9.webp', '[\"disrupt\", \"disturb\", \"hinder\"]', '[\"continue\", \"resume\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"interrupt a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"làm gián đoạn cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constantly interrupt\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục ngắt lời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disrupt\", \"note_vi\": \"disrupt gây xáo trộn, ngắt quãng mạnh hơn interrupt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interruption\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"uninterrupted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-cori-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru0-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru5-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru6-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru10-691911bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru9-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru3-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru7-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru8-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-aru2-691911bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-ljspeech-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt408-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt138-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt624-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt396-691911bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt498-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt132-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt288-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt42-691911bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interrupt-lt90-691911bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'disrupt\' mang nghĩa phá vỡ hoặc gây hỗn loạn.', 'office', 1, 25),
('69c66036-07a2-5f0b-8c44-373b6c9ff632', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'aside from', 'UK: /əˈsaɪd frəm/ | US: /əˈsaɪd frʌm/', 'B2', 'preposition', 'ngoài... ra', 'in addition to something or someone, or except for a specific detail mentioned', 'Aside from the renovation, the office is ready.', 'Ngoài việc cải tạo, văn phòng đã sẵn sàng.', '{\"en\": \"Aside from a few minor typos, the quarterly financial report was perfectly formatted.\", \"vi\": \"Ngoại trừ một vài lỗi chính tả nhỏ, báo cáo tài chính hàng quý đã được trình bày hoàn hảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-ljspeech-9da8cce4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-cori-9da8cce4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aside-from-9bb06c27.webp', '[\"apart from\", \"besides\", \"except for\", \"other than\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"aside from the fact that\", \"meaning\": \"ngoại trừ thực tế là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aside from this\", \"meaning\": \"ngoài điều này ra\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-cori-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru0-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru5-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru6-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru10-9da8cce4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru9-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru3-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru7-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru8-9da8cce4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aside-from-aru2-9da8cce4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/