('231e90c9-469f-5924-873c-30741a329f4d', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'propose', '/prəˈpəʊz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đưa ra một ý kiến, kế hoạch để xem xét.', 'to put forward an idea or plan for consideration.', 'The committee will propose a new solution to the problem next week.', 'Ủy ban sẽ đề xuất một giải pháp mới cho vấn đề vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"Our team will propose a marketing strategy to the clients tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ của chúng tôi sẽ đề xuất một chiến lược marketing với khách hàng vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-ljspeech-5fc6bd93.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-cori-5fc6bd93.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/propose-ee59c299.webp', '[\"suggest\", \"recommend\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"propose a plan\", \"meaning\": \"đề xuất kế hoạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"propose a solution\", \"meaning\": \"đề xuất giải pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"propose marriage\", \"meaning\": \"cầu hôn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"purpose\", \"note_vi\": \"purpose là mục đích, khác propose đề xuất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"proposal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"proposition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-cori-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru0-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru5-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru6-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru10-5fc6bd93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru9-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru3-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru7-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru8-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-aru2-5fc6bd93.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-ljspeech-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt408-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt138-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt624-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt396-5fc6bd93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt498-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt132-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt288-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt42-5fc6bd93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/propose-lt90-5fc6bd93.mp3\"]}}', 'Propose (đề xuất) dễ nhầm với purpose (mục đích) do gần giống chữ.', 'business', 1, 27),
('793a3a29-291a-57ef-9804-030dd6c80f0b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '1e69ec11-b9c9-570a-a4b8-9dca396c0350', '61d6e4bb-3676-5acb-8e19-2701e048a616', 'assessment', '/əˈsesmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự đánh giá, nhận định về giá trị hoặc chất lượng của cái gì đó.', 'the process of considering all the information about a situation or a person and making a judgment.', 'Our team conducted a thorough safety assessment before launching the new product.', 'Nhóm của chúng tôi đã tiến hành đánh giá an toàn toàn diện trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department conducts a performance assessment for all employees at the end of the year.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự tiến hành đánh giá hiệu suất cho tất cả nhân viên vào cuối năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-ljspeech-1de9d55f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-cori-1de9d55f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assessment-56a79193.webp', '[\"evaluation\", \"appraisal\", \"judgment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"performance assessment\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá hiệu suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"risk assessment\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conduct an assessment\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành đánh giá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"access\", \"note_vi\": \"access là truy cập, assessment là sự đánh giá.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assess\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assessor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-cori-1de9d55f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-aru0-1de9d55f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-aru5-1de9d55f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-aru6-1de9d55f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-aru10-1de9d55f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assessment-aru9-1de9d55f.mp3\