('922b44a4-53a7-58f5-bf48-06185d51ad0f', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'feather', '/ˈfɛðə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lớp phủ mềm mại trên cơ thể chim.', 'one of the soft light things that cover the body of a bird.', 'The bird had a beautiful blue feather.', 'Con chim có một chiếc lông vũ màu xanh tuyệt đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provides soft pillows filled with natural duck feather for guest comfort.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp gối mềm nhồi lông vịt tự nhiên để mang lại sự thoải mái cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-ljspeech-85f15bc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-cori-85f15bc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feather-c80e7bda.webp', '[\"plume\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"feather pillow\", \"meaning\": \"gối lông vũ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"light as a feather\", \"meaning\": \"nhẹ như lông hồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"further\", \"note_vi\": \"further khác cả về cách phát âm và nghĩa so với feather.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feathery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-cori-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru0-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru5-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru6-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru10-85f15bc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru9-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru3-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru7-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru8-85f15bc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feather-aru2-85f15bc5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu