('17b0c71e-8382-51d1-bd04-acd6ea0c449a', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'considerable', 'UK: /kənˈsɪdərəbl/ | US: /kənˈsɪdərəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đáng kể, to lớn', 'Great in amount, size, value, or importance, and worthy of notice.', 'The project requires a considerable amount of funding to succeed.', 'Dự án này đòi hỏi một khoản tài trợ đáng kể để thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The company made a considerable investment in renewable energy research this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thực hiện một khoản đầu tư đáng kể vào nghiên cứu năng lượng tái tạo trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-ljspeech-72cb60c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-cori-72cb60c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/considerable-473e633a.webp', '[\"significant\", \"substantial\", \"sizable\", \"great\"]', '[\"insignificant\", \"slight\", \"negligible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"considerable amount\", \"meaning\": \"một lượng đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"considerable effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực to lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"considerate\", \"note_vi\": \"ân cần, chu đáo đối với người khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"considerably\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consideration\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consider\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-cori-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru0-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru5-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru6-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru10-72cb60c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru9-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru3-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru7-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru8-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru2-72cb60c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-ljspeech-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt408-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt138-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt624-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt396-72cb60c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt498-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt132-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt288-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt42-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt90-72cb60c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'considerate\' (chu đáo). \'Considerable\' thể hiện mức độ/số lượng lớn lao.', 'finance', 1, 18),
('6d184957-0a42-5ea5-bc87-56a82d3aab90', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'inform', '/ɪnˈfɔːm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cung cấp thông tin cho ai đó.', 'to tell someone about particular facts or details in an official way.', 'The human resources manager will inform successful candidates by phone tomorrow morning.', 'Trưởng phòng nhân sự sẽ thông báo cho những ứng viên trúng tuyển qua điện thoại vào sáng mai.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will inform all staff members about the updated vacation policy tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ thông báo cho tất cả nhân viên về chính sách nghỉ phép cập nhật vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-ljspeech-c44cec63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-cori-c44cec63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inform-39a402bd.webp', '[\"notify\", \"advise\", \"tell\"]', '[\"conceal\", \"hide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inform someone of something\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo cho ai về việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep someone informed\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục cập nhật thông tin cho ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"announce\", \"note_vi\": \"inform + người (inform me), announce + sự việc (announce the news).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"information\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"informative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-cori-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru0-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru5-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru6-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru10-c44cec63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru9-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru3-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru7-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru8-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru2-c44cec63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-ljspeech-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt408-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt138-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt624-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt396-c44cec63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt498-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt132-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt288-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt42-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt90-c44cec63.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc quan trọng: inform somebody OF/ABOUT something.', 'office', 1, 19),
('fc903ee2-d28e-56dd-9605-fcfa8bcd4471', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'conscious', '/ˈkɒnʃəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nhận thức được, biết rõ về điều gì đó.', 'noticing or realizing that something is happening or exists around you at a certain time.', 'She is very conscious of her appearance when going out.', 'Cô ấy rất có ý thức về ngoại hình của mình khi ra ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The management team is conscious of the need to reduce waste in our manufacturing process.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ quản lý nhận thức được nhu cầu giảm thiểu lãng phí trong quy trình sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-ljspeech-eeb6ad95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-cori-eeb6ad95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conscious-48102c58.webp', '[\"aware\", \"mindful\"]', '[\"unconscious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conscious of\", \"meaning\": \"nhận thức được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost-conscious\", \"meaning\": \"ý thức về chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conscience\", \"note_vi\": \"conscience là lương tâm, conscious là nhận thức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consciousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-cori-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru0-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru5-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru6-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru10-eeb6ad95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru9-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru3-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru7-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru8-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-aru2-eeb6ad95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-ljspeech-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt408-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt138-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt624-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt396-eeb6ad95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt498-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt132-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt288-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt42-eeb6ad95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conscious-lt90-eeb6ad95.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ sự hiểu biết hoặc nhận thức về một vấn đề.', 'business', 1, 20),
('6cee611f-71ac-5840-b810-f2de1fb8dabd', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'spiritual', '/ˈspɪrɪtʃuəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến linh hồn, tinh thần hoặc tôn giáo, không phải vật chất.', 'relating to deep feelings and religious beliefs rather than physical or material things.', 'Many people find peace through spiritual practices like meditation and prayer.', 'Nhiều người tìm thấy sự bình yên thông qua các thực hành tâm linh như thiền và cầu nguyện.', '{\"en\": \"The retreat center offers quiet spaces for employees seeking spiritual peace and stress relief.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm nghỉ dưỡng cung cấp những không gian yên tĩnh cho nhân viên tìm kiếm sự bình yên trong tâm hồn và giảm căng thẳng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-ljspeech-5b742e15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-cori-5b742e15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spiritual-b7a8af4b.webp', '[\"sacred\", \"holy\", \"immaterial\"]', '[\"physical\", \"material\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spiritual life\", \"meaning\": \"đời sống tâm linh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spiritual values\", \"meaning\": \"các giá trị tinh thần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spirited\", \"note_vi\": \"Spirited nghĩa là hăng hái, sôi nổi, khác với spiritual thuộc về tâm linh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spirit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"spiritually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-cori-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru0-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru5-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru6-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru10-5b742e15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru9-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru3-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru7-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru8-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-aru2-5b742e15.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-ljspeech-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt408-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt138-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt624-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt396-5b742e15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt498-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt132-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt288-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt42-5b742e15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiritual-lt90-5b742e15.mp3\"]}}', 'Spiritual trái nghĩa với material (vật chất) hoặc physical (thể xác).', 'daily', 1, 21),
('a9db36df-d820-5d6a-8418-ad7dcb9c8ffb', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'permanent', '/ˈpɜːmənənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Kéo dài mãi mãi hoặc trong một thời gian rất dài, không thay đổi.', 'lasting for a long time or forever without changing in state or condition.', 'He decided to get a permanent tattoo on his arm.', 'Anh ấy quyết định xăm một hình xăm vĩnh viễn trên cánh tay.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to offer her a permanent position after her successful internship.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định mời cô ấy vào vị trí chính thức sau kỳ thực tập thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-ljspeech-8699f2b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-cori-8699f2b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/permanent-3229a5da.webp', '[\"lasting\", \"enduring\", \"perpetual\"]', '[\"temporary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"permanent staff\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên chính thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"permanent address\", \"meaning\": \"địa chỉ thường trú\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prominent\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nghĩa: prominent nghĩa là nổi bật, quan trọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"permanently\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"permanence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-cori-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru0-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru5-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru6-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru10-8699f2b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru9-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru3-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permanent-aru7-8699f2b0.mp3\", \"/sto