('ca1346bc-7974-5098-be24-87a5c8041cf6', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'mysterious', '/mɪˈstɪə.ri.əs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khó hiểu, lạ lùng, hoặc có điều gì đó chưa được giải thích.', 'strange, unknown, or difficult to understand and explain clearly to others.', 'The old castle is known for its mysterious legends and secret passages.', 'Lâu đài cổ nổi tiếng với những truyền thuyết bí ẩn và lối đi bí mật.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department fixed the mysterious software glitch before the system crashed.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận CNTT đã sửa sự cố phần mềm bí ẩn trước khi hệ thống bị sập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-ljspeech-3b41c7ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-cori-3b41c7ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mysterious-9599be21.webp', '[\"puzzling\", \"secretive\"]', '[\"clear\", \"obvious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mysterious circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn cảnh bí ẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mysterious visitor\", \"meaning\": \"vị khách bí ẩn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mystery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"mysteriously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-cori-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru0-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru5-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru6-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru10-3b41c7ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru9-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru3-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru7-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru8-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-aru2-3b41c7ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-ljspeech-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt408-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt138-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt624-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt396-3b41c7ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt498-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt132-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt288-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt42-3b41c7ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mysterious-lt90-3b41c7ae.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng danh từ là mystery (bí ẩn), chú ý đuôi -ous biến nó thành tính từ.', 'technology', 1, 24),
('7264675b-0567-54b6-a617-0c39373d96af', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'cry', '/kraɪ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Chảy nước mắt do cảm xúc mạnh mẽ như buồn bã hoặc đau đớn.', 'to produce tears from your eyes because you are unhappy, hurt, or feeling strong emotions.', 'The baby started to cry loudly when she felt hungry.', 'Em bé bắt đầu khóc to khi cảm thấy đói.', '{\"en\": \"The customer started to cry when she realized her lost wallet contained all her important documents.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng bắt đầu khóc khi nhận ra chiếc ví bị mất chứa tất cả giấy tờ quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-ljspeech-a05d478d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-cori-a05d478d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cry-ef1d28f6.webp', '[\"weep\", \"sob\"]', '[\"laugh\", \"smile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cry for help\", \"meaning\": \"kêu cứu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cry over\", \"meaning\": \"khóc vì chuyện gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-cori-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru0-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru5-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru6-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru10-a05d478d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru9-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru3-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru7-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru8-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru2-a05d478d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-ljspeech-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia