('daf8e67e-01b1-52d1-bd20-581c02a7ce8b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'crisis', '/ˈkraɪsɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một giai đoạn khó khăn hoặc nguy hiểm nghiêm trọng.', 'a time of great disagreement, confusion, or suffering that is very dangerous.', 'The country is facing an economic crisis due to high inflation.', 'Đất nước đang đối mặt với một cuộc khủng hoảng kinh tế do lạm phát cao.', '{\"en\": \"The PR team handled the public relations crisis quickly to protect the brand.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ PR đã xử lý cuộc khủng hoảng quan hệ công chúng nhanh chóng để bảo vệ thương hiệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-ljspeech-58076e41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-cori-58076e41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crisis-5614d56e.webp', '[\"emergency\", \"catastrophe\", \"disaster\"]', '[\"stability\", \"peace\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"financial crisis\", \"meaning\": \"khủng hoảng tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manage a crisis\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý khủng hoảng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"critical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-cori-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru0-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru5-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru6-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru10-58076e41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru9-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru3-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru7-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru8-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-aru2-58076e41.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-ljspeech-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt408-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt138-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt624-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt396-58076e41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt498-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt132-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt288-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt42-58076e41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crisis-lt90-58076e41.mp3\"]}}', 'Số nhiều của \'crisis\' là \'crises\' (phát âm đuôi là /siːz/).', 'business', 1, 26),
('4b41dc9a-35cc-5f55-868c-f9106d59a3bb', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'acquisition', 'UK: /ˌækwɪˈzɪʃən/ | US: /ˌækwɪˈzɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự mua lại, thâu tóm', 'the act of obtaining or buying something, especially by a business', 'The company announced its acquisition of a smaller competitor.', 'Công ty đã công bố việc mua lại một đối thủ cạnh tranh nhỏ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The recent acquisition of the rival firm will help boost our market share by fifteen percent.\", \"vi\": \"Thương vụ thâu tóm công ty đối thủ gần đây sẽ giúp tăng phần thị phần của chúng tôi thêm 15%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-ljspeech-e6520fc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-cori-e6520fc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acquisition-efdeb066.webp', '[\"takeover\", \"purchase\", \"procurement\"]', '[\"divestment\", \"sale\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mergers and acquisitions\", \"meaning\": \"sáp nhập và thâu tóm doanh nghiệp (M&A)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recent acquisition\", \"meaning\": \"thương vụ mua lại gần đây\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"acquire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-cori-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru0-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru5-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru6-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru10-e6520fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru9-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru3-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru7-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru8-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru2-e6520fc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-ljspeech-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt408-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt138-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt624-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt396-e6520fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt498-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt132-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt288-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt42-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt90-e6520fc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong thuật ngữ tài chính - kinh doanh \'Mergers and Acquisitions\' (M&A - Sáp nhập và Thâu tóm).', 'finance', 1, 27),
('abb975e6-4677-5c6e-8e7e-d901426a785c', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'priority', '/praɪˈɒrəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Điều quan trọng nhất cần được giải quyết trước.', 'the state of being more important than other things and needing to be done first.', 'Safety is always our top priority when planning an event.', 'An toàn luôn là ưu tiên hàng đầu của chúng tôi khi lên kế hoạch cho một sự kiện.', '{\"en\": \"Our primary priority this month is to increase customer satisfaction ratings across all service departments.\", \"vi\": \"Ưu tiên hàng đầu của chúng tôi tháng này là tăng xếp hạng hài lòng của khách hàng ở tất cả các bộ phận dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-ljspeech-3345867e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-cori-3345867e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/priority-5885231a.webp', '[\"preference\", \"importance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"top priority\", \"meaning\": \"ưu tiên hàng đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set a priority\", \"meaning\": \"đặt ra sự ưu tiên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prioritize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-cori-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru0-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru5-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru6-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru10-3345867e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru9-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru3-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru7-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority-aru8-3345867e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/priority