('733e0e82-75e2-57df-bf6d-473e583fdbc3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '2631a443-911f-5e2f-a5b0-f4d909bae267', '5cf0ed39-b670-5188-b533-0bbc678dbac5', 'blind', '/blaɪnd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không nhìn thấy được.', 'unable to see because of injury, disease, or a natural condition.', 'The old man has been blind since birth.', 'Ông cụ bị mù từ khi mới sinh.', '{\"en\": \"The company is testing a blind recruitment process to reduce bias during hiring.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang thử nghiệm quy trình tuyển dụng ẩn danh để giảm định kiến khi tuyển dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-ljspeech-7afb6295.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-cori-7afb6295.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blind-2d6b5fd6.webp', '[\"sightless\", \"unseeing\"]', '[\"sighted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"blind audition\", \"meaning\": \"thử giọng ẩn danh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blind spot\", \"meaning\": \"điểm mù\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"blindness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"blindly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-cori-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru0-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru5-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru6-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru10-7afb6295.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru9-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru3-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru7-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru8-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-aru2-7afb6295.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-ljspeech-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt408-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt138-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt624-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt396-7afb6295.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt498-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt132-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt288-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt42-7afb6295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-lt90-7afb6295.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, \'blind\' thường dùng nghĩa bóng là ẩn danh (ví dụ: blind test).', 'hr', 1, 29),
('c483ebba-7f6a-5d92-94c7-ea8f8d538d57', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '29a16727-6985-5e12-b9c6-9214a00e76fd', 'cb8ffb00-e340-592d-86d2-ad82dd15521b', 'threat', '/θret/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một lời cảnh báo về ý định gây hại; mối nguy hiểm.', 'a statement or situation that suggests someone will experience pain or something unpleasant very soon.', 'Climate change poses a serious threat to our planet.', 'Biến đổi khí hậu đặt ra một mối đe dọa nghiêm trọng cho hành tinh của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in market demand poses a major threat to our company\'s annual profit.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm đột ngột trong nhu cầu thị trường gây ra mối đe dọa lớn cho lợi nhuận hàng năm của công ty chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-ljspeech-4e71a7b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-cori-4e71a7b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/threat-33fdf4cf.webp', '[\"danger\", \"risk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pose a threat\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra mối đe dọa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serious threat\", \"meaning\": \"mối đe dọa nghiêm trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"threatening\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-cori-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru0-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru5-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru6-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru10-4e71a7b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru9-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru3-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru7-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru8-4e71a7b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threat-aru2-4e71a7b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {