('2a6c12e6-453f-55ba-bd72-0ebd1a79b040', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '29a16727-6985-5e12-b9c6-9214a00e76fd', 'cb8ffb00-e340-592d-86d2-ad82dd15521b', 'delay', '/dɪˈleɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng bị trì hoãn, chậm trễ.', 'a situation in which something happens later than it was planned or expected to happen.', 'There was a significant delay in the flight due to bad weather.', 'Chuyến bay bị chậm trễ đáng kể do thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"We apologize for the delay in processing your order due to high seasonal demand.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi xin lỗi vì sự chậm trễ trong việc xử lý đơn hàng của bạn do nhu cầu mùa vụ cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-ljspeech-ab464f02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-cori-ab464f02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delay-0928fcd7.webp', '[\"postponement\", \"setback\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cause a delay\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự chậm trễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid delay\", \"meaning\": \"tránh chậm trễ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"delay\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-cori-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru0-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru5-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru6-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru10-ab464f02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru9-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru3-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru7-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru8-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru2-ab464f02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-ljspeech-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/