('2208bbac-c2bd-5ec7-a5ca-bd0b786fc9d2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '29a16727-6985-5e12-b9c6-9214a00e76fd', 'cb8ffb00-e340-592d-86d2-ad82dd15521b', 'justice', '/ˈdʒʌstɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự công bằng, lẽ phải.', 'the quality of being fair and acting according to the law or moral rules.', 'The victims fought for years to achieve justice through the judicial system.', 'Các nạn nhân đã đấu tranh nhiều năm để đạt được công lý thông qua hệ thống tư pháp.', '{\"en\": \"The company policy ensures justice for all employees regarding their salary and benefits.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách công ty đảm bảo sự công bằng cho tất cả nhân viên về lương và phúc lợi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-ljspeech-050d859c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-cori-050d859c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/justice-815fbdfe.webp', '[\"fairness\", \"equity\"]', '[\"injustice\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"social justice\", \"meaning\": \"công bằng xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bring to justice\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra xét xử\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"just\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-cori-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru0-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru5-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru6-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru10-050d859c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru9-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru3-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru7-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru8-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru2-050d859c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public