('fc9878e1-4533-5e82-8bc8-2f1dc4ed71bd', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '3272ab85-a35e-5dcb-b467-31b71e3a9553', 'd145cec5-2dc9-52d3-9d0e-27807438ed74', 'declare', '/dɪˈkleə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Công bố hoặc khẳng định một điều gì đó một cách chính thức, rõ ràng.', 'to announce something publicly or officially to a group of people.', 'The government will declare a state of emergency.', 'Chính phủ sẽ tuyên bố tình trạng khẩn cấp.', '{\"en\": \"The company will declare its quarterly earnings during the meeting with all major shareholders.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ công bố thu nhập hàng quý trong cuộc họp với tất cả các cổ đông lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-ljspeech-a0910bc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-cori-a0910bc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/declare-1fcb0628.webp', '[\"announce\", \"proclaim\"]', '[\"conceal\", \"hide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"declare bankruptcy\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố phá sản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"declare a profit\", \"meaning\": \"công bố lợi nhuận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"declaration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-cori-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru0-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru5-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru6-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru10-a0910bc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru9-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru3-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru7-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru8-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-aru2-a0910bc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-ljspeech-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt408-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt138-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt624-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt396-a0910bc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt498-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt132-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt288-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt42-a0910bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/declare-lt90-a0910bc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong văn bản pháp lý hoặc tài chính.', 'finance', 1, 18),
('ed24f6c4-17b5-54e7-9d16-e1b499f9b850', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '3272ab85-a35e-5dcb-b467-31b71e3a9553', 'd145cec5-2dc9-52d3-9d0e-27807438ed74', 'honour', '/ˈɒnə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tôn trọng, lòng kính trọng hoặc phẩm giá.', 'a feeling of great respect or a special privilege.', 'It was a great honour to be invited to speak at the conference.', 'Đó là một vinh dự lớn khi được mời phát biểu tại hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"It is an honour to work with such a talented team on this international project.\", \"vi\": \"Thật là một vinh dự khi được làm việc với một đội ngũ tài năng như vậy trong dự án quốc tế này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-ljspeech-1cfce1f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-cori-1cfce1f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/honour-c415a7ee.webp', '[\"privilege\", \"respect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"great honour\", \"meaning\": \"vinh dự lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in honour of\", \"meaning\": \"để tôn vinh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"honourable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-cori-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru0-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru5-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru6-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru10-1cfce1f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru9-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru3-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru7-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru8-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-aru2-1cfce1f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honour-ljspeech-1cfce1f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje