('2a235311-f472-5333-8855-76370b4f1dd5', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '3272ab85-a35e-5dcb-b467-31b71e3a9553', 'd145cec5-2dc9-52d3-9d0e-27807438ed74', 'courage', '/ˈkʌrɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự dũng cảm, khả năng đối mặt với nỗi sợ hãi.', 'the ability to do something that is difficult or dangerous without showing fear.', 'It took a lot of courage to speak in front of such a large audience.', 'Cần rất nhiều lòng dũng cảm để nói trước một lượng khán giả lớn như vậy.', '{\"en\": \"It takes great courage to start a new business in a highly competitive market.\", \"vi\": \"Cần có lòng dũng cảm lớn để khởi nghiệp trong một thị trường cạnh tranh khốc liệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-ljspeech-a2d90f4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-cori-a2d90f4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/courage-9c24e778.webp', '[\"bravery\", \"valor\", \"boldness\"]', '[\"cowardice\", \"fear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have the courage to\", \"meaning\": \"có can đảm để làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gather courage\", \"meaning\": \"lấy hết can đảm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"courageous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"courageously\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"encourage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-cori-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru0-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru5-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru6-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru10-a2d90f4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru9-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru3-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru7-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru8-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-aru2-a2d90f4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-ljspeech-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt408-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt138-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt624-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt396-a2d90f4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt498-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt132-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt288-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt42-a2d90f4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courage-lt90-a2d90f4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Courage là danh từ không đếm được, không dùng với mạo từ \'a\'.', 'business', 1, 28),
('f40420c0-4c18-599a-99c0-85464f243f66', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '3272ab85-a35e-5dcb-b467-31b71e3a9553', 'd145cec5-2dc9-52d3-9d0e-27807438ed74', 'associate', '/əˈsəʊʃieɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Kết nối hoặc liên hệ một người/vật với một người/vật khác.', 'to connect someone or something in your mind with another person or thing.', 'Many people associate the smell of freshly baked bread with comfort.', 'Nhiều người liên kết mùi bánh mì mới nướng với cảm giác dễ chịu.', '{\"en\": \"Clients usually associate our brand with high quality service and reliable support.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng thường gắn liền thương hiệu của chúng tôi với dịch vụ chất lượng cao và sự hỗ trợ tin cậy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-ljspeech-adb833ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-cori-adb833ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/associate-237c9647.webp', '[\"connect\", \"link\", \"relate\"]', '[\"separate\", \"disconnect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"associate A with B\", \"meaning\": \"liên tưởng hoặc gắn kết A với B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"closely associate\", \"meaning\": \"liên kết chặt chẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assign\", \"note_vi\": \"Assign là phân công công việc, associate là liên tưởng hoặc kết nối.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"association\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"associated\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"associate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-cori-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru0-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru5-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru6-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru10-adb833ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru9-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru3-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru7-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru8-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-aru2-adb833ac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-ljspeech-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt408-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt138-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt624-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt396-adb833ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt498-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt132-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt288-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt42-adb833ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associate-lt90-adb833ac.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: associate something with something.', 'business', 1, 29),
('2c9e3b03-ca7b-5727-8002-29e186d16479', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'schedule', '/ˈʃedjuːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Danh sách các sự kiện hoặc hoạt động được sắp xếp theo thời gian.', 'a plan that lists all the work that you have to do.', 'The construction project remains strictly on schedule despite the recent bad weather.', 'Dự án xây dựng vẫn duy trì đúng lịch trình mặc dù thời tiết xấu gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager updated the production schedule to reflect the new delivery date.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng dự án đã cập nhật lịch trình sản xuất để phản ánh ngày giao hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-ljspeech-11e9ba26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-cori-11e9ba26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/schedule-b619bdcd.webp', '[\"timetable\", \"agenda\", \"calendar\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tight schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình bận rộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ahead of schedule\", \"meaning\": \"trước thời hạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scheme\", \"note_vi\": \"scheme là kế hoạch hoặc hệ thống lớn, schedule là lịch trình thời gian\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"schedule\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scheduled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-cori-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru0-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru5-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru6-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru10-11e9ba26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru9-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru3-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru7-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/stor