('15321c1e-b795-5518-b0de-8aa20fcc1ab3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'confidence', '/ˈkɒnfɪdəns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tin tưởng vào khả năng của bản thân hoặc vào ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'a feeling of trust in your own abilities or in other people.', 'She gained a lot of confidence after successfully completing the project.', 'Cô ấy đã có được rất nhiều sự tự tin sau khi hoàn thành dự án một cách thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The manager has full confidence in the marketing team to launch the new product.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc có sự tin tưởng hoàn toàn vào đội ngũ tiếp thị để ra mắt sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-ljspeech-01656883.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-cori-01656883.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confidence-23e921fe.webp', '[\"trust\", \"belief\", \"assurance\"]', '[\"doubt\", \"distrust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gain confidence\", \"meaning\": \"lấy lại sự tự tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have confidence in\", \"meaning\": \"có lòng tin vào ai/cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"build confidence\", \"meaning\": \"xây dựng sự tự tin\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confidentiality\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là sự bảo mật, không phải sự tự tin\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confident\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"confidently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-cori-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru0-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru5-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru6-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru10-01656883.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru9-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru3-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru7-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru8-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-aru2-01656883.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-ljspeech-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt408-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt138-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt624-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt396-01656883.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt498-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt132-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt288-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt42-01656883.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidence-lt90-01656883.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa confidence (sự tự tin) và confidentiality (sự bảo mật).', 'office', 1, 3),
('337819b7-bc6e-5e07-8a7c-d9cb3b4a7f0e', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'wealthy', '/ˈwelθi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có rất nhiều tiền, tài sản.', 'having a large amount of money, property, or valuable possessions.', 'He became wealthy after investing wisely in technology stocks.', 'Anh ấy trở nên giàu có sau khi đầu tư khôn ngoan vào cổ phiếu công nghệ.', '{\"en\": \"The wealthy investor decided to fund the startup company after reviewing their business proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà đầu tư giàu có đã quyết định tài trợ cho công ty khởi nghiệp sau khi xem xét đề xuất kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-ljspeech-7c48ff80.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-cori-7c48ff80.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wealthy-4a18dec8.webp', '[\"rich\", \"affluent\", \"prosperous\"]', '[\"poor\", \"needy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wealthy investor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà đầu tư giàu có\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wealthy individual\", \"meaning\": \"cá nhân giàu có\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"healthy\", \"note_vi\": \"Wealthy là giàu có, healthy là khỏe mạnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wealth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-cori-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru0-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru5-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru6-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru10-7c48ff80.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru9-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru3-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru7-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wealthy-aru8-7c48ff80.mp3\", \"/storage/