('cf90e9d9-d93e-50fb-bc6b-cf4f284e782b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'anticipate', 'UK: /ænˈtɪsɪˌpeɪt/ | US: /ænˈtɪsəˌpeɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'mong đợi, dự đoán', 'to expect or foresee that something will happen and prepare for it in advance.', 'We anticipate a significant increase in sales next quarter.', 'Chúng tôi dự đoán doanh số bán hàng sẽ tăng đáng kể vào quý tới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team anticipates a significant rise in product sales during the quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị dự đoán doanh số bán sản phẩm sẽ tăng đáng kể trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-ljspeech-4dc2fddc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-cori-4dc2fddc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anticipate-318486fe.webp', '[\"expect\", \"foresee\", \"predict\", \"await\"]', '[\"doubt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anticipate demand\", \"meaning\": \"dự báo nhu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"anticipate problems\", \"meaning\": \"lường trước các sự cố\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expect\", \"note_vi\": \"expect chỉ sự mong đợi chung chung, anticipate nhấn mạnh vào việc lường trước để có sự chuẩn bị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anticipation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"anticipated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-cori-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru0-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru5-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru6-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru10-4dc2fddc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru9-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru3-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru7-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru8-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-aru2-4dc2fddc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-ljspeech-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt408-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt138-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt624-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt396-4dc2fddc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt498-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt132-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt288-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt42-4dc2fddc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipate-lt90-4dc2fddc.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: anticipate + V-ing / danh từ. Khác với \'expect\', \'anticipate\' bao hàm việc dự đoán và chủ động chuẩn bị trước.', 'marketing', 1, 5),
('7110fd36-cb44-57c7-b7d7-f8bda6a4fe2e', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'anxious', '/ˈæŋkʃəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, bồn chồn hoặc mong muốn điều gì đó.', 'feeling worried or nervous about something that is going to happen in the future.', 'He was anxious about the job interview tomorrow.', 'Anh ấy lo lắng về buổi phỏng vấn xin việc ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was anxious about the delay in the delivery of the new office equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy lo lắng về sự chậm trễ trong việc giao thiết bị văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-ljspeech-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anxious-5ebf0d83.webp', '[\"worried\", \"nervous\"]', '[\"calm\", \"confident\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anxious about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel anxious\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy lo âu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anxiety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru0-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru5-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru6-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru10-3d58dabf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru9-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru3-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru7-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru8-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru2-3d58dabf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-ljspeech-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt408-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt138-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt624-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt396-3d58dabf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt498-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt132-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt288-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt42-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt90-3d58dabf.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa là lo lắng, không phải là háo hức (dù đôi khi có thể hiểu là mong đợi).', 'office', 1, 6),
('0a1b37f2-e039-57be-8024-df56b74f026a', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'broadcast', '/ˈbrɔːdkɑːst/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Truyền đi chương trình qua sóng radio hoặc TV.', 'to send out sound or images by radio or television.', 'The news channel will broadcast the live event starting at 7 PM.', 'Kênh tin tức sẽ phát sóng trực tiếp sự kiện bắt đầu lúc 7 giờ tối.', '{\"en\": \"The company will broadcast the training session to all branch offices live.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ phát sóng buổi đào tạo trực tiếp đến tất cả chi nhánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-ljspeech-b58ccb78.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-cori-b58ccb78.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/broadcast-3e0529e1.webp', '[\"air\", \"transmit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"broadcast live\", \"meaning\": \"phát sóng trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broadcast network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng phát sóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broadcast signal\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu phát sóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"broadcaster\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"broadcasting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-cori-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru0-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru5-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru6-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru10-b58ccb78.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru9-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru3-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru7-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broadcast-aru8-b58ccb78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia