('bf7452de-b925-532f-89c8-22f5df3c1164', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'worst', '/wɜːst/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Tồi tệ nhất, kém nhất về chất lượng hoặc mức độ.', 'of the lowest quality or the most unpleasant experience possible.', 'Heavy traffic caused the worst delay we experienced during the entire business trip.', 'Giao thông đông đúc đã gây ra sự chậm trễ tồi tệ nhất mà chúng tôi gặp phải trong suốt chuyến công tác.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported its worst financial results in over a decade due to the crisis.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo kết quả tài chính tồi tệ nhất trong hơn một thập kỷ do cuộc khủng hoảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-ljspeech-c5ce11c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-cori-c5ce11c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worst-cb314953.webp', '[\"poorest\", \"lowest\"]', '[\"best\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"worst case\", \"meaning\": \"trường hợp xấu nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at worst\", \"meaning\": \"trong trường hợp xấu nhất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bad\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"worse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-cori-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru0-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru5-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru6-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru10-c5ce11c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru9-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru3-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru7-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-aru8-c5ce11c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worst-a