('55e82268-23a4-5c83-ba8a-6710fb6a3e65', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'reveal', '/rɪˈviːl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Để lộ ra, cho thấy điều gì đó đã được giấu kín.', 'to make something known to people after it was previously kept secret or hidden.', 'The detective promised to reveal the truth behind the mysterious disappearance.', 'Thám tử hứa sẽ tiết lộ sự thật đằng sau vụ mất tích bí ẩn.', '{\"en\": \"The company will reveal its new marketing strategy during the annual stockholders meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ tiết lộ chiến lược tiếp thị mới trong cuộc họp cổ đông hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-ljspeech-658c8286.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-cori-658c8286.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reveal-e2b6f51e.webp', '[\"disclose\", \"unveil\", \"expose\"]', '[\"hide\", \"conceal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reveal details\", \"meaning\": \"tiết lộ chi tiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reveal plans\", \"meaning\": \"tiết lộ kế hoạch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relieve\", \"note_vi\": \"relieve nghĩa là làm dịu bớt hoặc giải tỏa đau đớn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"revelation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"revealing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-cori-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru0-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru5-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru6-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru10-658c8286.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru9-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru3-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reveal-aru7-658c8286.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio