('db5864ff-a8a2-536b-89d6-bb4ee9dad316', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'gang', '/ɡæŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người, thường là thanh thiếu niên, tụ tập và gây rắc rối.', 'a group of people who spend time together, often associated with negative activities.', 'The police are investigating a local gang suspected of several robberies.', 'Cảnh sát đang điều tra một băng nhóm địa phương bị nghi ngờ thực hiện vài vụ cướp.', '{\"en\": \"The security team was hired to prevent a gang of vandals from entering the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Đội an ninh đã được thuê để ngăn chặn một nhóm kẻ phá hoại xâm nhập vào nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-ljspeech-6465ec48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-cori-6465ec48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gang-030c850e.webp', '[\"group\", \"band\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local gang\", \"meaning\": \"băng nhóm địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"criminal gang\", \"meaning\": \"băng nhóm tội phạm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-cori-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru0-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru5-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru6-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru10-6465ec48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru9-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru3-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru7-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru8-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-aru2-6465ec48.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-ljspeech-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt408-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt138-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt624-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt396-6465ec48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt498-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt132-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt288-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt42-6465ec48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gang-lt90-6465ec48.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang nghĩa tiêu cực, cần dùng cẩn thận trong ngữ cảnh công sở.', 'law', 1, 20),
('0da7f6e4-d0ae-5f27-8e1b-2339e4192d85', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'shade', '/ʃeɪd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khu vực tối hơn do bị che khuất ánh sáng.', 'an area that is dark and cool because it is protected from direct sunlight.', 'It\'s much cooler to sit in the shade on a hot day.', 'Ngồi trong bóng râm mát hơn nhiều vào một ngày nóng.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor seating area provides plenty of shade for customers during the hot summer.\", \"vi\": \"Khu vực ngồi ngoài trời cung cấp nhiều bóng râm cho khách hàng trong mùa hè nóng bức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-ljspeech-7f5bb03c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-cori-7f5bb03c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shade-facb9f5a.webp', '[\"shadow\", \"shelter\"]', '[\"light\", \"sun\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in the shade\", \"meaning\": \"trong bóng râm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide shade\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp bóng râm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shadow\", \"note_vi\": \"shadow là hình bóng, shade là vùng râm mát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shadow\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shady\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-cori-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru0-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru5-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru6-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru10-7f5bb03c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru9-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru3-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru7-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru8-7f5bb03c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shade-aru2-7