('0982a45d-c667-50ef-9362-2456443ef210', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'slip', '/slɪp/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Mất thăng bằng và ngã hoặc di chuyển không chủ ý.', 'to lose balance and fall or move unintentionally.', 'The muddy path caused several runners to slip during the morning race.', 'Con đường bùn lầy đã khiến nhiều vận động viên bị trượt chân trong giải chạy buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees should not slip on wet surfaces in the restaurant kitchen.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên không nên trượt chân trên bề mặt ướt trong bếp nhà hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-ljspeech-191c1609.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-cori-191c1609.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slip-67649c9f.webp', '[\"slide\", \"skid\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"slip on\", \"meaning\": \"trượt chân trên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slip off\", \"meaning\": \"tuột ra, trượt khỏi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slit\", \"note_vi\": \"slit là khe rạch, khác slip trượt chân.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"slippery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-cori-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru0-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru5-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru6-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru10-191c1609.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru9-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru3-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru7-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru8-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-aru2-191c1609.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-ljspeech-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt408-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt138-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt624-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt396-191c1609.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt498-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt132-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt288-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt42-191c1609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-lt90-191c1609.mp3\"]}}', 'Slip nghĩa trượt chân, không phải slit (khe hở) hay ship (vận chuyển).', 'office', 1, 24),
('30d905b0-40a4-5ee5-911c-e8d9997393f0', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '44f4cbb5-7969-56b6-bf96-cd784df9f27a', 'fd4849b7-347a-5dd5-94c5-9d5d82419d5c', 'outer', '/ˈaʊtə/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Nằm ở phía ngoài, bên ngoài một cái gì đó.', 'situated on the outside or forming the external part of something.', 'Astronauts wore specialized suits designed to protect them from extreme temperatures in outer space.', 'Các phi hành gia đã mặc những bộ đồ đặc biệt được thiết kế để bảo vệ họ khỏi nhiệt độ khắc nghiệt ngoài vũ trụ.', '{\"en\": \"The outer walls of the warehouse need to be painted before the rainy season starts.\", \"vi\": \"Các bức tường bên ngoài của nhà kho cần được sơn lại trước khi mùa mưa bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-ljspeech-b1417920.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-cori-b1417920.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outer-01049745.webp', '[\"external\", \"outside\"]', '[\"inner\", \"internal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"outer layer\", \"meaning\": \"lớp bên ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outer edge\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh ngoài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"utter\", \"note_vi\": \"utter là hoàn toàn, outer là bên ngoài.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-cori-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru0-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru5-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru6-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru10-b1417920.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru9-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru3-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru7-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru8-b1417920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outer-aru2-b1