('151e36e4-6bd8-5021-a6b3-6a47d00edcf0', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '5958337e-4c9f-57bc-b220-6a137dd1e581', 'f0df39e9-1703-5574-8b7b-08a9cc41b893', 'generate', '/ˈdʒenəreɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tạo ra hoặc sản xuất ra cái gì đó.', 'to create or produce something, especially energy or a specific result or effect.', 'Solar panels generate electricity from sunlight.', 'Tấm pin mặt trời tạo ra điện từ ánh sáng mặt trời.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing campaign is expected to generate more interest from potential international clients.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới được kỳ vọng sẽ tạo ra nhiều sự quan tâm hơn từ các khách hàng quốc tế tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-ljspeech-9e59d425.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-cori-9e59d425.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/generate-b73883de.webp', '[\"produce\", \"create\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"generate revenue\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra doanh thu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"generate interest\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra sự quan tâm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"generation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-cori-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru0-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru5-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru6-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru10-9e59d425.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru9-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru3-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru7-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru8-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-aru2-9e59d425.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-ljspeech-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt408-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt138-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt624-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt396-9e59d425.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt498-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt132-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt288-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt42-9e59d425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generate-lt90-9e59d425.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay đi với \'revenue\' (doanh thu) hoặc \'profit\' (lợi nhuận).', 'marketing', 1, 9),
('1092c834-f72a-5ffc-9cbe-16e9d1553a37', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '5958337e-4c9f-57bc-b220-6a137dd1e581', 'f0df39e9-1703-5574-8b7b-08a9cc41b893', 'pursue', '/pəˈsjuː/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Theo đuổi một mục tiêu, sự nghiệp hoặc sở thích.', 'to try to achieve a plan, activity, or situation over a long period of time.', 'Many young professionals choose to pursue higher education while working full-time jobs.', 'Nhiều chuyên gia trẻ chọn theo đuổi học vị cao hơn trong khi làm việc toàn thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The manager encouraged the staff to pursue new opportunities within the international marketing department.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý khuyến khích nhân viên theo đuổi các cơ hội mới trong phòng tiếp thị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-ljspeech-7c47bc37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-cori-7c47bc37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pursue-9f1a43d2.webp', '[\"follow\", \"seek\", \"chase\"]', '[\"abandon\", \"give up\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pursue a career\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi sự nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pursue a goal\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi mục tiêu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"persuade\", \"note_vi\": \"persuade là thuyết phục, pursue là theo đuổi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pursuit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-cori-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru0-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru5-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru6-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru10-7c47bc37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru9-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru3-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru7-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru8-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-aru2-7c47bc37.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-ljspeech-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt408-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt138-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt624-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt396-7c47bc37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt498-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt132-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt288-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt42-7c47bc37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-lt90-7c47bc37.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ cụm \'pursue a goal\' để dùng trong bài viết hoặc nói về dự định.', 'business', 1, 10),
('da0b45ea-320e-56eb-a723-1d8c6a2d24ff', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '5958337e-4c9f-57bc-b220-6a137dd1e581', 'f0df39e9-1703-5574-8b7b-08a9cc41b893', 'vast', '/vɑːst/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất rộng lớn về kích thước hoặc số lượng.', 'extremely large in area, size, amount, or degree.', 'The desert stretched out before them, a vast expanse of sand.', 'Sa mạc trải dài trước mắt họ, một vùng cát rộng lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The company has invested a vast amount of money into research and technology development.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đầu tư một khoản tiền cực lớn vào nghiên cứu và phát triển công nghệ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-ljspeech-6a7ebfc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-cori-6a7ebfc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vast-d9f5d358.webp', '[\"huge\", \"immense\", \"enormous\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vast majority\", \"meaning\": \"đại đa số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vast amount\", \"meaning\": \"lượng cực kỳ lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vast experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm phong phú\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fast\", \"note_vi\": \"fast nghĩa là nhanh, tránh nhầm lẫn mặt chữ với vast.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vastly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vastness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-cori-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru0-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru5-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru6-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru10-6a7ebfc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru9-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru3-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru7-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru8-6a7ebfc5.