('f8f51a19-09dc-5b6b-b8f3-a074dc55897e', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '5b5299ed-580f-523b-86d1-a453590fbefc', '8fb88ab6-208f-593b-8099-600442c0133c', 'logical', '/ˈlɒdʒɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có lý, có cơ sở, tuân theo các nguyên tắc suy luận.', 'sensible and based on clear thinking rather than on feelings or emotions.', 'It was a logical conclusion based on all the evidence presented during the investigation.', 'Đó là một kết luận hợp lý dựa trên tất cả bằng chứng được trình bày trong quá trình điều tra.', '{\"en\": \"It is a logical choice to upgrade our software to improve the team\'s overall productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một lựa chọn hợp lý khi nâng cấp phần mềm để cải thiện năng suất chung của nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-ljspeech-38dd6692.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-cori-38dd6692.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/logical-d6feb574.webp', '[\"reasonable\", \"sensible\"]', '[\"illogical\", \"unreasonable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"logical choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"logical conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"kết luận hợp lý\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"logic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-cori-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru0-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru5-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru6-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru10-38dd6692.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru9-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru3-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru7-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru8-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia