('656832ae-006d-5e6e-ba80-357cea297c57', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '5b5299ed-580f-523b-86d1-a453590fbefc', '8fb88ab6-208f-593b-8099-600442c0133c', 'obtain', '/əbˈteɪn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Có được hoặc đạt được điều gì đó, thường là qua nỗ lực.', 'to get something that you want or need, usually by making an effort to find it.', 'You need to obtain a visa before traveling to that country.', 'Bạn cần phải có thị thực trước khi đi du lịch đến quốc gia đó.', '{\"en\": \"You must obtain written permission from the manager before taking any office equipment home.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn phải có được sự cho phép bằng văn bản từ người quản lý trước khi mang bất kỳ thiết bị văn phòng nào về nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-ljspeech-b5c5697f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-cori-b5c5697f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obtain-433eb8c8.webp', '[\"acquire\", \"get\", \"gain\"]', '[\"lose\", \"give\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obtain permission\", \"meaning\": \"xin phép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obtain information\", \"meaning\": \"thu thập thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obtain a degree\", \"meaning\": \"lấy bằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attain\", \"note_vi\": \"attain thường dùng cho mục tiêu, obtain dùng cho vật chất hoặc giấy tờ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obtainable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-cori-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru0-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru5-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru6-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru10-b5c5697f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru9-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru3-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru7-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru8-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-aru2-b5c5697f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-ljspeech-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt408-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt138-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt624-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt396-b5c5697f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt498-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt132-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt288-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt42-b5c5697f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obtain-lt90-b5c5697f.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong TOEIC Part 7 khi nói về việc lấy giấy phép hoặc thông tin.', 'office', 1, 7),
('b78f5b26-ca76-5e7b-bcc7-18e157488b15', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'cautiously', 'UK: /ˈkɔːʃəsli/ | US: /ˈkɔːʃəsli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách thận trọng', 'in a careful manner to avoid potential danger, mistakes, or unexpected risks', 'The company moved cautiously into the new market.', 'Công ty thận trọng thâm nhập thị trường mới.', '{\"en\": \"The board decided to proceed cautiously with the proposed merger to minimize economic risks.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị quyết định tiến hành một cách thận trọng với thương vụ sáp nhập được đề xuất nhằm giảm thiểu rủi ro kinh tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-ljspeech-ef9075a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-cori-ef9075a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cautiously-f7fb3227.webp', '[\"carefully\", \"prudently\", \"warily\"]', '[\"carelessly\", \"recklessly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cautiously optimistic\", \"meaning\": \"lạc quan một cách thận trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proceed cautiously\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành một cách thận trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"caution\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cautious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-cori-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru0-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru5-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru6-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru10-ef9075a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru9-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru3-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru7-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru8-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-aru2-ef9075a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-ljspeech-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt408-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt138-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt624-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt396-ef9075a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt498-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt132-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt288-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt42-ef9075a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cautiously-lt90-ef9075a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ \'cautiously\' hay xuất hiện trong các cụm như \'proceed cautiously\' (tiến hành thận trọng) hoặc \'cautiously optimistic\' (lạc quan một cách thận trọng).', 'finance', 1, 0),
('1521ab5e-7d51-591a-87b2-7ca65618d704', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'chief', '/tʃiːf/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người đứng đầu, thủ lĩnh của một nhóm hoặc bộ lạc.', 'a leader or person with the highest authority in an organization or group.', 'The chief of the village made an important announcement to all the residents.', 'Thủ lĩnh của làng đã đưa ra một thông báo quan trọng cho tất cả cư dân.', '{\"en\": \"The chief executive officer delivered an encouraging speech to all employees this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã có bài phát biểu động viên tới toàn thể nhân viên vào sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-ljspeech-c4b038d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-cori-c4b038d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chief-4021343c.webp', '[\"leader\", \"head\", \"boss\"]', '[\"subordinate\", \"follower\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chief executive officer\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc điều hành (CEO)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chief financial officer\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc tài chính (CFO)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"police chief\", \"meaning\": \"trưởng cảnh sát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chef\", \"note_vi\": \"Chef là bếp trưởng, chief là người đứng đầu hoặc cấp trưởng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"chiefly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"chief\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-cori-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru0-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru5-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru6-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru10-c4b038d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru9-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru3-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/