('66dbdbb6-00f5-5aa7-b7bd-85ed998a426d', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'assurance', 'UK: /əˈʃʊərəns/ | US: /əˈʃʊrəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự đảm bảo', 'a positive statement or promise intended to give confidence about something.', 'The company provided assurance of job security.', 'Công ty đưa ra sự đảm bảo về an ninh công việc.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave her assurance that the delayed shipment would arrive by tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra lời đảm bảo rằng lô hàng bị chậm trễ sẽ đến trước sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-ljspeech-f3753f1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-cori-f3753f1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assurance-d34064da.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"pledge\", \"promise\", \"certainty\"]', '[\"uncertainty\", \"doubt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"quality assurance\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give assurance\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra sự đảm bảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insurance\", \"note_vi\": \"Insurance là hợp đồng/dịch vụ bảo hiểm tài chính, còn assurance là lời cam đoan hoặc sự đảm bảo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"assured\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-cori-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru0-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru5-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru6-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru10-f3753f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru9-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru3-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru7-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru8-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru2-f3753f1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-ljspeech-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt408-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt138-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt624-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt396-f3753f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt498-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt132-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt288-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt42-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt90-f3753f1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'quality assurance\' (đảm bảo chất lượng) là cụm rất hay gặp. Phân biệt: \'assurance\' (lời đảm bảo/sự tự tin) khác với \'insurance\' (bảo hiểm).', 'business operations', 1, 2),
('e3804955-8fa2-52a3-842c-c017b631f788', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'lively', '/ˈlaɪvli/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đầy năng lượng, hoạt bát và thú vị.', 'full of energy, excitement, and activity in a way that is interesting and enjoyable.', 'The market was a lively place, full of people and vibrant colors.', 'Chợ là một nơi sống động, đầy người và màu sắc rực rỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team held a lively discussion about the new advertising campaign this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị đã có một cuộc thảo luận sôi nổi về chiến dịch quảng cáo mới sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-ljspeech-49ab5955.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-cori-49ab5955.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lively-4e2425ef.webp', '[\"energetic\", \"animated\"]', '[\"dull\", \"boring\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lively discussion\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc thảo luận sôi nổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lively atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí sôi động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"live\", \"note_vi\": \"live là động từ hoặc tính từ, lively là tính từ chỉ sự hoạt bát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"live\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"life\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-cori-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru0-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru5-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru6-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru10-49ab5955.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru9-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru3-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lively-aru7-49ab5955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/l