('8e801778-db2d-5eb7-a88a-8a2bb3a27d3f', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'bet', '/bet/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đặt cược tiền vào kết quả của một sự kiện.', 'to risk money on the result of a game or a future event.', 'I wouldn\'t bet on that horse; it doesn\'t look very strong.', 'Tôi sẽ không đặt cược vào con ngựa đó; nó trông không khỏe lắm.', '{\"en\": \"I would not bet on the new product line succeeding without a stronger marketing strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi sẽ không đặt cược vào việc dòng sản phẩm mới thành công nếu thiếu chiến lược tiếp thị mạnh mẽ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-ljspeech-c033816b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-cori-c033816b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bet-b6d1393d.webp', '[\"wager\", \"gamble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"place a bet\", \"meaning\": \"đặt cược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bet on\", \"meaning\": \"đặt cược vào\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"betting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-cori-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru0-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru5-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru6-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru10-c033816b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru9-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru3-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru7-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru8-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-aru2-c033816b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-ljspeech-c033816b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bet-lt408-c033816b.mp3\", 