('1c5c866c-7589-52fd-aec0-7c689f75e2d3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'vitamin', '/ˈvɪtəmɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chất dinh dưỡng hữu cơ cần thiết cho sự sống và sức khỏe.', 'an organic substance needed in small amounts for healthy body function.', 'Eating fruits and vegetables provides essential vitamins for your body.', 'Ăn trái cây và rau củ cung cấp các vitamin thiết yếu cho cơ thể bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers vitamin supplements to employees during the wellness program.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp thực phẩm bổ sung vitamin cho nhân viên trong chương trình sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-ljspeech-e492e8cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-cori-e492e8cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vitamin-b8d8f5eb.webp', '[\"nutrient\", \"micronutrient\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"vitamin C\", \"meaning\": \"vitamin C\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take vitamins\", \"meaning\": \"uống vitamin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vitamin deficiency\", \"meaning\": \"thiếu hụt vitamin\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mineral\", \"note_vi\": \"mineral là khoáng chất, không phải vitamin hữu cơ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-cori-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru0-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru5-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru6-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru10-e492e8cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru9-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru3-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru7-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru8-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-aru2-e492e8cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-ljspeech-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt408-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt138-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt624-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt396-e492e8cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt498-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt132-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt288-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt42-e492e8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitamin-lt90-e492e8cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Vitamin luôn số ít khi nói chung, số nhiều \'vitamins\' khi cụ thể.', 'health', 1, 6),
('44880c18-b7b0-5129-a44c-447ef62308ff', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'regret', '/rɪˈɡrɛt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cảm thấy buồn hoặc hối hận về một việc đã làm hoặc không làm.', 'To experience sadness or remorse concerning a past action or decision.', 'I deeply regret not taking that job offer when I had the chance.', 'Tôi vô cùng hối hận vì đã không nhận lời đề nghị công việc đó khi có cơ hội.', '{\"en\": \"The management will regret ignoring the complaints from our most loyal corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý sẽ hối hận vì đã phớt lờ những lời phàn nàn từ các khách hàng doanh nghiệp trung thành nhất của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-ljspeech-66450d95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-cori-66450d95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regret-0214890d.webp', '[\"lament\", \"repent\"]', '[\"rejoice\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply regret\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng hối hận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regret to inform\", \"meaning\": \"rất tiếc phải thông báo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"apologize\", \"note_vi\": \"apologize là xin lỗi ai đó, regret là cảm giác hối hận bên trong.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regretful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regrettable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-cori-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru0-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru5-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru6-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru10-66450d95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru9-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru3-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru7-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru8-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru2-66450d95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-ljspeech-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt408-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt138-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt624-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt396-66450d95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt498-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt132-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt288-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt42-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt90-66450d95.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với V-ing (hối hận việc đã làm) hoặc to V (rất tiếc phải làm gì).', 'business', 1, 7),
('31f04377-0dc1-5bff-8923-dd1d6dfd3485', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'auction', 'UK: /ˈɔːkʃən/ | US: /ˈɔːkʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'buổi đấu giá', 'a public sale where goods are offered for competitive bidding to the highest offer.', 'The rare painting was sold at an online auction.', 'Bức tranh quý hiếm đã được bán trong một buổi đấu giá trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"Surplus office equipment will be put up for auction at the end of the month.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết bị văn phòng dư thừa sẽ được đưa ra đấu giá vào cuối tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-ljspeech-0677209b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-cori-0677209b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/auction-8628538a.webp', '[\"bidding sale\", \"public sale\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"put up for auction\", \"meaning\": \"mang ra đấu giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online auction\", \"meaning\": \"buổi đấu giá trực tuyến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"auction\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"auctioneer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-cori-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru0-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru5-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru6-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru10-0677209b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru9-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru3-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru7-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru8-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-aru2-0677209b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-ljspeech-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt408-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt138-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt624-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt396-0677209b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt498-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt132-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt288-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt42-0677209b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/auction-lt90-0677209b.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi với động từ \'hold/conduct an auction\' (tổ chức đấu giá) hoặc cụm \'put up for auction\' (đưa ra đấu giá).', 'sales', 1, 8),
('43f26d93-6264-5910-b6f5-b40a7a667a37', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'depressed', '/dɪˈprest/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất buồn bã, tuyệt vọng hoặc không vui.', 'feeling very sad, unhappy, and without hope for the future.', 'The constant rainy weather made many residents feel thoroughly depressed throughout the winter.', 'Thời tiết mưa kéo dài khiến nhiều cư dân cảm thấy vô cùng chán nản trong suốt mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees felt depressed after hearing about the upcoming budget cuts.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cảm thấy chán nản sau khi nghe tin về việc cắt giảm ngân sách sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-ljspeech-2f27bbc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-cori-2f27bbc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/depressed-576fc93c.webp', '[\"sad\", \"gloomy\", \"miserable\"]', '[\"happy\", \"cheerful\", \"joyful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel depressed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy trầm cảm/buồn bã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severely depressed\", \"meaning\": \"trầm cảm nặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"depressing\", \"note_vi\": \"depressed mô tả cảm xúc con người, depressing mô tả tính chất sự việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"depress\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"depression\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"depressing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-cori-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru0-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru5-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru6-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru10-2f27bbc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru9-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru3-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru7-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru8-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-aru2-2f27bbc5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-ljspeech-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt408-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt138-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt624-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt396-2f27bbc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt498-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt132-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt288-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt42-2f27bbc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depressed-lt90-2f27bbc5.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ed dùng để chỉ cảm xúc của con người đối với một tác nhân nào đó.', 'hr', 1, 9),
('206a195a-0375-558c-8ba6-abff5fb04097', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'justify', '/ˈdʒʌstɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đưa ra lý do hợp lý hoặc chứng minh điều gì đó là đúng.', 'to provide reasons or evidence that show an action is reasonable or correct.', 'He tried to justify his actions by explaining the difficult circumstances he was in.', 'Anh ấy đã cố gắng biện minh cho hành động của mình bằng cách giải thích những hoàn cảnh khó khăn mà anh ấy đang gặp phải.', '{\"en\": \"The manager must justify the extra budget to the directors.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý phải đưa ra lý do hợp lý cho ngân sách thêm với ban giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-ljspeech-3d7a034a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-cori-3d7a034a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/justify-836a70d1.webp', '[\"defend\", \"explain\", \"validate\"]', '[\"contradict\", \"disprove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"justify the cost\", \"meaning\": \"biện minh chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"justify a decision\", \"meaning\": \"biện minh quyết định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hard to justify\", \"meaning\": \"khó biện minh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"justice\", \"note_vi\": \"justice là công lý, khác với justify là biện minh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"justification\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"justifiable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-cori-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru0-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru5-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru6-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru10-3d7a034a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru9-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru3-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru7-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru8-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-aru2-3d7a034a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-ljspeech-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt408-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt138-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt624-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt396-3d7a034a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt498-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt132-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt288-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt42-3d7a034a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justify-lt90-3d7a034a.mp3\"]}}', 'Justify thường theo sau bởi danh từ chỉ hành động cần biện minh.', 'business', 1, 10),
('0dc16023-92a1-5f98-9a59-652291529bc1', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'even', '/ˈiːvn/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Thậm chí, ngay cả (dùng để nhấn mạnh).', 'used to emphasize something surprising or extreme within a statement.', 'Even experienced managers found it difficult to resolve the complex technical issue.', 'Thậm chí các quản lý giàu kinh nghiệm cũng thấy khó giải quyết sự cố kỹ thuật phức tạp đó.', '{\"en\": \"The manager even approved the refund without checking the customer\'s receipt.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý thậm chí đã duyệt hoàn tiền mà không kiểm tra biên lai khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-ljspeech-04b8c80b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-cori-04b8c80b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/even-202e7bf1.webp', '[\"indeed\", \"in fact\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"even if\", \"meaning\": \"cho dù rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"even though\", \"meaning\": \"mặc dù rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"even so\", \"meaning\": \"tuy nhiên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ever\", \"note_vi\": \"ever nghĩa là từng, không phải even (thậm chí).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"even\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"evenness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-cori-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru0-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru5-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru6-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru10-04b8c80b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru9-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru3-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru7-04b8c80b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-aru8-04b8c80b.m