('29f33f6f-d04f-519b-abf4-5c0992c640da', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'drag', '/dræɡ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Kéo lê hoặc lôi cái gì đó đi.', 'to pull something along the ground because it is too heavy to carry.', 'She had to drag the heavy suitcase across the floor.', 'Cô ấy phải kéo lê chiếc vali nặng qua sàn nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff had to drag the heavy equipment to the repair workshop yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã phải kéo lê thiết bị nặng đến xưởng sửa chữa vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-ljspeech-a4e2dc76.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-cori-a4e2dc76.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drag-710db490.webp', '[\"pull\", \"haul\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"drag something across\", \"meaning\": \"kéo lê cái gì qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drag along\", \"meaning\": \"kéo theo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-cori-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru0-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru5-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru6-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru10-a4e2dc76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru9-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru3-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru7-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru8-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-aru2-a4e2dc76.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-ljspeech-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt408-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt138-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt624-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt396-a4e2dc76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt498-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt132-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt288-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt42-a4e2dc76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drag-lt90-a4e2dc76.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng \'drag one\'s feet\' rất hay gặp trong môi trường công sở.', 'manufacturing', 1, 23),
('7e2d9a89-1d9e-57a4-963a-2562c20262c6', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'stretch', '/stretʃ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Kéo giãn ra, làm cho dài hơn hoặc rộng hơn.', 'to pull something to make it longer or wider, or to become larger.', 'It\'s important to stretch before exercising to prevent injuries.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải kéo giãn trước khi tập thể dục để tránh chấn thương.', '{\"en\": \"The budget limit forces us to stretch our available resources over two financial quarters.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân sách hạn hẹp buộc chúng tôi phải kéo dài các nguồn lực hiện có qua hai quý tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-ljspeech-14431dad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-cori-14431dad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stretch-21cb389d.webp', '[\"extend\", \"expand\", \"elongate\"]', '[\"shrink\", \"compress\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stretch budget\", \"meaning\": \"tối ưu/kéo giãn ngân sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stretch resources\", \"meaning\": \"tận dụng tối đa nguồn lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sketch\", \"note_vi\": \"sketch có nghĩa là phác thảo, vẽ nháp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stretch\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stretchy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-cori-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru0-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru5-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru6-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru10-14431dad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru9-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru3-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru7-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru8-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-aru2-14431dad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-ljspeech-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt408-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt138-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt624-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt396-14431dad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt498-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt132-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt288-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt42-14431dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-lt90-14431dad.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh công sở, stretch còn mang nghĩa nỗ lực vượt giới hạn.', 'finance', 1, 24),
('d04e0298-666f-510e-9f6e-b75b158b6f6d', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'obey', '/əˈbeɪ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tuân theo mệnh lệnh, quy tắc hoặc luật lệ.', 'to do what someone in authority tells you to do, or to follow a rule or law.', 'All citizens are expected to obey the laws of the country.', 'Mọi công dân đều được mong đợi tuân thủ luật pháp của đất nước.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are required to obey all workplace safety regulations at all times.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được yêu cầu tuân thủ tất cả các quy định an toàn nơi làm việc mọi lúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-ljspeech-a65b8e17.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-cori-a65b8e17.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obey-15969715.webp', '[\"follow\", \"comply with\", \"abide by\"]', '[\"disobey\", \"defy\", \"violate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obey the rules\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo các quy tắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obey orders\", \"meaning\": \"tuân lệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obey the law\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ pháp luật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comply\", \"note_vi\": \"\'comply\' thường dùng với \'with\' (comply with rules); \'obey\' dùng trực tiếp với tân ngữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obedience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obedient\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"obediently\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disobey\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-cori-a65b8e17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-aru0-a65b8e17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-aru5-a65b8e17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-aru6-a65b8e17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-aru10-a65b8e17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obey-aru9-a65b8e17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub