('fa99f0ec-9c81-50b8-bc57-f13a16006b61', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'urge', '/ɜːdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thúc giục, khuyến khích hoặc thôi thúc ai làm gì.', 'to strongly advise or try to persuade someone to do a particular thing.', 'I would urge you to consider all your options before making a decision.', 'Tôi muốn thúc giục bạn xem xét tất cả các lựa chọn của mình trước khi đưa ra quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will urge all employees to submit their quarterly reports before the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý sẽ thúc giục tất cả nhân viên nộp báo cáo hàng quý trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-ljspeech-78bd637d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-cori-78bd637d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/urge-a2633af4.webp', '[\"encourage\", \"push\"]', '[\"discourage\", \"deter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"urge someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"thúc giục ai làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly urge\", \"meaning\": \"kịch liệt thúc giục\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"urgent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"urgency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-cori-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru0-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru5-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru6-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru10-78bd637d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru9-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru3-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru7-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru8-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-aru2-78bd637d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-ljspeech-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt408-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt138-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt624-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt396-78bd637d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt498-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt132-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt288-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt42-78bd637d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urge-lt90-78bd637d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cấu trúc: urge someone to do something.', 'office', 1, 27),
('6a0d251f-e034-594d-a6bc-a68d9e05f530', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'stiff', '/stɪf/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khó uốn cong hoặc di chuyển; cứng nhắc.', 'firm, hard, or not easily bent, moved, or changed in shape.', 'My neck feels stiff after sleeping in an awkward position.', 'Cổ tôi cảm thấy cứng sau khi ngủ sai tư thế.', '{\"en\": \"The manager faced stiff competition from foreign companies when launching the new product line.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý phải đối mặt với sự cạnh tranh gay gắt từ các công ty nước ngoài khi ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-ljspeech-69a1dfc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-cori-69a1dfc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stiff-72ffe09a.webp', '[\"rigid\", \"firm\", \"inflexible\"]', '[\"flexible\", \"soft\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stiff competition\", \"meaning\": \"sự cạnh tranh gay gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stiff penalty\", \"meaning\": \"hình phạt nặng nề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stuff\", \"note_vi\": \"stuff là đồ đạc (danh từ), stiff là cứng (tính từ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stiffness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stiffen\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stiffly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-cori-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru0-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru5-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru6-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru10-69a1dfc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru9-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru3-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru7-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru8-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-aru2-69a1dfc0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-ljspeech-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt408-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt138-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt624-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt396-69a1dfc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt498-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt132-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt288-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt42-69a1dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stiff-lt90-69a1dfc0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đề TOEIC, stiff thường đi với competition/penalty mang nghĩa gay gắt, nghiêm khắc.', 'business', 1, 28),
('9ed0e477-a0db-55bb-bb40-5b113e419cd2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '6326d28f-b036-5b76-ae44-9b94baa85139', '545dfc25-569f-52d0-9c1c-dc35ada8b8ea', 'privacy', '/ˈprɪvəsi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự riêng tư, quyền được giữ kín thông tin cá nhân.', 'the state of being free from public attention or having personal information kept secret.', 'Many people value their privacy and don\'t like sharing personal details online.', 'Nhiều người coi trọng sự riêng tư của mình và không thích chia sẻ thông tin cá nhân trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"Our company policy ensures the privacy of all employee records and personal contact information.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách công ty chúng tôi đảm bảo sự riêng tư cho tất cả hồ sơ nhân viên và thông tin liên lạc cá nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-ljspeech-96ed5c57.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-cori-96ed5c57.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/privacy-0d39425d.webp', '[\"secrecy\", \"confidentiality\"]', '[\"publicity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"privacy policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách bảo mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"protect privacy\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ sự riêng tư\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"private\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-cori-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru0-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru5-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru6-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru10-96ed5c57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru9-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru3-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru7-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru8-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-aru2-96ed5c57.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-ljspeech-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt408-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt138-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt624-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt396-96ed5c57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt498-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt132-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt288-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt42-96ed5c57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/privacy-lt90-96ed5c57.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong các văn bản về chính sách công nghệ và nhân sự.', 'office', 1, 29),
('b0c36c2c-7e27-50c6-b416-0f607e5b86ae', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '752e1bb3-8c68-5ab4-830c-9299f1cccd5b', 'c3878140-674f-5dd8-92c7-adee571863e9', 'fault', '/fɔːlt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lỗi lầm, khuyết điểm hoặc trách nhiệm về một điều gì đó sai trái.', 'Culpability or liability assigned to an individual for an error or failure.', 'It was his fault that we missed the train because he forgot the tickets.', 'Đó là lỗi của anh ấy mà chúng tôi lỡ chuyến tàu vì anh ấy quên vé.', '{\"en\": \"The technician fixed the system fault within thirty minutes after receiving the report.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã khắc phục lỗi hệ thống trong vòng ba mươi phút sau khi nhận được báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-ljspeech-586cbf6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-cori-586cbf6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fault-e1459bea.webp', '[\"mistake\", \"error\", \"defect\"]', '[\"strength\", \"merit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"technical fault\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi kỹ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at fault\", \"meaning\": \"có lỗi, chịu trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find fault with\", \"meaning\": \"chê bai, tìm lỗi ở\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"false\", \"note_vi\": \"fault là danh từ (lỗi lầm), false là tính từ (sai, giả).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"faulty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-cori-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru0-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru5-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru6-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru10-586cbf6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru9-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru3-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru7-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"