('7c59b812-6f0d-5eda-833b-b67f702d8c97', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '752e1bb3-8c68-5ab4-830c-9299f1cccd5b', 'c3878140-674f-5dd8-92c7-adee571863e9', 'assumption', 'UK: /əˈsʌmpʃən/ | US: /əˈsʌmpʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'giả định, giả thuyết', 'a belief or statement accepted as true without having proof or evidence to verify it', 'The assumption was that he would lead the team.', 'Giả định là anh ấy sẽ dẫn dắt đội.', '{\"en\": \"We based our financial projections on the assumption that sales will grow by 10%.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi dựa trên dự báo tài chính của mình với giả định rằng doanh số sẽ tăng 10%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-ljspeech-57763304.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-cori-57763304.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assumption-02f7789f.webp', '[\"presumption\", \"hypothesis\", \"supposition\", \"belief\"]', '[\"fact\", \"proof\", \"certainty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make an assumption\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra giả định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the assumption that\", \"meaning\": \"với giả định / cho rằng là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consumption\", \"note_vi\": \"sự tiêu thụ (hàng hóa, năng lượng), không liên quan tới giả định.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assume\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-cori-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru0-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru5-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru6-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru10-57763304.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru9-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru3-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru7-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru8-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru2-57763304.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-ljspeech-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt408-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt138-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt624-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt396-57763304.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt498-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt132-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt288-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt42-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt90-57763304.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi với cấu trúc \'make an assumption\' (đưa ra giả định) hoặc cụm giới từ \'on the assumption that\' (dựa trên giả định rằng).', 'business', 1, 7),
('4349a097-62b8-5d61-87d5-6dcda5143aa3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '752e1bb3-8c68-5ab4-830c-9299f1cccd5b', 'c3878140-674f-5dd8-92c7-adee571863e9', 'rid', '/rɪd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Loại bỏ, thoát khỏi cái gì đó không mong muốn.', 'to make someone or something free from an unwanted person or thing.', 'The department plans to get rid of outdated computer hardware next month.', 'Bộ phận có kế hoạch loại bỏ phần cứng máy tính đã cũ vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager plans to rid the office of old paper files by converting them to digital format.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý có kế hoạch loại bỏ các hồ sơ giấy cũ khỏi văn phòng bằng cách chuyển chúng sang định dạng kỹ thuật số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-ljspeech-a77018e2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-cori-a77018e2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rid-6469e9f9.webp', '[\"clear\", \"remove\", \"eliminate\"]', '[\"keep\", \"retain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get rid of\", \"meaning\": \"loại bỏ, tống khứ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rid oneself of\", \"meaning\": \"tự giải thoát khỏi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ride\", \"note_vi\": \"ride là đi xe/cưỡi, khác rid là loại bỏ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"riddance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-cori-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru0-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru5-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru6-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru10-a77018e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru9-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru3-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru7-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-aru8-a77018e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rid-a