('eae4a1bf-ef94-5182-8942-cff199818393', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '752e1bb3-8c68-5ab4-830c-9299f1cccd5b', 'c3878140-674f-5dd8-92c7-adee571863e9', 'struggle', '/ˈstrʌɡl̩/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nỗ lực hết sức để làm gì đó, thường là trong hoàn cảnh khó khăn.', 'to try very hard to do something despite facing great difficulty.', 'The newborn calf had to struggle for several minutes before standing firmly on its feet.', 'Chú bê mới sinh đã phải vật lộn trong vài phút trước khi đứng vững trên đôi chân của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The small firm had to struggle to meet the strict project deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nhỏ đã phải nỗ lực rất nhiều để kịp thời hạn dự án nghiêm ngặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-ljspeech-1972a0fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-cori-1972a0fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/struggle-65996016.webp', '[\"strive\", \"attempt\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"struggle to cope\", \"meaning\": \"chật vật đối phó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"struggle for survival\", \"meaning\": \"đấu tranh để sinh tồn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"struggle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-cori-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru0-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru5-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru6-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru10-1972a0fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru9-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru3-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru7-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru8-1972a0fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/struggle-aru2-1972a0fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"