('73ff21e6-00cc-5d5f-8cb8-b340f03e3476', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '752e1bb3-8c68-5ab4-830c-9299f1cccd5b', 'c3878140-674f-5dd8-92c7-adee571863e9', 'arms', '/ɑːmz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Các loại vũ khí dùng trong chiến tranh hoặc tự vệ.', 'weapons and military equipment used by soldiers or police for fighting or defence.', 'The country decided to reduce its spending on military arms.', 'Đất nước đã quyết định cắt giảm chi tiêu cho vũ khí quân sự.', '{\"en\": \"The international security company was ordered to restrict the sale of arms to illegal groups.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty an ninh quốc tế đã được yêu cầu hạn chế việc bán vũ khí cho các nhóm bất hợp pháp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-ljspeech-0dfa6acc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-cori-0dfa6acc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arms-73fb2ef7.webp', '[\"weapons\", \"armaments\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"arms trade\", \"meaning\": \"buôn bán vũ khí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arms control\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm soát vũ khí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"alms\", \"note_vi\": \"alms là tiền hoặc đồ bố thí; arms là vũ khí hoặc cánh tay.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"arm\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-cori-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru0-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru5-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru6-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru10-0dfa6acc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru9-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru3-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru7-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru8-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-aru2-0dfa6acc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-ljspeech-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt408-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt138-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt624-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt396-0dfa6acc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt498-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt132-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt288-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt42-0dfa6acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arms-lt90-0dfa6acc.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi ở dạng số nhiều \'arms\', từ này thường mang nghĩa là vũ khí thay vì cánh tay.', 'law', 1, 18),
('9cf5d40c-76a1-51f0-a84a-cabbf227598c', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '752e1bb3-8c68-5ab4-830c-9299f1cccd5b', 'c3878140-674f-5dd8-92c7-adee571863e9', 'structure', '/ˈstrʌktʃə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cách các bộ phận được sắp xếp hoặc xây dựng.', 'the way in which parts are arranged or put together to form something.', 'The executive team decided to reorganize the corporate structure to improve decision-making efficiency.', 'Ban điều hành đã quyết định tái cấu trúc doanh nghiệp nhằm cải thiện hiệu quả đưa ra quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"Our organization needs a clear structure to improve team communication.\", \"vi\": \"Tổ chức của chúng tôi cần một cơ cấu rõ ràng để cải thiện giao tiếp nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-ljspeech-2d309ce9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-cori-2d309ce9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/structure-9bd69e2b.webp', '[\"arrangement\", \"framework\", \"construction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"organizational structure\", \"meaning\": \"cơ cấu tổ chức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sentence structure\", \"meaning\": \"cấu trúc câu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"building structure\", \"meaning\": \"kết cấu tòa nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"infrastructure\", \"note_vi\": \"infrastructure là cơ sở hạ tầng, structure là cấu trúc chung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"structural\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"restructure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-cori-2d309ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-aru0-2d309ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-aru5-2d309ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-aru6-2d309ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-aru10-2d309ce9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structure-aru9-2d309ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro