('68a9784f-0d52-5e86-ac3a-104abdc84d64', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '75e76636-bdc9-5006-a712-93f2fe802470', 'ce030923-299a-577e-b68c-cc9468e77a94', 'intense', '/ɪnˈtɛns/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mãnh liệt, dữ dội, rất mạnh.', 'having a very strong effect or being done with a great amount of energy or force.', 'The heat from the desert sun was incredibly intense.', 'Cái nóng từ mặt trời sa mạc cực kỳ dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The intense competition in the market forced our company to lower its product prices.\", \"vi\": \"Sự cạnh tranh gay gắt trên thị trường đã buộc công ty chúng tôi phải hạ giá sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-ljspeech-e121ada1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-cori-e121ada1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intense-7147ed98.webp', '[\"extreme\", \"severe\"]', '[\"mild\", \"weak\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intense competition\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh tranh gay gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intense pressure\", \"meaning\": \"áp lực lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intensity\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intensify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-cori-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru0-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru5-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru6-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru10-e121ada1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru9-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru3-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru7-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru8-e121ada1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intense-aru2-e121ada1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/