('e2c7782b-a259-5d7a-ac73-d22d74c8a195', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '961c6053-5c01-5879-9c92-6a9e878dc464', '839210ac-bf23-53e8-a622-0d185259d9a5', 'ethical', '/ˈeθɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến các nguyên tắc đạo đức, đúng đắn về mặt đạo đức.', 'connected with beliefs about what is morally right or acceptable in human behavior.', 'It\'s important for businesses to operate in an ethical manner.', 'Điều quan trọng là các doanh nghiệp phải hoạt động theo cách có đạo đức.', '{\"en\": \"The corporation introduced new ethical guidelines to prevent bribery and financial dishonesty.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn đã đưa ra các hướng dẫn đạo đức mới nhằm ngăn chặn nạn hối lộ và gian lận tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-ljspeech-025e6dee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-cori-025e6dee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ethical-9c65cd71.webp', '[\"moral\", \"upright\", \"honorable\"]', '[\"unethical\", \"immoral\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ethical behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi đạo đức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ethical standards\", \"meaning\": \"các chuẩn mực đạo đức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ethical issues\", \"meaning\": \"các vấn đề đạo đức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ethnic\", \"note_vi\": \"ethnic thuộc về dân tộc/sắc tộc, khác với ethical là thuộc về đạo đức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ethics\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ethically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-cori-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru0-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru5-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru6-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru10-025e6dee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru9-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru3-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru7-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru8-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru2-025e6dee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-ljspeech-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt408-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt138-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt624-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt396-025e6dee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt498-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt132-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt288-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt42-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-lt90-025e6dee.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với ethnic (thuộc về dân tộc hoặc sắc tộc).', 'business', 1, 14),
('0d46a530-7e37-5f36-967a-994397d381e8', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '961c6053-5c01-5879-9c92-6a9e878dc464', '839210ac-bf23-53e8-a622-0d185259d9a5', 'curve', '/kɜːv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đường cong, đoạn uốn lượn.', 'a line that bends continuously and has no straight parts.', 'The road had a sharp curve, so drivers needed to slow down.', 'Con đường có một khúc cua gấp nên các tài xế cần giảm tốc độ.', '{\"en\": \"The chart shows a steep growth curve in company profits over the past four quarters.\", \"vi\": \"Biểu đồ cho thấy đường cong tăng trưởng mạnh mẽ của lợi nhuận công ty trong bốn quý qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-ljspeech-6792236d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-cori-6792236d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/curve-3c061f7a.webp', '[\"bend\", \"arch\"]', '[\"straight line\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"growth curve\", \"meaning\": \"đường cong tăng trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"learning curve\", \"meaning\": \"tiến trình học hỏi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"curved\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-cori-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru0-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru5-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru6-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru10-6792236d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru9-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru3-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru7-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru8-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-aru2-6792236d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curve-ljspeech-6792236d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi