('6fe40ead-83fe-5de6-829c-881fca068bd6', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '961c6053-5c01-5879-9c92-6a9e878dc464', '839210ac-bf23-53e8-a622-0d185259d9a5', 'feel', '/fiːl/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Cảm nhận một cảm xúc hoặc trạng thái thể chất.', 'to experience a particular physical sensation or emotional state through one\'s own senses or mind.', 'I sometimes feel tired after a long day at work.', 'Đôi khi tôi cảm thấy mệt mỏi sau một ngày làm việc dài.', '{\"en\": \"Employees often feel more motivated when they receive positive feedback from their direct supervisors.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thường cảm thấy có động lực hơn khi họ nhận được phản hồi tích cực từ cấp trên trực tiếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-ljspeech-ccfcd366.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-cori-ccfcd366.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feel-cb15f510.webp', '[\"experience\", \"sense\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"feel confident\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy tự tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel comfortable\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy thoải mái\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"feeling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-cori-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru0-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru5-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru6-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru10-ccfcd366.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru9-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru3-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru7-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru8-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-aru2-ccfcd366.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-ljspeech-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt408-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt138-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt624-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt396-ccfcd366.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt498-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt132-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt288-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt42-ccfcd366.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feel-lt90-ccfcd366.mp3\"]}}', 'Là động từ chỉ trạng thái, không dùng ở dạng tiếp diễn (feeling) khi nói về cảm xúc.', 'daily', 1, 20),
('0465c26d-39bf-542f-a385-0e396e7f92aa', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '961c6053-5c01-5879-9c92-6a9e878dc464', '839210ac-bf23-53e8-a622-0d185259d9a5', 'nightmare', '/ˈnaɪtmɛə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một giấc mơ đáng sợ hoặc một trải nghiệm tồi tệ.', 'a very frightening dream or a highly unpleasant event or situation.', 'The long flight delays turned our vacation into a complete nightmare.', 'Việc chuyến bay bị hoãn kéo dài đã biến kỳ nghỉ của chúng tôi thành một cơn ác mộng thực sự.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden system crash during the meeting was a total nightmare for the staff.\", \"vi\": \"Vụ sập hệ thống đột ngột trong cuộc họp là một cơn ác mộng thực sự với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-ljspeech-0ffa9326.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-cori-0ffa9326.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nightmare-301f3f58.webp', '[\"bad dream\", \"ordeal\", \"disaster\"]', '[\"pleasure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have a nightmare\", \"meaning\": \"gặp ác mộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nightmare scenario\", \"meaning\": \"kịch bản tồi tệ nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worst nightmare\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi ám ảnh tồi tệ nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"daydream\", \"note_vi\": \"là mơ mộng ban ngày, không phải ác mộng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"nightmarish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-cori-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru0-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru5-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru6-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru10-0ffa9326.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru9-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru3-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru7-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru8-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-aru2-0ffa9326.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-ljspeech-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt408-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt138-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt624-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt396-0ffa9326.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt498-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt132-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt288-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt42-0ffa9326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nightmare-lt90-0ffa9326.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận không tách \'nightmare\' thành \'night mare\' nghĩa là ngựa ban đêm.', 'daily', 1, 21),
('d719431c-0631-52b1-a8e1-86122655fa23', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '961c6053-5c01-5879-9c92-6a9e878dc464', '839210ac-bf23-53e8-a622-0d185259d9a5', 'handle', '/ˈhændl̩/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giải quyết, quản lý một tình huống hoặc nhiệm vụ.', 'to manage, deal with, or take responsibility for a situation.', 'She is very good at handling difficult customers.', 'Cô ấy rất giỏi trong việc xử lý những khách hàng khó tính.', '{\"en\": \"Our customer service department is trained to handle complaints in a professional manner.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận dịch vụ khách hàng của chúng tôi được đào tạo để xử lý các khiếu nại một cách chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-ljspeech-a2dd7ec6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-cori-a2dd7ec6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/handle-4ca8225e.webp', '[\"manage\", \"deal with\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"handle a problem\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle a situation\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý tình huống\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"handler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-cori-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru0-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru5-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru6-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru10-a2dd7ec6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru9-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru3-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru7-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru8-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru2-a2dd7ec6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-ljspeech-a2dd7e