('c31fe81a-d71d-5e91-a2df-c7b1a2e81b31', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'switch', '/swɪtʃ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để bật hoặc tắt dòng điện, thay đổi trạng thái.', 'a small device that starts or stops the flow of electricity.', 'Please remember to turn off the light switch when you leave the room.', 'Xin hãy nhớ tắt công tắc đèn khi bạn rời khỏi phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The technician replaced the faulty light switch in the conference room yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã thay thế công tắc đèn bị lỗi trong phòng họp ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-ljspeech-01ba7992.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-cori-01ba7992.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/switch-a6f5637f.webp', '[\"button\", \"control\", \"toggle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"light switch\", \"meaning\": \"công tắc đèn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flip a switch\", \"meaning\": \"bật/tắt công tắc nhanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"switch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-cori-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru0-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru5-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru6-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru10-01ba7992.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru9-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru3-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru7-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru8-01ba7992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-aru2-01ba7992.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-ljspeech-01ba7992.mp3\",