('385cfa45-9a80-5032-8001-0e1764ccda16', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'curved', '/kɜːvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng cong, không thẳng.', 'having a rounded shape that is not straight or flat.', 'The artist created a beautiful sculpture with curved lines.', 'Nghệ sĩ đã tạo ra một tác phẩm điêu khắc đẹp với những đường cong.', '{\"en\": \"The modern conference hall features curved walls and custom ergonomic seating for visitors.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng hội nghị hiện đại có các bức tường cong và chỗ ngồi công thái học tùy chỉnh cho khách tham quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-ljspeech-33d59279.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-cori-33d59279.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/curved-d0b72f86.webp', '[\"bent\", \"arched\", \"rounded\"]', '[\"straight\", \"flat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"curved surface\", \"meaning\": \"bề mặt cong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"curved line\", \"meaning\": \"đường cong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"curved screen\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình cong\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"carved\", \"note_vi\": \"Carved là được chạm khắc, khác với curved là cong.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"curve\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"curve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-cori-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru0-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru5-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru6-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru10-33d59279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru9-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru3-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru7-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru8-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru2-33d59279.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-ljspeech-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt408-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt138-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt624-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt396-33d59279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt498-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt132-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt288-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt42-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt90-33d59279.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ là curve (làm cong), danh từ là curve (đường cong).', 'housing', 1, 8),
('9f1fc331-9e65-5643-96a7-c2962e738ec1', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'shame', '/ʃeɪm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Điều đáng tiếc hoặc cảm giác xấu hổ.', 'a situation that is disappointing or unfortunate and should have been better.', 'It\'s a real shame that you couldn\'t join us for the party.', 'Thật đáng tiếc là bạn không thể tham gia bữa tiệc cùng chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"It is a shame that the conference was cancelled due to the unexpected weather conditions today.\", \"vi\": \"Thật đáng tiếc khi hội nghị đã bị hủy do điều kiện thời tiết bất ngờ hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-ljspeech-d4ef5822.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-cori-d4ef5822.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shame-ee53eb1f.webp', '[\"pity\", \"disappointment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a crying shame\", \"meaning\": \"một điều rất đáng tiếc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"what a shame\", \"meaning\": \"thật đáng tiếc quá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shameful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-cori-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru0-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru5-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru6-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru10-d4ef5822.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru9-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru3-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru7-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru8-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru2-d4ef5822.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-ljspeech-d4ef5822.mp3