('8baecce7-a932-5c5d-a459-0d92aa4243b5', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'rapid', '/ˈræpɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Diễn ra hoặc xảy ra với tốc độ rất nhanh.', 'happening or moving with very great speed in a short time.', 'Online technology has led to rapid changes in modern business practices.', 'Công nghệ trực tuyến đã dẫn đến những thay đổi nhanh chóng trong các phương thức kinh doanh hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"We need rapid delivery to satisfy the urgent customer order.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần giao hàng nhanh để thỏa mãn đơn đặt hàng khẩn cấp của khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-ljspeech-dc94ac81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-cori-dc94ac81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rapid-4c545fc8.webp', '[\"fast\", \"quick\", \"swift\"]', '[\"slow\", \"gradual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rapid growth\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rapid change\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rapid response\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi nhanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rabid\", \"note_vi\": \"rabid nghĩa là cuồng nhiệt hoặc dại, rapid là nhanh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"rapidly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rapidity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-cori-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru0-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru5-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru6-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru10-dc94ac81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru9-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru3-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru7-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru8-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru2-dc94ac81.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-ljspeech-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt408-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt138-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt624-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt396-dc94ac81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt498-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt132-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt288-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt42-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt90-dc94ac81.mp3\"]}}', 'Rapid là tính từ, dùng rapidly cho trạng từ chỉ tốc độ nhanh.', 'business', 1, 13),
('7f75b241-0088-5649-b5a7-79d44c4e7ca6', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'value', '/ˈvæljuː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tầm quan trọng hoặc ý nghĩa của một thứ gì đó.', 'the importance, usefulness, or worth of something to a person or organization.', 'She places a high value on honesty and integrity in her friends.', 'Cô ấy rất coi trọng sự trung thực và chính trực ở bạn bè mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our company places high value on delivering quality customer service to every client.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đánh giá cao việc mang lại dịch vụ khách hàng chất lượng cho mọi đối tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-ljspeech-f32b67c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-cori-f32b67c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/value-bc965da7.webp', '[\"worth\", \"importance\", \"significance\"]', '[\"worthlessness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"place value on\", \"meaning\": \"coi trọng cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market value\", \"meaning\": \"giá trị thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"value\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"valuable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"invaluable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-cori-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru0-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru5-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru6-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru10-f32b67c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru9-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru3-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru7-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru8-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-aru2-f32b67c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-ljspeech-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt408-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt138-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt624-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt396-f32b67c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt498-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt132-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt288-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt42-f32b67c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/value-lt90-f32b67c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Valuable (có giá trị) khác với invaluable (cực kỳ quý giá/vô giá).', 'business', 1, 14),
('7bc4685e-90fc-5a85-91aa-a9af072e5ca5', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'suspect', '/səˈspekt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nghi ngờ, cho rằng điều gì đó có thể đúng.', 'to believe or feel that something is likely to be true.', 'I suspect he knows more about the incident than he\'s letting on.', 'Tôi nghi ngờ anh ấy biết nhiều về vụ việc hơn những gì anh ấy nói ra.', '{\"en\": \"The manager tends to suspect that the delay was caused by technical errors.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý có xu hướng nghi ngờ rằng sự chậm trễ là do lỗi kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-ljspeech-358bf3e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-cori-358bf3e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suspect-39225095.webp', '[\"believe\", \"assume\", \"guess\"]', '[\"trust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"suspect that\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly suspect\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"doubt\", \"note_vi\": \"Doubt là nghi ngờ không tin, suspect là nghi ngờ có khả năng xảy ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suspect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suspicious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suspicion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-cori-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru0-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru5-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru6-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru10-358bf3e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru9-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru3-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru7-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru8-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru2-358bf3e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-ljspeech-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt408-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt138-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt624-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt396-358bf3e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt498-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt132-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt288-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt42-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt90-358bf3e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với doubt: suspect nghi ngờ điều đó ĐÚNG, doubt nghi ngờ điều đó SAI.', 'office', 1, 15),
('b010a5c3-606c-5d27-bc44-7aa1dc827ce3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'vital', '/ˈvaɪtəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cực kỳ quan trọng hoặc cần thiết cho sự sống, sự thành công.', 'extremely important or necessary for the success, existence, or health of something.', 'Regular exercise is vital for maintaining good health and energy levels.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên là điều thiết yếu để duy trì sức khỏe tốt và mức năng lượng.', '{\"en\": \"Clear communication is vital for maintaining effective teamwork during large corporate projects.\", \"vi\": \"Giao tiếp rõ ràng là cực kỳ quan trọng để duy trì làm việc nhóm hiệu quả trong các dự án lớn của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-ljspeech-17cb65e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-cori-17cb65e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vital-dfc80864.webp', '[\"essential\", \"crucial\", \"critical\"]', '[\"unimportant\", \"trivial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vital role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò thiết yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vital component\", \"meaning\": \"thành phần thiết yếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vitality\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vitally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-cori-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru0-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru5-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru6-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru10-17cb65e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru9-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru3-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru7-17cb65e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vital-aru8-17c