('9c701f18-829e-5328-8ef6-ee3d76fbca1b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'advance', '/ədˈvɑːns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tiến lên, sự phát triển hoặc tiến bộ.', 'a development or improvement that helps something progress or become more successful.', 'Medical advances have significantly improved life expectancy.', 'Những tiến bộ y học đã cải thiện đáng kể tuổi thọ.', '{\"en\": \"The latest technological advance in software allows our team to process data much faster now.\", \"vi\": \"Tiến bộ công nghệ mới nhất trong phần mềm cho phép nhóm chúng tôi xử lý dữ liệu nhanh hơn nhiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-ljspeech-6ef7c4c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-cori-6ef7c4c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advance-2e2e05e4.webp', '[\"progress\", \"breakthrough\"]', '[\"setback\", \"delay\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"technological advance\", \"meaning\": \"tiến bộ công nghệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make an advance\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được sự tiến bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"advantage\", \"note_vi\": \"advantage là lợi thế, advance là sự tiến bộ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"advanced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-cori-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru0-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru5-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru6-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru10-6ef7c4c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru9-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru3-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru7-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advance-aru8-6ef7c4c1.mp3\", \