('6209100b-c709-561b-9141-3d4f022718cf', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'rush', '/rʌʃ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Di chuyển hoặc làm việc nhanh chóng.', 'to move or do something with great speed, often because you do not have much time.', 'We had to rush to catch the last train.', 'Chúng tôi phải vội vã để kịp chuyến tàu cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"Do not rush the report, as we need all the financial figures to be completely accurate.\", \"vi\": \"Đừng vội vàng làm báo cáo, vì chúng ta cần tất cả số liệu tài chính phải hoàn toàn chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-ljspeech-6572e9cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-cori-6572e9cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rush-99b042d1.webp', '[\"hurry\", \"hasten\", \"speed\"]', '[\"delay\", \"linger\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rush to do something\", \"meaning\": \"vội vã làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rush hour\", \"meaning\": \"giờ cao điểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brush\", \"note_vi\": \"brush là chải/quét, rush là vội vã.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rush\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-cori-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru0-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru5-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru6-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru10-6572e9cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru9-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru3-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru7-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru8-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-aru2-6572e9cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-ljspeech-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt408-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt138-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt624-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt396-6572e9cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt498-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt132-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt288-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt42-6572e9cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rush-lt90-6572e9cf.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'rush hour\' (giờ cao điểm) là một từ ghép cực kỳ phổ biến.', 'office', 1, 28),
('bb08ad69-aac3-5ab4-ac24-68e4b597b60f', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', '9b33e871-492b-5ee3-af78-56c898d0254e', '79d19ef5-038b-5d8c-8167-4af2a8f331c2', 'ensure', '/ɪnˈʃʊə/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Làm cho điều gì đó chắc chắn sẽ xảy ra.', 'to take action so that something is sure to occur.', 'Please ensure that all doors are locked before you leave the building.', 'Làm ơn đảm bảo rằng tất cả các cửa đều đã được khóa trước khi bạn rời khỏi tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"We must ensure the shipment arrives before the deadline next Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta phải đảm bảo lô hàng đến trước hạn chót vào thứ Sáu tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-ljspeech-03503cd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-cori-03503cd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ensure-8a53bf66.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"secure\", \"assure\"]', '[\"jeopardize\", \"risk\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ensure quality\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure safety\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure success\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insure\", \"note_vi\": \"insure là bảo hiểm, ensure là đảm bảo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"surely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-cori-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru0-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru5-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru6-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru10-03503cd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru9-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru3-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru7-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati