('d0ba0dcf-0249-5cc6-ac4e-7a94dddc357f', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'a29ae110-c6ff-5064-973b-52de609618e7', 'f8f4efd3-6651-5a9e-aa1a-f6f1ff72c975', 'aisle', 'UK: /aɪl/ | US: /aɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lối đi giữa các hàng kệ', 'a narrow passage between rows of shelves, seats, or display units in a store.', 'You can find rice in aisle three.', 'Bạn có thể tìm thấy gạo ở lối đi thứ ba.', '{\"en\": \"The flight attendant asked passengers to keep their luggage out of the aisle during takeoff.\", \"vi\": \"Tiếp viên hàng không đã yêu cầu hành khách để hành lý tránh xa lối đi trong lúc cất cánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-ljspeech-58791057.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-cori-58791057.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aisle-ec95a1ad.webp', '[\"passageway\", \"gangway\", \"corridor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"aisle seat\", \"meaning\": \"ghế ngồi cạnh lối đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supermarket aisle\", \"meaning\": \"lối đi giữa các gian hàng siêu thị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"isle\", \"note_vi\": \"hòn đảo nhỏ (cũng phát âm là /aɪl/)\"}, {\"word\": \"alley\", \"note_vi\": \"hẻm, ngõ ngách giữa các tòa nhà\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-cori-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru0-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru5-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru6-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru10-58791057.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru9-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru3-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru7-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru8-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-aru2-58791057.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-ljspeech-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt408-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt138-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt624-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt396-58791057.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt498-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt132-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt288-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt42-58791057.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aisle-lt90-58791057.mp3\"]}}', 'Âm \'s\' trong \'aisle\' là âm câm, đọc là /aɪl/ (giống từ \'I\'ll\').', 'travel', 1, 1),
('aee5e716-5069-57f7-9888-a9df1fa3d105', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'a29ae110-c6ff-5064-973b-52de609618e7', 'f8f4efd3-6651-5a9e-aa1a-f6f1ff72c975', 'hold', '/həʊld/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Giữ hoặc nắm chặt một vật gì đó bằng tay.', 'to keep something in your hand or arms, or to support it in a position.', 'Can you please hold this bag for a moment?', 'Bạn có thể cầm giúp tôi cái túi này một lát được không?', '{\"en\": \"The manager will hold a meeting to discuss the quarterly budget with all department heads.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ tổ chức một cuộc họp để thảo luận về ngân sách quý với tất cả trưởng bộ phận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-ljspeech-43c88f6f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-cori-43c88f6f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hold-27c1dcf3.webp', '[\"grasp\", \"clutch\"]', '[\"release\", \"drop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hold a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức một cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold a position\", \"meaning\": \"giữ một vị trí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"holder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-cori-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru0-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru5-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru6-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru10-43c88f6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru9-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru3-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru7-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru8-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-aru2-43c88f6f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-ljspeech-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt408-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt138-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt624-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt396-43c88f6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt498-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt132-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt288-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt42-43c88f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hold-lt90-43c88f6f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'hold a meeting\' là cụm từ cực kỳ phổ biến.', 'office', 1, 2),
('0aa69612-68d5-534e-a080-21b8fb729742', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'a29ae110-c6ff-5064-973b-52de609618e7', 'f8f4efd3-6651-5a9e-aa1a-f6f1ff72c975', 'oppose', '/əˈpəʊz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Không đồng tình, chống lại một ý kiến hoặc hành động.', 'to disagree strongly with a plan or idea and try to prevent it from happening.', 'Several board members strongly oppose the plan to merge with another firm.', 'Một số thành viên hội đồng quản trị phản đối mạnh mẽ kế hoạch sáp nhập với một công ty khác.', '{\"en\": \"Several board members decided to oppose the merger during the annual general meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Một vài thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã quyết định phản đối vụ sáp nhập trong cuộc họp thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-ljspeech-35a522e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-cori-35a522e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oppose-5a54776b.webp', '[\"resist\", \"object\"]', '[\"support\", \"approve\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly oppose\", \"meaning\": \"kịch liệt phản đối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"opposition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-cori-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru0-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru5-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru6-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru10-35a522e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru9-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru3-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru7-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru8-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-aru2-35a522e9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-ljspeech-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt408-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt138-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt624-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt396-35a522e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt498-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt132-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt288-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt42-35a522e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oppose-lt90-35a522e9.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi bạn muốn bày tỏ sự không đồng tình trong công việc.', 'business', 1, 3),
('5f21c430-0c5b-5868-8a3e-a9d1a2791b3c', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'a29ae110-c6ff-5064-973b-52de609618e7', 'f8f4efd3-6651-5a9e-aa1a-f6f1ff72c975', 'reasonable', '/ˈriːzənəbəl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có lý, công bằng, không quá đắt hoặc cực đoan.', 'fair, practical, and sensible, or not costing too much money.', 'The price for the new apartment seemed quite reasonable given its location.', 'Giá của căn hộ mới có vẻ khá hợp lý xét theo vị trí của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers high-quality services at a very reasonable price for business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp dịch vụ chất lượng cao với giá cả rất hợp lý cho khách đi công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-ljspeech-759cc80a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-cori-759cc80a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reasonable-43c26cf0.webp', '[\"fair\", \"sensible\", \"affordable\"]', '[\"unreasonable\", \"expensive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reasonable price\", \"meaning\": \"giá cả hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reasonable doubt\", \"meaning\": \"sự nghi ngờ hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reasonable demand\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu hợp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"affordable\", \"note_vi\": \"affordable nhấn mạnh giá rẻ, reasonable nhấn mạnh sự hợp lý, vừa phải\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reason\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"reasonably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-cori-759cc80a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-aru0-759cc80a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-aru5-759cc80a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-aru6-759cc80a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-aru10-759cc80a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonable-aru9-759cc80a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rea