('1083ba5b-88dc-58db-9f48-a50a40284e03', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'a29ae110-c6ff-5064-973b-52de609618e7', 'f8f4efd3-6651-5a9e-aa1a-f6f1ff72c975', 'inch', '/ɪntʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo chiều dài bằng 2.54 cm.', 'a unit for measuring length, equal to two point five four centimeters.', 'The snow fell an inch overnight, just enough to cover the ground.', 'Tuyết rơi một inch qua đêm, vừa đủ để phủ kín mặt đất.', '{\"en\": \"The new office desks are just one inch wider than the old ones.\", \"vi\": \"Những chiếc bàn văn phòng mới chỉ rộng hơn những chiếc bàn cũ một inch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-ljspeech-02bbb02e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-cori-02bbb02e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inch-c4bbe3d8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"by an inch\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ một chút xíu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"every inch\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn, mọi phần\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"inch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-cori-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru0-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru5-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru6-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru10-02bbb02e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru9-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru3-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru7-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru8-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-aru2-02bbb02e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-ljspeech-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inch-lt408-02bbb02e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation