('96f7bce1-7204-5c1d-90e4-3c3db34b2512', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'ab4d0e07-9e25-50bd-8a99-4c5b283fc949', '6ea548eb-d539-591c-a873-4ce148f54bd8', 'expense', '/ɪkˈspens/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Số tiền phải chi trả cho một việc gì đó.', 'the amount of money needed or spent to buy or do something.', 'Travel expenses for the business trip will be reimbursed by the company.', 'Chi phí đi lại cho chuyến công tác sẽ được công ty hoàn trả.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must submit all travel expense receipts to the finance department by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải nộp tất cả hóa đơn chi phí đi lại cho bộ phận tài chính trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-ljspeech-3a85e310.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-cori-3a85e310.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expense-0979c291.webp', '[\"cost\", \"expenditure\", \"outlay\"]', '[\"income\", \"revenue\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"travel expense\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí đi lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business expense\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at the expense of\", \"meaning\": \"phải trả giá bằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expand\", \"note_vi\": \"expand nghĩa là mở rộng, phát triển kích thước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"expensive\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-cori-3a85e310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru0-3a85e310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru5-3a85e310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru6-3a85e310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru10-3a85e310.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru9-3a85e310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru3-3a85e310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expense-aru7