('b23668a5-ba1e-5fa1-a165-1f59390e390f', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'ad2dee82-7a13-515b-a6e4-08775346f07b', 'a66277b5-341d-5d9a-b764-39fabd358b68', 'debt', '/det/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khoản tiền hoặc nghĩa vụ mà một người hoặc tổ chức phải trả cho người khác.', 'an amount of money that you owe to a person or bank.', 'Many small businesses accumulated heavy debt during the economic downturn.', 'Nhiều doanh nghiệp nhỏ đã tích tụ khoản nợ lớn trong thời kỳ suy thoái kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"The company managed to pay off its outstanding debt before the fiscal year ended.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã xoay xở trả hết khoản nợ tồn đọng trước khi năm tài chính kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-ljspeech-e52ec7a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-cori-e52ec7a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/debt-57f2caed.webp', '[\"liability\", \"obligation\", \"arrears\"]', '[\"asset\", \"credit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pay off a debt\", \"meaning\": \"trả hết nợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"run up debts\", \"meaning\": \"tích tụ nợ nần\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"debtor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-cori-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru0-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru5-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru6-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru10-e52ec7a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru9-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru3-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru7-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru8-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-aru2-e52ec7a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-ljspeech-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt408-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt138-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt624-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt396-e52ec7a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt498-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt132-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt288-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt42-e52ec7a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debt-lt90-e52ec7a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Âm \'b\' trong \'debt\' là âm câm, phát âm là /det/.', 'finance', 1, 1),
('d95933cf-9d6f-56fa-9527-0c61242509ed', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'ad2dee82-7a13-515b-a6e4-08775346f07b', 'a66277b5-341d-5d9a-b764-39fabd358b68', 'delighted', '/dɪˈlaɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất vui sướng hoặc hài lòng.', 'feeling or showing great pleasure, happiness, or satisfaction about something good.', 'We were absolutely delighted to hear the good news about your promotion.', 'Chúng tôi vô cùng vui mừng khi nghe tin tốt về việc bạn được thăng chức.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was delighted to accept the award on behalf of the team.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng rất vui mừng khi nhận giải thưởng thay mặt cho cả nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-ljspeech-17d0ecd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-cori-17d0ecd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delighted-6bd2596d.webp', '[\"pleased\", \"thrilled\", \"joyful\"]', '[\"disappointed\", \"unhappy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delighted to hear\", \"meaning\": \"rất vui khi nghe thấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delighted with\", \"meaning\": \"hài lòng với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"delicate\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nghĩa: delicate nghĩa là mỏng manh, tinh tế, nhạy cảm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delight\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"delightful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-cori-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru0-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru5-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru6-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru10-17d0ecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru9-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru3-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru7-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru8-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru2-17d0ecd7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-ljspeech-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt408-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt138-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt624-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt396-17d0ecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt498-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt132-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt288-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt42-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt90-17d0ecd7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm cấu trúc: delighted to do something hoặc delighted with/by something.', 'office', 1, 2),
('04d76e6f-bf1c-5578-965a-a61b2b52dfee', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'ad2dee82-7a13-515b-a6e4-08775346f07b', 'a66277b5-341d-5d9a-b764-39fabd358b68', 'phase', '/feɪz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một giai đoạn hoặc thời kỳ riêng biệt trong một quá trình phát triển.', 'a specific step or part of a longer process that happens over a period of time.', 'The construction of the new bridge is now in its final phase.', 'Việc xây dựng cây cầu mới hiện đang ở giai đoạn cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The project is currently in the planning phase, and we expect to start production next month.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án hiện đang trong giai đoạn lập kế hoạch và chúng tôi dự kiến bắt đầu sản xuất vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-ljspeech-fe77c82b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-cori-fe77c82b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/phase-252118a1.webp', '[\"stage\", \"step\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"initial phase\", \"meaning\": \"giai đoạn đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final phase\", \"meaning\": \"giai đoạn cuối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"faze\", \"note_vi\": \"faze là làm bối rối, phase là giai đoạn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-cori-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru0-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru5-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru6-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru10-fe77c82b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru9-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru3-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru7-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru8-fe77c82b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phase-aru2-fe77c82b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/obje