('709ea1c9-ccf5-50d8-b68e-db45322afecc', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'aefff331-dcf2-5945-99d0-87ca3b33511e', 'f095cddf-5e5d-5824-a989-cbbbc394e27a', 'brief', '/briːf/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Ngắn gọn, không kéo dài.', 'lasting for only a short period of time or using very few words to explain.', 'Please keep your presentation brief, as we only have 15 minutes.', 'Xin hãy giữ bài thuyết trình của bạn ngắn gọn, vì chúng ta chỉ có 15 phút.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a brief summary of the project goals before starting the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa ra bản tóm tắt ngắn gọn về các mục tiêu dự án trước khi bắt đầu cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-ljspeech-57c8ddb0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-cori-57c8ddb0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brief-55756ee3.webp', '[\"short\", \"concise\"]', '[\"long\", \"lengthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"brief meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp ngắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brief summary\", \"meaning\": \"bản tóm tắt ngắn gọn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"briefly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-cori-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru0-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru5-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru6-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru10-57c8ddb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru9-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru3-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru7-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru8-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-aru2-57c8ddb0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-ljspeech-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt408-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt138-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt624-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt396-57c8ddb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt498-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt132-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt288-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt42-57c8ddb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brief-lt90-57c8ddb0.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi sự súc tích trong giao tiếp công việc.', 'office', 1, 4),
('d26489c1-c33f-564f-9cfd-10255230808f', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'aefff331-dcf2-5945-99d0-87ca3b33511e', 'f095cddf-5e5d-5824-a989-cbbbc394e27a', 'loan', '/ləʊn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khoản vay, tiền vay.', 'an amount of money that is borrowed, often from a bank, and has to be paid back.', 'She took out a bank loan to buy a new car.', 'Cô ấy đã vay tiền ngân hàng để mua một chiếc ô tô mới.', '{\"en\": \"The small business applied for a bank loan to expand its manufacturing facility.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh nghiệp nhỏ đã nộp đơn xin vay ngân hàng để mở rộng cơ sở sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-ljspeech-5826e374.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-cori-5826e374.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/loan-b0025c35.webp', '[\"debt\", \"credit\", \"advance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply for a loan\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn xin vay vốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pay back a loan\", \"meaning\": \"trả nợ khoản vay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"secure a loan\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo một khoản vay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"borrow\", \"note_vi\": \"borrow là động từ mượn, còn loan là danh từ khoản vay.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"loan\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-cori-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru0-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru5-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru6-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru10-5826e374.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru9-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru3-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru7-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru8-5826e374.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loan-aru2-5826e374.mp3\"]}, \"