('fda1d1e2-ef90-5125-adc7-163faf9a6bf0', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'aefff331-dcf2-5945-99d0-87ca3b33511e', 'f095cddf-5e5d-5824-a989-cbbbc394e27a', 'deliberate', '/dɪˈlɪbərət/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Được thực hiện một cách có chủ đích, có suy nghĩ kỹ lưỡng.', 'done or said in a planned way, often with the intention of causing a specific effect.', 'His silence was deliberate, meant to make them uncomfortable.', 'Sự im lặng của anh ấy là có chủ đích, nhằm khiến họ khó chịu.', '{\"en\": \"The delay in the shipment was a deliberate choice to ensure the quality of products.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ trong lô hàng là một quyết định có chủ đích để đảm bảo chất lượng sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-ljspeech-3c513544.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-cori-3c513544.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deliberate-a6a3457d.webp', '[\"intentional\", \"planned\"]', '[\"accidental\", \"unintentional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deliberate attempt\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực có chủ đích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deliberate action\", \"meaning\": \"hành động có tính toán\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"deliberately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-cori-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru0-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru5-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru6-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru10-3c513544.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru9-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru3-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru7-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberate-aru8-3c513544.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec