('94e71efb-e766-5484-98ab-a0936e10cbe1', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'concept', '/ˈkɒn.sept/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một ý tưởng hoặc nguyên tắc trừu tượng.', 'an abstract idea or general principle that explains something in mind.', 'The concept of time travel fascinates many people, even though it\'s still science fiction.', 'Khái niệm du hành thời gian làm nhiều người mê mẩn, dù nó vẫn chỉ là khoa học viễn tưởng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team presented a new concept for the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã trình bày một ý tưởng mới cho việc ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-ljspeech-49376c9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-cori-49376c9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concept-ce52f508.webp', '[\"idea\", \"notion\", \"principle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"basic concept\", \"meaning\": \"khái niệm cơ bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"concept map\", \"meaning\": \"sơ đồ khái niệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"new concept\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng mới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conception\", \"note_vi\": \"conception là sự thụ thai hoặc hình thành ý tưởng, concept là ý tưởng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conceptual\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conceptualize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-cori-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru0-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru5-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru6-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru10-49376c9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru9-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru3-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru7-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru8-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-aru2-49376c9c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-ljspeech-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt408-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt138-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt624-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt396-49376c9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt498-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt132-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt288-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt42-49376c9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concept-lt90-49376c9c.mp3\"]}}', 'Concept là danh từ đếm được, thường đi với giới từ of.', 'marketing', 1, 4),
('06545709-81a7-5823-a5d1-d25b8a22e691', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'intended', '/ɪnˈtendɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Được lên kế hoạch hoặc có ý định làm gì đó.', 'planned or designed to be used for a specific purpose or person.', 'The package was intended for you, not for me.', 'Gói hàng này là dành cho bạn, không phải cho tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The intended audience for this training seminar is the new staff in the accounting department.\", \"vi\": \"Đối tượng mục tiêu cho buổi hội thảo đào tạo này là nhân viên mới trong phòng kế toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-ljspeech-003353af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-cori-003353af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intended-f00d2f00.webp', '[\"planned\", \"meant\"]', '[\"unintended\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intended purpose\", \"meaning\": \"mục đích dự định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intended audience\", \"meaning\": \"đối tượng mục tiêu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intention\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-cori-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru0-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru5-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru6-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru10-003353af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru9-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru3-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru7-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru8-003353af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intended-aru2-003353af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\