('5683ae81-414a-5415-8859-7643faa0ab41', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'cancel', '/ˈkænsəl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Hủy bỏ hoặc đình chỉ một sự kiện, kế hoạch hoặc đơn đặt hàng.', 'to decide that an organized event, plan, or order will not happen.', 'They decided to cancel the picnic due to the heavy rain.', 'Họ quyết định hủy buổi dã ngoại vì trời mưa lớn.', '{\"en\": \"Due to bad weather conditions, the airline had to cancel all outdoor events today.\", \"vi\": \"Do thời tiết xấu, hãng hàng không đã phải hủy tất cả các sự kiện ngoài trời hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-ljspeech-4fd0653c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-cori-4fd0653c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cancel-f8e61ee9.webp', '[\"call off\", \"annul\", \"abort\"]', '[\"confirm\", \"schedule\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cancel an order\", \"meaning\": \"hủy đơn hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cancel a reservation\", \"meaning\": \"hủy đặt chỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cancel a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"hủy cuộc họp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conceal\", \"note_vi\": \"Conceal nghĩa là che giấu, khác với cancel là hủy bỏ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cancellation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-cori-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru0-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru5-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru6-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru10-4fd0653c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru9-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru3-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru7-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru8-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-aru2-4fd0653c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-ljspeech-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt408-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt138-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt624-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt396-4fd0653c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt498-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt132-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt288-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt42-4fd0653c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cancel-lt90-4fd0653c.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ là cancellation (sự hủy bỏ). Đồng nghĩa phổ biến là cụm động từ call off.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('233fad15-f197-5fbf-9ba7-3faa8af29afa', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'caterer', 'UK: /ˈkeɪtərər/ | US: /ˈkeɪtərər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người cung cấp thực phẩm và dịch vụ ăn uống', 'a person or business hired to provide meals and beverages for an event', 'The caterer will provide lunch for the conference.', 'Người cung cấp dịch vụ ăn uống sẽ cung cấp bữa trưa cho hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"The caterer arrived two hours before the reception to set up the buffet tables.\", \"vi\": \"Đơn vị cung cấp tiệc đã đến trước buổi tiệc hai giờ để chuẩn bị các bàn ăn tự chọn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-ljspeech-ef443552.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-cori-ef443552.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/caterer-6079b5a1.webp', '[\"provider\", \"supplier\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local caterer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà cung cấp dịch vụ tiệc địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hire a caterer\", \"meaning\": \"thuê đơn vị phục vụ tiệc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cater\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"catering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-cori-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru0-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru5-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru6-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru10-ef443552.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru9-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru3-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru7-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru8-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-aru2-ef443552.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-ljspeech-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt408-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt138-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt624-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt396-ef443552.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt498-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt132-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt288-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt42-ef443552.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/caterer-lt90-ef443552.mp3\"]}}', '\'Caterer\' chỉ cá nhân hoặc nhà thầu chuyên nghiệp đảm nhận việc chuẩn bị đồ ăn thức uống cho các buổi tiệc/hội nghị.', 'entertainment', 1, 7),
('47667a8e-8b40-5f2f-a330-923e79b10077', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'launch', '/lɔːntʃ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Bắt đầu một dự án, sản phẩm hoặc hoạt động mới.', 'to introduce a new product or service to the market for the first time.', 'Our marketing team will launch an aggressive advertising campaign early next week.', 'Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi sẽ ra mắt một chiến dịch quảng cáo rầm rộ vào đầu tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team will launch a new advertising campaign to attract more potential customers soon.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi sẽ triển khai một chiến dịch quảng cáo mới để thu hút thêm khách hàng tiềm năng sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-ljspeech-f7c91fef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-cori-f7c91fef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/launch-005e7086.webp', '[\"introduce\", \"release\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"launch a product\", \"meaning\": \"ra mắt sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"launch a campaign\", \"meaning\": \"triển khai chiến dịch\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"launch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-cori-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru0-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru5-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru6-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru10-f7c91fef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru9-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru3-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru7-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru8-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru2-f7c9