('827890fa-8c05-51be-b585-f85faaf96699', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'agenda', '/əˈdʒendə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Danh sách các vấn đề cần thảo luận tại một cuộc họp.', 'a list of matters or topics to be discussed at a formal meeting.', 'We have a full agenda for today\'s meeting, so let\'s start.', 'Chúng ta có một chương trình nghị sự đầy đủ cho cuộc họp hôm nay, vậy hãy bắt đầu.', '{\"en\": \"The manager distributed the revised agenda to all attendees before the strategy meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã phát chương trình nghị sự đã sửa đổi cho tất cả người tham dự trước cuộc họp chiến lược.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-ljspeech-dafd5013.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-cori-dafd5013.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agenda-68e6a0e0.webp', '[\"schedule\", \"program\", \"timetable\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"meeting agenda\", \"meaning\": \"chương trình cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the agenda\", \"meaning\": \"có trong chương trình nghị sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hidden agenda\", \"meaning\": \"ý đồ ẩn giấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"agent\", \"note_vi\": \"agent nghĩa là đại lý, tác nhân hoặc người đại diện.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-cori-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru0-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru5-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru6-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru10-dafd5013.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru9-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru3-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru7-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru8-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-aru2-dafd5013.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-ljspeech-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt408-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt138-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt624-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt396-dafd5013.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt498-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt132-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt288-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt42-dafd5013.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agenda-lt90-dafd5013.mp3\"]}}', 'Agenda là danh từ đếm được, thường dùng trong cụm \'on the agenda\'.', 'office', 1, 9),
('abf650e8-9a31-557c-a5c1-57cbc84367e9', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'expose', '/ɪkˈspəʊz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Để lộ ra, phơi bày một điều gì đó.', 'to show something that was hidden or make something public that was secret before.', 'The investigation helped to expose the truth behind the scandal.', 'Cuộc điều tra đã giúp phơi bày sự thật đằng sau vụ bê bối.', '{\"en\": \"The audit revealed security errors that could expose customer details to unauthorized users.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc kiểm toán đã tiết lộ các lỗi bảo mật có thể làm lộ thông tin khách hàng cho người dùng không được cấp phép.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-ljspeech-0d23a9d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-cori-0d23a9d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expose-419a0852.webp', '[\"reveal\", \"uncover\", \"disclose\"]', '[\"cover\", \"hide\", \"protect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expose to risk\", \"meaning\": \"đặt vào nguy cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expose a secret\", \"meaning\": \"làm lộ bí mật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"impose\", \"note_vi\": \"impose nghĩa là áp đặt (luật lệ, thuế...).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exposure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-cori-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru0-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru5-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru6-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru10-0d23a9d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru9-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru3-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru7-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru8-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-aru2-0d23a9d9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-ljspeech-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt408-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt138-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt624-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt396-0d23a9d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt498-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt132-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt288-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt42-0d23a9d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expose-lt90-0d23a9d9.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: expose somebody/something to something (phơi bày/đặt ai/cái gì vào nguy cơ).', 'technology', 1, 10),
('30ee1dce-470e-550c-a252-39775b6c5c04', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'aggressive', '/əˈɡresɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có xu hướng tấn công, gây hấn hoặc cạnh tranh mạnh mẽ.', 'using strong or forceful methods to succeed or to get what you want.', 'The company launched an aggressive marketing campaign to win new customers.', 'Công ty đã phát động một chiến dịch tiếp thị mạnh mẽ để giành được khách hàng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The retail chain launched an aggressive advertising campaign to attract younger shoppers.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi bán lẻ đã tung ra một chiến dịch quảng cáo táo bạo để thu hút người mua trẻ tuổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-ljspeech-64c90140.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-cori-64c90140.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aggressive-80d1a609.webp', '[\"assertive\", \"forceful\", \"hostile\"]', '[\"passive\", \"gentle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"aggressive marketing\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp thị mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aggressive behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi hung hăng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assertive\", \"note_vi\": \"assertive là quả quyết (tích cực), aggressive là hung hăng hoặc tấn công\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"aggressively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"aggression\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-cori-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru0-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru5-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru6-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru10-64c90140.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru9-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru3-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru7-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru8-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru2-64c90140.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-ljspeech-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt408-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt138-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt624-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt396-64c90140.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt498-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt132-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt288-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt42-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt90-64c90140.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, \'aggressive\' mang nghĩa tích cực là xông xáo, quyết liệt cạnh tranh.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('efd274a2-04cf-5c36-a7f3-34d2d387843a', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'b99bb589-de7d-5921-b059-38dcf8257518', '58376e68-2e09-515d-ad71-87c4154a7a09', 'equal', '/ˈiːkwəl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'có cùng giá trị, kích thước, mức độ hoặc quyền lợi.', 'having the same value, size, amount, or status as something else.', 'All citizens should have equal rights and opportunities, regardless of their background.', 'Mọi công dân đều phải có quyền và cơ hội bình đẳng, bất kể xuất thân của họ.', '{\"en\": \"Both candidates have equal qualifications and experience for the management position.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai ứng viên đều có bằng cấp và kinh nghiệm ngang nhau cho vị trí quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-ljspeech-f57b2d31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-cori-f57b2d31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/equal-91920659.webp', '[\"same\", \"identical\", \"equivalent\"]', '[\"unequal\", \"different\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"equal rights\", \"meaning\": \"quyền bình đẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"equal opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội ngang nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"equal pay\", \"meaning\": \"trả lương ngang nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"equable\", \"note_vi\": \"equable nghĩa là điềm tĩnh, không liên quan bình đẳng.\"}, {\"word\": \"equity\", \"note_vi\": \"equity là vốn chủ sở hữu hoặc công bằng pháp lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"equality\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"equally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-cori-f57b2d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-aru0-f57b2d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-aru5-f57b2d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-aru6-f57b2d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-aru10-f57b2d31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equal-aru9-f57b2d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v