('e7958cc2-4387-558e-82dd-bb8a387baa52', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'bbe56f0e-cb5b-5336-b031-e1c1b6087157', '8f9ba7f3-7b9c-51d9-88e3-1713d8839d0b', 'certify', 'UK: /ˈsɜːtɪfaɪd/ | US: /ˈsɜːrtɪfaɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'được chứng nhận', 'Having officially gained a qualification or passed examinations to perform a specific job or task.', 'He is a certified accountant.', 'Anh ấy là một kế toán viên được chứng nhận.', '{\"en\": \"Only certified technicians are authorized to repair the medical equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Chỉ các kỹ thuật viên đã được chứng nhận mới được phép sửa chữa thiết bị y tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-ljspeech-3f772e75.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-cori-3f772e75.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/certify-31eeb2c6.webp', '[\"verify\", \"validate\", \"license\", \"endorse\"]', '[\"disqualify\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"certified public accountant\", \"meaning\": \"kế toán viên công chứng (CPA)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"certify that\", \"meaning\": \"chứng nhận rằng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"certificate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"certification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-cori-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru0-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru5-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru6-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru10-3f772e75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru9-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru3-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru7-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru8-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-aru2-3f772e75.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-ljspeech-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt408-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt138-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt624-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt396-3f772e75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt498-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt132-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt288-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt42-3f772e75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certify-lt90-3f772e75.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ gốc \'certify\' là động từ (chứng nhận). Trong câu bổ nghĩa danh từ, dạng tính từ thường dùng là \'certified\' (ví dụ: certified accountant).', 'personnel', 1, 4),
('aae50195-595f-566c-9f83-b8c4fe150cec', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'bbe56f0e-cb5b-5336-b031-e1c1b6087157', '8f9ba7f3-7b9c-51d9-88e3-1713d8839d0b', 'routine', '/ruːˈtiːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi hành động được thực hiện thường xuyên theo một trình tự nhất định.', 'a regular way of doing things in a particular order or at specific times.', 'The maintenance crew follows a strict daily routine to ensure equipment safety.', 'Đội bảo trì tuân theo một quy trình hằng ngày nghiêm ngặt để đảm bảo an toàn thiết bị.', '{\"en\": \"Maintaining a daily routine helps employees manage their tasks more efficiently during busy work weeks.\", \"vi\": \"Duy trì thói quen hàng ngày giúp nhân viên quản lý công việc hiệu quả hơn trong những tuần bận rộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-ljspeech-012da8a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-cori-012da8a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/routine-73ef3530.webp', '[\"procedure\", \"habit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"daily routine\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work routine\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình làm việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"routinely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-cori-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru0-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru5-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru6-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru10-012da8a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru9-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru3-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru7-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/routine-aru8-012da8a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat