('d513e429-54c0-5f56-996c-e8ced03f1df7', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'bbe56f0e-cb5b-5336-b031-e1c1b6087157', '8f9ba7f3-7b9c-51d9-88e3-1713d8839d0b', 'appendix', 'UK: /əˈpen.dɪks/ | US: /əˈpen.dɪks/', 'B2', 'noun', 'phụ lục', 'Supplementary material added at the end of a book, document, or report.', 'Important data is included in the report’s appendix.', 'Dữ liệu quan trọng được đính kèm trong phụ lục của báo cáo.', '{\"en\": \"Detailed financial charts are provided in Appendix B at the end of the report.\", \"vi\": \"Các biểu đồ tài chính chi tiết được cung cấp trong Phụ lục B ở cuối báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-ljspeech-e8a60301.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-cori-e8a60301.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appendix-4c43fef9.webp', '[\"addendum\", \"supplement\", \"attachment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"refer to the appendix\", \"meaning\": \"tham khảo phụ lục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attached appendix\", \"meaning\": \"phụ lục được đính kèm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-cori-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru0-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru5-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru6-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru10-e8a60301.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru9-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru3-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru7-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru8-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru2-e8a60301.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-ljspeech-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt408-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt138-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt624-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt396-e8a60301.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt498-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt132-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt288-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt42-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt90-e8a60301.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ phần phụ lục ở cuối báo cáo hoặc tài liệu. Danh từ số nhiều có thể ghi là \'appendices\' hoặc \'appendixes\'.', 'office', 1, 6),
('5a440024-8ac8-5031-98dc-4c38ad97d2b2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'bbe56f0e-cb5b-5336-b031-e1c1b6087157', '8f9ba7f3-7b9c-51d9-88e3-1713d8839d0b', 'threaten', '/ˈθretn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đe dọa gây hại hoặc làm điều gì đó không mong muốn.', 'to say that you will cause trouble or hurt someone if they do not do what you want.', 'The dark clouds threatened to bring a storm.', 'Những đám mây đen đe dọa sẽ mang đến một cơn bão.', '{\"en\": \"Rising material costs threaten to reduce the company\'s profit margins this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí nguyên vật liệu tăng cao đe dọa làm giảm biên lợi nhuận của công ty trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-ljspeech-84ce7eb3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-cori-84ce7eb3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/threaten-49a5c924.webp', '[\"endanger\", \"intimidate\", \"menace\"]', '[\"protect\", \"defend\", \"guard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"threaten to do something\", \"meaning\": \"đe dọa làm điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"threaten someone with something\", \"meaning\": \"đe dọa ai bằng cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"warn\", \"note_vi\": \"warn là cảnh báo để giúp tránh nguy hiểm, threaten là đe dọa gây hại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"threat\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"threatening\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-cori-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru0-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru5-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru6-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru10-84ce7eb3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru9-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru3-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru7-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru8-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-aru2-84ce7eb3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-ljspeech-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt408-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt138-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt624-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt396-84ce7eb3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt498-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt132-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt288-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt42-84ce7eb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threaten-lt90-84ce7eb3.mp3\"]}}', 'Theo sau threaten thường là động từ to-infinitive (threaten to do something).', 'business', 1, 7),
('a69be127-8117-5e06-a589-b3430052502d', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'bbe56f0e-cb5b-5336-b031-e1c1b6087157', '8f9ba7f3-7b9c-51d9-88e3-1713d8839d0b', 'psychologist', '/saɪˈkɒl.ə.dʒɪst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chuyên gia nghiên cứu về tâm trí và hành vi.', 'a trained expert who studies how the mind works and why people behave as they do.', 'A child psychologist can help children cope with emotional difficulties.', 'Một nhà tâm lý học trẻ em có thể giúp trẻ đối phó với những khó khăn về cảm xúc.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a psychologist to improve employee well-being and reduce workplace stress.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một chuyên gia tâm lý để cải thiện sức khỏe tinh thần và giảm căng thẳng nơi làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-ljspeech-487bf0f5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-cori-487bf0f5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/psychologist-6071bb05.webp', '[\"therapist\", \"counselor\", \"mental health specialist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clinical psychologist\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên gia tâm lý lâm sàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consult a psychologist\", \"meaning\": \"tham khảo ý kiến chuyên gia tâm lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"child psychologist\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên gia tâm lý trẻ em\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"psychiatrist\", \"note_vi\": \"\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"psychology\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"psychological\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"psychologically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-cori-487bf0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-aru0-487bf0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-aru5-487bf0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-aru6-487bf0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychologist-aru10-487bf0f5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/ob