('ed260c41-8a09-5870-8857-1661fab34d57', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c0c008b1-6e46-5bce-ae79-42ba058f0a18', '51b08fb6-813f-5cd4-b866-b675d14d7412', 'conservative', '/kənˈsɜːvətɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có xu hướng giữ gìn những giá trị truyền thống, không thích thay đổi nhanh chóng.', 'preferring traditional styles and values, and not liking sudden changes or new ideas.', 'The company adopted a conservative financial strategy to minimize investment risks.', 'Công ty đã áp dụng một chiến lược tài chính bảo thủ để giảm thiểu rủi ro đầu tư.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors made a conservative estimate of the company\'s growth next year.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã đưa ra một ước tính thận trọng về sự tăng trưởng của công ty vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-ljspeech-42dc7e4f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-cori-42dc7e4f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conservative-ee9fd483.webp', '[\"traditional\", \"cautious\", \"moderate\"]', '[\"liberal\", \"progressive\", \"radical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conservative estimate\", \"meaning\": \"ước tính thận trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conservative approach\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp tiếp cận thận trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conservation\", \"note_vi\": \"conservation là sự bảo tồn thiên nhiên, tránh nhầm với conservative.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"conservatively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conservatism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-cori-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru0-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru5-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru6-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru10-42dc7e4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru9-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru3-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru7-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru8-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru2-42dc7e4f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-ljspeech-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt408-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt138-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt624-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt396-42dc7e4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt498-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt132-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt288-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt42-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt90-42dc7e4f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, conservative thường mang nghĩa là \'thận trọng, dè dặt\'.', 'finance', 1, 1),
('934635f2-febf-5341-9371-d39e3d7ee3c2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c0c008b1-6e46-5bce-ae79-42ba058f0a18', '51b08fb6-813f-5cd4-b866-b675d14d7412', 'solar', '/ˈsəʊlə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc liên quan đến mặt trời.', 'relating to or coming directly from the sun.', 'Many homes now use solar energy to heat water.', 'Nhiều ngôi nhà hiện nay sử dụng năng lượng mặt trời để đun nước.', '{\"en\": \"The factory recently installed solar panels on the roof to reduce its monthly electricity costs.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy gần đây đã lắp đặt các tấm pin năng lượng mặt trời trên mái nhà để giảm chi phí điện hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-ljspeech-0f016a18.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-cori-0f016a18.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/solar-2a44cf0e.webp', NULL, '[\"lunar\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"solar energy\", \"meaning\": \"năng lượng mặt trời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"solar panel\", \"meaning\": \"tấm pin mặt trời\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-cori-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru0-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru5-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru6-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru10-0f016a18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru9-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru3-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru7-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru8-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-aru2-0f016a18.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-ljspeech-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solar-lt408-0f016a18.mp3\", \"/stor