('031b329c-44a3-5c4e-b99c-6640eb64b401', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c0c008b1-6e46-5bce-ae79-42ba058f0a18', '51b08fb6-813f-5cd4-b866-b675d14d7412', 'accuse', '/əˈkjuːz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tố cáo, buộc tội ai đó đã làm điều sai trái.', 'to claim officially or publicly that a particular person has committed an offense or crime.', 'The police accused him of stealing the car, but he denied it.', 'Cảnh sát buộc tội anh ta ăn trộm xe, nhưng anh ta phủ nhận.', '{\"en\": \"The manager did not accuse anyone of the mistake until all facts were checked.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã không buộc tội ai về sai sót đó cho đến khi tất cả sự thật được kiểm tra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-ljspeech-d3e0c4f5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-cori-d3e0c4f5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accuse-c8c398d4.webp', '[\"blame\", \"charge\", \"indict\"]', '[\"defend\", \"absolve\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accuse someone of something\", \"meaning\": \"buộc tội ai về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"falsely accuse\", \"meaning\": \"buộc tội oan hoặc sai sự thật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"excuse\", \"note_vi\": \"Excuse là bào chữa hoặc tha lỗi, accuse là buộc tội.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accusation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accuser\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accusing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-cori-d3e0c4f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-aru0-d3e0c4f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-aru5-d3e0c4f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-aru6-d3e0c4f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-aru10-d3e0c4f5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-aru9-d3e0c4f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuse-aru3-d3e0c4f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accu