('028e5e9b-bb81-5a2a-bbfd-85f8076f75a9', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'elderly', '/ˈeldəli/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về người đã lớn tuổi, già.', 'used to describe people who have lived for many years.', 'Special care facilities are available for the elderly in our community.', 'Các cơ sở chăm sóc đặc biệt có sẵn cho người cao tuổi trong cộng đồng của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"Our hotel offers special discounts for elderly guests who stay during the weekdays.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn của chúng tôi cung cấp giảm giá đặc biệt cho khách lớn tuổi lưu trú vào các ngày trong tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-ljspeech-eb229eda.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-cori-eb229eda.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elderly-9d87410e.webp', '[\"old\", \"aged\"]', '[\"young\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elderly people\", \"meaning\": \"người cao tuổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elderly care\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc người già\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"older\", \"note_vi\": \"Older so sánh hơn, elderly chỉ người già một cách lịch sự.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"elder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-cori-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru0-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru5-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru6-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru10-eb229eda.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru9-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru3-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru7-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru8-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-aru2-eb229eda.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-ljspeech-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt408-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt138-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt624-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt396-eb229eda.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt498-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt132-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt288-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt42-eb229eda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elderly-lt90-eb229eda.mp3\"]}}', 'Cách gọi lịch sự hơn từ \'old\' khi nói về người.', 'travel', 1, 1),
('dcde0714-b964-5914-854a-77790ed8f4f4', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'moral', '/ˈmɒrəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về các nguyên tắc đúng sai trong hành vi.', 'relating to principles of right and wrong behavior in human conduct.', 'It\'s important to make moral choices that respect others\' rights.', 'Điều quan trọng là đưa ra những lựa chọn đạo đức tôn trọng quyền của người khác.', '{\"en\": \"The board members discussed the moral obligation to reduce pollution from their manufacturing plants.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã thảo luận về nghĩa vụ đạo đức trong việc giảm ô nhiễm từ các nhà máy sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-ljspeech-12d79c83.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-cori-12d79c83.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/moral-ab4f71c7.webp', '[\"ethical\", \"upright\"]', '[\"immoral\", \"unethical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"moral duty\", \"meaning\": \"nghĩa vụ đạo đức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moral obligation\", \"meaning\": \"trách nhiệm đạo đức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"morale\", \"note_vi\": \"Morale (danh từ) nghĩa là tinh thần, nhuệ khí làm việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"morality\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"morally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-cori-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru0-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru5-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru6-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru10-12d79c83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru9-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru3-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru7-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru8-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-aru2-12d79c83.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-ljspeech-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt408-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt138-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt624-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt396-12d79c83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt498-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt132-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt288-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt42-12d79c83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moral-lt90-12d79c83.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm moral (tính từ: thuộc đạo đức) với morale (danh từ: tinh thần tập thể).', 'business', 1, 2),
('552a52d6-cc54-5d1e-8cec-979c23c6b8a6', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'shift', '/ʃɪft/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thay đổi vị trí, dịch chuyển.', 'to move or change from one position or direction to another.', 'The company plans to shift its marketing focus toward younger consumer groups next quarter.', 'Công ty có kế hoạch chuyển hướng tập trung dịch vụ tiếp thị sang các nhóm người tiêu dùng trẻ hơn vào quý tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to shift its marketing focus toward younger consumers this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định chuyển hướng tập trung tiếp thị sang người tiêu dùng trẻ tuổi hơn trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-ljspeech-dbd79b31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-cori-dbd79b31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shift-4312b7c4.webp', '[\"move\", \"transfer\", \"relocate\"]', '[\"stay\", \"remain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shift focus\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển hướng trọng tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shift responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"đùn đẩy trách nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shaft\", \"note_vi\": \"Shaft nghĩa là trục máy hoặc hầm, khác hoàn toàn với shift.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shift\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-cori-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru0-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru5-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru6-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru10-dbd79b31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru9-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru3-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru7-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru8-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-aru2-dbd79b31.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-ljspeech-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt408-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt138-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt624-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt396-dbd79b31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt498-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt132-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt288-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt42-dbd79b31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shift-lt90-dbd79b31.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi là danh từ, shift còn có nghĩa rất phổ biến trong TOEIC là ca làm việc (night shift).', 'business', 1, 3),
('303cd19d-fe03-5f01-a176-b2d0474bf9ef', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'bid', 'UK: /bɪd/ | US: /bɪd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự dự thầu, giá thầu', 'an offer of a specific price to buy something or complete a contract.', 'We received three competitive bids for the construction project.', 'Chúng tôi nhận được ba hồ sơ dự thầu cạnh tranh cho dự án xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"Our engineering firm submitted a competitive bid for the municipal highway project.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kỹ thuật của chúng tôi đã nộp một hồ sơ dự thầu cạnh tranh cho dự án đường cao tốc đô thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bid-bf23e85a.webp', '[\"tender\", \"offer\", \"proposal\", \"quote\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"submit a bid\", \"meaning\": \"nộp giá/hồ sơ dự thầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"win a bid\", \"meaning\": \"trúng thầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bid\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bidder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru0-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru5-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru6-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru10-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru9-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru3-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru7-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru8-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru2-a65df709.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt408-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt138-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt624-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt396-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt498-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt132-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt288-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt42-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt90-a65df709.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các động từ \'submit a bid\' (nộp giá thầu) hoặc \'win a bid\' (trúng thầu).', 'contracts', 1, 4),
('7af4cf2f-aa44-5a6c-80d2-e978ce139fd6', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'following', '/ˈfɒləʊɪŋ/', 'A2', 'preposition', 'Sau (về thời gian hoặc thứ tự).', 'coming after someone or something in time or as a result of an event.', 'Following the recent press conference, the company announced a major product launch.', 'Sau cuộc họp báo gần đây, công ty đã thông báo ra mắt một sản phẩm lớn.', '{\"en\": \"Following the board meeting, the CEO decided to announce the new company policy to everyone.\", \"vi\": \"Sau cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị, giám đốc điều hành đã quyết định công bố chính sách công ty mới cho mọi người.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-ljspeech-6cbf68c5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-cori-6cbf68c5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/following-1c85371a.webp', '[\"after\", \"subsequent to\"]', '[\"before\", \"prior to\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"following the\", \"meaning\": \"sau khi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"following day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày hôm sau\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"follow\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-cori-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru0-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru5-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru6-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru10-6cbf68c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru9-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru3-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru7-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru8-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-aru2-6cbf68c5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-ljspeech-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt408-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt138-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt624-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt396-6cbf68c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt498-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt132-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt288-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt42-6cbf68c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/following-lt90-6cbf68c5.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ trình tự thời gian, trang trọng hơn \'after\'.', 'office', 1, 5),
('6c583371-0202-5ad0-90b1-a98642444a5b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'convert', '/kənˈvɜːt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thay đổi hình thức hoặc chức năng của một cái gì đó.', 'to change something into a different form or use it for a different purpose.', 'They plan to convert the old factory into modern apartments.', 'Họ dự định chuyển đổi nhà máy cũ thành các căn hộ hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"We need to convert these paper files into digital documents for easier storage access.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần chuyển đổi các tệp giấy này thành tài liệu kỹ thuật số để truy cập lưu trữ dễ dàng hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-ljspeech-20a70aaf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-cori-20a70aaf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/convert-a30dabdf.webp', '[\"transform\", \"change\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"convert into\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển đổi thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convert to\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển sang\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conversion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"convertible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-cori-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru0-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru5-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru6-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru10-20a70aaf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru9-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru3-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru7-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru8-20a70aaf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convert-aru2-20a70aaf.mp3\"]}, \"us\