('a6349a75-4875-5c95-a8ff-c40cbcbbe294', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'afterwards', '/ˈɑːftəwədz/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Vào một thời điểm sau khi một sự kiện khác đã xảy ra.', 'at a later time following an event that has already happened.', 'We went for dinner, and afterwards, we watched a movie.', 'Chúng tôi đi ăn tối, và sau đó, chúng tôi xem phim.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting ended early, and afterwards we reviewed the sales report.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp kết thúc sớm, và sau đó chúng tôi đã xem xét báo cáo bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-ljspeech-ad61e7ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-cori-ad61e7ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afterwards-70454789.webp', '[\"later\", \"subsequently\"]', '[\"beforehand\", \"previously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soon afterwards\", \"meaning\": \"ngay sau đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shortly afterwards\", \"meaning\": \"không lâu sau đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"afterward\", \"note_vi\": \"afterward là cách viết khác, thiếu s, nghĩa giống hệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"preposition\", \"word\": \"after\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"afterthought\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-cori-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru0-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru5-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru6-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru10-ad61e7ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru9-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru3-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru7-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/after