('bf55ab0e-1128-5bd1-8910-7e94e8c514fc', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'desire', '/dɪˈzaɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cảm thấy mong muốn mạnh mẽ điều gì đó.', 'to want something very much or to hope for something to happen.', 'She deeply desired to travel the world and experience new cultures.', 'Cô ấy khao khát được đi khắp thế giới và trải nghiệm những nền văn hóa mới.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors strongly desires to expand our retail operations into the Asian market.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc vô cùng mong muốn mở rộng hoạt động bán lẻ của chúng ta sang thị trường châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-ljspeech-c3c84bf0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-cori-c3c84bf0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desire-8fa9182d.webp', '[\"want\", \"wish\", \"crave\"]', '[\"despise\", \"hate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly desire\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng mong muốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply desire\", \"meaning\": \"khao khát sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"desire\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"desirable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-cori-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru0-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru5-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru6-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru10-c3c84bf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru9-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru3-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru7-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru8-c3c84bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desire-aru2-c3c84bf