('24500eb7-4d10-5e7d-a2ac-7eb6bbe82352', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'c360fcb6-9f86-5249-8fc0-4117b0e90399', '4372769e-751a-56d6-8fa2-aa6c9ceb6b08', 'labour', '/ˈleɪbə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sức lao động, công việc chân tay.', 'the physical or mental effort that people do to produce goods or provide services.', 'The project requires a lot of manual labour to complete on time.', 'Dự án này đòi hỏi rất nhiều sức lao động chân tay để hoàn thành đúng thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The factory needs more skilled labour to meet the increasing demand for new products.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy cần thêm lao động lành nghề để đáp ứng nhu cầu ngày càng tăng về sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-ljspeech-411cd345.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-cori-411cd345.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/labour-441861b5.webp', '[\"work\", \"workforce\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"manual labour\", \"meaning\": \"lao động chân tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"labour costs\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí nhân công\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"laborious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-cori-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru0-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru5-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru6-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru10-411cd345.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru9-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru3-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru7-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru8-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-aru2-411cd345.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-ljspeech-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt408-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt138-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt624-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt396-411cd345.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt498-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt132-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt288-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt42-411cd345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labour-lt90-411cd345.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý cách viết \'labour\' (Anh-Anh) và \'labor\' (Anh-Mỹ).', 'manufacturing', 1, 29),
('d67c7c6b-d3a3-5506-b299-3da867ecdb01', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'd20353fe-44ef-5f35-8d0d-211a60a1e308', '3d202fc0-354b-504b-9982-90b7286fe55f', 'pile', '/paɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một đống vật thể được xếp chồng lên nhau.', 'a quantity of things placed on top of each other.', 'There was a large pile of dirty laundry waiting to be washed.', 'Có một đống quần áo bẩn lớn đang chờ được giặt.', '{\"en\": \"Please move that large pile of documents to the storage room before the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng chuyển đống tài liệu lớn đó vào phòng kho trước cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-ljspeech-eb212bb2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-cori-eb212bb2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pile-94737386.webp', '[\"heap\", \"stack\", \"mound\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a pile of\", \"meaning\": \"một đống (cái gì)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at the top of the pile\", \"meaning\": \"ở vị trí đứng đầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"file\", \"note_vi\": \"File là hồ sơ hoặc tập tin, pile là đống chất cao.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pile\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-cori-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru0-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru5-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru6-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru10-eb212bb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru9-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru3-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru7-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru8-eb212bb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-aru2-eb212bb2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pile-ljspeech-eb212bb2.mp3