('19f95c63-b8cb-5b4c-b692-d96c88b7795e', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'd20353fe-44ef-5f35-8d0d-211a60a1e308', '3d202fc0-354b-504b-9982-90b7286fe55f', 'regulation', '/ˌreɡjʊˈleɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Quy tắc hoặc luật lệ chính thức do cơ quan ban hành.', 'an official rule or order that controls how something is done or should behave.', 'New safety regulations have been introduced for all construction sites.', 'Các quy định an toàn mới đã được ban hành cho tất cả các công trường xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must follow the company regulation regarding the use of office equipment after hours.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân thủ quy định của công ty về việc sử dụng thiết bị văn phòng ngoài giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-ljspeech-7320e2b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-cori-7320e2b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regulation-b7dd3665.webp', '[\"rule\", \"law\", \"policy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"comply with regulations\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ các quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety regulations\", \"meaning\": \"các quy định an toàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"regulate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-cori-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru0-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru5-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru6-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru10-7320e2b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru9-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru3-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru7-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru8-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v