('3c9a5149-17c4-581e-a4af-1d7cd36218da', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'd20353fe-44ef-5f35-8d0d-211a60a1e308', '3d202fc0-354b-504b-9982-90b7286fe55f', 'associated', '/əˈsəʊʃieɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có liên hệ, kết nối với cái gì đó.', 'connected to something else because they are part of the same group or process.', 'The risks associated with smoking are well-known.', 'Những rủi ro liên quan đến hút thuốc đều đã được biết rõ.', '{\"en\": \"Please review all the documents associated with the contract before you sign the final agreement.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xem lại tất cả tài liệu liên quan đến hợp đồng trước khi bạn ký thỏa thuận cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-ljspeech-dcf70c92.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-cori-dcf70c92.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/associated-32655b95.webp', '[\"related\", \"linked\"]', '[\"unrelated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"associated with\", \"meaning\": \"liên quan đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"closely associated\", \"meaning\": \"liên quan mật thiết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"associate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"association\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-cori-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru0-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru5-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru6-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru10-dcf70c92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru9-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru3-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru7-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/associated-aru8-dcf70c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc