('21c7811a-665b-542b-943e-d6261439767a', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'wise', '/waɪz/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng đưa ra những quyết định hoặc lời khuyên đúng đắn, dựa trên kinh nghiệm.', 'having or showing the ability to make good judgments based on knowledge and experience.', 'It would be wise to save some money for a rainy day.', 'Sẽ là khôn ngoan nếu bạn tiết kiệm một ít tiền cho những lúc khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"It is a wise decision to invest in employee training to improve overall company performance.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu tư vào đào tạo nhân viên để cải thiện hiệu suất công ty là một quyết định sáng suốt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-ljspeech-cb129d1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-cori-cb129d1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wise-fab2965f.webp', '[\"sensible\", \"smart\"]', '[\"foolish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wise choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn sáng suốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wise decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định sáng suốt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wisdom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-cori-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru0-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru5-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru6-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru10-cb129d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru9-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru3-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru7-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru8-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru2-cb129d1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pub