('66591e3f-31d4-5011-a26e-b0f78b00887c', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'attempt', '/əˈtempt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một sự cố gắng để làm điều gì đó, thường khó khăn.', 'an endeavor to accomplish a specific target, particularly one involving hardship or risk.', 'The tech company made a bold attempt to launch its new software earlier than scheduled.', 'Công ty công nghệ đã thực hiện một nỗ lực táo bạo nhằm ra mắt phần mềm mới sớm hơn dự kiến.', '{\"en\": \"The company made a successful attempt to enter the Asian market with its new software product.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã có một nỗ lực thành công để thâm nhập thị trường châu Á với sản phẩm phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-ljspeech-38e4e4b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-cori-38e4e4b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attempt-8a5a1212.webp', '[\"effort\", \"try\", \"endeavor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an attempt\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện một nỗ lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful attempt\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"effort\", \"note_vi\": \"attempt nhấn mạnh vào hành động thử làm, effort nhấn mạnh vào sức lực bỏ ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"attempt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-cori-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru0-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru5-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru6-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru10-38e4e4b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru9-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru3-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru7-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru8-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru2-38e4e4b0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-ljspeech-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt408-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt138-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt624-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt396-38e4e4b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt498-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt132-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt288-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt42-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt90-38e4e4b0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ \"make\" (make an attempt to do something).', 'business', 1, 12),
('81ba1304-48a6-530d-9d57-309a226224a4', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'delight', '/dɪˈlaɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác vui sướng, thích thú lớn.', 'a strong feeling of happiness and pleasure that someone experiences.', 'The children shrieked with delight when they saw the puppies.', 'Bọn trẻ la hét vì vui sướng khi nhìn thấy những chú chó con.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel manager expressed delight at receiving the five-star customer review.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý khách sạn bày tỏ sự vui mừng khi nhận được đánh giá năm sao từ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-ljspeech-2a17ce14.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-cori-2a17ce14.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delight-0ee56f52.webp', '[\"joy\", \"pleasure\", \"happiness\"]', '[\"disappointment\", \"displeasure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take delight in\", \"meaning\": \"thích thú với điều gì đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"to someone\'s delight\", \"meaning\": \"khiến ai đó vui mừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"with delight\", \"meaning\": \"với niềm vui sướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"desire\", \"note_vi\": \"\\\"desire\\\" là mong muốn, khao khát; không phải cảm giác vui sướng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"delight\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"delightful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"delightfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-cori-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru0-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru5-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru6-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru10-2a17ce14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru9-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru3-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru7-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru8-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-aru2-2a17ce14.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-ljspeech-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt408-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt138-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt624-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt396-2a17ce14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt498-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt132-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt288-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt42-2a17ce14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delight-lt90-2a17ce14.mp3\"]}}', '\"Delight\" mạnh hơn \"pleasure\"; dùng khi muốn diễn đạt niềm vui rõ rệt, sâu sắc.', 'daily', 1, 13),
('93cf963b-d1f2-5d89-9a23-f57342207dd2', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'adjustment', 'UK: /əˈdʒʌstmənt/ | US: /əˈdʒʌstmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự điều chỉnh', 'a small change made to something in order to improve it', 'We need to make some adjustments to the project timeline.', 'Chúng ta cần thực hiện một số điều chỉnh đối với tiến độ dự án.', '{\"en\": \"We need to make a minor adjustment to the project timeline before the client review.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần thực hiện một điều chỉnh nhỏ đối với tiến độ dự án trước buổi xem xét của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-ljspeech-cf8e0872.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-cori-cf8e0872.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adjustment-e9c9f2dc.webp', '[\"alteration\", \"modification\", \"revision\", \"tweak\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an adjustment\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện sự điều chỉnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slight adjustment\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh nhẹ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"adjust\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"adjustable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-cori-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru0-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru5-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru6-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru10-cf8e0872.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru9-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru3-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru7-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru8-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru2-cf8e0872.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-ljspeech-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt408-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt138-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt624-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt396-cf8e0872.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt498-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt132-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt288-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt42-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-lt90-cf8e0872.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm động từ \'make\' (make an adjustment to something).', 'office', 1, 14),
('91f3d0e6-d7b4-529f-ade9-a9e87099603a', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'extend', '/ɪkˈstend/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó dài hơn, rộng hơn hoặc kéo dài thêm thời gian.', 'to make something last for a longer period of time or cover a larger area.', 'The store agreed to extend the warranty period for all electronics purchased this month.', 'Cửa hàng đã đồng ý gia hạn thời gian bảo hành cho tất cả thiết bị điện tử được mua trong tháng này.', '{\"en\": \"The board decided to extend the deadline for the project proposal by two additional weeks.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc quyết định gia hạn thời hạn nộp đề xuất dự án thêm hai tuần nữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-ljspeech-de93ba2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-cori-de93ba2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extend-ec97377f.webp', '[\"prolong\", \"lengthen\"]', '[\"shorten\", \"reduce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extend a deadline\", \"meaning\": \"gia hạn thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extend an invitation\", \"meaning\": \"gửi lời mời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expand\", \"note_vi\": \"expand là mở rộng quy mô, extend là kéo dài thời gian/không gian.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-cori-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru0-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru5-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru6-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru10-de93ba2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru9-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru3-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru7-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru8-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-aru2-de93ba2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-ljspeech-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt408-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt138-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt624-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt396-de93ba2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt498-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt132-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt288-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt42-de93ba2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extend-lt90-de93ba2d.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong các thông báo về thời hạn hợp đồng hoặc dự án.', 'business', 1, 15),
('9f95b60d-128c-5d98-934f-4f7d34a6e4af', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'demand', '/dɪˈmɑːnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nhu cầu hoặc mong muốn mạnh mẽ về một thứ gì đó.', 'a strong need or desire for goods and services from buyers in the market.', 'Consumer demand for renewable energy solutions has increased significantly over the past decade.', 'Nhu cầu của người tiêu dùng đối với các giải pháp năng lượng tái tạo đã tăng đáng kể trong thập kỷ qua.', '{\"en\": \"We need to hire more staff to meet the growing demand for our new product.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần thuê thêm nhân viên để đáp ứng nhu cầu ngày càng tăng cho sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-ljspeech-49c2c209.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-cori-49c2c209.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demand-fc220865.webp', '[\"requirement\", \"need\", \"request\"]', '[\"supply\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"meet the demand\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng nhu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in demand\", \"meaning\": \"được ưa chuộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"command\", \"note_vi\": \"command nghĩa là ra lệnh hoặc chỉ huy, dễ nhầm mặt chữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"demand\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"demanding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-cori-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru0-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru5-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru6-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru10-49c2c209.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru9-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru3-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru7-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru8-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-aru2-49c2c209.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-ljspeech-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt408-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt138-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt624-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt396-49c2c209.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt498-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt132-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt288-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt42-49c2c209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demand-lt90-49c2c209.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'supply and demand\' (cung và cầu) rất phổ biến trong các bài đọc kinh tế.', 'business', 1, 16),
('90e33b94-69d6-580c-a57c-f262feff7a0b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'regard', '/rɪˈɡɑːd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'coi như, xem xét hoặc đánh giá một ai đó/điều gì đó.', 'to think of or consider someone or something in a specified way.', 'She always regarded him as a true friend and a reliable person.', 'Cô ấy luôn coi anh ấy là một người bạn thật sự và một người đáng tin cậy.', '{\"en\": \"Industry experts regard our company as a leading provider of innovative cloud services.\", \"vi\": \"Các chuyên gia trong ngành coi công ty chúng tôi là nhà cung cấp hàng đầu về dịch vụ điện toán đám mây sáng tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-ljspeech-b4583455.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-cori-b4583455.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regard-74392166.webp', '[\"consider\", \"view\", \"count\"]', '[\"disregard\", \"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"regard as\", \"meaning\": \"coi như là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly regard\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá rất cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reward\", \"note_vi\": \"reward nghĩa là phần thưởng hoặc thưởng cho ai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"regard\"}, {\"pos\": \"preposition\", \"word\": \"regarding\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"regardless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-cori-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru0-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru5-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru6-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru10-b4583455.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru9-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru3-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru7-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru8-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-aru2-b4583455.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-ljspeech-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt408-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt138-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt624-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt396-b4583455.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt498-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt132-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt288-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt42-b4583455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regard-lt90-b4583455.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: regard somebody/something as something.', 'business', 1, 17)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('ef029afb-844e-527f-b042-cd3450a896ce', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'mistake', '/mɪˈsteɪk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Sai lầm, lỗi lầm.', 'an action, decision, or judgment that is incorrect or produces an unwanted result.', 'Everyone makes mistakes, so don\'t worry too much about it.', 'Ai cũng mắc sai lầm, vì vậy đừng quá lo lắng về điều đó.', '{\"en\": \"Please double-check the financial report to ensure there is no mistake in the calculations.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra kỹ báo cáo tài chính để đảm bảo không có sai sót trong các phép tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-ljspeech-c07a45a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-cori-c07a45a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mistake-f5cbe3b9.webp', '[\"error\", \"fault\", \"slip\"]', '[\"correction\", \"accuracy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"phạm sai lầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"by mistake\", \"meaning\": \"do vô ý/nhầm lẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"error\", \"note_vi\": \"error mang tính trang trọng, kỹ thuật hơn; mistake dùng trong đời sống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mistake\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mistaken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-cori-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru0-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru5-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru6-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru10-c07a45a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru9-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru3-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru7-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru8-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-aru2-c07a45a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-ljspeech-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt408-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt138-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt624-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt396-c07a45a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt498-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt132-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt288-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt42-c07a45a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mistake-lt90-c07a45a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'by mistake\' nghĩa là vô tình, làm sai do sơ suất.', 'office', 1, 18),
('4cf4f984-5ca1-5bd2-9628-cfca3185da9d', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'judgement', '/ˈdʒʌdʒmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng đưa ra quyết định hoặc ý kiến hợp lý.', 'the ability to form valuable opinions and make good decisions after thinking carefully.', 'It requires good judgement to make difficult decisions under pressure.', 'Cần có sự đánh giá tốt để đưa ra những quyết định khó khăn dưới áp lực.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring manager trusted her professional judgement when selecting the best candidate for the position.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tuyển dụng đã tin tưởng vào phán đoán chuyên môn của cô ấy khi chọn ứng viên tốt nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-ljspeech-392ab84c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-cori-392ab84c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/judgement-559fe20c.webp', '[\"assessment\", \"evaluation\", \"decision\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional judgement\", \"meaning\": \"phán đoán chuyên môn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poor judgement\", \"meaning\": \"phán đoán kém\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decision\", \"note_vi\": \"judgement là khả năng đánh giá, decision là quyết định cuối cùng được đưa ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"judge\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"judgmental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-cori-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru0-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru5-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru6-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru10-392ab84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru9-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru3-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru7-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru8-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-aru2-392ab84c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-ljspeech-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt408-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt138-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt624-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt396-392ab84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt498-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt132-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt288-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt42-392ab84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judgement-lt90-392ab84c.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể viết là \"judgement\" (Anh-Anh) hoặc \"judgment\" (Anh-Mỹ), cả hai đều đúng.', 'hr', 1, 19),
('676ff5d3-7625-5dc3-b72b-095df3435c5a', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'participant', '/pɑːˈtɪsɪpənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người tham gia vào một sự kiện, hoạt động.', 'a person who takes part in or is involved in a particular activity or event.', 'Each participant in the workshop received a certificate of completion.', 'Mỗi người tham gia hội thảo đều nhận được giấy chứng nhận hoàn thành.', '{\"en\": \"Every participant must register online before the training session begins on Monday morning next week.\", \"vi\": \"Mỗi người tham gia phải đăng ký trực tuyến trước khi buổi đào tạo bắt đầu vào sáng thứ Hai tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-ljspeech-7a211045.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-cori-7a211045.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/participant-133b4381.webp', '[\"attendee\", \"member\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"active participant\", \"meaning\": \"người tham gia tích cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"workshop participant\", \"meaning\": \"người tham gia hội thảo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"participate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"participation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-cori-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru0-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru5-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru6-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru10-7a211045.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru9-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru3-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru7-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru8-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-aru2-7a211045.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-ljspeech-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt408-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt138-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt624-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt396-7a211045.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt498-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt132-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt288-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt42-7a211045.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/participant-lt90-7a211045.mp3\"]}}', 'Người tham gia sự kiện, hội thảo hoặc khóa học.', 'education', 1, 20),
('e516f214-fde6-5c55-82d9-860aaf1fea67', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'phenomenon', '/fɪˈnɒm.ə.nɒn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng, sự việc đặc biệt có thể quan sát được.', 'something that exists and can be seen, felt, or experienced.', 'Remote work has become a widespread social phenomenon across many corporate sectors.', 'Làm việc từ xa đã trở thành một hiện tượng xã hội phổ biến trong nhiều lĩnh vực doanh nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The rapid growth of online shopping is a global phenomenon that affects traditional retail.\", \"vi\": \"Sự phát triển nhanh chóng của mua sắm trực tuyến là một hiện tượng toàn cầu ảnh hưởng đến bán lẻ truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-ljspeech-6516f0ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-cori-6516f0ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/phenomenon-62d5f50c.webp', '[\"occurrence\", \"event\", \"trend\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"natural phenomenon\", \"meaning\": \"hiện tượng tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"social phenomenon\", \"meaning\": \"hiện tượng xã hội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"phenomena\", \"note_vi\": \"phenomena là dạng số nhiều của danh từ số ít phenomenon.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"phenomenal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"phenomenally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-cori-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru0-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru5-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru6-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru10-6516f0ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru9-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru3-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru7-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru8-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-aru2-6516f0ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-ljspeech-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt408-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt138-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt624-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt396-6516f0ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt498-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt132-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt288-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt42-6516f0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/phenomenon-lt90-6516f0ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý dạng số nhiều bất quy tắc của từ này là \'phenomena\'.', 'business', 1, 21),
('0ef8e6af-efaa-5430-b228-8833d0925d60', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'amount', '/əˈmaʊnt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một lượng hoặc tổng số của cái gì đó.', 'a quantity of something, especially when it cannot be counted.', 'A large amount of money was donated to the charity.', 'Một khoản tiền lớn đã được quyên góp cho tổ chức từ thiện.', '{\"en\": \"The company spent a significant amount of money on the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã chi một số tiền đáng kể cho chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-ljspeech-9cb6ff12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-cori-9cb6ff12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amount-861ff19f.webp', '[\"quantity\", \"sum\", \"total\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"large amount\", \"meaning\": \"lượng lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"total amount\", \"meaning\": \"tổng số lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"number\", \"note_vi\": \"number dùng cho danh từ đếm được, amount cho không đếm được\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"amount\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-cori-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru0-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru5-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru6-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru10-9cb6ff12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru9-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru3-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru7-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru8-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru2-9cb6ff12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-ljspeech-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt408-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt138-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt624-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt396-9cb6ff12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt498-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt132-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt288-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt42-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt90-9cb6ff12.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng \'amount\' với danh từ không đếm được (như money, time, information).', 'finance', 1, 22),
('5f50433a-6eaf-5e4a-af52-30a8d154b879', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'command', '/kəˈmɑːnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chỉ thị hoặc mệnh lệnh chính thức từ người có quyền lực.', 'an official order given by a person in authority that must be obeyed.', 'The software responds immediately to every keyboard command issued by the user.', 'Phần mềm phản hồi ngay lập tức với mọi lệnh từ bàn phím được đưa ra bởi người dùng.', '{\"en\": \"The director issued a direct command to halt all production immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã đưa ra một mệnh lệnh trực tiếp để dừng toàn bộ việc sản xuất ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-ljspeech-1925f793.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-cori-1925f793.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/command-bdf46780.webp', '[\"order\", \"instruction\", \"directive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chain of command\", \"meaning\": \"chuỗi mệnh lệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under the command of\", \"meaning\": \"dưới sự chỉ huy của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commend\", \"note_vi\": \"khen ngợi, ca ngợi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"command\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commander\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-cori-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru0-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru5-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru6-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru10-1925f793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru9-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru3-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru7-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru8-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru2-1925f793.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-ljspeech-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt408-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt138-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt624-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt396-1925f793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt498-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt132-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt288-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt42-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt90-1925f793.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'commend\' nghĩa là khen ngợi.', 'office', 1, 23),
('f77e10c7-221b-5a01-b4ba-75dfe7391053', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'arena', 'UK: /əˈriːnə/ | US: /əˈriːnə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đấu trường, sân vận động', 'A large enclosed space surrounded by seating, used for sports or entertainment events.', 'The concert in the arena sold out quickly.', 'Buổi hòa nhạc ở đấu trường đã bán hết vé nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"The new sports arena will host international basketball tournaments next summer.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thi đấu thể thao mới sẽ đăng cai các giải đấu bóng rổ quốc tế vào mùa hè tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-ljspeech-bbcfcdbc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-cori-bbcfcdbc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arena-787e5548.webp', '[\"stadium\", \"venue\", \"colosseum\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sports arena\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thi đấu thể thao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"international arena\", \"meaning\": \"đấu trường quốc tế\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-cori-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru0-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru5-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru6-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru10-bbcfcdbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru9-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru3-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru7-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru8-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-aru2-bbcfcdbc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-ljspeech-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt408-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt138-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt624-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt396-bbcfcdbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt498-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt132-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt288-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt42-bbcfcdbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arena-lt90-bbcfcdbc.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ nhà thi đấu/đấu trường, hoặc mở rộng là phạm vi cạnh tranh (như political/business arena).', 'entertainment', 1, 24),
('c4bc5e2c-0aaa-5fbf-ab6e-85c9c44d2634', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'against the wall', '', 'B2', 'preposition', 'tựa vào tường', 'positioned touching or leaning directly on a vertical side of a building or room.', 'He placed the ladder against the wall.', 'Anh ấy đặt cái thang dựa vào tường.', '{\"en\": \"Several wooden filing cabinets have been positioned against the back wall of the office.\", \"vi\": \"Một vài tủ đựng tài liệu bằng gỗ đã được đặt tựa vào bức tường phía sau của văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-ljspeech-46c0206c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-cori-46c0206c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/against-the-wall-4d33ccdb.webp', '[\"leaning on the wall\", \"next to the wall\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lean against the wall\", \"meaning\": \"dựa vào tường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"place against the wall\", \"meaning\": \"đặt tựa vào tường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stacked against the wall\", \"meaning\": \"xếp chồng tựa vào tường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-cori-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru0-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru5-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru6-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru10-46c0206c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru9-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru3-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru7-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru8-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-aru2-46c0206c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-ljspeech-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt408-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt138-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt624-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt396-46c0206c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt498-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt132-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt288-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt42-46c0206c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/against-the-wall-lt90-46c0206c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm giới từ hay gặp trong tranh tả đồ vật của TOEIC Listening Part 1 (dùng để tả đồ đạc được đặt tựa/dựa vào tường).', 'office environment', 1, 25),
('cd2c9f20-4cc9-5945-b17b-0cd48ad6e31b', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'stare', '/steə/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nhìn không chớp mắt vào ai đó hoặc cái gì đó.', 'to look directly at somebody or something for a long time without moving your eyes.', 'The candidate could only stare at the screen after seeing the interview results.', 'Ứng viên chỉ biết nhìn chằm chằm vào màn hình sau khi xem kết quả phỏng vấn.', '{\"en\": \"The technician had to stare at the computer screen to locate the software error.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã phải nhìn chăm chăm vào màn hình máy tính để tìm ra lỗi phần mềm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-ljspeech-bdd9b993.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-cori-bdd9b993.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stare-de32a19d.webp', '[\"gaze\", \"peer\"]', '[\"glance\", \"glimpse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stare at\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn chăm chăm vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blankly stare\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn ngẩn ngơ, thẫn thờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stair\", \"note_vi\": \"stair (bậc cầu thang) đồng âm với stare nhưng khác nghĩa hoàn toàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stare\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-cori-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru0-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru5-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru6-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru10-bdd9b993.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru9-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru3-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru7-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stare-aru8-bdd9b993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object