('aebab099-faa8-5468-8193-8cc7342b0cb3', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'high', '/haɪ/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có độ cao lớn từ mặt đất hoặc một điểm chuẩn.', 'having a large distance from the bottom to the top or from the ground level.', 'The mountain peak was very high, covered in snow.', 'Đỉnh núi rất cao, phủ đầy tuyết.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a high demand for its new software products during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo nhu cầu cao đối với các sản phẩm phần mềm mới trong mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-ljspeech-9235afd3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-cori-9235afd3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/high-3c70a785.webp', '[\"tall\", \"elevated\"]', '[\"low\", \"short\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng cao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"height\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"highly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-cori-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru0-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru5-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru6-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru10-9235afd3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru9-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru3-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru7-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru8-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-aru2-9235afd3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-ljspeech-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt408-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt138-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt624-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt396-9235afd3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt498-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt132-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt288-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt42-9235afd3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/high-lt90-9235afd3.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho cả nghĩa đen (độ cao) và nghĩa bóng (mức độ, giá trị).', 'business', 1, 28),
('9984e842-2472-5068-97fc-6ada260c9f37', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e6c44ae1-b565-54f2-9a4d-dedc7473c866', 'ac0554bd-96b3-5944-a438-3de0a905b018', 'bond', '/bɒnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Mối liên kết, gắn bó chặt chẽ.', 'a strong connection or feeling of shared interest between people or groups.', 'The strong bond between the siblings was evident in their support for each other.', 'Mối liên kết bền chặt giữa anh chị em thể hiện rõ qua sự ủng hộ lẫn nhau của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The partnership created a strong bond between the two companies, leading to long-term collaboration.\", \"vi\": \"Mối quan hệ đối tác đã tạo ra sự gắn kết mạnh mẽ giữa hai công ty, dẫn đến sự hợp tác lâu dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-ljspeech-1d2bba5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-cori-1d2bba5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bond-0c6b60f1.webp', '[\"connection\", \"tie\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"strong bond\", \"meaning\": \"mối liên kết bền chặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"form a bond\", \"meaning\": \"hình thành mối liên kết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bound\", \"note_vi\": \"bound là quá khứ của bind, hoặc có nghĩa là bắt buộc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bonded\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-cori-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru0-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru5-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru6-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru10-1d2bba5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru9-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru3-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru7-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru8-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-aru2-1d2bba5d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-ljspeech-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt408-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt138-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt624-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt396-1d2bba5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt498-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt132-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt288-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt42-1d2bba5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bond-lt90-1d2bba5d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh xây dựng mối quan hệ đối tác hoặc tình đồng nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 29),
('2c43f9aa-065f-546a-abb7-a2bdad3b8264', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'beforehand', 'UK: /bɪˈfɔːhænd/ | US: /bɪˈfɔrhænd/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'trước đó', 'earlier than a specific time or prior to an event happening.', 'Please submit your questions beforehand to the presenter.', 'Vui lòng gửi câu hỏi của bạn cho người thuyết trình trước đó.', '{\"en\": \"Participants are requested to register beforehand to secure a seat at the annual conference.\", \"vi\": \"Người tham dự được yêu cầu đăng ký trước để đảm bảo có chỗ ngồi tại hội nghị hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-ljspeech-076fb188.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-cori-076fb188.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beforehand-e25128ef.webp', '[\"in advance\", \"ahead of time\", \"priorly\"]', '[\"afterwards\", \"later\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"register beforehand\", \"meaning\": \"đăng ký trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"notify beforehand\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prepare beforehand\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"before\", \"note_vi\": \"trước (có thể làm giới từ/liên từ đi kèm tân ngữ hoặc mệnh đề)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-cori-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru0-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru5-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru6-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru10-076fb188.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru9-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru3-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beforehand-aru7-076fb188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub