('1d8a4ff3-d1f0-5526-afb4-f79f043a7ffc', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'accustom', 'UK: /əˈkʌstəm/ | US: /əˈkʌstəm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'làm quen, thích nghi', 'to make someone familiar with something through experience or practice', 'Please accustom yourself to the new office policies.', 'Xin hãy làm quen với các chính sách mới của văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"New employees need a few weeks to accustom themselves to the company\'s working culture.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới cần một vài tuần để tự làm quen với văn hóa làm việc của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-ljspeech-e7059c04.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-cori-e7059c04.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accustom-3b567a55.webp', '[\"adapt\", \"adjust\", \"familiarize\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"accustom oneself to\", \"meaning\": \"tự làm quen với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become accustomed to\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên quen thuộc với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"used to\", \"note_vi\": \"\'used to + V-inf\' chỉ thói quen đã qua trong quá khứ, còn \'accustomed to + V-ing\' diễn tả sự thạo/quen với công việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accustomed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-cori-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru0-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru5-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru6-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru10-e7059c04.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru9-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru3-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru7-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru8-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-aru2-e7059c04.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-ljspeech-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt408-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt138-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt624-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt396-e7059c04.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt498-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt132-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt288-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt42-e7059c04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accustom-lt90-e7059c04.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay dùng nhất dưới dạng cấu trúc \'be/get accustomed to + V-ing/N\' (quen thuộc với việc gì).', 'human resources', 1, 5),
('11cf60c3-2c50-5c41-9cac-92114fbd3131', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'artistic', '/ɑːˈtɪstɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về nghệ thuật hoặc có năng khiếu nghệ thuật.', 'showing skill, taste, or ability in creating beautiful or creative things.', 'Her artistic talent was evident in her beautiful paintings.', 'Tài năng nghệ thuật của cô ấy thể hiện rõ qua những bức tranh tuyệt đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The new graphic designer brought impressive artistic talent to our advertising department.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đồ họa mới đã mang lại tài năng nghệ thuật ấn tượng cho bộ phận quảng cáo của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-ljspeech-ee853884.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-cori-ee853884.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/artistic-eddd7f53.webp', '[\"creative\", \"expressive\", \"imaginative\"]', '[\"inexpressive\", \"unimaginative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"artistic skill\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng nghệ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"artistic vision\", \"meaning\": \"tầm nhìn nghệ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"artistic director\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc nghệ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"artificial\", \"note_vi\": \"Artificial là nhân tạo, artistic là thuộc về nghệ thuật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"art\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"artist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"artistically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-cori-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru0-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru5-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru6-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru10-ee853884.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru9-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru3-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru7-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru8-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-aru2-ee853884.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-ljspeech-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt408-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt138-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt624-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt396-ee853884.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt498-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt132-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt288-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt42-ee853884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artistic-lt90-ee853884.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với từ \'artificial\' (nhân tạo).', 'marketing', 1, 6),
('50ac64d5-cc03-5747-b728-9d8c48b00623', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'observation', '/ˌɒbzəˈveɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc kết quả của việc quan sát, theo dõi.', 'the act of watching something carefully or a remark based on it.', 'Scientific progress often begins with careful observation of natural phenomena.', 'Tiến bộ khoa học thường bắt đầu bằng việc quan sát cẩn thận các hiện tượng tự nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s observation of the workflow helped reduce errors significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Việc quan sát quy trình làm việc của người quản lý giúp giảm lỗi đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-ljspeech-7c02c7e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-cori-7c02c7e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/observation-4e573efa.webp', '[\"monitoring\", \"remark\", \"watch\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an observation\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra quan sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under observation\", \"meaning\": \"đang được theo dõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"direct observation\", \"meaning\": \"quan sát trực tiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"preservation\", \"note_vi\": \"preservation là bảo tồn, không phải observation (quan sát).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"observe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"observant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-cori-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru0-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru5-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru6-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru10-7c02c7e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru9-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru3-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru7-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru8-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-aru2-7c02c7e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-ljspeech-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt408-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt138-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt624-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt396-7c02c7e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt498-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt132-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt288-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt42-7c02c7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observation-lt90-7c02c7e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Observation có trọng âm thứ ba, tránh nhầm với observe.', 'office', 1, 7),
('1ec85947-ad13-51f7-b9bc-9fdec557554d', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'debate', '/dɪˈbeɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cuộc thảo luận hoặc tranh cãi về một vấn đề.', 'a formal discussion on a particular topic in which opposing arguments are put forward.', 'There was a lively debate about the new policy during the meeting.', 'Đã có một cuộc tranh luận sôi nổi về chính sách mới trong cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The board members engaged in a heated debate about the company\'s future investment strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng đã tham gia vào một cuộc tranh luận gay gắt về chiến lược đầu tư tương lai của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-ljspeech-26fee417.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-cori-26fee417.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/debate-e89047f6.webp', '[\"discussion\", \"argument\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"consensus\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"public debate\", \"meaning\": \"tranh luận công khai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heated debate\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tranh luận gay gắt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"debatable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-cori-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru0-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru5-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru6-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru10-26fee417.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru9-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru3-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru7-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru8-26fee417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debate-aru2-26