('fcbabe52-d4c0-5666-bda7-a0399c5b06d4', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'ultimately', '/ʌlˈtɪmətli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Sau tất cả mọi việc; rốt cuộc; cuối cùng.', 'used to emphasize the most important fact in a situation after everything else.', 'Despite many challenges, they ultimately succeeded in their mission.', 'Mặc dù gặp nhiều thử thách, cuối cùng họ đã thành công trong nhiệm vụ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided that the project would ultimately benefit the company in the long run.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định rằng dự án cuối cùng sẽ mang lại lợi ích cho công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-ljspeech-68d16beb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-cori-68d16beb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ultimately-57a78583.webp', '[\"eventually\", \"finally\"]', '[\"initially\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ultimately responsible\", \"meaning\": \"chịu trách nhiệm cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ultimately decide\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định cuối cùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ultimate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-cori-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru0-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru5-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru6-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru10-68d16beb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru9-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru3-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru7-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru8-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc