('e7253f61-dfd8-5479-959e-2b62cefef514', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'confusing', '/kənˈfjuːzɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Gây bối rối, khó hiểu hoặc không rõ ràng.', 'causing difficulty in understanding or making someone feel uncertain and unclear.', 'The instructions for assembling the furniture were very confusing.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp đồ nội thất rất khó hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The new tax form is confusing for many first-time employees.\", \"vi\": \"Mẫu thuế mới gây bối rối cho nhiều nhân viên lần đầu khai báo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-ljspeech-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confusing-149175b4.webp', '[\"puzzling\", \"unclear\", \"baffling\"]', '[\"clear\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confusing instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confusing situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống bối rối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly confusing\", \"meaning\": \"rất khó hiểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confused\", \"note_vi\": \"confused là cảm thấy bối rối, confusing là gây bối rối.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confuse\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confusion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru0-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru5-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru6-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru10-5bccaca1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru9-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru3-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusi