('eeebe8f8-241a-59b4-a9d8-0b391a894ae4', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'construction', '/kənˈstrʌkʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quá trình xây dựng hoặc công trình đang được xây dựng.', 'the work of building houses, offices, bridges, or other large structures.', 'Heavy machinery was brought in to accelerate the construction of the highway.', 'Máy móc hạng nặng đã được đưa vào để đẩy nhanh việc thi công đường cao tốc.', '{\"en\": \"Due to ongoing construction on the main road, employees should expect delays during their commute.\", \"vi\": \"Do việc xây dựng đang diễn ra trên đường chính, nhân viên nên dự kiến sẽ bị trễ giờ khi đi làm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-ljspeech-535ae678.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-cori-535ae678.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/construction-7ca1d5db.webp', '[\"building\", \"development\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under construction\", \"meaning\": \"đang trong quá trình xây dựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"construction site\", \"meaning\": \"công trường xây dựng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"construct\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-cori-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru0-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru5-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru6-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru10-535ae678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru9-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru3-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru7-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru8-535a