('077d4ca6-31fd-589f-86f9-a4abaa84d2a9', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'e702a931-7897-5a52-8dd3-7c5c6575084c', 'f675ffef-2f85-5861-a2d8-d82af66f33f4', 'popularity', '/ˌpɒpjuˈlærəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự được nhiều người yêu thích hoặc biết đến.', 'the state of being liked, enjoyed, or supported by a large number of people.', 'The singer\'s popularity grew rapidly after her first album was released.', 'Sự nổi tiếng của nữ ca sĩ tăng nhanh chóng sau khi album đầu tay của cô được phát hành.', '{\"en\": \"The new software gained popularity among employees because of its simple user interface.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới đã trở nên phổ biến đối với nhân viên nhờ giao diện người dùng đơn giản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-ljspeech-67b252c5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-cori-67b252c5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/popularity-096563a0.webp', '[\"fame\", \"acceptance\", \"favor\"]', '[\"unpopularity\", \"disfavor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gain popularity\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên phổ biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grow in popularity\", \"meaning\": \"ngày càng được yêu thích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"population\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là dân số, tránh nhầm lẫn vì viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"popular\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"popularize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"popularly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-cori-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru0-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru5-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru6-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru10-67b252c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru9-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru3-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru7-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru8-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-aru2-67b252c5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-ljspeech-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt408-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt138-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt624-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt396-67b252c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt498-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt132-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt288-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt42-67b252c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/popularity-lt90-67b252c5.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'population\' nghĩa là dân số.', 'marketing', 1, 29),
('a107e8ee-fe0a-5da8-9c3f-1e83d8ac3eca', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'ec8bc830-7cb4-5d41-8952-737d5ae3ca42', '34f013c4-a87e-519a-92cf-4b5c260b2e92', 'criticism', '/ˈkrɪtɪsɪzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự đánh giá, nhận xét, thường là tiêu cực, về ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'An evaluation of a performance or work, often identifying shortcomings or unfavorable aspects.', 'The team received constructive criticism after the presentation.', 'Nhóm đã nhận được những lời phê bình mang tính xây dựng sau buổi thuyết trình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager accepted the constructive criticism from the board and promised to improve the plan.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã chấp nhận những lời phê bình mang tính xây dựng từ ban giám đốc và hứa sẽ cải thiện kế hoạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-ljspeech-2b5d72ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-cori-2b5d72ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/criticism-a526dfc7.webp', '[\"disapproval\", \"feedback\", \"evaluation\"]', '[\"praise\", \"approval\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"constructive criticism\", \"meaning\": \"phê bình mang tính xây dựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face criticism\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với sự chỉ trích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"harsh criticism\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ trích gay gắt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"critic\", \"note_vi\": \"critic là nhà phê bình (người), còn criticism là lời phê bình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"criticize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"critic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"critical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-cori-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru0-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru5-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru6-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru10-2b5d72ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru9-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru3-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru7-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru8-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-aru2-2b5d72ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-ljspeech-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt408-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt138-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt624-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt396-2b5d72ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt498-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt132-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt288-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt42-2b5d72ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/criticism-lt90-2b5d72ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ cụm \'constructive criticism\' vì nó rất hay xuất hiện trong môi trường công sở.', 'hr', 1, 0),
('86aae537-33fb-5459-af32-748532c0b464', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'ec8bc830-7cb4-5d41-8952-737d5ae3ca42', '34f013c4-a87e-519a-92cf-4b5c260b2e92', 'clay', 'UK: /kleɪ/ | US: /kleɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đất sét', 'a soft, sticky earth material that can be shaped when wet and hardened by heat.', 'They used clay to make pottery and bricks.', 'Họ sử dụng đất sét để làm đồ gốm và gạch.', '{\"en\": \"The artisan pottery workshop imports high-grade clay to produce its premium tableware line.\", \"vi\": \"Xưởng đồ gốm thủ công nhập khẩu đất sét cấp cao để sản xuất dòng bộ đồ ăn cao cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-ljspeech-de6b29cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-cori-de6b29cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clay-1c04b139.webp', '[\"mud\", \"earthenware\", \"terracotta\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clay bricks\", \"meaning\": \"gạch làm bằng đất sét\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raw clay\", \"meaning\": \"đất sét thô chưa qua chế biến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gray\", \"note_vi\": \"Màu xám\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clayey\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-cori-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru0-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru5-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru6-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru10-de6b29cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru9-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru3-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru7-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru8-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru2-de6b29cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-ljspeech-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/