('992d6e37-8dac-5604-9ce4-f2f5e88044d7', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'fe63efa6-4c97-59d4-b4d8-509f7163391b', 'd9223ddd-0bbc-55ea-a580-721143783160', 'excuse', '/ɪkˈskjuːz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lý do được đưa ra để biện minh cho một hành động hoặc sự vắng mặt.', 'a reason given to explain why someone did something wrong or failed to do something.', 'He always has a good excuse for being late to meetings.', 'Anh ấy luôn có một cái cớ chính đáng cho việc đến muộn các cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier had no valid excuse for the delay in delivering our office furniture order.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp không có lý do chính đáng cho việc chậm trễ giao đơn hàng nội thất văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-ljspeech-8fb2c3ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-cori-8fb2c3ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excuse-a6d974e1.webp', '[\"pretext\", \"justification\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"valid excuse\", \"meaning\": \"lý do chính đáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make an excuse\", \"meaning\": \"viện cớ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excusable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-cori-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru0-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru5-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru6-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru10-8fb2c3ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru9-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru3-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru7-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru8-8fb2c3ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excuse-aru2-8fb2c3ed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/publi