('060dd249-7780-5143-a31a-38059c527434', 'a0594a7a-b5fe-5595-ba88-03001d217110', 'fe63efa6-4c97-59d4-b4d8-509f7163391b', 'd9223ddd-0bbc-55ea-a580-721143783160', 'trouble', '/ˈtrʌbl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Rắc rối, vấn đề khó khăn.', 'problems or difficulties that cause worry, distress, or unhappiness to someone.', 'If you\'re in trouble, don\'t hesitate to ask for help.', 'Nếu bạn gặp rắc rối, đừng ngần ngại yêu cầu giúp đỡ.', '{\"en\": \"Customers had trouble accessing the online portal during the scheduled server maintenance yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng gặp khó khăn khi truy cập cổng thông tin trực tuyến trong đợt bảo trì máy chủ hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-ljspeech-bee38fbc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-cori-bee38fbc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trouble-574f50fe.webp', '[\"problem\", \"difficulty\"]', '[\"ease\", \"peace\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have trouble doing\", \"meaning\": \"gặp khó khăn khi làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause trouble\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra rắc rối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"troublesome\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-cori-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru0-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru5-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru6-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru10-bee38fbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru9-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru3-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru7-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru8-bee38fbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trouble-aru2-bee38fbc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/